window.AKK_FAKE_HEIRESS_THOUGHTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FAKE_HEIRESS_THOUGHTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: She Has a Mom Now","paragraphs":["Jing Yi had grown up without a father or mother, but she had seen other people's mothers.","She had seen mothers picking up their children from school, mothers attending parent-teacher conferences, and mothers shopping with their kids...","Jing Yi had always felt that having parents or not didn't matter much to her; she could live well on her own.","But then, Lin Ruiqing said to her that she hoped her daughter would be healthy, happy, and successful in everything - just like what an ordinary mother would say to her daughter.","Jing Yi had never imagined that one day, someone would say such things to her.","After all, she was a person who had been abandoned at an orphanage right after birth.","Lin Ruiqing continued to look at her tenderly, \"Yi Yi, your arrival is another gift that heaven has sent me.\"","My arrival is a gift?","Jing Yi was suddenly stunned. At that moment, it was as if the softest corner of her heart had been touched.","She opened her mouth, her eyes burning slightly, her voice very soft, but Lin Ruiqing still heard it.","\"Mom.\"","Lin Ruiqing's eyes reddened slightly as she gently squeezed her hand and responded with a soft \"Yes!\"","She then looked at Jing Zejun, who also had tears in her eyes and called out \"Mom\" with a smile. Lin Ruiqing responded to her as well.","Lin Ruiqing embraced both daughters, patting them gently, and said with a smile, \"This is wonderful. This is the happiest birthday I've ever had!\"","Jing Yi rested her head on Lin Ruiqing's shoulder, tears welling up in her eyes. It was joy, and it was also contentment.","She had a mom now!","...","The party was still going on, and Jing Yi was on the balcony getting some fresh air.","She still held a wine glass in her hand, eyes closed, enjoying the cool evening breeze. She looked very happy.","But someone interrupted this scene. Jing Yi opened her eyes and looked in the direction of the approaching footsteps.","[I knew it would be this fool.]","Seeing Jing Zeqian walk over, Jing Yi turned her head away, refusing to look at him.","Jing Zeqian rubbed his nose, seemingly trying to figure out how to start, \"Um...\" Jing Yi still didn't speak or look at him.","[Um, um, do I not have a name? Or have you become a stutterer after not seeing me for a few days?]","Jing Zeqian sighed, feeling tongue-tied for the first time. Seeing that Jing Yi was about to turn and leave, he quickly called out to her, \"Yi Yi!\"","Jing Yi stood with her back to Jing Zeqian, \"If you have something to say, say it quickly.\"","Jing Zeqian lowered his head, looking somewhat dejected, \"I want to apologize to you. I'm sorry, I shouldn't have questioned you without asking, I shouldn't have said those awful things. I was presumptuous, I was unreasonable...\"","Jing Yi listened to Jing Zeqian's confession behind her and let out a light sigh. It had been several days, and her anger had mostly subsided, but his words still bothered her.","[I just feel... it's quite disappointing. You were the one who first said I was your sister...]","Jing Zeqian clenched his fists tightly, feeling an indescribable emotion in his heart.","\"...I'm sorry, I'm not a good brother. My sister hadn't been home for over twenty years, and I never once cared. When she came back, I mocked and criticized her, didn't help her with her suitcase, made fun of her for being silly, tried to control her everywhere, and thought I was doing what a brother should do.\"","His voice was a bit choked up. Jing Yi bit her lower lip lightly and blinked hard.","\"Now, I've said such harsh things to her because of someone who betrayed me. She's actually someone who loves to have fun and sleep, but she's been running around every day for my sake. Mom is right, I'm really ungrateful...\"","[Who apologizes by pointing out others' flaws? You're the one who loves to play and sleep!]","Jing Yi turned and walked back into the hall. Jing Zeqian thought she still wouldn't forgive him and leaned dejectedly against the door, looking defeated.","A few minutes later, Jing Yi came back. Jing Zeqian's eyes lit up, and he stood up straight.","Jing Yi handed him several bottles of wine. Jing Zeqian looked down at them, confused.","Jing Yi casually pulled out the cork, \"Last time you didn't get to drink, right? You can drink now.\" With that, she started drinking straight from the bottle.","Jing Zeqian was startled, his eyes widening as he quickly steadied her hand, \"This is red wine, not grape juice!\"","Jing Yi gave him a strange look, \"I know.\" She glanced at Jing Zeqian's hand, \"Are you going to drink or not?\"","[If I didn't see this fool was in a bad mood, I wouldn't bother drinking with him.]","Jing Zeqian felt a pang in his heart as he gripped the wine bottle, \"Yi Yi, I'm sorry...\" He really was a jerk.","The wine bottle opened with a 'pop', and Jing Zeqian took a big gulp.","Jing Yi leaned on the railing, looking at the path illuminated by the banquet hall lights, \"Did she give a reason?\"","\"...For a man.\" Jing Zeqian took another swig from the bottle as he spoke, \"For a man, she gave up everything. She gave up her career, her child, and now even her freedom...\"","Seeing him like this, Jing Yi frowned, her eyes displeased. She didn't mince her words, \"If she gave it up, why are you upset? Did you make her give it up? Besides, does she even have a career anymore? Didn't Junjun and Actor Wen both tell you about Jiang Miaomiao's issues? And you? You still think she was focused on her career?\"","Jing Yi's words stripped away the last layer of Jiang Miaomiao's facade and shattered the image of her in Jing Zeqian's mind.","\"When I first met her, she was just like Junjun, reverent and aspiring towards the acting profession.\"","[Even at a time like this, he's reminiscing about the past...]","Jing Yi scoffed and added for Jing Zeqian, \"Later, when she became famous, had money, and the boss was protecting her, there was no need to bother about acting anymore.\"","Jing Zeqian gave a bitter laugh, \"Yes, everyone could see it except me.\"","Jing Zeqian's eyes were a bit hazy as he raised the bottle for another drink. Jing Yi was a bit worried he might get drunk.","Jing Zeqian continued to ramble, \"Yi Yi, I'm the second young master of the Jing Family. On the surface, they call me the pride of heaven, but behind my back, they say I'm useless, that I'm nothing without the Jing Family.\"","\"Although I said I didn't care, I was actually very resentful. I secretly vowed that even without relying on the Jing Family, I could make something of myself. Startrack is my career, my pride.\"","\"How amazing was I! The first artist I managed won Best Actress, I founded Startrack, and this entertainment company quickly became one of the top in the industry. Later, many artists started joining, but...\"","[But Jiang Miaomiao was different from them. She was your initial pride.]","Jing Zeqian leaned on the railing and suddenly burst into laughter. Jing Yi watched, feeling very uncomfortable.","\"Hahahahaha, it's all fake! The dream was fake! The success was fake! I'm really f***ing useless, a presumptuous, ungrateful, blind fool. Yi Yi, I'm just useless!\" The figure on the railing trembled slightly...","Jing Yi sighed. Sometimes things need to fall apart before they can be rebuilt. It would be better once he got it all out of his system."]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: I, Jing Zeqian, am a big idiot","paragraphs":["As the banquet ended and guests dispersed, the Jing family remained in the hall due to a drunk causing a scene.","Jing Zeqian clung to Jing Zeyou's legs, sprawled on the floor, wailing: \"Yiyi, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm an idiot, I'm blind, please don't ignore me...\"","Looking at the person on the floor, Jing Zeyou felt a headache coming on. At least apologize to the right person, he thought.","Lin Ruiqing observed her son on the floor, pursed her lips, and turned to Jing Beicheng, \"This son, shall we give up on him?\"","Thankfully the guests had left, or the Jing family's reputation would have been tarnished by the second young master's drunken disgrace.","Jing Beicheng glanced at his younger son and nodded seriously, \"Let's give up.\" The Jing family couldn't afford such embarrassment.","Though they said that, perhaps the son could be salvaged after a good cleaning. She'd leave that task to her elder son.","Jing Zeyou: Once again, he had to clean up the mess...","Jing Zeyou's gaze shifted to Jing Yi, who was recording a video on the other side.","His lips curved into a helpless smile.","Jing Yi held her phone, camera pointed at herself and Jing Zeqian on the floor, beaming brightly, \"Jing Zeqian, say it again, what are you?\"","The person on the floor stirred, struggling to open his eyes. His slender eyes were hazy, his face flushed. \"I'm... I'm an idiot!\"","Feeling it wasn't loud enough, he shouted again: \"I, Jing Zeqian, am a big idiot! I made my sister sad, I'm a stupid big idiot!\"","In the video, Jing Yi laughed joyfully. Combined with her formal attire for the day, she looked radiant.","Satisfied, Jing Yi saved the video and sat down next to Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun laughed, \"How much did you guys drink?\" By the time they found him, Jing Zeqian was already drunk and crying to Jing Yi.","Jing Zejun had never seen Jing Zeqian like this before and was stunned at the time.","After pulling him out, Jing Zejun kept staring at Jing Zeqian, still curious to see more!","Jing Yi was also puzzled, \"Not much, just one bottle of red wine.\"","[And he ended up drunk and making a scene...]","Jing Zejun was shocked. That's not much?!","\"You drank too?!\"","Jing Yi nodded innocently, \"I brought the wine, I couldn't let him drink alone, could I?\"","Jing Zeyou tried to pull his leg free but failed. This lightweight couldn't even match Yiyi's tolerance, yet he tried to control others' drinking?","\"Let's go home,\" Lin Ruiqing stood up, ready to take Jing Yi and Jing Zejun home. Jing Yi looked at the crying mess on the floor, \"What about him?\"","\"Your big brother will carry him back.\"","Jing Beicheng followed behind, taking one last look at Jing Zeqian on the floor before leaving. It was too embarrassing to watch.","Jing Zeyou sighed, resigning himself to lifting the man up and carrying him as he followed their footsteps.","...","\"Jing Yiyi, delete that video!\"","The Jing family living room had returned to its usual liveliness. Jing Zeqian was chasing Jing Yi, demanding furiously that she delete the video from her phone.","That morning, Jing Zeqian had woken up with a headache. By the time he recovered, Jing Yi and the others had already finished lunch.","Jing Zeqian walked downstairs slowly, still hungover. Aunt Wang quickly brought him the hangover soup she had prepared earlier.","Though still feeling unwell, at least he had made it home, achieving his goal.","But before Jing Zeqian could feel happy for more than a few seconds, Jing Yi sneakily brought her phone to his ear.","'Jing Zeqian, what are you?' 'I'm... I'm an idiot!'","Jing Zeqian froze, recognizing his voice. He reached out to grab the phone, but Jing Yi laughed and quickly pulled it away.","Jing Zeqian rushed over anxiously, \"Jing Yiyi, you're despicable! Taking advantage of me!\"","Jing Yi smugly waved her phone at him, her ponytail swaying cutely behind her, \"If you provoke me again, next time I'll livestream it!\"","\"You wouldn't dare! Delete that video now!\" Jing Zeqian chased after her. Jing Yi quickly ran to Lin Ruiqing's side for protection, \"Mom, look at Second Brother!\"","[I'm the one with Mom's protection now!]","Lin Ruiqing's eyes flashed with tenderness as she gently patted Jing Yi's head. While Jing Zeqian saw it as gloating, to Lin Ruiqing it was utterly adorable.","\"Xiao Qian, don't bully your sister as soon as you get back!\"","Jing Zeqian's face was full of grievance. Who was bullying whom here?! At that moment, Jing Yi was showing the video to Jing Zejun, both enjoying it.","Jing Zeqian's ears kept replaying, 'I'm an idiot! I'm an idiot!'","Jing Yi laughed happily, her dimples deepening. Jing Zeqian's lips curved up involuntarily.","Nevermind, as long as she wasn't angry anymore.","\"Did my brother go to Hengjing?\"","If Jing Zeyou wasn't at home, there was an 80% chance he was at Hengjing, and a 20% chance he was on his way there.","Lin Ruiqing smiled and said, \"Yes, he left for the company early this morning.\" She continued, \"Yesterday you kept clinging to him, thinking he was Yiyi, hugging his leg and crying. Only your brother wouldn't mind you; he still carried you back home and then went to the company early today.\"","Jing Zeqian's hand paused mid-bite. She really didn't need to mention the latter part...","Lin Ruiqing saw her son's embarrassed expression and smiled. She meant to tease this kid a bit; he was too old to be acting so clingy.","Lin Ruiqing stood up, \"I won't chat with you anymore. The weather's nice today, your father and I are planning to go out and take photos.\"","Take photos?","Lin Ruiqing looked very interested, \"Yiyi gave me a complete set of photography equipment yesterday. It's perfect timing to try it out.\" As she spoke, she went upstairs to get the equipment.","This was a gift Jing Yi had thought about for a long time. She had been struggling with what to give, but then suddenly remembered that Lin Ruiqing liked sharing photos in group chats, so she specially customized a set of photography equipment.","Jing Beicheng sat to the side, reading a newspaper and waiting for Lin Ruiqing to come downstairs, but he seemed distracted, lost in thought.","He looked towards Jing Yi, \"Yiyi.\" Jing Yi looked up, smiling sweetly, \"What is it, Uncle?\"","Jing Beicheng paused, coughed lightly, and looked back at his newspaper, \"Nothing.\" Jing Yi gave him a strange look.","Jing Zeqian leaned in, arms crossed and eyebrows raised, with a knowing expression. Jing Zejun also slowly caught on, lowering his head to hide his smile.","Jing Yi looked at their odd expressions, confused.","[What's going on? Why do they all look so strange?]","Jing Beicheng put down his newspaper and shot them a look. Jing Zeqian quickly wiped the smile off his face, putting on a serious expression.","A strange atmosphere permeated the living room. At that moment, Lin Ruiqing came downstairs. Jing Beicheng stood up to help her with the equipment, \"We're heading out then.\"","After they left, Jing Zeqian immediately sidled up to Jing Yi, \"If you delete that video, I'll tell you what Dad was thinking just now.\"","Jing Yi looked at him suspiciously, \"Are you really that good?\"","[I don't believe you can guess what Uncle was thinking. You're not even on the same level.]","Jing Zeqian: Was his reputation really that bad...","He insisted indignantly, \"He's been my dad for almost thirty years. How could I not know what he's thinking?\"","[Are you sure you didn't get that backwards?]","Seeing Jing Yi's expression soften slightly, Jing Zeqian pressed his advantage, \"I promise I know what he was thinking! Delete the video and I'll tell you!\"","That video absolutely couldn't be left in Jing Yiyi's possession!"]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: On the Matter of Changing One's Words","paragraphs":["Jing Zeqian's expression was so pleading that Jing Zejun couldn't bear to interrupt, and he smiled as he looked at the two of them.","Jing Yi pondered seriously, waiting for her to look up again. Jing Zeqian's eyes were full of hope.","Then Jing Yi said, \"No.\"","Jing Zeqian was somewhat taken aback. \"Huh? Why? Didn't you want to know?\" Jing Yi looked innocent. \"If I wanted to know, I'd just ask uncle directly. Why should I listen to your guesses?\"","Jing Zeqian was stunned, but couldn't argue. He collapsed lifelessly onto the sofa. \"My lifetime's reputation!\" Jing Yi looked at him with disdain. \"What 'lifetime's reputation' do you have?\"","She then turned to look at Jing Zejun. \"Jun Jun, do you know why uncle was acting so strange just now?\"","Jing Zejun looked apologetically at Jing Zeqian on the sofa and said to Jing Yi, \"It might be because of how you addressed him.\"","Jing Yi asked puzzled, \"How I addressed him?\" Jing Zeqian didn't hold back anymore and added, \"Didn't you already start calling mom 'Mom'? Dad is waiting for you to change how you address him too.\"","Jing Yi had a sudden realization, finally understanding this matter. But...","[Calling mom 'Mom' before was easier because the atmosphere was right. But to suddenly call dad 'Dad' out of nowhere...]","Jing Yi cupped her chin, looking troubled. \"Jun Jun, how can I naturally change how I address him?\"","Jing Zeqian beside her suddenly sat up. \"I'll trade you a plan for deleting that video!\" Jing Yi glanced at him. \"How are you still not giving up on that?\"","How could he give up when his lifetime's reputation was at stake?","But Jing Yi wasn't interested in his plan. She could imagine it wouldn't be a good idea.","Jing Zeqian didn't like hearing that. He said seriously, \"I'm the CEO of a company after all. What's so hard about coming up with a perfect plan?\" Jing Yi ignored him.","To prove himself, Jing Zeqian continued, \"Let's do this: I'll go ask dad to give you a 'changing address fee'. Then won't you be able to naturally change how you address him?\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun silently looked at him.","[Is this the perfect idea from the boss of a listed company?]","Jing Zeqian clearly didn't understand what they were thinking. \"This is such a natural plan. Even if you can't naturally change how you address him, you can at least naturally call him 'sugar daddy'!\"","Jing Yi quietly averted her gaze. Never mind, she'd think of something herself.","Jing Zejun said with a smile, \"It's okay, Yi Yi. You can call him when you feel comfortable with it. Dad isn't so petty.\"","She understood. Jing Yi had never called anyone mom or dad since she was little. It was easier with Lin Ruiqing because they communicated more often, so it was relatively easy to say it. But with Jing Beicheng, it wasn't so simple.","Jing Yi nodded while cupping her chin, but her expression still looked troubled.","Meanwhile, Jing Beicheng, who was accompanying his wife for photos, was also a bit distracted.","Lin Ruiqing looked at him puzzled and asked with concern, \"What's wrong? You've been preoccupied the whole way.\"","Jing Beicheng then told Lin Ruiqing about how Jing Yi still hadn't called him dad.","Lin Ruiqing found it a bit amusing. She hadn't expected that this was what he'd been thinking about all morning. \"It's because you don't care enough about Yi Yi, that's why she hasn't changed how she addresses you.\" At least it wasn't Yi Yi's fault.","Jing Beicheng felt a bit wronged. He treated all four children the same. Although he didn't talk much usually, it didn't mean he didn't care.","Seeing his usually composed face showing rare emotion, Lin Ruiqing walked over with a smile. \"Alright, just spend more time with Yi Yi, and she'll change how she addresses you. It doesn't matter if it takes an extra day or two.\"","Lin Ruiqing wasn't in a hurry. After all, Jing Yi had already changed how she addressed her. As for Jing Beicheng, not only did he not get to be called dad, but with one \"mom\" and one \"uncle\", people might think it was a blended family if they didn't know better.","Jing Beicheng thought for a moment, then asked seriously, \"Do you think if I gave her a 'changing address fee', she would change how she addresses me?\" Lin Ruiqing playfully slapped him. \"Can't you put some effort into it?\"","Jing Beicheng: Isn't this putting in effort? Last time he gave her pocket money, Jing Yi called him \"sugar daddy\"...","Lin Ruiqing could tell at a glance that there was no hope in him coming up with ideas on his own. \"Oh right, there's a charity auction in a few days. Let's bring Yi Yi along. If she likes something, you can bid on it for her.\"","Jing Beicheng silently looked at his wife. Wasn't this just another way of giving money? It might even be less convenient than giving money directly.","Seeing Jing Beicheng's look, Lin Ruiqing knew what he was thinking. \"You don't think my idea is good?\" Her gaze carried a hint of warning.","Jing Beicheng immediately denied it. \"No, I think it's a great idea.\" Lin Ruiqing gave him an exasperated look. \"If not like this, how will Yi Yi feel your care? You're always wearing such a stern face.\"","Jing Beicheng felt a bit helpless. He had worn this face for decades, and now he was being complained about for having a sour expression?","Lin Ruiqing picked up the camera again. \"Hurry up and stand still, I'm going to take the picture!\" Jing Beicheng raised an eyebrow slightly. She complained about his sour face but still wanted to take his picture?","Though he only thought about it, Jing Beicheng quickly stood in the position Lin Ruiqing indicated.","In the Wang family study","A man sat at the desk. His temples showed some gray hair, indicating he was getting on in years.","Standing in front of him was none other than Wang Boqi, the man who had appeared multiple times at Jiang Miaomiao's apartment. The older man at the desk was his father, Wang He.","\"Did you know Jiang Miaomiao was arrested?\" His father's voice was calm, but Wang Boqi's heart skipped a beat. He bowed his head respectfully and replied, \"Yes, I knew.\"","Wang He looked up at him. \"You knew?\" Wang Boqi explained, \"Father, don't worry. Even if Jiang Miaomiao was arrested, she won't give me up. Besides, I didn't leave any evidence...\"","Wang He's brows furrowed tightly as he sternly said, \"Fool! You think the Jing family won't know it was you just because there's no evidence?\" Looking at Wang Boqi's expression, he continued, \"What? You think even if they know it was you, they can't do anything about it?\"","Wang He knew his son very well and was extremely disappointed. \"You only know they have no evidence. Do you realize that the past six months of planning have all been ruined? Do you know that there's no better opportunity to bring down the Jing family now?!\"","For Wang Boqi's plan, he had prepared for a full six months. But at the crucial moment, Jing Zeqian didn't fall for the trap at all. Instead, he swiftly had Jiang Miaomiao arrested!","The Jing family must be on guard now. Bringing down the Jing family and taking over the Hengjing Group had become an even more difficult task. Yet his son was still pleased with himself because the other side had no evidence!","\"If you had even a third of Jing Zeyou's ability, I wouldn't be afraid to step down even now!\"","Wang Boqi's hands clenched at his sides, his downcast eyes filled with deep hatred. Jing Zeyou again! Was he destined to live in Jing Zeyou's shadow for his entire life?","In his father's eyes, he would never measure up to Jing Zeyou!"]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Plan","paragraphs":["Wang Boqi's thoughts turned to Jing Yi, the one who had ruined the entire plan, and his teeth clenched with hatred, his eyes filled with a fierce glare.","\"I've already investigated thoroughly. Although Jing Yi grew up abroad, she has always known her true identity and the status of the Jing family,\" Wang Boqi said, his voice dripping with venom. \"That means she fully understands what it means to be the 'daughter of the Jing family.'\"","He continued, \"She majored in finance in university and maintained excellent grades for the first three years, all with the aim of better integrating into Hengjing. So she's not as simple as she appears on the surface.\"","Wang Boqi had also sent people to investigate Jing Yi's peers. From their accounts, she was portrayed as an arrogant and self-important individual who would never be content with just being a 'fake heiress.'","Wang Boqi had watched the Jing family's live streams and read the trending topics online, aware of the positive public perception of the Jing family, and even Jing Yi herself.","If not for his investigation into Jing Yi's life abroad, even Wang Boqi might have believed that Jing Yi had no ulterior motives towards the Jing family.","Wang He pondered, \"But they say the two daughters of the Jing family get along very well.\" Wang Boqi scoffed disdainfully, \"That's just a tactic to garner goodwill and favorable impressions.\"","She naturally knew that the Jing family wouldn't be so easily swayed.","\"So what are you planning to do?\" Wang He was more concerned about Wang Boqi's next move.","Wang Boqi's eyes were like a dark, icy pond, radiating a bone-chilling coldness. \"Now she's become the savior of the Jing family, and the Jing family naturally trusts her. So I'll target her!\"","A mere woman, he could win her over with just a snap of his fingers, especially one as vain as her. Just like Jiang Miaomiao.","Speaking of Jiang Miaomiao, after she was arrested, Wang Boqi had specially sent someone to investigate. It was fortunate she had taken the blame for everything herself, saving him the trouble.","Wang He looked up at Wang Boqi, indifferent to whatever methods his son would use. \"I hope you won't disappoint me this time.\" Wang Boqi nodded slightly, regaining his previous respectful demeanor. \"Don't worry, this time I absolutely won't let you down!\"","Meanwhile, in the office of Huarui Group","A knock sounded at the door, and before Shen Huaichu could respond, Gu Lin had already pushed it open and entered.","\"Brother,\" Gu Lin greeted.","Shen Huaichu didn't even lift his head. \"What is it?\" Gu Lin seemed accustomed to Shen Huaichu's coldness and didn't mind as he sat down on the sofa.","\"Can't I come see you if I don't have anything to say?\"","Shen Huaichu finally paused his work and looked up at Gu Lin. \"If you're bored, I can tell Auntie to let you come to Huarui for some training.\"","Gu Lin immediately straightened up. \"I was wrong, I actually have something to tell you.\" He didn't even want to go to his family's company, let alone work under his brother's watchful eye at Huarui, where it would undoubtedly be more strenuous!","Shen Huaichu silently watched him, ready to listen to what he had to say.","Gu Lin moved to sit in front of Shen Huaichu's desk, leaning in with a mysterious expression. \"Brother, do you know that Jiang Miaomiao got arrested?\"","Shen Huaichu glanced at him indifferently. \"Who's Jiang Miaomiao?\" Gu Lin realized his brother didn't follow the entertainment industry.","Gu Lin explained, \"She's the queen of 'Startrack,' Jing Zeqian's company's top star, Jiang Miaomiao!\"","Entertainment industry stuff?","Shen Huaichu frowned slightly. \"I'm busy.\" Gu Lin gave him a helpless look. \"I know! Just listen to me!\"","Who Jiang Miaomiao was or her arrest didn't matter. What was important was that it involved the Jing family.","\"Although the Jing family hasn't made any moves yet, I heard it's because she drugged Jing Zeqian and got caught.\"","Gu Lin feared Shen Huaichu would lose patience, so he simplified the whole story. He had originally wanted to chat more with his brother.","But even with the shortened version, Shen Huaichu still seemed impatient, lowering his head to continue his work.","He was signaling to Gu Lin with his actions: he really wasn't interested, and Gu Lin had already wasted a good fifteen seconds of his time.","Gu Lin insisted, \"It's Jing Zeqian, Jing Yi's second brother, Jing Zeqian!\" Shen Huaichu asked coldly, \"So?\"","Gu Lin widened his eyes, surprised that it hadn't caught his brother's interest. It seemed he had to pull out the big guns. \"Apparently, it was because of Jing Yi that Jing Zeqian escaped this disaster.\" Shen Huaichu's movements halted.","Gu Lin's eyes gleamed with satisfaction. He knew his brother would be interested in this news.","But the next moment, Shen Huaichu resumed his work and coldly said, \"You wasted five minutes of my time just to tell me such a worthless piece of news?\"","Before Gu Lin could bask in his triumph for long, he was deflated by Shen Huaichu. \"Aren't you interested? I thought you'd want to know about Jing Yi.\"","Shen Huaichu looked at Gu Lin, his expression unchanging. \"That's just your assumption. I've never said that.\" Gu Lin seemed to understand Shen Huaichu's meaning and obediently shut his mouth.","After a moment, he sneakily glanced over. To be honest, he didn't believe what his brother said; it was just stubbornness.","\"Is that all you had to say?\" Shen Huaichu was already hinting at him to leave.","Gu Lin sighed. Although he knew his brother's temperament, he still felt a bit frustrated at times.","Gu Lin decided to finish what he had to say, or else it would bother him.","\"I heard Jiang Miaomiao had prepared a banquet to poison Jing Zeqian, but Jing Yi happened to catch her in the act and disrupted it. The siblings had a huge argument at the banquet, and only then was the illegal substance discovered.\"","Shen Huaichu's pupils slightly contracted, but he quickly masked his emotions.","Gu Lin pressed on, \"Brother, what do you think about that?\" Shen Huaichu's lips curled into a mocking smile. \"My feeling is that she really likes to meddle in other people's business.\"","Back then, she had swung her fists around like a heroine.","Thinking of this, Shen Huaichu's lips unconsciously curved into a smile, but he quickly regained his indifferent expression.","Gu Lin looked at him strangely. What did that mean?","Shen Huaichu glanced at the person in front of him. \"Anything else?\" Gu Lin shrugged. Alright, he had said what he needed to say and could leave now.","As Gu Lin got up to leave, he suddenly remembered the task his mother had given him. He leaned against the doorframe, poking his head in. \"Brother, one more thing.\"","Shen Huaichu lifted an eyebrow and looked at him. Gu Lin quickly said, \"Your aunt mentioned there's a charity auction tomorrow, and there's a piece of art she really likes. She wants you to bid on it for her. That's all, goodbye!\"","With that, Gu Lin quickly closed the door and left, afraid to waste even a second.","After Gu Lin left, Shen Huaichu leaned back in his chair, his eyes half-closed, and softly said, \"Why do you always like to meddle in other people's affairs, little porcupine?\""]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Auction Farewell","paragraphs":["A black sedan pulled up in front of the exhibition hall.","Jing Beicheng stepped out first, extending his hand to help Lin Ruiqing out of the car. He let her take his arm as they walked, their long, straight legs entering everyone's view first.","Jing Yi leaned out and descended from the car, her black, slightly curled hair cascading over her shoulders. She wore a simple white shirt paired with a black and white patterned short skirt. The skirt's hem revealed the white edge of her shirt, barely covering her thighs. Whether it was the girl's sweet and beautiful face or her tall, slender figure, it was impossible not to stare.","Flashing back to the morning, Lin Ruiqing had just told Jing Yi about attending the auction together that evening.","Jing Yi was a bit surprised, \"An auction? But I don't have anything I want to buy.\" Lin Ruiqing explained that it was a charity auction. The company hosting the event would donate all the proceeds from the auction to the foundation established by the group.","Jing Yi thought it sounded quite meaningful, so she decided to tag along to broaden her horizons, as she had nothing else to do at home anyway.","Jing Yi followed Lin Ruiqing into the exhibition hall. In the center of the hall was a modest-sized stage with several rows of chairs. The scale wasn't large.","But the fact that Jing Beicheng personally came meant that the people attending the auction were likely not ordinary wealthy individuals.","Jing Yi curiously glanced around. Some people had already noticed Jing Beicheng's arrival and approached with smiles, \"Mr. Jing!\"","\"President Chen\"","The newcomer wore a suit and appeared to be slightly older than Jing Beicheng. He stood in front of Jing Beicheng, also smiling and greeting Lin Ruiqing.","Then, noticing Jing Yi, he smiled and said to Jing Beicheng, \"Is this your daughter, Mr. Jing?\"","Jing Beicheng nodded slightly and introduced, \"Our youngest daughter. Yi, this is your Uncle Chen.\"","Jing Yi wore a sweet smile, \"Hello, Uncle Chen!\" The man's smile grew even more benevolent, \"Hello, hello. She's indeed very beautiful. Mr. Jing, you're truly blessed to have such beautiful daughters!\"","Jing Yi stood obediently to the side, watching the adults exchange pleasantries, silently mocking the identical compliments in her heart.","After Jing Beicheng and President Chen chatted briefly, he led Lin Ruiqing and Jing Yi to their seats.","\"What are you doing here?!\" Jing Yi's voice rang out.","Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing looked over to see Shen Huaichu from Huarui Group sitting next to Jing Yi's seat.","Jing Yi felt extremely unlucky, never expecting to run into him at an auction!","Shen Huaichu raised an eyebrow slightly, about to greet her, \"Miss Jing...\" Jing Yi quickly interrupted him, turning to Jing Beicheng and saying, \"Dad, can I switch seats with you? I want to sit next to Mom.\"","Jing Beicheng was a bit surprised, the corners of his mouth turning up slightly, \"Come here then.\" Lin Ruiqing glanced at her husband, thinking that despite his straight face, he was probably overjoyed inside.","Shen Huaichu watched Jing Yi's retreating figure, his deep eyes inscrutable. By now, Jing Beicheng had stepped forward, and Shen Huaichu extended his hand, \"Mr. Jing, it's been a while.\"","\"Indeed, it has been.\"","It really had been quite some time, at least over ten years. Back then, Shen Huaichu was still a skinny young boy.","Jing Yi turned slightly to watch them greet each other.","Lin Ruiqing noticed her gaze and asked curiously, \"Yi, do you know President Shen from Huarui Group?\" Jing Yi opened her mouth, then remembered that Shen Huaichu was still collaborating with Hengjing, \"I've met him at my brother's company.\"","Just met? Lin Ruiqing was a bit skeptical but didn't press further.","Soon, the auction officially began. \"Welcome, everyone, to the Puli Charity Auction. This auction is hosted by...\"","Jing Yi only then learned that the group's foundation was dedicated to caring for orphans. She leaned close to Lin Ruiqing's ear, \"Mom, will all the auction proceeds be donated to orphans?\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded, explaining in detail: \"Puli holds such a charitable auction every year, using the proceeds from the auction...\"","Most well-known groups in North river have established one or two foundations, with different ways of raising funds. Puli uses auctions as a means to raise funds for their foundation.","Jing Yi listened, understanding some but not all, and nodded.","Ten minutes later, Jing Yi's desire to buy something gradually faded. A single cup selling for 18 million? Looking at it this way, her resources were truly limited...","Lin Ruiqing noticed Jing Yi's expression and leaned close to her, \"Yi, if you like anything, just bid on it. Mom will buy it for you.\"","Jing Yi nodded with a sweet smile, amused by the lavish tone.","Jing Beicheng, sitting nearby, noticed the interaction between Lin Ruiqing and Jing Yi from the corner of his eye. He opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but held back.","Hadn't they agreed that he would be the one buying? When would it be his turn?","Halfway through the auction, Jing Yi still hadn't found anything she liked, but Shen Huaichu had bid on an oil painting. How strange that such a cold person would like oil paintings?","It was quite surprising, and that painting was really expensive too, Jing Yi silently commented.","\"Our next item up for auction is a cloisonné tourmaline peach tree bonsai...\" The auctioneer was introducing the next item, a beautiful gemstone bonsai. The pink peaches were made of pink tourmaline, and the azure leaves were also crafted with exquisite workmanship.","Seeing Jing Yi's interest, Lin Ruiqing smiled and said, \"If you like it, bid on it.\" Jing Yi nodded, eagerly waiting for the auctioneer to announce the starting price. \"The starting price for this cloisonné tourmaline peach tree bonsai is 2 million!\"","Although it was a bit over her expectations, Jing Yi was still shocked when she heard the price. As expected of a gemstone bonsai, it really was expensive!","Jing Yi thought about her savings, gritted her teeth, and raised her hand to signal.","The auctioneer quickly caught sight of Jing Yi and politely announced, \"Miss Jing bids 2 million!\"","The three members of the Jing family were seated in the front row of the auction hall. The people behind them, knowing Jing Yi's identity and seeing that she was interested in this item, all wanted to do the Jing family a favor and only participated moderately in the bidding without raising the price further.","The auctioneer looked at Jing Yi again, \"Now we have Miss Jing's bid of 3 million. 3 million, going once.\" Jing Yi felt a pang in her heart – after just a few bids, she was already paying an extra million!","Just as Jing Yi thought she could secure the beautiful bonsai, Shen Huaichu made a bid. He slightly raised his hand, \"6 million.\" Jing Yi took a deep breath; this man truly seemed born to antagonize her!","\"Mr. Shen bids 6 million!\"","Jing Yi was immediately angered by Shen Huaichu's bid increase. She raised her hand again, \"Miss Jing bids 6.2 million!\" Shen Huaichu raised his hand once more, \"8 million.\"","Jing Yi glared at him. Was he just showing off his wealth?!","She raised her hand again, \"Miss Jing bids 8.2 million!\" Shen Huaichu maintained his cold demeanor, \"10 million.\"","The auctioneer's expression became excited, \"Mr. Shen bids 10 million. 10 million, going once!\" He then turned to look at Jing Yi, his eyes questioning whether she would continue bidding."]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: A Token of Gratitude and an Apology","paragraphs":["Jing Yi gritted her teeth and smiled, \"20 million!\" If you want to keep bidding, so be it.","[You can have the item, but you're definitely going to be the biggest sucker here!]","Jing Beicheng frowned slightly, not because he cared about the money, but because he was concerned about the confrontation between Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu.","He had originally planned to tell Shen Huaichu to let Jing Yi win this auction item, but since Jing Yi had her own plans, he decided not to interfere.","The people behind them were also pondering the relationship between these two, but they dared not compete with Shen Huaichu in the auction. Though young, they knew how ruthless he could be.","As expected, Shen Huaichu bid again, \"25 million.\" He had increased his bid by over 20 million now. What a fool and his money!","Lin Ruiqing looked at Jing Yi, \"Aren't you going to bid again? It's for charity, after all, and money isn't an issue.\" Lin Ruiqing could see that Jing Yi quite liked that bonsai and didn't want her to give up because of the price.","Jing Yi linked arms with Lin Ruiqing and said softly, \"I won't bid anymore. I've done my part, haven't I?\"","[After all, I'm the one who drove up the price by over 20 million.]","Lin Ruiqing gently patted her head, thinking she'd buy Jing Yi something she liked later.","Seeing that Jing Yi had no intention of bidding further, the auctioneer brought down the hammer three times, \"This enamel and pink tourmaline peach tree bonsai goes to Mr. Shen of Huarui Group!\"","Jing Yi applauded with the crowd to congratulate him, while inwardly pummeling Shen Huaichu.","As the auction ended and the Jing Beicheng couple were saying goodbye to acquaintances, Jing Yi noticed Shen Huaichu approaching from behind.","Jing Yi turned to face Shen Huaichu with a smile that didn't reach her eyes, \"Congratulations, Mr. Shen. Had I known you were so fond of this bonsai, I wouldn't have competed with you. But the price certainly suits you!\"","What an absolute fool!","Shen Huaichu seemed unfazed, his lips curving slightly, \"Well, I must thank Miss Jing for her generosity.\" Jing Yi replied with a fake smile, \"I'm glad you like it, Mr. Shen.\"","You big sucker!","\"However, this bonsai was actually meant for Miss Jing all along, as a thank you for your assistance,\" he paused, \"and as an apology. I misunderstood you before, and I'm sorry for that.\"","Jing Yi glared at him, carefully glancing towards Lin Ruiqing and her husband, then said sarcastically, \"Mr. Shen, your method of apologizing is truly unique!\"","\"You're too kind.\"","[Who's being kind to you?!]","Just as Jing Yi was about to retort angrily, Jing Beicheng turned and asked, \"What does Mr. Shen mean by 'assistance'?\" Jing Yi quickly shot Shen Huaichu a warning look.","[He'd better not mention those irrelevant matters in front of my parents!]","Seemingly sensing Jing Yi's reluctance to discuss the matter, Shen Huaichu didn't elaborate, \"It's nothing. Miss Jing happened to help me out earlier, so I wanted to give her a token of appreciation.\"","Jing Yi frowned slightly and immediately refused, \"No need, Mr. Shen. A 25-million-yuan gift is far too extravagant for me. You should keep it yourself.\"","Who knew what this man was really up to? His mind was full of twists and turns. Besides, who thanks someone like that?","Not wanting to spend any more time with him, Jing Yi pulled Lin Ruiqing and her husband away.","Shen Huaichu watched Jing Yi's retreating figure, his expression complex.","He had said what needed to be said and thanked her as he should. Shen Huaichu attributed his recent strange feelings to his debt to Jing Yi. Now, they should be even, right?","Once Jing Yi and her family were seated in their car heading home, Lin Ruiqing asked again, \"Yiyi, what did Shen Huaichu mean by 'assistance'?\" Jing Beicheng looked over as well.","Realizing she couldn't hide it anymore, Jing Yi had no choice but to honestly recount her first encounter with Shen Huaichu. She lowered her head, fiddling with her fingers and occasionally stealing glances at Lin Ruiqing and her husband.","Lin Ruiqing's eyes were filled with worry, \"That's so dangerous. Maybe we should assign you a bodyguard when you go out from now on?\"","Jing Yi quickly moved closer, \"Mom, there's no need for a bodyguard. I know self-defense, and that was just a one-time incident.\"","Lin Ruiqing frowned without speaking, so Jing Yi could only turn to Jing Beicheng with a pitiful look, \"Dad?\" Having heard her plea, how could Jing Beicheng resist? He cleared his throat a few times, preparing to join in persuading Lin Ruiqing.","Lin Ruiqing glared at him. This man had caved with just one \"Dad\"!","Jing Beicheng rubbed his nose, feeling a bit guilty. But what else could he do? He had been worried about Jing Yi calling him \"Dad,\" and now that it was happening smoothly, how could he not support her?","Lin Ruiqing turned away in exasperation. She knew Jing Yi was used to her independence and didn't like having someone following her around. \"Fine, but you still need to be more careful in the future.\"","\"Of course!\" Jing Yi immediately agreed with a smile.","Thinking about Shen Huaichu being cornered, Lin Ruiqing mused, \"I never imagined he'd change so much after all these years.\"","Jing Yi was surprised, \"Mom, you've met Shen Huaichu before?\"","Lin Ruiqing became lost in memories. It really had been a long time. When she first met Shen Huaichu, he was just a few years old, following his parents around, a very lively little boy.","Shen Huaichu was about the same age as Jing Zeqian, and they didn't get along from the moment they met, even coming to blows.","Both of them were crying loudly, trying to outdo each other.","Lin Ruiqing knelt down to apologize to him, but little Shen Huaichu wiped his tears and put on a tough act, saying, \"Auntie, I'm not crying! It's just so hot that my eyes are sweating!\"","Jing Yi leaned against Lin Ruiqing, laughing heartily.","\"Later, I saw him again at a banquet. Shen Huaichu was a teenager then, very thin but with a straight back. He was as quiet as he is now, following behind his cousin, almost like a servant, I suppose.\"","Lin Ruiqing had thought of many words, but none fit as well as \"servant.\" Despite the Shen family's pretenses, the young boy's face revealed Shen Huaichu's position in the family.","After that, the next news was of Shen Huaichu becoming the new CEO of Huarui Group.","Jing Yi recalled Jing Zeyou's evaluation of Shen Huaichu, \"Big brother said he's a very capable business partner.\" Jing Beicheng nodded slightly, \"Indeed, he is quite impressive.\"","Seeing Jing Beicheng's agreement, Jing Yi asked curiously, \"Dad, you think he's impressive too?\"","\"We say he's impressive not just because he became the CEO of Huarui Group, but because he's a ruthless person,\" Jing Beicheng explained. Ruthless to others and to himself.","Jing Beicheng looked at Jing Yi, his gaze meaningful, \"Ruthless enough that when interests conflict, his abilities and cold rationality become his best weapons.\" What he wanted to say more was that such a coldly rational person might not be easy to get along with, in any sense of the phrase.","Jing Yi nodded, not fully comprehending.","A hint of a smile flashed in Jing Beicheng's eyes. Well, no matter what, with the Jing Family's support, Jing Yi wouldn't be at a disadvantage."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Who is More Noble Than Whom","paragraphs":["After the auction that day, Jing Yi kept thinking about what Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng had said.","The original book had very little description of Shen Huaichu. One could say he was merely cannon fodder in the story, or more accurately, an NPC in the original book, appearing very rarely.","The original character's biggest impact on Hengjing was disrupting the cooperation between Hengjing and a financial group, a collaboration that held great significance for both conglomerates.","In this incident, both Hengjing and that financial group suffered enormous losses, and Shen Huaichu's Huarui Group was that financial group.","After the failed cooperation, Shen Huaichu never worked with Hengjing again. As the plot focusing on the main characters of the original book increased, he gradually faded from view.","\"He really is a task NPC, and one with a tragic backstory at that,\" Jing Yi silently mused.","However, none of this was her concern. It wasn't she who had harmed Shen Huaichu's parents, and she was going to intervene in the impending crisis facing Hengjing, which would incidentally help him as well.","She thought she was really getting the short end of the stick.","But now, none of this mattered to Jing Yi. She looked around and muttered to herself, \"That North river delicacy recommended by the blogger should be around here, right?\" She parked her car by the roadside and got out.","As she walked, Jing Yi looked at the building in front of her. Its transparent reflective glass mirrored her entire figure. \"... Wait, there's no road here?\"","Jing Yi felt a headache coming on. It seemed she had once again taken a wrong turn. To make matters worse, this particular roujiamo shop didn't offer delivery, and the photos made it look so delicious!","She sighed, deciding to give up. If she continued walking, who knew where she'd end up.","Just as Jing Yi was about to turn back, the sound of an argument nearby caught her attention. Normally, she would have just walked away, as she wasn't one to pry into others' business.","But she saw Shen Huaichu. His drama? Maybe she should watch for a bit before leaving?","Jing Yi quietly walked up behind a group of people who also seemed to be spectating but didn't dare get too close.","Not far away, a young man was kneeling in front of Shen Huaichu. He looked pale and haggard, his eyes full of helplessness and fear. He kept his head low, his voice trembling: \"Please, I beg you, let my parents go.\"","Shen Huaichu seemed unconcerned about being surrounded by onlookers and appeared very impatient with the person in front of him. This was his cousin, the beloved only son of his dear uncle and aunt.","Shen Huaichu glanced at him, his fingers lightly tapping on the roof of the car. His deep eyes were like stars in the night sky, cold and emotionless.","\"You're already on your knees?\" he said coldly. \"Shen Qi'an, I thought you'd have more backbone. Didn't you once tell me that the men of the Shen family should have backbone?\"","Fifteen years ago","\"Shen Huaichu, this cake is pretty good. Come on, eat it.\" The teenage Shen Huaichu looked at the dessert at the speaker's feet, his eyes hiding intense hatred.","Shen Qi'an had a smile on his face, but his words were cruel, \"Hurry up and eat, my friends are waiting.\" He turned to joke with the people beside him, \"Remember, if I win, you'll give me that car of yours.\"","\"Haha, isn't it obvious? He'll definitely do what you say. He's the Shen family's dog after all.\"","Shen Qi'an laughed and retorted, \"What are you saying? That's my cousin.\" But the mockery in his eyes couldn't have been more evident.","Shen Huaichu still ate that cake, crouching on the ground and putting it into his mouth bit by bit.","The cake was very rich and unpleasant to eat.","The group of teenagers watched him, standing in front of him and laughing smugly, \"Shen Huaichu, you really have no backbone! What kind of Shen family man are you? Oh, I forgot, you don't have parents to teach you. Tsk tsk, what a pity.\"","Backbone? What was backbone?","He was going to be the Shen family's dog, to let his uncle see that for the sake of wealth, he was a spineless dog!","Otherwise, how could he get his revenge?","Shen Huaichu felt a bit regretful. He didn't have cake in his hands now, but he also didn't want to play such meaningless games anymore.","\"Why do you think I haven't let you go?\" Shen Huaichu looked down at him condescendingly. \"Both Mrs. Shen and you, I'm just sending them in to reunite. Besides, didn't you just meet?\" His voice was ice-cold, sending chills down one's spine.","Why not just kill them?","Even Shen Tu thought he was being obedient by not dirtying his own hands, but only Shen Huaichu knew what those two were going through in prison.","Why should they be allowed to die without consequences after causing the death of his parents?","Shen Huaichu leaned down close to the person on the ground, \"Do you know why I didn't send you in there too?\" His cousin froze in place, feeling a chill run from head to toe, his hands on his knees involuntarily trembling.","\"Because you're their hope. As long as you're out here, they won't give up on themselves.\"","\"No matter how I treat them, they'll persist for your sake. If they can persist, they can live a bit longer. You'll have parents to teach you then. They'll teach you how to survive, or maybe how to have a bit more backbone, they'll teach you how to stand up to me. What a touching family scene, isn't it moving?\"","Revenge, huh? If they died, how could he get his revenge?","Shen Huaichu's voice was as normal as could be, but Shen Qi'an nearly screamed out loud. He was shaking all over, his eyes full of terror, as if the person in front of him was some kind of demon.","\"Madman! You're a madman!\"","Shen Huaichu shrugged indifferently, kicking away the person kneeling in front of him, and stepped into the car. The bodyguard was about to close the door when Shen Huaichu seemed to think of something and stopped him.","Looking at the desperate person on the ground, he said, \"Remember to visit once a month. If they die in there, we'll all have nothing left to play with.\" The car door closed, and the black business car drove away.","On the other side, the people in front of Jing Yi only dared to discuss after Shen Huaichu had left.","\"...Too cruel, really too cruel.\"","\"I felt scared just looking at his eyes!\"","\"We'd better keep our heads down and do our jobs. With a boss like that...\" He didn't finish his sentence, but Jing Yi understood his implication.","As the group walked away, Jing Yi looked in the direction Shen Huaichu had left, her eyes revealing a different meaning.","\"He followed behind his cousin, I guess that counts as serving him.\"","For some reason, Jing Yi found herself understanding Shen Huaichu at this moment.","They all said he was cruel, but she only saw his pitiful side.","That year, they said it was just a joke, but then the words \"unwanted\" frequently appeared in her ears, on her textbooks, on her desk...","If she was lucky, it was just three words. If she was unlucky, even a bit of resistance from her would bring an even greater storm.","\"You know, this little orphan is quite good-looking.\"","\"You brat without parents to teach you, you dare to fight us with that little body of yours?\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Who is Li Shaocheng","paragraphs":["Later, as she watched those people kneeling before her, their hands trembling and heads bowed, not daring to meet her eyes.","They begged for mercy, their voices quivering with fear, \"I-I was just joking, please spare me!\"","Jing Yi crouched down, smiling lightly, but that smile carried a deep chill, \"A joke? Why couldn't you have spared me?\" Was it because she hadn't begged for mercy?","Jing Yi took a deep breath, trying to expel the turbid air in her heart. Recalling Lin Ruiqing's words, she sighed softly.","\"Fierce? But she's just a pitiful person after all,\" she muttered to herself, gazing in the direction Shen Huaichu had left.","......","At the Jing family restaurant, the whole family had gathered for lunch, a rare occasion.","Tomorrow would be the final recording of the variety show, and Director Xu had already notified Jing Zejun and the others of the specific recording location.","For the last episode, Director Xu planned to bring all the guests together in one villa.","So after this, no one would be coming to install cameras in the Jing family home anymore.","Mr. and Mrs. Jing Beicheng were also planning to embark on their second travel adventure after the children left for the recording.","And after this recording, Jing Zejun was preparing to officially join the cast, with Wen Qingyan conveniently as the male lead.","Jing Yi ate her meal, occasionally glancing up at Jing Zeqian.","[It's been two days, why is he still sulking?]","Ever since learning that Jing Zejun's next script was co-starring with Wen Qingyan, Jing Zeqian hadn't smiled, maintaining a stern expression.","What bothered Jing Zeqian wasn't just Wen Qingyan's 'ulterior motives', but that he knew about the script too, and it was indeed a rare good script, which is precisely why he was angry.","That guy had planned everything from the start, anticipating that he definitely wouldn't obstruct it!","Although no one would listen to his objections.","In the current situation, even if they held a family meeting, he would probably be the only dissenting vote...","Lin Ruiqing had no time to worry about whether her son had the appetite to eat, he was even more controlling than her as a mother.","\"You're going to join the cast as soon as you get back?\" Lin Ruiqing asked with concern, worried that the continuous work might be too intense for Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun smiled, \"Don't worry, Mom. Recording the variety show is much more relaxing, it's almost like a break.\"","This wasn't a lie, 'Dear Family' was an indoor variety show, and recording with family made it even more enjoyable. She was even a bit reluctant to see it end.","As for the upcoming work with the cast, while it would inevitably be tiring, Jing Zejun was more excited than anything. She really liked that script.","Lin Ruiqing nodded, \"That's good. By the way, what kind of script is it again?\"","It was an infinite flow script, starting with the male lead discovering strange occurrences in the familiar school setting, with each story carrying some thrilling elements.","Jing Zejun had stayed up all night reading the script, finding it incredibly impactful.","But Jing Zejun was hesitant about accepting this role, after all, Wen Qingyan had already been cast as the male lead, and she didn't want to diminish his popularity.","However, her manager didn't care about such things. Since they had extended the olive branch, especially with such an excellent script, how could she let Jing Zejun pass it up?","Moreover, she was confident that if Jing Zejun took the role, this drama would definitely help her break out of the third-tier ranks!","\"Even if you don't accept the script, you're already tied together now. Wen Qingyan's intentions are probably known to everyone.\"","Jing Zejun felt troubled, her manager's words were indeed correct.","Seeing that Jing Zejun seemed to be wavering, she pressed on, \"You know this script is good, you shouldn't miss this opportunity. Do you think Wen Qingyan is the type of person who would use his privilege for personal gain?\"","In the end, Jing Zejun decided to audition and successfully landed the female lead role.","\"It's an infinite flow script called 'The 19th Floor Campus'.\"","Lin Ruiqing didn't read much fiction and didn't quite understand what Jing Zejun meant by infinite flow, so she just took it as a regular campus drama, \"Is Wen Qingyan also playing a student?\" Jing Zejun nodded.","Jing Zeqian immediately scoffed, \"Pretending to be young!\" Lin Ruiqing looked at him exasperatedly, \"Is that how you talk about Startrack's artists?\" Where's his CEO demeanor?","Jing Zeqian stubbornly retorted, \"So what? I'm just stating facts. He's almost thirty, and he's still playing a student?\"","Lin Ruiqing countered, \"He's not even thirty! He's only in his twenties, and you're three years older than him.\" Besides, Wen Qingyan's naturally youthful looks made him perfectly suitable for student roles.","Of course, there was another important reason why Lin Ruiqing was speaking up for Wen Qingyan - his attitude towards Jing Zejun. How could she not see that Wen Qingyan liked her Jun Jun?","Watching the livestreams, every time she saw Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun standing together, she thought they looked quite compatible. Firstly, this young man had already made a name and achievements in his field at such a young age, and secondly, his personality seemed quite nice too.","Jing Zeqian was left speechless, once again defeated.","Jing Yi buried her head, chuckling, and Jing Zeqian glanced at her.","Why bother hiding? Her laughter was already deafening!","Jing Zeqian looked helplessly at Lin Ruiqing, \"Mom, am I still your son?\" Lin Ruiqing was even more straightforward, \"I'm just telling the truth.\"","Jing Zeqian's gaze grew increasingly plaintive, and Lin Ruiqing coughed lightly, quickly averting her eyes.","\"By the way, where's your recording location tomorrow?\" Jing Zejun mentioned a place, some distance from North river.","Hearing Lin Ruiqing mention the livestream, Jing Zeyou remembered something he hadn't mentioned yet.","\"When you go there tomorrow, keep an eye on that Li Shaocheng.\"","Jing Yi looked up, puzzled, \"Who's Li Shaocheng?\"","Jing Zeqian was exasperated, \"You don't even know who's recording the same variety show with you?\" Jing Yi retorted, \"This is a family variety show, I've been with you guys the whole time, how would I know about others?\"","Jing Zejun briefly introduced Li Shaocheng to Jing Yi.","Jing Zeyou then explained what he had found out about the source of the water army, \"Last time when Director Xu mentioned the situation with the livestream comments to me, I had someone investigate. There indeed was a water army, hired by that Li Shaocheng.\"","Jing Yi sat beside them, furrowing her brow in concentration as she tried to recall the edited version of the first episode she had seen.","\"Oh, oh, you mean that sweet girl who can sing and dance!\"","Jing Zeqian's lips curled into a smirk, his eyes filled with mockery, \"What sweet girl? You've affected her popularity, so she's hired a water army to smear you.\"","Jing Zejun clearly tried to explain further, especially since they were a pair of sisters on their side, and Li Shaocheng's side also had a pair of sisters.","Jing Yi listened until her head ached, \"It's so complicated! I thought only people in the same field would be competitive. Give me a break!\""]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Family Riddle Quiz","paragraphs":["Jing Zeyou had not expected Li Shaocheng to so blatantly hire an army of internet trolls to attack the Jing Family.","He looked at Jing Yi, \"Don't worry about these things. She's only capable of these small tricks.\" Jing Yi nodded and picked up a piece of taro with her chopsticks.","[It's just the last episode anyway. After this, we probably won't see each other again.]","Jing Zeyou's eyes flickered. After the final episode, Li Shaocheng would likely never be seen in the entertainment industry again.","Early the next morning, after the rain, the sky cleared and the sun rose in the east.","The production team had made all the preparations at the filming location and opened the main livestream room, waiting for the guests to arrive.","[I can't believe this is already the last live broadcast. I'm not ready for it to end!]","[I haven't had enough of watching Young Master Jing and Jing Yi banter!]","[Don't worry, everyone! We still have the edited version, right?]","[It'll be a while before we can see Emperor Wen again!]","[That's right, he doesn't participate in variety shows. We can only see him in the cinema now.]","As soon as the broadcast began, the comments in the main livestream room were already enthusiastic. At this time, the first family group entered - it was Chen Yu and his wife.","\"Hello everyone, long time no see!\"","The couple greeted the audience in the livestream room and then sat down on the sofa in the living room, waiting for the other guests.","Not long after, Jing Yi and Jing Zejun walked in, with Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian following behind, pulling their luggage.","Seeing the newcomers, Chen Yu and his wife quickly stood up. They were somewhat aware that one of their show's guests was the CEO of a top global company.","Jing Zejun stepped forward, acting as the 'diplomat'. \"Brother Chen, Sister Lin, hello, I'm Jing Zejun.\" The couple hurriedly greeted them back.","Jing Zejun then introduced the people behind him, \"This is my sister Jing Yi, this is my eldest brother Jing Zeyou, and that's my second brother Jing Zeqian.\" Looking at it this way, their family really did have a lot of members.","The three of them greeted Chen Yu and his wife.","Jing Zejun looked around and asked, \"Are we waiting for everyone to arrive?\" Chen Yu replied, \"Yes, Director Xu said he'd announce the subsequent arrangements once everyone is here.\" He seemed a bit nervous, especially when facing Jing Zeyou.","Jing Zeyou gradually steered the conversation towards the sports meet, mentioning things he was good at. Chen Yu visibly relaxed, and the atmosphere in the living room improved considerably.","\"Sister Jing Yi!\"","Wen Qingyan and Wen Yin walked into the living room with their luggage. Wen Yin immediately greeted Jing Yi. Ever since he had seen Jing Yi racing, he had become her little fanboy.","Wen Qingyan also walked over to where Jing Zejun and the others were standing. \"Mr. Jing, have you been here long?\"","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms, looking displeased at this person. He was clearly greeting him, so why did his eyes keep drifting towards his sister?","In his opinion, if Wen Qingyan hadn't been out of town on business before coming here, he probably would have tried to come along with them.","\"Brother Qingyan, we just arrived not long ago,\" Jing Zejun explained with a gentle smile.","Wen Qingyan automatically stood next to Jing Zejun, and the two began chatting. As soon as the two got together, the comments in the livestream began scrolling uncontrollably.","A few minutes later, Cheng Cheng's family and the Li Shaocheng sisters also arrived at the villa. For the first time, all five families were gathered together. Jing Yi scanned the room.","There really were a lot of people.","[At this moment, an expression pack of a famous actress floated by: So many people!]","[Wen Qingyan, you're really being too obvious...]","[Jing Yi's little glances that have nowhere to land.]","[Orange, I'm here!]","Director Xu officially announced the rules for this episode's recording, \"This is our last live broadcast. There are no specific rules this time. We just hope everyone can eat well and have fun here!\"","The surroundings fell silent, with no reaction to the director's words. Jing Yi's gaze was filled with deep skepticism; she didn't believe the director would be so kind-hearted.","Director Xu smiled helplessly, \"There really are no rules. We just want everyone to gather together, experience the differences between various family relationships, and draw a perfect conclusion to this variety show.\"","After the preamble, it was time to get down to business. \"We've prepared a suite for each family, but they're of different grades, so it depends on your efforts!\"","Everyone thought: Is this what you call eating well and having fun?","Director Xu innocently replied: We still need to have some procedures, right?","\"As for the choice of suites, it will be decided by each family's level of tacit understanding!\"","In simple terms, the other four families would take turns asking questions, and each family would select two contestants to answer, to see if their answers matched.","Director Xu took out several sketchbooks and pens, handing them out to the five families.","The first to go were Chen Yu and his wife. The questions from the other four families mostly revolved around their wedding anniversary, the most memorable places they'd been, and so on.","The couple gave matching answers to most questions, with the livestream audience exclaiming about their love and expressing envy.","Cheng Cheng and his parents had slightly less tacit understanding, mainly because they weren't very familiar with each other's work and life.","Wen Qingyan and Wen Yin were also doing okay. The surprise came from Li Shaocheng's group - many of their answers didn't match, and they even wrote different dates for the older sister's birthday.","The older sister looked embarrassed and explained, \"Because I don't celebrate the birthday on my ID card. Orange usually celebrates two birthdays for me, so we remembered different dates. It was my mistake.\"","[Not to be rude, but this group is really starting to break their image! What's going on?]","[It's normal to forget birthdays, you can't possibly remember the birthdays of all your relatives!]","[That's true, but don't forget Li Shaocheng is supposed to have the image of a good sister.]","[The key point is, why did the older sister admit she was wrong?]","[Just watch, they're completely silent. They don't look like close sisters at all.]","Everyone could only gloss over it like this.","Finally, it was Jing Zejun's family's turn. Jing Yi and Jing Zejun were the contestants.","They sat with their backs to each other on opposite sides. Chen Yu began to ask, \"What is Zejun's birthday?\" The corners of Jing Zeqian's mouth turned up. He had previously thought this brother looked too honest, but was he really honest or just cunning?","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun's birthdays were only a month apart, so of course Jing Yi couldn't get it wrong.","Seeing the identical answers from the two, Li Shaocheng's face darkened another shade. At this moment, the livestream comments erupted into another round of heated discussion.","Cheng Cheng started to ask, \"What is Jing Yi's favorite food?\"","Jing Zejun's eyes sparkled with confidence as he wrote down his answer: All dishes made by Aunt Wang. Jing Yi also wrote: All food made by Aunt Wang!","Wen Qingyan looked at Jing Zejun with gentle eyes and asked softly, \"What kind of love does Jing Zejun look forward to?\"","As soon as this question was asked, even the production team members looked over. Come on, you can't make things difficult for Jing Yi just because you're pursuing someone, right?","Who could possibly give identical answers to this?","Jing Yi indeed hesitated for a moment before writing down two characters: Equality.","On the other side, Jing Zejun also wrote two characters."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Who is the Little Princess of the Jing Family","paragraphs":["The words 'equality' appeared on Jing Zejun's drawing board.","At this, even Jing Zeqian couldn't sit still anymore. He widened his eyes, staring at the drawing boards in front of the two of them. \"Did you two cheat behind my back?! How could you get such a broad question right?\"","Something wasn't right though - he couldn't hear Jing Yi's thoughts?","Jing Yi was speechless and ignored him.","Wen Qingyan looked at the two characters Jing Zejun had written, deep in thought.","Finally, only Li Shaocheng was left. She looked at Jing Yi, a sweet smile on her face, but asked, \"May I ask, who is the little princess of the Jing family?\" The living room fell into a deathly silence.","Even Wen Yin could hear the intention behind Li Shaocheng's question.","Jing Zeyou narrowed his eyes slightly, looking towards Li Shaocheng. It seemed she had no intention of holding back.","[What's wrong with Li Shaocheng? Is she sick?!]","[This question is clearly aimed at destroying the relationship between the Jing sisters! How awful!]","[The key is that answering with one person isn't good, but writing the other person's name isn't right either!]","[Orange is just asking casually. If their relationship can be ruined by one sentence, what kind of sisters are they?!]","[You people are too hostile towards Orange! I didn't hear anything wrong with it?]","[The person above should get their ears checked. Li Shaocheng's intentions can be heard from two miles away!]","Director Xu was about to ease the atmosphere and ask Li Shaocheng to ask a different question, but Jing Yi had already started writing, seemingly without much thought.","Jing Zeqian was a bit worried. For such a question, Jing Yi would definitely write Jing Zejun, but he didn't want Jing Yi to feel wronged.","On the other side, Jing Zejun seemed to have thought of something and wrote down three characters with a smile.","\"Now, please both of you raise your answers at the same time.\" Since they had already written, this was the only way.","Jing Zeyou was the first to see Jing Yi's answer, his eyes filled with obvious amusement. On Jing Yi's board, three large characters were clearly written: Jing Zeqian.","And Jing Zejun had obviously written the same three characters.","\"Hahahahaha!\" Wen Yin couldn't hold back and burst out laughing. Except for Li Shaocheng, everyone unconsciously started laughing.","As the main character, Jing Zeqian puffed up his cheeks and looked at Jing Yi. Jing Yi, give me back my worry!","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving into crescents, dimples appearing at the corners of her mouth, looking so lively. She smiled and high-fived Jing Zejun.","Of course, the little princess of the Jing family could only be Jing Zeqian!","[Hahaha, slapped in the face! Still want to sow discord between our 'Jun Yi'!]","[Look! Look! Li Shaocheng's face looks so bad!]","[What they said is really true, the little princess of the Jing family is Jing Zeqian!]","[Did no one notice the tacit understanding between Jing Yi and Jing Zejun? Their relationship must be so good to be this in sync!]","Director Xu tallied the tacit understanding scores of the five families. \"Then the order for choosing suites will be: Jing Zejun siblings, Chen Yu couple, Wen Qingyan brothers, Cheng Cheng's family, and finally Li Shaocheng sisters.\"","Li Shaocheng hadn't expected this result, and her smile became a bit stiff.","The production team had specially prepared five different levels of rooms. The first class could enjoy an entire floor; the second class also had two complete rooms and a living room; the third class was a standard hotel suite with a relatively large master bedroom and living room.","The fourth and fifth classes were a bit worse. The fourth was a standard hotel room with two single beds; the fifth was just like a small motel room.","Jing Yi looked at the picture of the last room with some relief. It was good that they could choose first. If they really had to sleep in a small motel, Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian would have to sleep on the floor.","\"Now the five families can come up in order to choose.\"","Jing Zejun didn't hesitate and directly took the first-class photo. Her family had the most people, and if she deliberately gave up the room to show modesty, it would seem a bit fake.","When it was Chen Yu couple's turn, they instead chose the third class. Director Xu looked at them in surprise.","Chen Yu scratched the back of his head, a bit embarrassed. \"The second class has two rooms, which would be a bit wasteful for us.\" The other guests smiled kindly.","Wen Yin came up and took the standard hotel room, smiling so wide his little tiger tooth showed. \"Perfect, my brother and I can each have a bed!\" Seeing that Wen Qingyan also agreed, Director Xu didn't say anything more.","Cheng Cheng's face reddened a bit. He understood that everyone was accommodating his family. He had previously thought that at worst they could get a standard room, which although not very convenient, would still be okay.","Now instead, they had left the second-class suite for him. Cheng Cheng took the second-class suite with a red face and thanked the other guests, leaving the small motel room for Li Shaocheng sisters to take last.","[What's wrong with this guy?! He doesn't have any gentlemanly qualities at all?]","[How thick-skinned, maybe Film Emperor Wen was leaving it for the two girls?!]","[Above, what are you thinking?! Has your brain stopped working?]","Cheng Cheng's fans were not to be trifled with. Cheng Cheng had debuted early, and although his fan numbers couldn't compete with Li Shaocheng's, almost all of those who remained were fans with strong fighting spirit.","Seeing Li Shaocheng's fans say such things, they immediately went on the offensive!","[I'm saying, can you Orange fans have some self-awareness? Don't you understand who it was left for?]","[Chen Yu and Wen Qingyan left it for Cheng Cheng because he's a family of three.]","[Who can compete with Li Shaocheng's fans in terms of thick skin?]","[Don't try to involve Wen Qingyan, or we won't be polite either!]","[What's wrong with a family of three living in a suite? How can Li Shaocheng's two people not live there?]","Li Shaocheng's fans were quickly ganged up on by the other fandoms and had to slink away in silence.","After arranging the rooms, the guests took their suitcases upstairs to see their rooms.","The second floor was taken over by Jing Zejun's family, with a total of four rooms, living room, kitchen, and main bathroom all included.","Jing Yi curiously looked at each room. \"The lighting is quite good over here!\" Sunlight was already streaming through the latticed windows onto the gray bedding.","Jing Zeqian nodded with satisfaction. \"Then I'll take this room.\" Jing Yi immediately stuck out her hand, \"Rock, paper, scissors!\"","Jing Zeqian's pupils dilated slightly. He had thought that him taking this room was a matter of course.","Of the four rooms, two were in deep tones, and two were obviously for girls, with one being excessively pink. It was unclear whose trashy aesthetic that was.","Obviously, Jing Yi wasn't very interested in that room either.","Jing Zeqian looked very serious, hands behind his back. He stared intently at Jing Yi, trying to see from her eyes what she would choose, but there were too many people around and he couldn't hear anything!","There was no choice but to hope the goddess of luck was on his side.","The surrounding guests watched this scene with amusement. In the past, they had only seen the two bickering on screen. Watching it in person was really interesting.","To prevent Jing Zeqian from cheating, Jing Yi added, \"One round decides!\" Jing Zeqian nodded solemnly.","\"Rock, paper, scissors!\"","Jing Yi looked in disbelief at her own outstretched fingers, which trembled slightly. She had lost!","Jing Zeqian laughed without mercy. \"Jing Yi, hurry up and move your suitcase to your little pink room!\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Do I Look Like a Fool","paragraphs":["Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi's drooping shoulders and found it a bit amusing. \"Yi, you can switch with me.\"","\"No way!\"","Jing Yi immediately refused. She had to accept the consequences of the bet - it was just a pink suite after all, and she only had to sleep there for a week.","Li Shaocheng, standing nearby, watched this scene and secretly clenched her fists. She smiled and said, \"Yi, if you don't like it, you can switch with my sister and me. It's perfect since you're alone, and it's quite cramped for my sister and me over there.\"","Li Shaocheng wore the smile of a caring sister, and when mentioning the small room, she even looked pitifully towards Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian.","But she failed to notice the complex looks from the other guests around her when she said this.","[Why does she have to be everywhere?!]","[Does she really think this makes her look cute?]","[This is too annoying, I think four families were just fine...]","[How can Orange and her sister fit in that room? Jing Yi is alone anyway, what's wrong with letting her have it?]","[Yeah, didn't Wen Qingyan and the others give up their room for Cheng Cheng?]","[? You're standing on such high moral ground, the wind must be strong up there. Hold tight to your moral superiority!]","Jing Yi's expression became even more complex. \"Are you saying I should go live in the small single room while you stay in the luxury suite with my family?\"","[What exactly makes her think I'm an idiot?]","Li Shaocheng was stunned. She had imagined many reactions, but never expected Jing Yi to state her intentions so directly.","Jing Zeqian's eyes showed some impatience, and he was about to say something when Jing Zeyou stepped forward first, the corner of his mouth slightly raised. \"Miss Li, I think it's better to respect the rules of the game, don't you agree?\"","Li Shaocheng's sister laughed awkwardly, \"Orange was just joking.\" Li Shaocheng's face darkened for a moment, but she quickly recovered, forcing a smile, \"How could I really come to disturb everyone? It was just a joke.\"","She hadn't expected Jing Zeyou to be so unaccommodating, thinking he would at least consider the cameras a bit.","Jing Zeyou glanced at Li Shaocheng without saying anything more.","Sensing the awkward atmosphere, the other families picked up their suitcases and returned to their rooms. Li Shaocheng's sister quickly grabbed her suitcase and pulled Li Shaocheng away.","Jing Zeqian stood with his arms crossed, watching Li Shaocheng's retreating figure. His lips were pressed together, his eyes cold, but he didn't speak due to the cameras.","Jing Yi's expression was hard to read. She solemnly patted Jing Zeqian's shoulder, \"Second brother, I've secured your room for you. Go ahead.\"","Jing Zeqian was momentarily stunned, feeling touched for a second before realizing what was happening. He glared at Jing Yi, \"Who's securing what for whom! Go, go, go back to your own room!\"","Jing Yi looked slightly disappointed.","[I thought he would fall for it. What a pity.]","Jing Zeqian was fuming, pointing at Jing Yi's back as she walked away. \"Big brother, does Jing Yi really think I'm an idiot?!\" Jing Zeyou smiled helplessly and returned to his room.","Downstairs, Li Shaocheng's sister was preparing lunch when Jing Yi and Jing Zejun entered, startling her. \"I saw it was almost noon, so I took the liberty of preparing something...\"","She looked very nervous. Jing Yi felt a bit sorry for startling her.","\"I'm sorry, did I scare you? I should have knocked to let you know we were coming.\" Her eyes showed apology.","Li Shaocheng's sister shook her head quickly, \"No, I just didn't notice anyone coming.\" She had just been sent out by Li Shaocheng, so she thought she'd spend some time in the kitchen where there were fewer cameras.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun seemed very easy to get along with, and Li Shaocheng's sister's expression relaxed a bit. They started to chat casually.","\"By the way, we haven't introduced ourselves. I'm Jing Yi.\" Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"I'm Jing Zejun.\"","Li Shaocheng's sister said softly, \"My name is Li Yujia.\" She had known about them all along, as Li Shaocheng often talked about these two. It would have been hard not to remember them.","The stove was covered with ingredients, and Jing Yi felt overwhelmed just looking at it.","\"This is lunch for thirteen people, how can we let you prepare it alone? I'll go call my second brother and the others down!\"","With that, Jing Yi turned and left the kitchen before Li Yujia could even call out to her.","Seeing her look worried, Jing Zejun reassured her, \"It's alright. We're all going to eat, so it's only right that we help.\"","Li Yujia's earlier reaction had also caught her attention. \"Yi can be a bit impulsive. I hope she didn't startle you earlier.\" Li Yujia shook her head slightly, her eyes showing a hint of panic, \"Not at all.\"","The kitchen fell silent again.","Li Yujia was peeling shrimp, her lips slightly pursed. \"Miss Jing Yi seems to understand you very well...\" Li Yujia remembered the seamless question and answer between the two earlier.","Li Yujia couldn't understand why they, who were just sisters without blood relation, could so easily overcome Li Shaocheng's careful planning.","Jing Zejun smiled, her eyes filled with warmth. \"Actually, Yi and I only met not long ago.\"","As she spoke, she organized the ingredients on the table. \"She's a very simple person. She may seem carefree, but she's actually more attentive than anyone. I often say she's my sister, but in reality, I'm the one being taken care of.\"","Li Yujia lowered her head, her mind filled with images of her parents and Li Shaocheng. \"But, shouldn't the youngest in the family be the most cared for?\"","Li Yujia's words seemed disconnected, which Jing Zejun found a bit strange, but she still answered, \"It's actually not like that for us. Since there are four children in the family, our parents don't really get involved in our conflicts.\"","Many viewers noticed Li Yujia's low spirits.","[I feel like Li Shaocheng's sister is about to break...]","[I just learned today that her name is Li Yujia, I only knew her as Orange's sister before.]","[The way the Jing family parents handle things is really great. They're all children, there's no need for anyone to always give in to others. Isn't it everyone's first time being a child?]","[Is Li Shaocheng's sister asking this because Li Shaocheng is very pampered at home?]","Meanwhile, Jing Yi had already dragged Jing Zeqian and Jing Zeyou over. Li Yujia looked even more nervous, her expression evasive. She still remembered Jing Zeyou's warning look to Li Shaocheng earlier.","Jing Zeyou didn't seem to mind, taking the vegetables Jing Yi had assigned him and washing them nearby. Compared to last time, his movements were much more practiced.","Jing Zeqian leaned lazily against the door. \"Don't tell me we have to prepare meals for everyone else too?\" Jing Yi glanced at him, handing him the food that needed peeling. \"Peel these.\"","Jing Zeqian's expression was reluctant, but he still obediently squatted in the corner to peel. The viewers watching this scene were quite amused.","\"Sister Yujia, what are you planning to make? We can help you with the prep work.\"","Li Yujia looked a bit dazed. The kitchen was getting more and more crowded, with people her sister disliked and feared, but at this moment, Li Yujia didn't seem as nervous as before.","\"...The ingredients in the fridge are quite varied. I can only make a few dishes I know. Oh, there are also quite a lot of seafood down there. Do any of you know how to cook seafood?\"","Jing Yi's eyes lit up. She opened the lower compartment of the fridge and indeed saw it full of seafood ingredients.","\"I'll go call Little Yin!\""]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Live Leak, Persona Collapse","paragraphs":["The kitchen in the villa was originally quite spacious, but with so many people, they had to send out a few who weren't of much use.","For example, Jing Zeyou, Jing Zeqian, and Wen Qingyan - the last one was collateral damage, as there simply wasn't enough room for him to cook.","[Hahaha, they look so pitiful!]","[Who would have thought that Hengjing's CEO would have a day of being unwanted...]","[That's too much! You're all having fun in there, isolating my Orange!]","[Excuse me, but it was your Orange who said she wasn't feeling well and needed to rest.]","[The atmosphere is so much better without that one person!]","It was Jing Yi's first time cooking with so many people, and already there was a table full of diverse dishes in front of her.","Meanwhile, Li Yujia went to call Li Shaocheng.","However, when Li Shaocheng heard that everyone else was cooking and only she was absent, her expression soured.","Mindful of the cameras, Li Shaocheng forced a smile and said, \"Sister, why didn't you call me to join? It's not good for me to be the only one resting.\"","Jing Yi, who was preparing the last set of dishes and utensils, heard Li Shaocheng's words and looked over curiously, \"Didn't you say you weren't feeling well?\" Li Shaocheng's face darkened even more.","Jing Zeqian pressed his lips together, suppressing a smile.","Chen Yu's wife, seeing the atmosphere become tense, quickly invited Li Shaocheng and the others to sit down and eat, \"It's alright, your sister was in charge of cooking and has already prepared your portion.\"","Hearing her words, Li Shaocheng's expression became even more unpleasant.","[I'm really about to die laughing, is Jing Yi some kind of green tea buster?]","[Hahaha, Sister Lin originally wanted to ease the situation, but the more she spoke, the worse Li Shaocheng's face got!]","[How many natural-born roasters are there in this house? Hahaha]","[Why can't they mention the sister being in charge of cooking?]","[Don't you know? Li Shaocheng has been emphasizing that her sister can't cook.]","[I even suspect that the previous desserts were also made by her sister.]","On the dining table, in the center was the seafood platter made by Wen Yin and the radish beef brisket and braised fish made by Li Yujia, surrounded by dishes made by others, all looking very appetizing.","Jing Yi immediately went for the seafood platter, \"Little Yin, you're really amazing!\" Wen Yin seemed a bit embarrassed, \"It's actually quite simple.\"","Jing Yi had been by Wen Yin's side the whole time, observing and assisting him. The preparation was indeed quite troublesome, but Wen Yin's movements were very skillful, and she basically hadn't been able to help much.","Li Shaocheng's eyes flashed with disdain, it's just a plate of seafood, what's so special about it?","Everyone at the table was eating happily except for Li Shaocheng. Li Yujia's beef brisket was also very popular. Sister Lin casually praised, \"Yujia's cooking skills are really good, Shaocheng must have been well-fed by her sister, right?\"","The air at the dining table froze for a second.","Sister Lin hadn't actually watched the other guests' livestreams, and seeing Li Yujia's skilled manner, she assumed she was the one who cooked more at home.","But the others who were in the entertainment industry more or less knew about the controversy surrounding the Li Shaocheng sisters on the internet.","Hearing Sister Lin's words, they all lowered their heads without speaking, to avoid laughing out loud.","The smile on Li Shaocheng's lips vanished instantly, a momentary gloom crossing her brow before she quickly resumed smiling.","But the smile at the corners of her mouth seemed forced, \"I didn't realize my sister had such talent. Usually, I do most of the cooking, it seems we've really been overlooking her abilities.\"","Li Yujia looked a bit uncomfortable, forcing a smile, \"Yeah, it's just a coincidence.\" Sister Lin finally noticed the oddness between the two and, after exchanging a glance with Chen Yu beside her, closed her mouth and continued eating.","Jing Yi looked up, somewhat surprised, \"Really? I thought Sister Yujia knew how to cook originally. But if she's a beginner, that's even more impressive!\"","Everyone else: It's clear she's genuinely praising...","Jing Zeqian put a piece of beef brisket in her bowl, \"Just eat your food!\" If this went on, Li Shaocheng might die of anger on the spot.","Although Jing Yi was a bit confused, she obediently ate her food without saying more. The dining table returned to silence.","[Pfft!]","[Pfft! Pfft! I'm not laughing, really!]","[Jing Yi is just too cute!]","The afternoon was basically free time.","Li Shaocheng was circling around Wen Qingyan, \"Brother Qingyan, you can even ride a bicycle? That's amazing. I wanted to look around the area this morning! But I don't know how to ride, could you please give me a lift?\"","Anyway, her reputation was already like this, and since she couldn't salvage it, at least she couldn't lose her popularity!","Wen Qingyan was pushing the bicycle, his eyes showing impatience. He had originally wanted to ask Jing Zejun if he wanted to go cycling together, but this person just latched onto him.","[...Does anyone know what Li Shaocheng is trying to do again?]","[Can't she just go away?]","[I knew she would definitely cling to brother to leech off him!]","[Orange just wants to be friendly, can't you guys see people in a less dirty way?]","[The one above, Li Shaocheng might as well have 'Bad publicity is still publicity' written on her face!]","Wen Qingyan, annoyed by her pestering, said emotionlessly, \"Actually, I don't know how to ride either, I just brought it out to have a look.\" Li Shaocheng's expression froze on her face.","Li Shaocheng watched as he pushed the bicycle back, her hands clenched tightly, gritting her teeth. After Wen Qingyan left, Li Yujia came forward and tugged at Li Shaocheng's sleeve, her expression somewhat tired.","\"Orange, let's go.\"","Li Shaocheng suppressed the urge to shake her off, and walked stiffly towards the villa. Li Yujia could only follow her.","\"Sorry, my sister and I have something private to discuss.\" Li Shaocheng forced a smile as she blocked the cameraman outside the door, not noticing the staff's attempt to say something.","As soon as the door closed, Li Shaocheng's face darkened, \"What are you trying to do?\"","Li Yujia looked exhausted, \"I should be asking you that. What exactly are you trying to do? It's the last episode, can't we just get through it peacefully?\" Always causing trouble for the Jing Zejun siblings, and now clinging to Wen Qingyan.","Why couldn't she just be content with the status quo?","Li Shaocheng's lips curled into a mocking smile, \"How can I be at peace? I prepared for so long, just wanting to become famous through this show, and now it's all been ruined by them. Now you must be pleased, everyone is praising you!\"","Li Shaocheng's voice gradually became frantic, \"You're so great, you can cook, you're sensible, you know how to take care of your sister, you have excellent grades, you graduated from a prestigious school! I just have to snatch all of these away from you!\"","She let out a cold laugh, \"You think I don't know? Why did you choose to study in such a faraway city?\" Her voice was icy, and Li Yujia unconsciously took half a step back.","\"Isn't it just to escape from me and our parents? Li Yujia, let me tell you, don't even think about it! In this life, you're destined to never surpass me, Li Shaocheng!\"","Li Yujia stared blankly at Li Shaocheng's frenzied appearance, murmuring, \"So you knew? Why?\"","Li Shaocheng curled her lips, her eyes mocking, \"Why? If I can't win against them, can't I at least beat you? Sister, of course I need to always stand above you, only then can I sleep soundly!\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: The Most Embarrassing Moments for Each Other","paragraphs":["Li Yujia looked at her in disbelief, her eyes slightly red, her voice very soft, \"Am I just your sister? In your mouth, I'm like an object, something to be trampled under your feet for a lifetime, just to boost your confidence.\"","Li Shaocheng didn't seem to realize how cruel her words were, glancing sideways at her, \"Isn't that what Mom and Dad have always told you?\"","Li Yujia's face turned pale. Li Shaocheng was about to say something else when there came an urgent knock at the door.","She looked annoyed but still composed herself, smiling as she opened the door. Outside was Director Xu, his expression anxious and uneasy.","\"Director Xu, is something wrong?\"","Director Xu spoke urgently: \"Shaocheng, I forgot to tell you, the staff just installed cameras in the rooms. You didn't say anything, did you?\" The last sentence was probing, but Li Shaocheng's face had already turned deathly pale.","It was due to viewers' suggestions that Director Xu had decided to do a 24-hour live broadcast at the last minute. After all, there were only a few days left, and the afternoon was free time. He never imagined any guests would return to their rooms to talk!","Seeing Li Shaocheng's expression, Director Xu understood everything!","At the same time, a trending topic appeared on Weibo: \"I can only sleep soundly if I'm always standing above you!\"","[What kind of sister is this?! She's like an enemy!]","[Help, it's the middle of the afternoon, and I'm getting goosebumps just hearing this...]","[I always thought there was something odd about Li Shaocheng's relationship with her sister. She's always subtly putting her down. How terrifying!]","[Her sister must have the worst luck in the world to have a sister like that!]","[No! What's even scarier is that Li Shaocheng's parents treat her sister the same way!]","[No wonder her sister always looks so nervous on camera, afraid of saying the wrong thing. I thought she was just wooden...]","[Maybe it's just the sisters arguing! Don't blow it out of proportion!]","[Wow! There are still fans trying to defend this! If you had a sister like that, wouldn't you find it terrifying?]","The production team called an emergency meeting, and Li Shaocheng received a call from her manager, \"Li Shaocheng, you've really outdone yourself. You managed to create such a huge mess on your last variety show!\"","Li Shaocheng's face was pale. She wanted to say something, but her manager didn't give her the chance, \"You're done with the show, and don't even think about any chance of a comeback!\" He hung up the phone.","Li Shaocheng collapsed to the ground. It was over, everything was over, she had nothing left...","Due to the live broadcast incident, Li Shaocheng was asked to leave as soon as possible. Li Yujia sat blankly on the grass, lost in thought.","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun exchanged a glance, and Jing Yi decided to go over and chat with her.","\"Sister Yujia.\"","Li Yujia's eyes flickered, and she forced a smile, \"I'm sorry for causing you trouble.\" Her first thought was that the production team must be upset about such a conversation being broadcast.","Jing Yi frowned slightly, \"Sister Yujia, you haven't caused anyone trouble. You're Li Shaocheng's sister, not her accessory. You don't need to apologize for her.\"","Li Yujia's nose tingled, and her eyes welled up with tears.","\"She always wants the best of everything, to be better than everyone else. I've always known that, but I never knew that she just saw me as something to step on...\"","Jing Zejun sighed inwardly, walked to her side, and sat down. \"What do you plan to do now?\"","Li Yujia blinked, looking up at the sky. \"Actually, I decided a while ago that I would definitely leave.\"","Li Shaocheng had suffered a major blow this time, and their parents would certainly blame her first. Li Yujia had had enough of this family; she really wanted to live a life that belonged only to her.","She had been timid for over twenty years, and the only courage she had was shattered by Li Shaocheng.","Now, it was time to pick up the pieces.","\"If you need any help, just ask me,\" Jing Zejun said, wanting Li Yujia to fulfill her wishes. It was time for her to live her own life.","Li Yujia smiled faintly, \"Thank you. I've always been curious, why is your relationship so good?\" Even though you're not related by blood, and were even considered 'competitors' before.","She at least wanted to know where Li Shaocheng had lost out.","Jing Zejun smiled gently, \"Because we've both seen each other at our most vulnerable.\" Jing Yi with tears and snot, and Jing Zejun in despair.","Jing Yi smiled a bit embarrassedly, naturally knowing that Jing Zejun was referring to when they first met.","Jing Zejun smiled again, his eyes filled with warmth: \"When I'm with her, I'm at my most comfortable.\" It had nothing to do with whether he could hear Jing Yi's thoughts; it was a kind of dependence and ease that came from within.","Li Yujia smiled. She and Li Shaocheng could never achieve something like that in this lifetime...","Half an hour later, the 'Dear Family' variety show posted an announcement on Weibo, stating that Li Shaocheng's family had officially withdrawn from the show's recording, and she would not appear in the edited version of later episodes.","As soon as the news was released, many netizens cheered. They had always hoped for harmonious scenes with the four families, and it came true so quickly!","After the video was leaked, Li Shaocheng's public image completely collapsed. Most fans were disappointed and unfollowed her. Although there were still some voices from Li Shaocheng's fans in the comments, it was to no avail.","Jing Yi and the others gathered in the living room. The atmosphere was a bit strange. Just as they started recording the last episode, such a big incident occurred. Was this a good omen?","Director Xu stepped up to take charge, \"Let's still follow the original plan.\" His tone carried a hint of bitterness.","'Pfft' Jing Yi's laughter was particularly noticeable. Realizing the looks everyone was giving her, especially Director Xu's particularly intense gaze, Jing Yi quietly hid behind Jing Zejun's back.","It was mainly because the director's expression was so miserable that hearing him talk about this was really funny.","[Jing Yi Yi, Director Xu's knife is about to be mailed to your house in the next second!]","[Poor Director Xu, he was about to take off, but then Li Shaocheng hit the brakes at the last moment.]","[Hmm, let's look at it from another angle. Isn't this also a way of going viral?]","[The one above, you're stealing the show!]","Director Xu was about to say something else when Jing Yi raised her hand again. The director sighed but couldn't pretend not to see her. \"Do you have a question?\"","Jing Yi looked at the sky outside, \"Director Xu, it's almost dinner time. Are we still having free time?\" To be honest, she was getting a bit hungry...","Jing Zeqian looked at her helplessly. Nothing could interfere with her meal times!","What else could Director Xu do? On the first day, they had already lost one family. What more could he ask for? Let's just end it for today!","After dinner, Director Xu found Jing Yi. \"There's something I'd like to ask for your help with, Yi Yi.\"","Jing Yi and Jing Zejun exchanged a glance. What kind of matter would require the director to come talk to her privately?"]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Race Registration","paragraphs":["Director Xu explained that a variety show was being recorded next door simultaneously, teaching children's martial arts. Due to poor ratings, the other director planned to invite a celebrity as a training guest, but the person didn't show up at the time of recording, so they came here for help.","Jing Yi widened her eyes, \"Do you want me to work part-time?\" Was she supposed to record a family variety show here while also being a coach there?","Her accusing gaze was too obvious, so Director Xu hurriedly explained, \"It's not a permanent guest role. They just want to know if you'd be willing to be a one-time guest, teaching the kids some boxing.\"","If it weren't for the fact that the other director was his friend, he wouldn't have even asked Jing Yi. Besides, how could he bear to give away the popularity of this show? Even if it were his own father asking, he wouldn't agree!","Jing Yi pondered for a moment, \"Training kids, huh? I suppose it's not impossible.\" After all, it's still recording, just in a different location.","Seeing Jing Yi agree, Director Xu hurried to respond to the other director and finalize the schedule.","......","That night, Jing Yi was lounging in Jing Zejun's room, making a phone call.","On the other end was Shen Xi, asking about Jiang Miaomiao's situation. \"Sis, isn't your information a bit late? It's been over a week already.\"","Shen Xi sounded irritated, \"It's not that I didn't know about Jiang Miaomiao's situation, I didn't know you were involved!\"","Jing Yi realized she hadn't told Shen Xi about it. She suddenly felt a bit guilty, \"Oh, so that's what you meant...\" Shen Xi shouted from the other end, \"What else could I be talking about?! Such a big thing and you didn't tell me!\"","Jing Yi quickly explained, \"No, it's not like that! I was arguing with my second brother at that time, and then it was my mom's birthday, so I forgot about this matter.\"","Shen Xi also considered that Jing Yi was currently participating in a reality show with 24-hour live streaming, so many things couldn't be discussed openly.","\"Alright, I'll let you off the hook this time, but you better give me all the details when you get back!\"","\"Okay!\"","But that wasn't the main reason for Shen Xi's call. \"Have you signed up for that championship race?\" As Jing Yi's long-time friend, Shen Xi naturally knew about Jing Yi's love and conflict with car racing.","It wasn't Jing Yi's only hobby, but among the things she loved, only car racing counted.","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving, \"I've already signed up!\" Shen Xi was surprised, not expecting such a quick answer from Jing Yi, who was usually so hesitant.","Moreover, she hadn't seen Jing Yi participate in any races before, but this time she signed up so quickly.","What surprised Shen Xi even more was that Jing Zeqian had suggested signing Jing Yi up for this race.","Jing Yi's initial reaction was the same as Shen Xi's. She even suspected Jing Zeqian might have a fever, reaching out to feel his forehead - it was normal!","Then she wondered if Jing Zeqian was drunk, sniffing carefully, but couldn't smell any alcohol.","Jing Zeqian rolled his eyes at her, \"Can't you think better of me?\" Jing Yi widened her eyes in confusion.","How else should she think? Jing Zeqian was always the one in the family most afraid of her racing cars.","Jing Zeqian had indeed been very worried about Jing Yi getting hurt before. It wasn't that he knew nothing about car racing, but he truly understood the dangers of being a race car driver and the risks of such extreme sports.","Every year, Shanchi Racing Track holds various car racing competitions, and the number of accidents is not small. Jing Zeqian was well aware of this.","How could he not worry?","But after hearing Jing Yi's words last time, he had given it some serious thought. He realized that his excessive concern was not care for Jing Yi, but a burden.","Jing Zeqian felt a bit heartbroken. He had seen Jing Yi driving race cars before - free and bold, very different from her usual obedient demeanor.","But he was certain that was the most authentic Jing Yi.","This realization led Jing Zeqian to decide to respect Jing Yi's hobby, which is why he suggested signing her up for the race.","Shen Xi sighed, thinking how wonderful it was that Jing Yi's family truly cared for her.","\"Then I'll be able to see your brilliance on the race track!\"","Jing Yi's lips curved up involuntarily, dimples appearing on her cheeks.","Jing Zejun, leaning against the headboard reading a script, saw Jing Yi end the call and asked, \"Was that Shen Xi?\"","Jing Yi nodded, lying on the sofa, \"She was asking about the banquet I attended with Second Brother last time.\" Jing Zejun smiled, knowing that even in high society circles, secrets couldn't be kept for long.","She looked at Jing Yi, who was still lounging on the sofa, and asked curiously, \"Aren't you going to get ready for bed?\" Jing Yi looked troubled, \"That wall of pink is just too eye-catching.\"","It wasn't that she really disliked pink, but when almost everything in the room was the same color, along with the lace canopy, Jing Yi found it hard to concentrate.","Jing Zejun looked at her amusedly, \"I told you to bring your luggage over directly.\" The room was spacious enough for two people anyway.","Jing Yi thought about it and agreed. There was no need to make things difficult for herself, so she immediately got up to fetch her suitcase from next door.","Jing Zejun smiled and walked in front of the camera, waving, \"Good night, everyone.\" Then she covered it with a black cloth.","[So sweet!]","[Oh no! Going to sleep so soon? Can't we chat a bit longer?]","[I've been guessing all day when Jing Yi would finally give up and leave that room!]","[To be honest, I couldn't stand looking at that room either...]","Early in the morning, Director Xu mysteriously pulled Jing Yi aside, saying something. The two seemed to be finalizing some arrangements.","They walked back into view of the livestream.","Jing Zeyou looked up, \"What's going on?\" Jing Yi told him about Director Xu's request yesterday for her to help out with the neighboring show.","It was too late last night, so she didn't want to disturb them.","[What kind of show is it?]","[Seems like it's a show teaching martial arts to children, a small obscure show.]","[Does that mean we won't see Yi Yi all day today?!]","[No way! We don't have much time left as it is, and now we lose another day!]","Jing Zeqian came over, \"Are you going now?\" Jing Yi shook her head, \"I'll go after breakfast.\"","Jing Zeqian: ......","Seeing his disapproving look, Jing Yi felt a bit indignant, \"What? I'm basically working two jobs, I should at least fill my stomach, right?\"","Just then, Chen Yu and his wife came out of the kitchen carrying breakfast. Sister Lin smiled, \"That's right, we should at least let our Yi Yi eat her fill.\"","She placed the breakfast in front of Jing Yi, \"Here, Yi Yi, try the breakfast I made. Especially these siu mai, your Brother Chen says they're unbeatable.\"","Jing Yi's eyes lit up, her gaze fixed on the French toast and pork and bamboo shoot siu mai in front of her.","\"Thank you, Sister Lin!\"","A glint of amusement passed through Jing Zeyou's eyes as he followed Jing Zejun to the kitchen to bring out breakfast for everyone else."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Street Performing","paragraphs":["The variety show that needed Jing Yi to come to the rescue was a children's martial arts program.","The show had invited over a dozen children, including both celebrity kids and ordinary ones, hoping to prevent the show from flopping too badly.","At first, although the show's popularity wasn't high, netizens were still interested in the adorable little ones. However, this enthusiasm couldn't sustain till the end, prompting the director to invite some celebrities to teach.","They managed to invite someone, but the guest canceled just before arriving at the recording site. With no other choice, the director had to beg Director Xu for help.","Jing Yi, a guest who knew Sanda and had a fan following, was the perfect candidate.","The director hurried over, his joy evident in his expression. He grasped Jing Yi's hand, excitement in his voice, \"Miss Jing! Thank you! Thank you so much for agreeing to come to our rescue!\"","How did his little show deserve such honor?","The director's enthusiasm startled Jing Yi a bit. She forced a smile, \"You're too kind.\" She quickly introduced the person behind her, \"This is our show's cameraman. He'll be following me throughout. Did Director Xu mention this to you?\"","The director nodded rapidly, \"Yes! Yes! You can rest assured about that. We won't interfere with your normal filming.\"","Jing Yi's smile was polite but somewhat awkward. She was starting to believe Director Xu's words about \"doing whatever she wanted\" - just how desperately did this show need a guest?","Since Jing Yi had to rush back to the villa that evening, the director didn't chat for long. He began explaining the work of the flying guest, which basically boiled down to interacting with the kids and teaching them some basic moves.","Jing Yi breathed a sigh of relief. That seemed simple enough.","That is, until Jing Yi stood in the square, looking at the group of children on the stage and the circle of staff surrounding them.","Oh? An outdoor show?","The director explained that these children would have a martial arts performance in the next few days, so they wanted them to get used to the venue in advance. But the real reason was that they couldn't afford to rent a large indoor space.","Jing Yi felt a headache coming on. Was it the kids who needed to adapt, or her?","Fortunately, this was a small, relatively unknown show, so there weren't many onlookers. Most of them were there to see the children. Otherwise, Jing Yi would have wanted to find a hole to hide in.","[Hahaha, Jing Yi is starting to feel embarrassed!]","[Where is this? Quick, quick, friends, don't let her relax, rush to the front line!]","[Hey up there, are you trying to get Jing Yi killed?]","[Teaching here? How is this any different from performing on the street?!]","[Hey! Don't say it like that! You could say it's street performing.]","Jing Yi composed herself and began to focus on teaching. After all, since she had accepted the task, she had to do it, right?","To be fair, although the director making children 'perform' on the street was quite doggy, the safety measures were quite adequate. They all wore professional protective gear, and thick mats were laid on the ground.","Jing Yi first demonstrated a set of basic Sanda moves to the children. \"Alright, now let's do this move together.\" Although the children's movements were a bit clumsy, they added a touch of cuteness.","Looking at the slightly tottering figures, Jing Yi found herself amused and lowered her head, laughing silently.","Jing Yi taught very attentively, correcting their postures one by one, guiding them hands-on how to punch and kick.","Gradually, more and more onlookers gathered around.","\"Teacher Yi Yi, we want to see you perform,\" a chubby little boy standing by her leg said, looking up at her.","As soon as he said this, several other children rushed up, saying the same thing.","Jing Yi had no choice but to ask them to move to the side, leaving her an open space.","She stood in the center of the area, her posture upright, her gaze determined. As she moved, the air seemed to tense up with her.","Suddenly, she threw rapid punches, each one carrying great power and speed. Her fists traced arcs through the air, accurately hitting the target, producing loud thuds.","Her movements were clean and crisp, without any unnecessary flourishes.","Jing Yi slowly lowered her arms and legs, and a round of applause broke out around her. Her body stiffened slightly as she finally noticed the dense crowd that had gathered around the stage.","When did so many people arrive?!!","Now it really had turned into street performing. Jing Yi quickly called the children to start moving, intending to hide behind them.","But the children were completely mesmerized by Jing Yi's moves and crowded around her, demanding an encore.","Jing Yi felt a bit helpless, \"But I just performed for you. When you learn it, you'll be as good as me.\"","However, these kids didn't seem so easy to persuade. They could tell the difference between the moves they were taught and how impressive they actually were, and they weren't willing to compromise.","Since they were still filming the show, Jing Yi quickly gave in. \"Alright, I'll find someone to demonstrate for you one more time, but this is the last time, okay?\" The children started cheering.","Jing Yi, however, was getting a headache. Kids really were hard to deal with.","She looked towards the staff, thinking it might be easier to find someone there.","Whether it was because she had briefly demonstrated a few moves on her livestream before, the staff's gazes were deliberately avoiding her.","The onlookers, however, were very enthusiastic, raising their hands one after another.","[Hahaha, have those staff members seen the video of Jing Yi sparring before?]","[Where exactly is this? It looks so lively!]","[It's looking more and more like street performing!]","[This is the first time I've seen so many people volunteering to get beaten up.]","Jing Yi scanned the crowd. There were many eager volunteers, making it hard for her to choose. Should she pick someone who looked sturdy?","Jing Yi's gaze paused for a few seconds, focusing on someone not far away.","Oh? Wasn't this sturdy one just presenting himself?","On the other side, Shen Huaichu noticed Jing Yi's gaze on him. He quietly turned off the livestream on his phone, a sense of foreboding flashing through his mind.","The large crowd gathered here hadn't caught Shen Huaichu's attention, but he knew Jing Yi was in the middle of it.","He had only gotten out of the car to take a look, but now it seemed he couldn't leave.","Sure enough, he saw Jing Yi smiling with her eyes curved into crescents, saying, \"Then let's have that gentleman over there.\" Everyone's gaze shifted towards him.","[Oh, which company's CEO is this?]","[Wow, he's quite handsome!]","[He looks oddly familiar to me, like I've seen him somewhere before...]","[Why did Yi Yi call him? He doesn't look like someone who'd be willing to cooperate.]","Shen Huaichu paused, not even sure why he was hesitating. He should have turned and left.","\"Let your bodyguard come instead. You can just stand and watch,\" she said straightforwardly, her tone carrying a hint of challenge."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Let's Fight","paragraphs":["Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu gazed at each other from afar. As their eyes met, it was as if a silent battlefield had formed between them.","The air was thick with an undeniable tension.","Jing Yi lifted her chin slightly, a faint smile playing at the corner of her lips. It was both challenging and composed, her eyes calm on the surface yet concealing a turbulent depth, sparkling with a refusal to back down.","Her gaze seemed to say, \"I dare you to come over here!\"","Shen Huaichu narrowed his eyes slightly, the corners of his mouth also turning up slightly, his gaze deep and enigmatic.","The surrounding crowd watched this scene unfold, their eyes gleaming with the excitement of potential gossip.","Seeing Shen Huaichu preparing to approach, his bodyguard grew anxious. \"Sir, why don't I go instead?\" He had seen Jing Yi fight before, and it was nothing like what the livestream viewers had witnessed - it was the real deal!","Shen Huaichu didn't break his stride, simply saying, \"No need.\"","The bodyguard's concern didn't lessen one bit. He was already contemplating whether it would be faster to call an ambulance or to carry his boss to the hospital himself.","As Shen Huaichu approached, the smile in Jing Yi's eyes deepened.","Oh, Shen Huaichu, this is your own choice. Don't blame her for using you to vent her recent frustrations.","With a mischievous smile playing on her lips, she said, \"Thank you for your cooperation, sir. Since the children are very interested, I might need your help to play the role of my opponent.\"","Shen Huaichu could easily read the intent in Jing Yi's eyes. A complex light flashed in his gaze, but he simply replied, \"Alright.\" He agreed to her request without hesitation.","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow slightly. So quick to agree?","She instructed the staff to outfit Shen Huaichu with professional gear. \"Remember to add extra padding,\" she said. Shen Huaichu paused for a moment but allowed the staff to approach him.","The excitement of the surrounding crowd grew, and even the children found spots to sit down, ready to enjoy the spectacle.","Shen Huaichu was now prepared, looking at the unfamiliar outfit he was wearing. The feeling of being a human punching bag was becoming increasingly apparent.","Jing Yi smiled with satisfaction and took a few steps closer.","\"I'm going to attack here, here, and here,\" she said, pointing to Shen Huaichu's abdomen, thighs, and other areas. \"You can use these stances to defend yourself.\"","Jing Yi taught very seriously, not noticing Shen Huaichu's body suddenly stiffen, his jawline tightening.","\"Do you understand?\" Shen Huaichu snapped back to attention, a flash of panic in his eyes, and nodded slightly.","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow and walked to the center of the arena, taking her stance.","Now, let's settle our scores one by one!","Jing Yi struck with lightning speed, her body as flexible as a snake, quickly closing in on Shen Huaichu. She followed through with her earlier instructions - punches, whip kicks, not missing a single move.","Shen Huaichu could barely block them, but Jing Yi's eyes brightened a bit. It seemed she had underestimated Shen Huaichu's skill level.","However, this surprise was quickly replaced by anger. She silently increased her force, \"Mr. Shen, if you can fight, why did you just stand by and watch the commotion?\"","Shen Huaichu clearly felt a numbness in his thigh where he had been kicked. \"Miss Jing, I have bodyguards,\" he said. If he still had to fight himself, why bother employing bodyguards?","The fire in Jing Yi's eyes became more apparent, her attacks faster. \"Having bodyguards makes you so great? Am I your bodyguard?!\"","Shen Huaichu hesitated for a moment, and in that instant, his waist was kicked.","The spectators couldn't help but wince, and the livestream comments exploded.","[Isn't this a bit harsh for a stranger? It feels like bullying.]","[Stranger? Didn't you see the fire in Jing Yi's eyes? They must know each other.]","[I think they might be enemies. She's so vicious.]","[I have to say, even though he looks a bit disheveled, he's still quite handsome.]","Shen Huaichu dodged to the side, avoiding Jing Yi's attack. \"Miss Jing, I apologize for last time.\" Jing Yi's lips curled up slightly, her aggressive gaze not diminishing in the slightest.","\"Apologize? Again, you take away what I want and then apologize?!\"","The bodyguard stood anxiously at the edge of the stage, watching as Jing Yi's attacks became increasingly fierce. Should he call an ambulance now?","Then, Jing Yi spun around, her hands firmly grasping Shen Huaichu's arms, twisting forcefully. \"Mr. Shen, I'm not the type to keep my displeasure hidden, but you've really annoyed me several times!\"","Her movements were clean and swift. Caught off guard, Shen Huaichu stumbled backward, losing his balance.","\"So, sorry for the trouble!\"","Shen Huaichu's heart suddenly tightened. The next moment, he and Jing Yi performed what looked like an impromptu wrestling move, and Shen Huaichu found himself staring at the azure sky.","The audience below was dumbfounded, watching as Shen Huaichu was lifted off the ground by Jing Yi as if she were uprooting a large tree, and then slammed heavily onto the ground.","The surroundings fell silent. The director stared blankly at this scene. Brother Xu had only said that Jing Yi would definitely bring heat to the show, not that she was this fierce!","Jing Yi stood in the center of the arena, dusting off her hands. Her demeanor was composed, as if she had completely vented her pent-up frustrations. She seemed quite cheerful. \"Sorry, I used a bit too much force,\" she said with a smile.","She turned to face the group of children, smiling so widely that her eyes curved into crescents, dimples appearing one deep, one shallow at the corners of her mouth.","\"Kids, that move just now was using a trick from Sanda...\" Even at this moment, she didn't forget her teaching duties.","Shen Huaichu, looking at the bright sunny sky and listening to Jing Yi's deliberately gentle voice, chuckled softly.","This laugh terrified the bodyguard waiting below. Had his boss's brain been damaged?! He anxiously approached Shen Huaichu, \"Mr. Shen, shall I take you to the hospital now?\"","We must have a doctor take a thorough look!","Jing Yi noticed the situation and told the children to practice by themselves for a while. She walked over to Shen Huaichu's side. The bodyguard wished he could rush onto the stage, watching her warily.","Jing Yi bent down and reached out her hand. \"Not dead, are you?\" Shen Huaichu hesitated briefly before grasping her hand. \"Not yet.\" Jing Yi's moves looked brutal, but except for those few minutes of questioning, she had controlled her strength the rest of the time.","...Although, he could feel that his body was probably bruised.","\"Good that you're not dead. Here, take this.\" Jing Yi handed him some medicine for bruises and sprains. \"Now we're even.\" Indeed, when you're upset, it's best to have a good fight and get it out of your system. She felt much better now.","Shen Huaichu hesitantly accepted the medicine, his eyes filled with confusion. \"For me?\" Jing Yi replied irritably, \"Who else? Aren't you human? I'm giving you medicine so you won't try to extort me.\"","He looked down at the medicine, his eyes flickering. \"Thank you.\"","Jing Yi found this curious. \"Oh? So you do know how to say thank you? Remember to be more sincere next time you thank someone. If you do it like last time again, you'll really get beaten up! Don't forget to apply the medicine.\"","With that, Jing Yi left.","Shen Huaichu watched her retreating figure. So, what just happened didn't count as getting beaten up?"]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Water-based Pen Properties","paragraphs":["At a manor in North River.","Shen Xi followed her mother to attend a party hosted by relatives. Speaking of parties, it was actually a reception held by the host to show off their newly acquired manor.","She had already attended countless such parties and couldn't help but wonder where the Shen family got so many relatives who loved to show off...","Such a manor would be completely unremarkable compared to the Jing Family's properties! After all, she was someone who had seen the world!","As Shen Xi was wandering around the manor, secretly evaluating its interior structure, she bumped into a group of people standing in the middle of the path.","\"Don't you have eyes?\"","A girl wearing a Chanel-style dress looked at Shen Xi with some displeasure and contempt.","But at that moment, Shen Xi was thinking: Next time, she must tell Jing Yiyi that not just in all of North River, but even just within the Shen family, it's easy to encounter these typical novel cannon fodder characters!","You know, the kind that has \"I look down on you, go ahead and hit me!\" written all over their face, and usually don't appear a second time.","Shen Xi maintained a polite smile, \"I'm sorry, I accidentally bumped into you.\" This wasn't the first time Shen Xi had encountered such people, and usually, as long as she 'admitted defeat,' things would blow over quite smoothly.","But today seemed different. The girl opposite her didn't look like she was going to let it go easily. \"Is sorry all you have to say?!\"","Shen Xi was confused. What else? She barely even bumped into her, it was just a slight touch. What more did she want?","The girl looked at her disdainfully and pointed at her own clothes, \"This is Chanel's latest collection. How can I wear it after you've touched it?!\"","Shen Xi wore an expression of utter disbelief, like an elderly person on the subway staring at their phone.","\"Miss, I did touch it, but I'm not a water-based pen. How could it become unwearable?\" Besides, after hanging out with Jing Yiyi for so long, it had been a while since she'd heard anyone brag about wearing the latest fashion.","Moreover, everyone here was from families considered 'well-off' in North River. Was she implying that Shen Xi couldn't afford to compensate for a Chanel dress? She wasn't some Cinderella...","While Shen Xi was internally ranting, the girl beside her seemed to have been provoked by Shen Xi's words and was about to say something when laughter from the side interrupted their conversation.","Shen Xi turned to look and saw Gu Lin, along with a sunny-looking handsome guy!","The girl also recognized the young master of the Gu family, who was being specially entertained by the manor's owner. She immediately changed her attitude and greeted Gu Lin with a smile.","Shen Xi watched her behavior intently, really wanting to take a video to show Jing Yiyi, to prove that she wasn't exaggerating.","Gu Lin ignored her and turned to look at Shen Xi, \"Little niece, I didn't know you had water-based pen properties. One touch and clothes become unwearable?\"","Shen Xi looked at the girl beside her, whose face had turned somewhat pale. Wow, she never thought she'd have a day to become the protagonist of such a classic scene.","Shen Xi deliberately asked, \"So what should we do?\" It felt so good to have someone to back her up!","The girl's face was full of panic, \"I was just joking with this young lady, just joking...\"","Shen Xi snorted, \"It's not funny at all.\" She deliberately looked the other person up and down, \"And Chanel's latest collection? You're showing off last season's clothes?\"","She hadn't said anything earlier, but as it happened, Jing Yiyi had also sent her some of Chanel's new collection!","Seeing that the girl had been rendered speechless by Shen Xi's retort, Gu Lin's lips curled into a smile. \"Let's go, or we'll start leaking ink.\"","Shen Xi quickly followed behind the two, occasionally glancing at the handsome guy beside Gu Lin.","He noticed her! And even smiled at her! She wondered if he would think she was too fierce?","Gu Lin had originally just wanted to help Shen Xi out of the situation, but this girl followed them and kept stealing glances at his friend, her actions so obvious that he found it hard to ignore.","He waved his hand in front of her, saying helplessly, \"Little niece, restrain yourself a bit, you're being too boy-crazy.\" This girl seemed to like handsome guys so much, last time he saw her she was like this too, but then abandoned the guy a minute later...","Shen Xi quickly withdrew her gaze and secretly glared at Gu Lin. How could he describe her like that in front of a handsome guy?!","The person beside Gu Lin didn't seem to mind, though. He actually found this round-faced girl quite cute, especially her \"water-based pen\" comment.","He had naturally noticed her glances along the way, and he curved his lips into a smile. She really was an interesting girl.","Gu Lin asked Shen Xi, \"Did you come with Mrs. Shen?\" Shen Xi nodded, otherwise she wouldn't have come at all.","\"I want to ask you something.\" Shen Xi looked up at him curiously, and Gu Lin continued, \"Will Jing Yiyi participate in this North River car race?\"","Shen Xi looked at him, her eyes full of wariness, \"Little Uncle, why are you asking this?\"","Gu Lin found it amusing. Of course, he only thought to ask because he saw Shen Xi here.","\"You even call me Little Uncle, how could I be a bad person?\" Shen Xi didn't say anything, but the disbelief in her eyes had already answered the question.","They had only met a few times, and there was only a tiny bit of family relation between them.","Gu Lin smiled helplessly, \"I'm just asking if she's participating. Maybe we'll happen to be in the same group for the race.\" Shen Xi's eyes widened, \"Little Uncle, are you participating in the car race?\"","Gu Lin nodded, \"Yes.\" Although he didn't pursue the path of a professional racer, he had participated in quite a few races.","He had noticed Jing Yiyi's interest in racing last time and was quite curious about her skill level.","\"Yiyi is indeed planning to participate.\" She would also go to cheer for Jing Yiyi.","Shen Xi looked at Gu Lin's thoughtful expression, \"Little Uncle, how good are you at racing?\" She had to scout out the competition for Jing Yiyi in advance.","Gu Lin glanced at her, putting on an air of superiority, \"Very good.\" Shen Xi pouted, not believing him in her heart.","Usually, people who boast about being very good aren't actually that great. It's the low-key ones like Jing Yiyi who are truly the best!","The expressions on this girl's face were really too vivid, Gu Lin raised an eyebrow, \"Why don't you believe me?\" Shen Xi smiled fakely, \"No! Little Uncle must be very good!\"","Sigh, she still needed to rely on Gu Lin for support. Next time, she'd bring Jing Yiyi!","Gu Lin crossed his arms, \"Is that so? Then who do you think is better, me or Jing Yiyi?\" Shen Xi answered without hesitation, \"Of course it's Yiyi!\"","Shen Xi had never seen Gu Lin race, but she had seen Jing Yiyi race. She firmly believed that Jing Yiyi was the best!","Gu Lin was stumped. He had just helped this girl, but couldn't even get a single nice word out of her.","The person beside him watched their interaction, amusement flashing in his eyes.","Shen Xi finally paid attention to the handsome guy beside Gu Lin again. She felt a bit nervous and smiled, \"Hello, I'm Shen Xi.\" The sunny guy's lips curved upward as he said, \"Hello, I'm Chen Yisi.\"","Shen Xi's eyes sparkled, \"What an interesting name!\"","Sunny guy: ...","Gu Lin, speechless: Little niece, who on earth taught you to flirt like this?"]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Jing Yiyi, are you here to feed the fish","paragraphs":["Shen Xi and Madam Shen left, and Gu Lin noticed his friend still watching Shen Xi's retreating figure with a thoughtful expression.","He felt compelled to warn his friend. \"Don't be fooled by her innocent looks. She's quite the 'little heartbreaker.'\"","Gu Lin's friend had never been in a relationship before, and if he fell for Shen Xi, how would Gu Lin explain it to Chen Yisi's parents?","Chen Yisi looked at him with a gentle smile, \"I just think your little niece is quite interesting.\" Gu Lin chuckled, \"She is indeed interesting.\" Otherwise, he wouldn't have such a strong impression of her.","\"Let's go. This party is rather dull. I should have gone to see my brother instead.\" He wondered where his brother had gotten all those injuries from - he'd almost thought someone had beaten him up.","The two chatted as they walked away.","A gentle breeze blew through a quiet corner of the countryside. Tender green leaves adorned with crystal-clear raindrops were dripping onto the rocks below with soft 'plop plop' sounds.","A small stream meandered through the landscape, with sunlight filtering through sparse leaves to dance on the water's surface, creating shimmering ripples. The river was as still as a mirror, clear to the bottom, with fish leisurely swimming about.","Jing Yi and her three companions sat in a row by the stream, waiting for fish to bite.","[Two hours have passed, and I feel like I'm going crazy. How come I'm not bored at all?]","[Me too! I could watch them sit and fish all night long.]","[I suspect the person above is mocking Jing Yi for not catching any fish, but I have no proof.]","By the stream, a tall willow tree was reflected in the clear water. As the breeze blew, the willow swayed gently, its trailing branches creating ripples on the water's surface, much like the ripples in Jing Yi's heart.","At this moment, Jing Yi was staring intently at the lake's surface. The fish were swimming all around, eating her bait but not taking the hook!","Not far away, an old man sat quietly on the shore, holding his fishing rod and waiting patiently. Jing Yi sneaked a glance at his fish bucket.","It was almost full...","Another fish took his bait! The old man's rod bent, suddenly breaking the surrounding tranquility. He leaned over to pull up a fish and placed it in his basket, his expression as calm as ever.","Jing Yi could barely hide her envious gaze. Jing Zeqian looked at her mockingly, \"Jing Yi, do you think you'll manage to catch even one fish today?\"","Jing Yi puffed out her cheeks, glancing at the lone fish in Jing Zeqian's basket. \"Just you wait and see!\" Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow slightly, \"Well, I'll be watching closely then.\"","Jing Zeyou smiled as he looked at the two of them, then shifted his gaze to the mountain peaks across the way. It had been a long time since he'd enjoyed such a leisurely moment.","Jing Yi glared at Jing Zeqian who was mocking her. The old man beside her looked over and said with a smile, \"Young lady, your bait's been eaten again.\" She quickly pulled up her fishing rod, and sure enough, the hook was empty.","Jing Zeqian burst out laughing, \"Hahaha, Jing Yi, are you here to feed the fish?\" Jing Yi looked at her hook in disappointment.","Perhaps her expression was too pitiful, as the old man next to her called out, \"Young lady, come over here and try my bait.\"","Jing Yi's face immediately lit up with joy. She quickly walked over to the old man's side.","\"Grandpa, is it a problem with the bait?\" She crouched down, offering her hook to the man and humbly asking for advice.","The old man smiled, \"Yes and no.\" He explained further, \"The bait you bought isn't as popular as freshly made bait, but more importantly, your mind isn't calm.\"","Getting up to check every few minutes, your movements scare away the fish that have gathered.","Jing Yi scratched the back of her head in embarrassment. She really wasn't very good at these leisure activities; she'd rather just lie down and sleep.","The old man put some bait on her hook and handed it back to her with a smile, \"Here you go. Be patient, and you'll catch a fish soon. If not, you can always take one from grandpa's bucket!\" After all, he had caught plenty.","Jing Yi gave the old man an obedient smile, \"Thank you, grandpa.\" She took the fishing rod and returned to her spot.","[The old man seems like some kind of sage from another world.]","[Look at the contrast. Jing Yi has such an expensive fishing rod. It's really a case of 'all the gear, no idea.']","[Don't worry, with an expert teaching her, she should get the hang of it soon.]","[Jing Yi really has a way with older people. My parents adore her!]","Jing Yi waved her fishing rod at Jing Zeqian, boasting, \"Just you wait, I'll beat you soon!\" Jing Zeqian looked unconcerned, \"Oh really? Well, I'll be watching closely.\"","Jing Yi's competitive spirit was aroused. She stopped fidgeting and focused intently on the lake's surface, just waiting for a fish to bite.","Jing Zejun smiled as she looked at Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian. Who fishes with such intense expressions? She shook her head, ignoring their competition, and settled back into enjoying the therapeutic nature of fishing.","Finally! The fishing rod moved!","Her eyes flashed with delight, but she remembered the old man's advice to wait a bit longer before reeling in.","Jing Yi was a bit nervous. The three people around her all looked over, watching her slightly moving fishing rod. Even the old man's eyes held a hint of tension.","The fishing rod began to shake violently. Jing Yi felt a surge of excitement, her eyes fixed on the water's surface as she gripped the rod tightly and began to reel in the line.","This fish seemed to be quite large, struggling fiercely and pulling on the line. The fishing rod bent into a beautiful arc. The old man quickly advised, \"Don't rush to reel it in, give it some slack.\"","Jing Yi quickly loosened her grip a bit, but still held the rod firmly, maintaining a stable posture.","Time ticked by slowly, and the big fish's resistance gradually weakened. The old man saw that the moment was right and called out, \"Reel it in now!\"","The arc of the fishing rod gradually straightened as the fish was pulled closer to the shore. Jing Yi raised the rod, lifting the fish out of the water.","She was overjoyed, \"Look everyone! It's such a big fish!\" Jing Zeyou came over to unhook the fish and place it in her bucket.","Jing Yi turned to the old man, her face beaming, \"Thank you, grandpa!\" The old man waved his hand, \"It's nothing, nothing at all.\"","Jing Yi happily looked at the plump fish in her basket, then turned to Jing Zeqian with a smug expression, \"Second brother, you lost!\" Jing Zeqian laughed, \"It's one-all, how did I lose?\"","Jing Yi compared the size of her fish to Jing Zeqian's, \"In terms of size, you lost.\"","Seeing Jing Yi's smug little expression, a hint of amusement flashed in Jing Zeqian's eyes, but he said mercilessly, \"That's only because you had expert help. At most, we're tied!\"","\"You're not convinced? Then let's go again!\"","The two of them plunged into a new round of competition.","By the time they finished their contest, the sky had begun to darken, and the old man had already gone home. Both of them still only had one fish each in their buckets.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zejun had caught several fish, but they each only chose to keep one large fish and released the others back into the stream.","The four of them returned to the villa with their fish. Wen Qingyan and the others had already started preparing dinner."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Boiled Fish","paragraphs":["\"You're back.\" Cheng Cheng's mother brought out the stir-fried dishes from the kitchen. Jing Yi looked at the shrimp in her hands and asked, \"Auntie, have you already started cooking?\"","Cheng Cheng's mother smiled and wiped her hands on her apron, \"We just started, just stir-fried a few simple dishes.\"","Hearing the voices, Wen Qingyan also came out, smiling as he looked at the fish in Jing Zeqian's hands, \"Looks like you had quite a catch.\"","Jing Zeqian put the fish in the kitchen, \"Of course! Actually, we caught more than these, but we thought we couldn't eat them all and it would be wasteful, so we only brought back these few.\" Jing Yi glanced over, not exposing Jing Zeqian's boasting.","\"Little Yin, I can handle the fish.\" Jing Yi walked into the kitchen and took over the fish from Wen Yin's hands.","Wen Yin had been the main chef for the past few meals, so Jing Yi felt a bit embarrassed to just be an assistant.","Wen Yin chatted with Jing Yi nearby, \"Sister Jing Yi, which fish did you catch?\" She proudly raised her chin, gesturing for Wen Yin to look at the big fish in the sink.","\"Of course, it's that biggest one. Aren't I amazing?\"","Wen Yin was indeed very supportive, showing a surprised expression, \"You caught such a big one?! That's awesome!\" Jing Yi looked even more proud.","Jing Zejun was helping Sister Lin prepare ingredients nearby and smiled when he overheard their conversation.","Jing Yi's behavior was exactly like Jing Zeqian's just now.","Sister Lin also looked over with a smile, \"Yiyi is quite skilled.\" Jing Zejun lowered his head and chuckled softly, \"She is indeed skilled.\" The truly skilled one was probably that old man.","At this moment, Jing Yi had already started processing the fish. Wen Yin watched her skillfully wielding the knife and cautiously asked, \"Sister Jing Yi, do you want me to help you cut it?\"","Jing Yi's gaze was still focused on the fish bones, and with another chop, she cut off another piece of bone, \"No need, I can handle it myself.\"","[Haha, Little Yin, don't be afraid, your Sister Jing Yi is just chopping fish.]","[She's so quick and efficient, it's scared the child.]","[Wen Yin probably thought Jing Yi was fierce, but didn't expect her to be fierce enough to handle live fish!]","[The production team was indeed foresighted, immediately moving the camera away!]","Jing Yi planned to make boiled fish with two of the fish, but since Cheng Cheng's parents don't eat spicy food, she also prepared a tomato-flavored version.","The bones of the big fish were already prepared, and now all that was left was to slice the meat. Jing Yi cut the fish meat into slices and put them in a large bowl, adding salt and cooking wine to lightly mix and remove the fishy smell.","The wok was heating up with oil, and as the oil temperature gradually rose, Jing Yi quickly handed the fish slices to Wen Yin, \"Little Yin, help me wash the fish meat and then marinate it.\" She needed to hurry and prepare the spicy base.","Jing Yi poured various seasonings like green onions, ginger, and chili base into the wok, which turned a fiery red color. The kitchen was immediately filled with a strong spicy aroma and a slightly pungent chili smell.","Thankfully, there was a range hood, otherwise, no one would be able to stay in the kitchen at this moment.","Jing Yi slightly adjusted the heat, put the fish bones into the wok, and added boiling water, letting the fish bones and base boil together.","After simmering, she removed the fish bones and added half of the marinated fish meat that Wen Yin had prepared. She lightly stirred it a few times to ensure even heating, while also adding the pre-cooked side dishes one by one into the wok.","The various ingredients cooked in the rolling water, emitting an enticing aroma, colorful and appetizing.","A few minutes later, Jing Yi carefully scooped out the boiled fish, while heating oil in another wok and adding Sichuan peppercorns and chili peppers. The 'sizzle' of hot oil meeting spices filled the kitchen with the tempting aroma of boiled fish.","Jing Yi looked satisfyingly at the bright red boiled fish in front of her, \"Alright! This can be served now, be careful, it's hot.\" Wen Yin, wearing oven mitts, carefully carried out the pot of boiled fish.","Looking at the remaining fish meat, Jing Yi lifted the wok again, \"The rest will be tomato-flavored!\" She took the peeled tomatoes from Jing Zejun and put them in the wok to simmer with the base to make a tomato soup base, then added the fish slices.","It was another perfect fusion of a different red soup and tender fish meat, making one's mouth water.","[It's been a long time since we've seen Jing Yiyi cooking, she's so skilled!]","[Her movements are so smooth and pleasing to watch.]","[Wow! As a tomato lover, I'm in love!]","[Only kids make choices! Adults want it all.]","On the other side, Sister Lin's chicken wings were also ready. Jing Zejun helped Jing Yi take off her apron, and they both sat back in their seats.","Once again, the table was full of dishes.","Jing Yi was still slightly affected by the cooking fumes and didn't have much appetite yet. Jing Zejun was pouring her some juice.","Sister Lin tasted Jing Yi's boiled fish and was amazed, \"Yiyi, I didn't know you had such culinary skills!\"","Jing Yi smiled, this dish was indeed her specialty, \"It's nothing special, I don't know how to cook many dishes, just happen to know how to prepare fish.\" She turned to Cheng Cheng's parents, \"Auntie, Uncle, since you don't eat spicy food, the tomato one is not spicy.\"","The family of three looked over, and Cheng Cheng's mother smiled, \"Thank you, Yiyi. I just tried it, it's delicious!\" Seeing the two different fish dishes, they knew Jing Yi had prepared them specially.","However, Cheng Cheng's mother was also curious. Jing Yi grew up abroad and was from North river, so how did she learn to make boiled fish?","She curiously asked, \"Yiyi, how did you learn to make boiled fish?\" Jing Yi looked up, slightly startled, as if she hadn't expected anyone to be curious about this.","The corners of her mouth turned up, her eyes full of nostalgia, \"I had an elder who really liked it, so I gradually learned how to make it.\" The elder Jing Yi referred to was the grandmother from the orphanage, who was also Grandma Jing.","At first, Jing Yi also found it strange that both grandmothers loved boiled fish. At an age when they should be eating light foods, they both had a particular fondness for boiled fish.","Jing Yi grew up abroad, and apart from Jing Beicheng and Lin Ruiqing, her only elder was Grandma Jing.","Jing Zeyou, noticing Jing Yi's expression, picked up a piece of fish for her and asked, \"Did you cook your big fish too?\" His question scattered Jing Yi's thoughts, pulling her out of her emotions.","\"No! That's the one I caught with great effort, let it live another day!\"","Jing Zeqian's mouth curved slightly, deliberately saying, \"You only care about the one you caught? The ones my big brother and I caught have all become dishes!\" Jing Yi immediately became smug, \"Who told you that you can't cook? Besides, if you're so concerned about your fish, why are you eating with such a red mouth!\"","This guy was both bad at cooking and loved eating. He had only eaten a few pieces, but his mouth was already red.","Jing Zeqian didn't really like spicy food, but Jing Yi's boiled fish was indeed very tasty. Hearing Jing Yi's words, he felt quite indignant.","\"I'm eating to give you face. What if no one ate the dish you made? Wouldn't that be pitiful for you?\"","Jing Yi didn't believe his nonsense, but this banter had given her an appetite.","Outside the window, night had fallen, and laughter could be heard from time to time from the villa."]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: All Men Outside Are Deceivers","paragraphs":["As night fell, Jing Zejun had just finished a phone call with her manager, who had briefed her on the upcoming work schedule for the next few days.","Just as Jing Zejun was about to return to the villa, she saw Wen Qingyan approaching from a distance. This was their first time meeting alone since she learned of his feelings for her.","Jing Zejun pursed her lips and smiled softly as she greeted him, \"Brother Qingyan, out for some fresh air?\"","Wen Qingyan smiled back at her, \"I came to find you.\"","Jing Zejun was momentarily taken aback, but quickly recovered her composure. \"I just came out to make a phone call. Shall we head back?\" She made a move to walk past him.","\"Zejun,\" Wen Qingyan called out, stopping her. He turned to face her, his gaze filled with tenderness. \"Can we talk for a bit?\"","After a moment's hesitation, Jing Zejun nodded.","They walked a little further, stopping on a patch of lawn where the atmosphere was particularly quiet. A gentle breeze rustled the leaves of nearby trees, creating a soft, whispering sound.","Wen Qingyan spoke first, \"You seem to have been avoiding me lately.\"","Despite working on the same variety show and being cast in the same upcoming drama, Wen Qingyan had found it difficult to engage Jing Zejun in conversation.","Jing Zejun lowered her head, biting her lower lip lightly, remaining silent.","Wen Qingyan turned to face her fully, his eyes brimming with warmth as he asked softly, \"Has my affection for you become a burden?\"","He had been waiting for the right moment to express his feelings to Jing Zejun. Contrary to popular belief, their first meeting wasn't on the set of \"Jun Lin.\" If he had developed feelings for every co-star he'd worked with, he wouldn't have made it this far in his career. He had been unsure of when the right time would be to confess.","It wasn't until he realized that he might miss his chance entirely if he didn't speak up that he began to openly show his interest. He wanted the public and fans to see that he had made the first move.","Jing Zejun looked up at Wen Qingyan, clearly seeing the tenderness in his eyes. \"Brother Qingyan, it's not a burden. I just don't know how to interact with you,\" she said softly but earnestly. \"The gap between us is too wide. You're an internationally acclaimed actor with numerous awards, while I can count my notable works on one hand.\"","A smile played on Wen Qingyan's lips. \"If we're talking about gaps, isn't the difference in our family backgrounds even greater?\"","Jing Zejun was momentarily stunned, catching the teasing tone in Wen Qingyan's voice. Her lips curved into a smile.","\"Brother Qingyan, you know that when I say 'gap,' I've never meant anything outside of our professional achievements.\"","While he could easily face the disparity in their family backgrounds, Jing Zejun couldn't ignore the difference in their professional standing.","Wen Qingyan chuckled, \"I know. That's why I wanted to talk to you. When I show my feelings, I'm not trying to pressure you into accepting them. My affection is my own business, but I wanted to make my intentions known first.\"","Wen Qingyan had indeed considered the issues Jing Zejun raised, even prioritizing them as matters to be resolved. He wasn't in a hurry for her to give him an answer; he just wanted her to be aware of his feelings. He feared that if he didn't speak up, he might lose the chance to pursue her altogether.","Jing Zejun looked puzzled. \"Make your intentions known?\"","Wen Qingyan smiled, his gaze intensifying. \"I hope to be at the front of the line among your potential suitors. If you ever decide to consider a relationship, I want to be your first choice.\"","A gentle smile graced Jing Zejun's lips. \"My life revolves around work. I hardly have the opportunity to meet any suitors.\"","Wen Qingyan laughed softly. She was clearly underestimating herself.","With things out in the open, Jing Zejun felt more at ease, and Wen Qingyan breathed a sigh of relief. Surely she wouldn't avoid him anymore.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian were leaning on the windowsill, watching the distant figures.","The live stream chat was filled with confusion.","[Come on, at least show us what you're looking at outside!]","[What's so interesting out there that you've been staring for half an hour?]","[Young Mr. Jing, have you forgotten your position as Startrack CEO?]","[Ahhh, what are you looking at? Tell us!]","The two were whispering to each other. Jing Zeqian wore a displeased expression, his gaze fixed on the scene outside. \"What could they possibly be talking about for so long?!\"","Jing Yi lightly tapped his arm. \"Keep your voice down. What if someone hears us?\" These netizens had sharp eyes and ears; if they overheard, it would surely become the next hot topic.","Jing Zeqian remained unhappy. \"If they're worried about being discovered, why don't they just come inside? Why chat alone outside?\"","Jing Yi glanced at him. \"They're just having a simple conversation. Why are you so concerned?\"","Jing Zeqian's eyes widened. \"It better be just a simple conversation. If he tries anything, I'll teach him a lesson!\"","Jing Yi sighed, ignoring her brother's agitation as she continued to watch the pair in the moonlight.","[The road to winning Jing Zejun's heart is long and winding for Wen Qingyan... Not only does he have to face her father and eldest brother, but even her second brother seems tough to deal with. More importantly, Jing Zejun doesn't seem interested in romance at all!]","Jing Yi couldn't help but feel sympathy for Wen Qingyan. Beside her, Jing Zeqian let out a cold snort.","Did they think it would be easy to marry into the Jing family?","This thought led Jing Zeqian to consider Jing Yi. She was another cause for concern!","Jing Zeqian casually glanced at Jing Yi and probed, \"Jing Yi, you don't have a boyfriend, right?\"","Jing Yi gave him a strange look. \"No, I don't. Why do you ask?\"","Jing Zeqian breathed a sigh of relief. \"I'm worried you might be too naive and get deceived.\"","Jing Yi glared at him. \"Who's the naive one? Some people have already been fooled!\"","Jing Zeqian was at a loss for words. She had to bring up that sore spot, and the most frustrating part was that he couldn't refute it!","Jing Zeyou, who had been working nearby, overheard their conversation and couldn't help but smile.","[Big brother is smiling! He looks so handsome!]","[I could watch the CEO work forever!]","[The previous commenter wants to work our CEO to death...]","[It seems Jing Yi was talking to the second brother about someone being deceived.]","Jing Zeqian tried to assert his authority. \"As your brother, I'm just worried about you being deceived. You should be more respectful.\"","Jing Yi turned back to the window, ignoring him.","Feeling a bit sheepish, Jing Zeqian leaned on the windowsill again.","After a few seconds, still concerned, he advised, \"Remember, all men out there are deceivers. You must keep your eyes open and not agree to be with someone just because they say a few nice things. You need to evaluate them thoroughly! It's best if big brother and I do the evaluation.\"","Jing Zeqian's rambling was giving Jing Yi a headache.","He continued, \"But you're still young. Enjoy being single for a few more years. There's no rush to find a boyfriend. Jing Yi, are you listening?\"","Jing Yi looked at him helplessly. \"Yes, I hear you...\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Yi, Signifying Another Beginning","paragraphs":["\"Today is our last day of filming,\" Director Xu announced, facing the four groups of guests.","The final day of filming was clearly different. The production team had moved the set to the lawn outside the villa. The four families sat in a row on lounge chairs, with Director Xu seated in front of them.","\"We brought all the guest families together this week to let everyone experience the atmosphere between different family relationships. After spending these few days together, how does everyone feel?\"","Jing Yi looked over blankly, wondering if they were supposed to respond one by one.","Fortunately, the invited guests were to speak individually. Jing Yi immediately relaxed, watching everyone's responses with ease.","After Jing Zejun finished speaking, Director Xu turned to Jing Yi, \"Yi Yi, do you have any thoughts?\" In the camera frame, Jing Yi looked confused and surprised, clearly not expecting the director to deliberately ask her to respond!","[Hahaha, Jing Yi Yi's expression of watching the drama unfold was too obvious, she got caught!]","[This is just like me getting caught daydreaming in class!]","[Haha, she seems to have thought she wouldn't be asked to speak.]","Though it was sudden, Jing Yi still managed to say a few simple words.","Seeing this, Director Xu let her off the hook and pulled out a large screen from behind him. It showed the live broadcast of the variety show, with comments quickly scrolling by, indicating how popular the livestream was.","Since they chose to broadcast live, Director Xu couldn't just change the filming format without considering the online audience.","This time, he had specially prepared a Q&A session. \"This segment is to answer questions from the audience.\" The production team would designate guests one by one, with netizens asking questions. A random question would be selected for each guest to answer.","What if they picked one or two questions from haters? Would they still have to answer?","Jing Yi could only silently pray, hoping to get simple questions.","Meanwhile, Director Xu had already started taking screenshots. Watching the Cheng Cheng family, Chen Yu family, and the Wen Qingyan brothers answer their questions one after another, Jing Yi felt inexplicably nervous.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian's questions were also very common, asking about their ideal types and whether they had partners. Jing Yi secretly hoped she would get such questions too – she could answer those at length!","It was Jing Zejun's turn, and things went smoothly for her. She got a question about when she would start her next project. Jing Zejun answered, \"I might start right after this variety show ends...\"","Finally, it was Jing Yi's turn. Jing Zeqian found her nervous expression amusing. \"It's not like you're answering questions in class, why are you so nervous?\" Jing Yi, staring intently at Director Xu's screenshot gesture, retorted, \"Mind your own business!\"","What if she got another question about her feelings? How would she answer?","The question had been captured. Director Xu looked at the top comment on the screen and froze slightly, immediately feeling that his luck was not good.","Jing Zeyou noticed Director Xu's expression and sensed it probably wasn't a friendly question.","Then, Director Xu read out the question, \"May I ask, why do your brothers and sister all have 'Ze' in their names, while you're called Jing Yi?\"","After reading it, Director Xu started sweating profusely. The two Mr. Jings were looking at him unfavorably, but this wasn't a question he had come up with.","Director Xu wanted to cheat, but this was a live broadcast!","In contrast, Jing Yi seemed to relax after hearing the question. Answering about the origin of her name was simple – even if it was a malicious comment, wasn't this easier than talking about her feelings?","Jing Yi sighed in relief and answered simply, \"Grandma gave me my name. She said she hoped I could have a new beginning. 'Yi' means 'beginning', signifying a fresh start.\"","'Since you've come to the orphanage, I hope you can have a new beginning, so I'll name you Jing Yi.'","Jing Zeqian watched Jing Yi's smile, his heart softening a bit, while his gaze toward Director Xu grew fiercer.","[Who asked that? Trying to stir up trouble?!]","[They just had to pick this question! Are you afraid Jing Yi might consider herself part of the Jing family?!]","[Silly Jing Yi Yi is still smiling, they're practically spelling it out for her!]","[Jing Yi must really love her grandmother, her eyes always light up when she talks about her...]","Director Xu could hardly withstand the glares from the two Mr. Jings. Wiping his cold sweat, he quickly said a few words and moved past this segment.","\"When the production team sent out invitations, we asked everyone what goals they hoped to achieve on this show. Have you all accomplished them?\"","The Chen Yu couple answered first. As athletes, even though they've retired, their lives still revolve around their child. So Chen Yu's initial goal was to spend more time with his wife.","\"We've been married for almost ten years, but I feel like I haven't really spent quality time with her. During this period, I accompanied her in doing various things she wanted to do. I think I've achieved that goal.\"","Sister Lin's eyes were slightly red, and the couple held hands tightly.","Cheng Cheng's mother also looked at her husband, quite emotional. Cheng Cheng's parents are very busy, as is Cheng Cheng himself, and they rarely have the chance to travel together as a family.","Cheng Cheng held his parents' hands, \"I think we've achieved it. Although we still don't fully understand each other's work, this time together has been precious for all of us.\"","It was Wen Qingyan's turn. The previously warm and slightly melancholic atmosphere suddenly turned a bit awkward.","Almost everyone knew Wen Qingyan's purpose for joining the show, and now it was a matter of how he would express it. The comments were slyly mentioning Jing Zejun's name.","Jing Yi leaned forward, her eyes brimming with curiosity.","Wen Qingyan smiled, \"The goal completion is already higher than I expected. Additionally, my biggest takeaway from this experience is gratitude towards my brother.\" He lightly patted Wen Yin's shoulder.","Even though he knew his brother didn't really intend to take him on a trip, Wen Yin played along, accompanying him on drives and preparing meals. It seemed that Wen Qingyan, as the older brother, was the one who needed more care.","Wen Yin's ears turned slightly red, his expression showing a hint of embarrassment.","Jing Yi nodded silently on the side, thinking that Wen Yin was indeed very loyal, helping his brother pursue a wife and acting as a chef.","Finally, it was Jing Zejun's turn. She looked at Jing Yi and her two brothers beside her, her eyes filled with a tender smile. \"I think I've achieved it. I'm very grateful to have had this experience with my family.\"","Her initial intention was just to resolve the malicious online discussions about Jing Yi, and now these discussions have gradually disappeared. The four of them have also shared a rich and beautiful time together.","The 'Dear Family' live broadcast officially ended. No matter how reluctant the audience was, they could only look forward to the edited version.","After Jing Yi and the others said goodbye to Chen Yu and Cheng Cheng, they boarded the plane back to North river.","Surprisingly, the Wen Qingyan brothers appeared on the same flight.","\"You're on this flight too?\" Wen Qingyan's face showed a handsome smile, \"Yes, what a coincidence.\"","Jing Zeqian gritted his teeth, \"What a coincidence indeed!\" This guy just can't stay away for a moment, can he?"]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: Racing Team","paragraphs":["The four people who returned to North River quickly switched to work mode.","For Jing Zeyou, work mode was his usual style. As for Jing Zeqian, he had some contract termination matters to resolve after Jiang Miaomiao was arrested. Jing Zejun, true to his word, started filming for a drama the day after finishing the variety show. As for Jing Yi, with the championship race approaching, she planned to intensify her training at Shanchi Racing Track.","Jing Zeqian gave his 'wild horse' race car and team to Jing Yi. It wasn't that he couldn't afford a new one, but there wasn't enough time, and a hastily modified race car naturally couldn't compare to Jing Zeqian's.","However, the biggest problem now was how she should tell Lin Ruiqing and her husband about this.","Jing Yi was having lunch with Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng at a restaurant, looking deep in thought.","[How should I tell Mom and Dad about the car race? Will they be very worried? I should have asked about their attitude before signing up!]","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng exchanged glances, both noticing the amusement in each other's eyes.","Lin Ruiqing deliberately asked, \"Yi Yi, you don't seem to have much appetite. Did something happen?\" If she didn't speak up now, Jing Yi might end up eating only those few grains of rice for lunch.","Jing Yi bit her lower lip, various thoughts flashing through her mind. Finally, she put down her chopsticks and said solemnly, \"Mom, Dad, I have something to tell you.\"","Jing Beicheng also looked at Jing Yi, waiting for what she was about to say.","Jing Yi looked a bit nervous. \"I signed up for a car race.\" She lowered her head, waiting for their response, but didn't hear anything from them for a long time.","Jing Yi raised her head to see Lin Ruiqing smiling and Jing Beicheng with a gentle expression.","Lin Ruiqing said amusedly, \"You signed up, so what? It's not a bad thing. Why are you so nervous?\"","Jing Yi widened her eyes, her voice tinged with surprise, \"Don't you think this is a dangerous thing?\"","Lin Ruiqing said gently, \"Didn't Mom tell you before? Worrying and supporting are not mutually exclusive.\"","Jing Beicheng added, \"It's a good thing that you have something you like. Although it's quite dangerous, your mom and I believe that you will take good care of yourself.\"","This was the first time Jing Beicheng had said such things to Jing Yi as a father.","Jing Yi's eyes reddened slightly. She got up and sat next to Lin Ruiqing, holding her arm and leaning gently on her shoulder, saying softly, \"Mom, thank you.\"","Jing Beicheng cleared his throat lightly.","Jing Yi realized she hadn't included her dad, so she looked over with a sweet smile, \"Thank you, Dad!\"","Jing Beicheng was satisfied now. \"Since you're going to race, I'll transfer some money to your account later.\"","Typical of his generous nature, but Jing Yi felt a bit uncomfortable accepting it. The racing team was already prepared, and even the car was Jing Zeqian's.","Before she could voice her refusal, Jing Beicheng had already settled the matter, \"You'll need money sooner or later. If you don't use it for the race, just consider it pocket money.\"","Whose pocket money has so many zeros?","In the end, Jing Yi failed to refuse and went to the racing track with a net worth that had gained several more zeros.","\"Miss Jing\"","This was the coach of Jing Zeqian's racing team, specially recruited by Jing Zeqian to be Jing Yi's race team coach. He was a foreign man in his forties, with slightly brown curly hair and a full beard, who spoke excellent Chinese.","\"Coach, just call me Jing Yi.\"","The coach didn't mind about the form of address. If it weren't for the hefty sum Jing Zeqian was paying, he wouldn't have been interested in this sweet-looking young girl.","\"Alright, Jing Yi, first take a lap so I can record it.\" Let's see her skill level first, he thought. If it's really not up to par, he would have to refuse.","Jing Yi didn't notice the coach's attitude and went straight to change into her racing suit.","The coach sat in the passenger seat as Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel, her eyes beginning to change.","Seeing the change in Jing Yi's demeanor, the coach raised an eyebrow, seeming a bit surprised.","But his surprise was just beginning.","The race car shot off like an arrow released from a bow, powerful horsepower surging forth, the roar of the engine echoing in the air.","The car set off, speeding through the curves, the body almost hugging the ground as if trying to merge with it.","The coach's initially nonchalant expression suddenly changed, watching in disbelief as Jing Yi constantly adjusted her direction until she completed a lap of the track.","Jing Yi lifted her helmet visor and smiled at the coach, \"How was that, coach? Where should I start improving?\"","The coach opened and closed his mouth, muttering, \"OMG, does Mr. Jing even know what he's wasting?\"","Jing Yi was a bit confused, \"What did you say?\"","The coach came to his senses, his expression excited, \"Jing! Mr. Jing said you haven't had any systematic training before?\" His form of address had become more familiar.","Jing Yi nodded, \"Yes, but I have friends who are racers, and they've taught me.\"","Just being taught could result in driving like this?! He never thought he'd encounter a driver like Jing Yi in his professional career.","Jing Yi didn't understand why the foreign coach suddenly became so excited. She waved her hand in front of his eyes, \"Hello, are you okay?\"","The coach's expression could only be described as beaming, \"I couldn't have been better!\"","\"Jing, let's take another lap! There are a few operational details that need some improvement...\" And so, Jing Yi stayed at the racing track until the sun was almost setting.","After running lap after lap on the racing track, Jing Yi took off her helmet and stretched her tired body, \"Coach, let's call it a day.\" If she stayed any longer, she might not even be able to drive home.","This was Jing Yi's first systematic training, and the current intensity was a bit too much for her.","The coach seemed somewhat reluctant to end, but he understood the principle of moderation, \"You should still increase some physical training when you get back.\"","Jing Yi's most obvious weakness was probably her strength. Car racing isn't just about pursuing speed; compared to other factors, endurance is also crucial.","\"Okay, coach.\"","Jing Yi stayed at the racing track to stretch her body for a while before hugging her helmet and changing out of her racing suit, then drove home.","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu, who had just finished work, was walking out of the company's main entrance when his bodyguard ran over anxiously, \"Mr. Shen, someone has tampered with the car.\"","After Shen Huaichu finished work, the bodyguard was about to bring the car around in advance, but as soon as he started the engine, he noticed something was wrong.","The car had been tampered with!","Shen Huaichu's face suddenly darkened. Tampering with the car again, trying to use the same method they used on his parents to deal with him?","These people really lack originality."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Good Deeds Today","paragraphs":["The dark red, nearly black sports car drove smoothly down the road, attracting the gazes of passersby.","Jing Yi was driving home when she noticed someone familiar ahead. She took a closer look and realized it was Shen Huaichu.","She found it strange, \"Shen Huaichu? What's he doing standing there?\"","Shen Huaichu was waiting at the entrance for the driver to bring the spare car.","A dark red sports car stopped in front of him. Shen Huaichu frowned slightly as the window lowered, revealing Jing Yi's small face.","Shen Huaichu instinctively relaxed his brow as he heard Jing Yi say, \"Mr. Shen, are you waiting for a car? Do you need a ride?\" This was her good deed for the day.","Shen Huaichu looked at her with a hint of surprise in his eyes, as if he hadn't expected Jing Yi to approach and speak to him.","Jing Yi, holding the steering wheel, was already getting impatient. It was tiring to keep her head tilted like this, and this guy was still hemming and hawing.","Her voice carried a note of dissatisfaction, \"Are you coming or not? If you don't say anything, I'm leaving!\" She sat up straight, about to press the window button when Shen Huaichu stepped forward and said coolly, \"Thank you for your trouble, Miss Jing.\"","Jing Yi rolled her eyes and muttered under her breath, \"Good that you know it's trouble.\" At the same time, she pressed the button to open the gull-wing door for him.","The moment he sat in the car, Shen Huaichu's hands began to tremble involuntarily. He hated fast cars and despised the roaring and friction sounds they made. He shouldn't have gotten in.","He clenched his fists tightly to hide it, trying his best to appear natural. As a result, Jing Yi saw Shen Huaichu sitting next to her with a cold expression as soon as he got in the car.","She said helplessly, \"Mr. Shen, I drive very steadily!\" So there's no need to be so nervous.","She knew the importance of \"safety first\" among the many rules of the road, and even though she liked racing, she wouldn't do it on public streets, would she?","What kind of idiot would rev their engine in the city center, thinking they were so cool driving fast?","Meanwhile, when the driver came out with the car, he saw his boss getting into someone else's vehicle and looked a bit confused.","Wait, what? Did Mr. Shen mistake that car for the spare? That's impossible! Mr. Shen can't even have sports cars!","At the same time, Huarui Group employees who had just gotten off work also witnessed this scene. They stared with wide eyes in surprise and began frantically spreading gossip in their small group chat.","[Breaking news! Breaking news! I just saw Mr. Shen get into a beautiful woman's car!]","[What! Impossible, I haven't seen any women around Mr. Shen since he's been here!]","[Did I miss something? Didn't I just leave the company?]","[It's true! I saw it with my own eyes, and it was a beautiful woman driving a supercar!]","[That's so cool! Is she taking Mr. Shen home?]","[So this is the type Mr. Shen likes?]","[Little Li, did you see what she looked like?!]","[I didn't notice, by the time I saw, Mr. Shen was already in the car!]","The Huarui Group employees' small group chat erupted into heated discussion.","\"Mm, you can take the car back.\"","Shen Huaichu hung up the phone, staring ahead with the same cold expression.","After looking at him for a while, Jing Yi had gotten used to it. She asked curiously, \"Mr. Shen, is your car broken?\" Shen Huaichu made a sound of agreement, then, seeming to recall what Jing Yi had said when she hit him before, he repeated, \"The car had some issues.\"","Jing Yi wasn't wrong; she really did drive very steadily. Shen Huaichu gradually relaxed.","\"Do you know about the upcoming car race?\"","Shen Huaichu's cool voice broke the silence in the car. Jing Yi, keeping her eyes on the road ahead, replied, \"Yes, I've signed up for it.\"","Shen Huaichu frowned slightly, \"Why do you all like these kinds of racing games?\"","You all? Who else?","\"I don't know about 'all,' but if you're just asking me, I like the feeling of gripping the steering wheel.\"","Shen Huaichu didn't say anything, so Jing Yi continued on her own, \"Actually, hobbies are just inexplicable things. If you asked me to fully explain why I like it, I couldn't really say.\"","She turned the steering wheel, \"What? Do you think it's too dangerous?\" Jing Yi wasn't surprised; nine out of ten people would think that way, including the racers themselves.","Shen Huaichu hesitated, then said coolly, \"Just curious.\"","Jing Yi's lips curved upward, \"Mr. Shen, you seem to be speaking much more diplomatically.\" Shen Huaichu pressed his lips together without responding.","A glimmer of amusement flashed in Jing Yi's eyes, \"Sometimes I wonder if my hobby is too dangerous. If I were a parent, would I allow my child to do this?\"","\"Then why did you suddenly stop worrying about them?\"","Jing Yi looked at the road ahead, the dimple at the corner of her mouth clearly visible. The last rays of the setting sun fell on her lips, making her look warm and beautiful.","\"Actually, it's nothing special, I just gained more confidence.\" Concern and support weren't mutually exclusive, and that was Jing Yi's greatest source of confidence.","Jing Yi looked at the road ahead and suddenly realized something. The car slowed down.","\"Um, Mr. Shen, where's your house?\"","She had been so caught up in the conversation that she forgot to ask Shen Huaichu for directions...","Shen Huaichu had clearly just realized this too. He coughed lightly, looking a bit uncomfortable, \"Turn right up ahead.\"","Jing Yi increased her speed slightly, turned right, and soon arrived at the entrance of a villa complex.","The sports car came to a stop. Jing Yi turned to look at Shen Huaichu, \"Mr. Shen, I'll drop you off here.\" She looked at the villa buildings in front. The sky had darkened, with only the street lamps lit.","Shen Huaichu got out of the car and said coolly, \"Thank you for the ride today, Miss Jing.\" It was the first time a girl had driven him home.","He didn't hurry to turn and leave. After a pause, he said seriously, \"About last time, I want to formally apologize to Miss Jing.\"","\"I'm sorry for not only causing you to get hurt but also for suspecting you, and about the gift matter, I apologize.\"","Hearing Shen Huaichu's apology, Jing Yi was stunned for a moment. Then, realizing what was happening, the corners of her mouth turned up, \"Indeed, Shen Huaichu, you really have become better at talking.\"","Could it be that he learned to change after getting hit? If she had known, she would have hit him earlier.","Shen Huaichu pressed his lips together, feeling a hint of embarrassment: \"......\" He wasn't mute.","Jing Yi turned the steering wheel, preparing to leave, and Shen Huaichu also turned to go.","\"Shen Huaichu!\" He stopped in his tracks and turned back. Jing Yi leaned out of the car window, smiling with her eyes curved into crescents, \"Next time your car breaks down, don't just stand stupidly by the roadside. It's dangerous!\"","Shen Huaichu stiffened, his expression a bit helpless, \"Miss Jing, I'm a man.\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow. Boys need to protect themselves too. Didn't he worry about being kidnapped, standing there looking like that?","After saying this, she waved at Shen Huaichu, turned the steering wheel, and drove away.","Night fell, and the street lamps along the road emitted a warm glow. Jing Yi's slightly curled hair fluttered gently in the breeze. She smiled, her eyes curving, her dimple shallow, making her look even more radiant with her rosy lips and white teeth.","Shen Huaichu watched the sports car disappear into the distance, his heart beating once, then again."]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: Jingze's Daily Filming","paragraphs":["Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun were filming in a spacious abandoned factory.","The entire filming crew was very quiet. The cameraman adjusted the angle at appropriate times, while the director intently watched Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun's movements and expressions on the screen.","The two were filming the first layer of the story in the drama.","The male and female leads were in an abandoned basement. The props team had adjusted the lighting to create an atmosphere where light was almost completely blocked out, with only weak twilight rays filtering through broken windows, casting shadows on the ground.","Wen Qingyan's coat was already covered in dust, and sweat had soaked through his clothes. His eyes scanned the surroundings with determination as he tightly gripped a flickering flashlight, carefully advancing along the chaotic corridor.","Footsteps echoed in the empty basement. Jing Zejun followed closely behind Wen Qingyan, her figure small and delicate. She looked around, tightening her clenched fists, seemingly prepared for any potential danger.","Wen Qingyan glanced back at Jing Zejun and forcefully pushed open the heavy door in front of them.","The two entered a dim room, greeted by an eerie and terrifying sight. Dust-covered furniture was scattered chaotically, and cracks in the walls revealed the decay of time.","\"Cut!\"","The director frowned slightly, his expression serious. He gestured for Jing Zejun to come over, pointing to the part of the scene she had just acted on the screen. \"Your expression is off. This part has no dialogue. If you can't immerse yourself, when the audience sees it...\"","Jing Zejun listened attentively to the director's words, her expression serious.","After finishing here, the director had them shoot another take, but he still seemed unsatisfied.","\"Again!\" His brow furrowed even deeper.","It wasn't until after the third take that the director saw the shot he wanted, nodding with slight satisfaction.","\"Cut, this take is good.\"","The costume designer came forward to adjust the outfits for Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun, while the makeup artist rushed to touch up the actors' makeup.","Wen Qingyan looked at Jing Zejun and asked with concern, \"How are you doing? Can you adapt to Director Lu's style?\" Jing Zejun carefully glanced over, seeing the director still frowning as he watched the monitor.","She looked a bit worried, a flash of disappointment crossing her eyes. \"Brother Qingyan, am I performing really badly?\" Although she had mentally prepared herself, this director had previously worked with actors of Wen Qingyan's caliber.","Jing Zejun was self-aware about her acting skills. They had only been filming for a few days, and they had to reshoot multiple times because of her.","Wen Qingyan looked at Jing Zejun gently, \"It's not that you're bad. It's just that Director Lu is indeed very demanding of every shot. You can learn a lot from him.\"","Finding a good script and a good director was a very rare thing, which was why Wen Qingyan didn't want Jing Zejun to give up on this script.","He believed that Jing Zejun would achieve her goals here.","Jing Zejun looked at Wen Qingyan's encouraging gaze, smiled and nodded, feeling some of the pressure lift from her heart.","Soon, Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun were immersed in a new round of filming.","\"You're only resting now?\"","Jing Yi, lying on her bed, was on the phone with Jing Zejun. She glanced at the time - it was almost midnight.","On the other end, Jing Zejun was removing her makeup in the hotel, with the phone placed nearby. \"Yeah, because I kept messing up, and I even made Brother Qingyan film with me until now.\"","Jing Yi frowned slightly, \"Acting really isn't an easy job.\"","Jing Zejun turned on the faucet, washing the cleansing oil off her face. After wiping her face, she continued, \"I think it's because my acting isn't up to par that it seems more difficult.\"","If she were as skilled as Wen Qingyan, would they need to film so many takes?","Although Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan had scenes together in \"Your Highness\", most of her scenes were one-sided expressions, so she didn't have a direct sense of Wen Qingyan's acting skills.","During this time, she truly experienced firsthand how terrifyingly good Wen Qingyan's acting was.","Jing Yi turned to lie on her stomach, curious, \"Is the Film Emperor Wen that amazing?\" Although she knew Wen Qingyan was a skilled actor, she still couldn't quite grasp what Jing Zejun meant.","On the other end, Jing Zejun had finally lain down on her bed, \"Yes, sometimes I'm even scared by his acting.\" There were several times when she felt like the person standing in front of her might not be Wen Qingyan, but the character from the drama.","Now Jing Yi was even more curious, \"Junjun, can people visit your set?\" Jing Zejun laughed, \"You want to join in on the excitement, don't you?\"","Jing Yi chuckled a few times. After hearing Jing Zejun describe how amazing it was, she felt like seeing it in person would be even more impressive.","Jing Zejun thought for a moment, \"It's probably not allowed right now. Director Lu is intentionally keeping things confidential. Maybe after some time.\"","\"I see.\"","Jing Yi wasn't too disappointed. There would always be a chance to witness it eventually. But now there was another matter that needed to be resolved.","\"So, will you be able to come to my car racing competition?\"","Given what Jing Zejun said, the director seemed quite strict, and she wasn't sure if they would let her leave.","\"Don't worry, I should be able to get a day off.\" Besides, in the coming days, her scenes would be relatively less demanding.","Jing Yi was satisfied, \"Alright then, you should get some rest now.\" It was late, and Jing Zejun had to get up early for filming tomorrow. Jing Yi didn't want to take up too much of her rest time.","After hanging up the phone, Jing Yi yawned, wrapped herself in her blanket, and fell into a deep sleep.","...","\"Second brother? Aren't you going to work today?\"","Jing Yi entered the living room to see Jing Zeqian sitting there, her face full of surprise.","Jing Zeqian looked up, \"You're one to talk. I was planning to accompany you to practice driving today. Where did you go?\"","He hadn't seen her all morning and thought Jing Yi was still sleeping, but Uncle Li said she had left very early.","Jing Yi looked at him strangely, \"I went to practice driving. I have something to do in the afternoon, so I went earlier. Why didn't you tell me in advance that you wanted to accompany me?\"","Who knew she would get up so early to practice driving?","Jing Zeqian wanted to say something more, but Jing Yi had already hurried upstairs, \"Second brother, we'll talk later. I need to change clothes first!\"","Jing Zeqian watched her disappear, confused. Why was she in such a rush?","When Jing Yi came back downstairs, she had changed into an evening gown.","A white, pleated strapless top hugged her beautiful figure tightly, with a playful bow tied at the waist below a rose. The black fishtail skirt was relaxed and casual.","Her slightly curled hair cascaded down her back, and she wore a short black rose necklace around her neck.","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow, \"You just got back and you're leaving again?\"","\"Yes, didn't I say I had something to do this afternoon?\"","Since when had Jing Yi become so busy? Jing Zeqian suddenly felt a bit dejected. He had finally made time to accompany her to practice driving, but she was so busy she didn't even need him to accompany her.","Jing Yi was hurriedly preparing to leave when she suddenly remembered something and turned back to look at Jing Zeqian."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Gu Lin's Birthday Party","paragraphs":["\"Second brother, you promised to accompany me for driving practice tomorrow, so remember to wake up early! And tell Aunt Wang I want to eat her almond milk pudding when I get back tonight!\"","Jing Zeqian watched with amusement as Jing Yi hurried away from the living room. Even as busy as she was, she still didn't forget to give him instructions.","Oh well, if she wanted him to accompany her for practice tomorrow, then that's what he'd do.","Meanwhile, after leaving the house, Jing Yi drove out in her \"Ghost\" - they were still in the \"honeymoon phase\" and she'd been taking this car out quite frequently lately.","Sometimes she found herself fretting over which car to drive each day.","Jing Yi was still indulging in these rather privileged thoughts when her phone rang. It was Shen Xi calling.","\"Yi Yi, where are you? Do you need me to come pick you up?\" Jing Yi kept her eyes on the road ahead as she replied, \"I'll be there in a few minutes.\"","\"Alright, I'll wait for you by the riverbank then.\"","\"Sounds good.\"","Gu Lin's yacht was docked on the bank of the Jiu River, quite close to the Jing family home. A few minutes later, Jing Yi arrived.","Shen Xi spotted Jing Yi's distinctive dark red sports car and waved to her.","Jing Yi parked and walked over. Shen Xi came up and linked arms with her, asking, \"Why are you so late?\"","Jing Yi widened her eyes in surprise, \"Late?! I came straight here as soon as training finished, without even stopping for a sip of water!\"","Shen Xi laughed, \"Alright, alright. I'll get you some water in a minute.\"","\"Why do these North river parties seem to start earlier and earlier?\" Jing Yi mused. She had thought most parties started in the evening, but now they were gathering in the afternoon. Didn't anyone have other things to do?","Shen Xi led her onto the yacht, explaining, \"Well, it is the Gu family young master's birthday party.\" Jing Yi felt a bit overwhelmed - just how many more North river elite families did she have to get acquainted with?","As soon as Jing Yi stepped onto the yacht, she was startled by the lively atmosphere inside, almost taking a step back. Despite the yacht's size, it didn't feel the least bit empty.","\"Just how many people are here? Is the Gu family's young master such a big deal?\"","Shen Xi's eyes also held a hint of surprise as she surveyed the scene inside, unable to look away. \"It's not just for Gu Lin - at least half the guests are here for Shen Huaichu.\"","This surprised Jing Yi even more. \"Shen Huaichu is here too?\" Shen Xi nodded, explaining that she had just found out from Gu Lin when she arrived.","Due to the bustling scene of clinking glasses and mingling guests inside, the two hesitated on the deck, unsure whether to go in.","At that moment, Gu Lin spotted them and walked over with a glass of wine in hand.","\"Jing Yi.\"","Jing Yi turned to him with a smile, handing over her gift. \"Gu Lin, happy birthday.\"","Gu Lin looked curiously at the square gift box in his hands. \"May I ask what it is?\" Jing Yi nodded, \"Of course, it's a Cartier racing helmet.\"","This was part of the gear Jing Zeqian had provided for her, and since she found it quite good, she bought one for Gu Lin as a birthday gift too.","Gu Lin seemed to like it, thanking Jing Yi with a smile.","\"It's quite lively inside. Don't you want to join the party?\"","Jing Yi instinctively declined, \"No thanks, I'm fine staying out here with Xi Xi.\" She was allergic to crowds.","Gu Lin wasn't surprised. He turned to Shen Xi instead, \"Little niece, that Chen Yisi from last time is inside too.\" Sorry, brother, but I have to sacrifice you for my big brother's sake! We can't let him come all this way for nothing.","At the mention of the handsome, sunny guy's name, Shen Xi's eyes immediately lit up.","Seeing Shen Xi's expression, Jing Yi understood immediately. Another handsome guy that had caught Shen Xi's eye - who knew how long this one would last.","Shen Xi looked torn, \"I should stay with Yi Yi though.\"","\"Oh, by the way, my brother is on the third-floor observation deck,\" Gu Lin quickly told Jing Yi where Shen Huaichu was. This way, they'd both have someone to talk to and wouldn't have to stick so closely together, right?","Jing Yi thought about it and decided this arrangement worked well. \"Xi Xi, you go find your handsome guy. I'll go hang out with Shen Huaichu for a bit.\" She didn't want to get in the way of her friend chatting up a cute boy.","Shen Xi still hesitated, remembering how Jing Yi had disliked Shen Huaichu before. \"Yi Yi, are you sure you're okay with that?\" She glanced cautiously at Gu Lin before leaning in to whisper to Jing Yi, \"That's my uncle, didn't you say you really disliked him last time?\"","Jing Yi laughed awkwardly, gently nudging Shen Xi. Maybe don't say things like that in front of the guy's brother!","\"Just go see your handsome guy already!\"","\"Alright Jing Yi, you can go up that way then. Shall I take Shen Xi over first?\" Gu Lin pointed to the stairs behind him, and Jing Yi nodded.","Seeing that Jing Yi wasn't forcing herself, Shen Xi followed Gu Lin inside.","Jing Yi shook her head as she watched them go, wondering how her friend could be so keen on chatting up handsome guys.","After they left, Jing Yi gathered her skirt and headed towards the stairs Gu Lin had indicated.","What Jing Yi didn't notice were the many eyes following her.","A group of girls huddled together, watching Jing Yi's retreating figure. One girl in a black sequined spaghetti strap dress gestured for her friends to look.","\"Look, someone else is going up there.\"","A girl in a black strapless dress next to her sneered, \"Just wait, she'll be back down with her tail between her legs in less than a minute.\"","The sequined dress girl replied, \"That's Jing Yi though.\" Her friend looked surprised, \"You mean that fake heiress from the Jing family?\"","Recently, the two Jing family daughters had become quite famous in these circles, especially after appearing on that reality show, so the girl recognized Jing Yi at first glance.","The previously disdainful girl bit her lip, \"So what? You think Shen Huaichu will look at her any differently?\" A flash of jealousy passed through her eyes.","Indeed, many people on the yacht had come for Shen Huaichu, but they were also too intimidated by his cold demeanor to approach him. Even now, he was the only one on the top deck.","Jing Yi craned her neck to look outside and sure enough, saw Shen Huaichu standing alone on the deck, looking every bit the brooding, aloof young master.","Today he wore a black shirt with the top two buttons undone, managing to make the formal shirt look somewhat rakish and debonair.","\"So you really are up here?\"","Jing Yi carefully navigated the last few steps onto the deck.","Hearing her voice, Shen Huaichu turned to look. Seeing Jing Yi, he said simply, \"Miss Jing,\" his face as impassive as ever.","The top deck offered the best view of the Jiu River scenery. Only a few lounge chairs were arranged on the spacious deck.","Jing Yi walked curiously to the railing, leaning against it lightly. Right in front of her, the sun was beginning to set.","A gentle breeze blew, ruffling her hair and revealing the slender nape of her neck and fair shoulder blades.","The last rays of sunset danced on the river's surface, glittering and sparkling. They also fell upon Jing Yi, seeming to scatter fragments of light in her bright, lively eyes.","The sight made Shen Huaichu blink, momentarily dazzled."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: People do not live just for one goal","paragraphs":["Jing Yi turned her head, her eyes sparkling like the rippling lake waters under the setting sun.","She looked very happy, her eyes gleaming with excitement, the dimples at the corners of her mouth adding to her vivacity.","\"Shen Huaichu, I'm asking you a question.\"","Shen Huaichu's gaze flickered, a hint of panic flashing in his eyes, but his tone remained calm and composed, \"What did you say?\" Jing Yi gave him a curious look, \"I said, why are you standing here alone in the wind?\"","What had he been daydreaming about just now?","Shen Huaichu regained his usual composure, \"It's too noisy downstairs.\"","His reclining posture looked so comfortable that Jing Yi walked over and lay down on the chair next to him, letting the last rays of the sunset fall on her whole body.","Jing Yi spoke lazily, \"If you think it's noisy, why did you come to the birthday party?\" Shen Huaichu turned his head to look at Jing Yi, who had already closed her eyes and started to enjoy herself, \"Miss Jing, didn't you come up here because you thought it was noisy too?\"","...That was indeed the case, Jing Yi couldn't argue, but she still found it strange how quiet it was up here.","\"How come there's not a single person up here?\" It was so lively downstairs.","Jing Yi opened her eyes and looked around, surprised that such a large deck had only the two of them on it.","Shen Huaichu beside her said calmly: \"Miss Jing, I believe we count as people.\"","\"......\" Jing Yi silently glanced at Shen Huaichu.","Jing Yi rolled her eyes at him, but she was still curious, \"Why did you come?\" Shen Huaichu didn't seem like the type who would willingly participate in this kind of young people's gathering.","Why did Shen Huaichu come? Apart from Gu Lin, this was everyone's question.","\"Brother, I'm planning to throw a yacht birthday party next week, will you come?\" Shen Huaichu didn't even look up, \"No.\"","Gu Lin wasn't surprised by the rejection. He lay sideways on the sofa, his voice tinged with playfulness, \"Oh? That's a real pity. I specially invited a lot of friends.\"","\"......\" Shen Huaichu ignored Gu Lin.","Gu Lin raised an eyebrow and continued, \"I'll have to ask my little niece to take good care of Jing Yi then, otherwise it wouldn't be nice if she's not well looked after with so many people around.\"","Shen Huaichu paused for a second, \"Go choose one, it's your birthday gift this year.\" The corners of Gu Lin's mouth turned up slightly, his eyes full of smugness.","See? This is what you call getting what you want. Time to choose a new yacht!","......","Shen Huaichu said calmly, \"Gu Lin was being too noisy.\" Jing Yi nodded in understanding, thinking he had come to this birthday party because he was annoyed by Gu Lin's pestering.","Gu Lin: ......","Thinking about it now, the personalities of the two brothers were indeed worlds apart. But then again, her big brother and Jing Zeqian had very different personalities too, and they were even biological brothers.","As Jing Yi's thoughts wandered, Shen Huaichu looked over, \"What is Miss Jing thinking about?\" Without hesitation, Jing Yi replied, \"I'm wondering how you and Gu Lin can have such different personalities.\"","Shen Huaichu looked at the last traces of the sunset. How could they be the same? Gu Lin grew up under the care of his aunt and uncle.","Seeing the sudden drop in Shen Huaichu's mood, Jing Yi realized she had touched a sore spot and quickly tried to change the subject, \"Well, you know, this yacht is really quite big......\"","\"Miss Jing, if one day you achieve your predetermined goal, what would you do?\" Shen Huaichu suddenly asked.","Jing Yi was puzzled, but she had gotten used to his abrupt changes in conversation topics, \"Of course I'd lie down and rest!\"","\"After finally achieving your goal, shouldn't you seize the opportunity to reward yourself? Otherwise, by the time the next goal comes along, you won't even have a chance to rest.\"","Shen Huaichu was slightly stunned, \"There's another goal?\" Jing Yi looked at him strangely, \"Of course there is. People don't live for just one goal.\"","But his life was lived only for revenge.","Shen Huaichu's lips moved, the corners of his mouth curving slightly, \"But my life has only one goal.\" His voice carried a hint of self-mockery and bitterness.","Before Shen Huaichu's sadness could spread, Jing Yi suddenly slapped his thigh with surprising force.","\"Even if you have only one goal, it should be about how to live better.\" Shen Huaichu didn't have time to feel the numbness in his thigh, only feeling a sudden jolt in his heart.","Those almond eyes were filled with seriousness, \"I don't know what important goal you've achieved, but since you've completed it, it should be something to be happy about.\"","Shen Huaichu looked at her, ripples appearing in his calm eyes, a barely noticeable warmth coloring their depths.","She was so young, yet where did she learn such old-fashioned words?","\"Miss Jing, where did you learn these old-fashioned words?\"","Jing Yi glared at him, her eyes filled with strong dissatisfaction, \"These are not old-fashioned words!\" These were words the grandmother at the orphanage had told Jing Yi.","She hoped all the children in the orphanage could live their lives well, not giving up on this one-time journey of life because of abandonment or other reasons.","Shen Huaichu pressed his lips together, his expression a bit unnatural, \"I'm sorry.\" Jing Yi's eyes told him that those words had really angered her.","Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu with a stern face, seeing that his apology seemed sincere.","\"I'll let you off this time, but you really don't know how to talk, and you're very impolite! It was the same last time, didn't I tell you that you should......\"","Shen Huaichu: ...... How deeply ingrained was her memory of him not thanking her?","Jing Yi was still criticizing Shen Huaichu, while he sat in front of her, quietly accepting the endless stream of criticism.","Gu Lin came up and saw this scene, and was stunned.","That was his brother, right? Was he seeing things?","Shen Huaichu noticed Gu Lin's frozen figure and coughed lightly a few times. Jing Yi followed his gaze and saw Gu Lin, quickly stopping her long tirade.","Shen Huaichu turned to Gu Lin and asked, \"Why did you come up?\"","Gu Lin: Are you implying that I'm interrupting your lecture?","The shock in Gu Lin's eyes hadn't faded, he opened his mouth, \"I came to ask if you two want to go down and eat something?\"","Jing Yi's eyes lit up, \"Sure!\" She hadn't eaten anything since she arrived and was hungry now.","Jing Yi stood up and adjusted her fishtail skirt, about to walk towards the stairs.","She suddenly remembered there was still someone behind her, \"Shen Huaichu, do you want to go eat something?\"","Jing Yi was just being polite, but Shen Huaichu had already stood up, \"Alright, let's go down together then.\"","He really came over, which surprised Jing Yi, \"You really want to go down?\" Wasn't it too noisy for him?","Shen Huaichu seemed a bit confused, \"Didn't Miss Jing invite me?\"","Was that considered an invitation? Jing Yi wasn't quite sure either.","Gu Lin, standing at the top of the stairs: Guys, the one who invited you was me......"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Come on, aren't you afraid of falling","paragraphs":["Regardless of who invited them, Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu were both preparing to go downstairs.","Jing Yi now truly felt that attending parties was a troublesome affair. All of her gowns were beautiful, but also very cumbersome. Next time, she would just wear boots or sneakers to attend!","Jing Yi looked at the stairs, carefully lifting her skirt, preparing to step down.","If her high heels caught on her dress while going downstairs and she fell, she really wouldn't need to live on this planet anymore.","Just as she was about to take a step down, Shen Huaichu's voice came from behind, \"Miss Jing, let me go first.\"","Was he really going to compete over this too?","Jing Yi thought Shen Huaichu found her too slow, and wordlessly made way, \"Please, after you!\" Not a gentleman at all! Jing Yi added another mark against Shen Huaichu.","However, Shen Huaichu didn't go downstairs. Instead, he stood two steps below her and extended his hand.","Jing Yi clearly heard him say: \"Come, aren't you afraid of falling?\"","At that moment, Jing Yi felt bewitched again by Shen Huaichu's face.","Shen Huaichu was truly handsome, with deep, cold eyes and thin lips that rarely curved. But this didn't detract from his exquisite features, instead adding a unique air of nobility and mystery.","From this angle, Jing Yi could even see his slightly open collar and distinct collarbone...","Jing Yi blinked, hurriedly lowering her head to hide the emotions in her eyes. \"It's fine, I can go down by myself.\" Shen Huaichu maintained his earlier posture.","Seeing this, Jing Yi knew he wouldn't back down.","She felt inexplicably nervous, her long eyelashes fluttering slightly as she bit her lower lip. She placed her hand in Shen Huaichu's palm.","Shen Huaichu gently tightened his grip, lightly holding the hand in his palm. His cold fingertips touched Jing Yi's warm fingers.","The people in the hall stood still, watching as Shen Huaichu carefully guided her down the stairs, their expressions frozen in shock.","They had been wondering how long it would take before Jing Yi was sent down, but while she did come down, it was with Shen Huaichu protectively escorting her.","After reaching the bottom of the stairs, Jing Yi withdrew her hand, smiling awkwardly, \"Thank you.\" As the warmth in his palm disappeared, Shen Huaichu's hand tightened slightly before he put it behind his back, saying coolly, \"You're welcome.\"","Meanwhile, Shen Xi, who had been shocked throughout, came over. \"Yi Yi, do you want to eat something?\" She had to find an excuse to pull Jing Yi away for questioning!","Shen Xi carefully watched Shen Huaichu's expression, unable to hide the curiosity in her eyes.","Jing Yi was already feeling extremely awkward, so when she heard Shen Xi's suggestion, she quickly pulled her friend to the dining area.","Shen Huaichu's deep gaze followed her retreating figure, his eyes seemingly holding some other meaning, his hand behind his back still tightly clenched.","\"Brother, she's already gone,\" Gu Lin couldn't help but tease, standing beside Shen Huaichu.","The person had walked far away, yet he was still staring. Was this what his brother meant by \"presumptuous thoughts\"?","Shen Huaichu glanced at him, \"Didn't they say they were going to eat?\" Gu Lin pointed confusedly to the area behind them, \"That's already set up over there.\"","It was in the completely opposite direction from where Jing Yi had gone. Shen Huaichu looked in the direction Jing Yi had left, \"Then where did they go?\"","\"Probably to the other dining area.\" Surely his brother wasn't thinking of following them?","Gu Lin looked at Shen Huaichu in shock.","Of course, Shen Huaichu wasn't going to follow. He had just asked casually.","He put his hands in his trouser pockets, looking at the supposedly discreet glances people around were casting his way, his eyes filled with impatience.","\"Have someone send it to the deck,\" Shen Huaichu said before turning to go back upstairs.","Gu Lin was exasperated. Then why did you come down? Just to specially help Jing Yi down the stairs?","The girls who had been discussing Jing Yi earlier watched as Shen Huaichu walked back up to the top deck, their eyes full of unwillingness.","\"Lili, aren't you going to try again?\" One girl raised her eyebrows, suggesting she approach Shen Huaichu again.","This girl called Lili was the first to go up to the deck to test the waters, but she had probably been chased away before she could even poke her head out.","Lili, stung by the mockery, glared at her, \"Why don't you go try?!\"","The girl shrugged, \"My target was never Shen Huaichu. I know my limits. I'd be eternally grateful if I could win over Young Master Gu.\"","Lili laughed sarcastically, \"You really think Gu Lin is like cabbage in the market for you to pick and choose? Look at yourself!\"","\"If you really knew your limits, you wouldn't have set your sights on Gu Lin in the first place!\"","The girl seemed to be provoked, her expression twisting for a moment, \"Well! He didn't even look at you properly, yet you were mocking Jing Yi about being sent down. How did that turn out? She was escorted down!\"","Their voices had grown louder, and the friends around hurried to intervene, afraid they might attract the attention of the party hosts.","At the other dining area, the table was laden with various foods, from seafood to barbecue, to colorful desserts.","However, Shen Xi wasn't interested in any of this. At this moment, she only cared about why her uncle had held her best friend's hand coming down.","Jing Yi was busy sampling the party's dishes. \"That wasn't holding hands, it was supporting. It's a gentlemanly behavior.\"","Shen Xi didn't care, to her it was all the same - it was physical contact!","\"How can that be the same? It only shows that your uncle is a gentleman, who, concerned that a lady might have difficulty descending the stairs in her gown, offered his hand in support.\"","Shen Xi narrowed her eyes, full of doubt. Her uncle? Shen Huaichu? A gentleman?","Who wouldn't laugh their teeth off hearing that?","Jing Yi put down her knife and fork, grinning at Shen Xi to show her teeth were still intact.","Shen Xi looked at her helplessly, \"You do know that's just a figure of speech, right?\"","How could Jing Yi not know? But she and Shen Huaichu were at most just friends, and their relationship had only recently begun to improve. What was the point in making a fuss?","Seeing that Jing Yi had no such intentions, Shen Xi didn't press further. However, she still felt that Shen Huaichu's attitude was a bit odd.","Shen Xi sat beside her, rubbing her chin with a pensive look. Jing Yi forked a small piece of steak and fed it into her mouth.","\"Just eat your food. Why are you acting like some profound thinker here?\"","Seeing that she wasn't going to delve deeper, Jing Yi breathed an internal sigh of relief. \"By the way, didn't you go chat with that handsome guy? How did it go?\"","Jing Yi had expected to see the same disinterested Shen Xi as before, but to her surprise, the girl's face visibly reddened, shocking Jing Yi so much she forgot to eat.","\"No way? What's with this bashful blush? Did you take a liking to him?\"","Jing Yi stared intently at Shen Xi, finding it more and more incredible. Was there really someone who could survive a conversation with Shen Xi?","Now Jing Yi was intrigued. She leaned closer to Shen Xi, her face full of curiosity as she began to inquire about what they had talked about.","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu was still on the deck, feeling the breeze as he gazed at his palm, lost in thought."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Championship","paragraphs":["\"Cut! That's a wrap for this scene.\"","Wen Qingyan quickly pulled himself out of character, while Jing Zejun lowered her head, slowly emerging from the scene's emotions.","Recently, Jing Zejun had been making fewer mistakes. Hearing the director's words, she breathed a sigh of relief - today's filming was finally complete.","Standing in place, Jing Zejun watched as the makeup artist touched up Wen Qingyan's makeup. \"Brother Qingyan, I'm heading out soon. Good luck with the rest of your scenes.\" Wen Qingyan's filming would likely continue until evening.","Wen Qingyan looked at Jing Zejun. \"Are you going to watch Jing Yi's race?\" He recalled Jing Zejun mentioning that Jing Yi had a car race coming up.","Jing Zejun nodded, her eyes sparkling with excitement. \"I've already cleared it with the director. I'll change clothes and head out soon.\"","Seeing her happy expression, Wen Qingyan's lips curved into a smile. \"Give Jing Yi my best wishes for victory.\"","\"I'll make sure to pass that along.\"","The North River Raceway was one of the top racing circuits in the country, hosting many professional races. This time, it was hosting the Supercar Championship Race, another well-known national event.","As the name suggests, drivers compete in specially modified supercars, chosen from brands specified by the competition rules.","An hour before the race, Jing Yi was warming up, though her method seemed out of place. She was going through kickboxing moves, one after another.","From a distance, one could see a tall, muscular young woman moving her arms, her curly ponytail swaying in the breeze.","As her rhythm quickened, Jing Yi's movements became more fluid and powerful. She spun and rotated, her punches and kicks accurately striking imaginary opponents in the air, each impact carrying undeniable force.","Soon, her body began to heat up, sweat trickling down her forehead and along her delicate jawline. She paused, her breathing slowing, her round almond eyes glimmering with determination.","Jing Zeqian watched from the sidelines, instinctively stepping back as if afraid Jing Yi might accidentally hit him.","Jing Yi's kickboxing skills were no joke - he still remembered the pitiful state of that investor.","\"Thanks, big brother!\" Jing Yi took the towel Jing Zeyou handed her, calmly wiping the sweat from her brow.","Looking at the circle of people around her, including her family and Shen Xi, Jing Yi smiled. \"Mom, Dad, you don't need to stay here with me. The race will start soon, you should wait in the lounge to watch.\"","Besides, in a little while, only team members would be allowed in this area.","Lin Ruiqing looked even more nervous than Jing Yi. The thought of going to rest now was unbearable. \"Don't worry about us. Is everything prepared?\"","Jing Yi nodded obediently. \"Everything's ready.\" The racing team Jing Zeqian had assembled for her was highly professional, leaving her with almost nothing to worry about.","As time drew near, event staff began ushering non-essential personnel out of the area.","Jing Yi waved to her family, then turned to face her race car, feeling a bit nervous. This was, after all, her first official race.","The coach beside her encouraged Jing Yi to relax. In his view, Jing Yi's skills were more than adequate. The only issue was her rookie status - she lacked the experience and mental fortitude of veteran drivers.","Jing Yi took a deep breath, donned her helmet, and settled into the cockpit. Only ten minutes remained until the race.","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu stood in the stands, his eyes fixed on Jing Yi's bright red race car, his expression unreadable.","The venue was chaotic - the raceway's announcements, spectator chatter, and staff warnings all blended into a cacophony around Shen Huaichu.","Yet his gaze remained locked on the position of Jing Yi's car.","Shen Huaichu shouldn't have been here. He hated the roaring engines, and in this environment, the agitation in his eyes grew increasingly apparent.","He had seen Jing Yi's expression earlier. She looked a bit nervous, but her excitement was unmistakable.","She must truly love racing.","As the countdown ended, all the race cars shot off the starting line like arrows released from a bow.","But perhaps it was just bad luck - moments after the start, an overeager car collided violently with a white sports car not far from the starting line, sending debris flying.","The spectators were stunned, and the previously lively atmosphere instantly became more chaotic.","A sharp, piercing sound rang out. Shen Huaichu felt his body jolt. He instinctively looked towards Jing Yi's red race car and Gu Lin's black and white car, both of which had already sped far ahead.","Elsewhere, Jing Zeqian, who had just breathed a sigh of relief, spotted Shen Huaichu in the distance.","He furrowed his brow. \"Brother, is that Shen Huaichu?\" Jing Zeyou looked over, surprised. \"It is. Why is he here?\"","Jing Zeqian remembered that Gu Lin was also a participant in this race. \"Is he here to watch Gu Lin race?\" Jing Zeyou observed the distant figure, his deep eyes hiding curiosity.","Here to watch Gu Lin race?","Maybe, but Jing Zeyou felt that Shen Huaichu's intentions weren't so simple. Besides, as far as he knew, Shen Huaichu didn't enjoy these kinds of racing events.","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms. \"He couldn't possibly be here for Jing Yi, right?\" His tone was dismissive as his gaze returned to following Jing Yi's red race car.","Jing Zeyou glanced at him and let out a soft sigh.","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu, the subject of the brothers' discussion, was slowly making his way down from the stands towards the exit.","He seemed to walk with difficulty, his brows furrowed and eyes tightly shut. The image of the crashing vehicles pierced his mind like countless sharp needles, causing an intense headache.","Memories of his troubled youth came flooding back. Shen Huaichu's breathing became rapid and shallow. His chest felt constricted, as if bound by invisible ropes, making it hard to breathe. He seemed trapped in his own terrifying recollections.","At the same time, Jing Yi, who had also heard the crash, felt her heart skip a beat. She quickly regained her composure, determined not to let the accident behind her affect her performance.","Several cars ahead of her stubbornly held their positions. Jing Yi didn't rush - the race had only just begun, and she still had plenty of opportunities.","In the stands, the Jing family was equally tense. The earlier accident had startled them, but fortunately, Jing Yi's car had already sped ahead, unaffected by the collision behind her.","\"Zeqian, are those two drivers alright?\" Lin Ruiqing asked, concerned.","After the accident, race officials and team personnel quickly removed the vehicles and drivers from the track.","Lin Ruiqing could only see the staff helping the two drivers away, unable to tell the extent of their injuries.","In contrast, Jing Zeqian wasn't as worried. He was aware of the protection provided by the modified race cars.","\"Mom, don't worry. These race cars are specially modified to maximize driver safety.\""]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Red Racing Debut","paragraphs":["Although the car crash looked horrifying, since the race had just started and the vehicles weren't going very fast yet, the driver should be alright.","Lin Ruiqing breathed a sigh of relief, \"That's good.\" Having an accident right at the starting line still made her feel anxious.","By this time, Jing Yi had already successfully overtaken the two cars in front of her. The broadcast was reporting her progress, and the Jing family quickly turned their attention to it.","\"We can now clearly see the red Martin swiftly pulling ahead, preparing to overtake! The black and white Bentley isn't making any defensive moves. The red Martin is now alongside the black and white Bentley, waiting for the right moment!\"","\"The opportunity has come! The red Martin attacks, executing a very calm and collected overtake!\"","Jing Yi had just passed Gu Lin's black and white vehicle at a curve, swiftly taking the position ahead.","The commentator's voice was very excited, stirring up the audience at the scene. The Jing family also kept their eyes glued to the big screen.","Multiple race cars circled around lap after lap. With most of the race completed, there were still two cars ahead of Jing Yi - one white and one red.","On the racetrack, three cars sped through a curve, the roar of engines echoing throughout the entire circuit. Jing Yi's car closely pursued the leaders, the opportunity drawing ever closer, keeping the spectators in the stands on edge.","The track ahead opened up into a long straight section. The three cars immediately floored their accelerators, their speeds instantly skyrocketing as they surged forward.","The airflow whistled past the bodies of the race cars, making it nearly impossible for the spectators in the stands to make out their details.","Up ahead, Jing Yi was getting closer and closer to the car in second place. She steadied her hands, gripping the steering wheel tightly, her gaze locked onto her opponent without the slightest distraction.","\"The red Martin is charging up! She seems to be preparing to overtake! The red Martin and the Ferrari are now side by side! All three cars are hurtling towards the curve! An impressive overtaking scene is about to unfold!\"","At the crucial moment, Jing Yi suddenly drifted to the left at high speed, pushing her car to the dangerous edge.","The white Ferrari driver immediately noticed Jing Yi's attempt to overtake. The two cars were in extremely close proximity, with sparks from their tires tracing beautiful and strange arcs.","As they entered the curve, the white Ferrari collided with Jing Yi's red Martin from the outside, then continued to scrape against the Martin's body, trying to force her off the track.","Jing Yi quickly adjusted her car's angle, making the white Ferrari think it had successfully pushed her back. But before the other driver could feel relieved,","In a split second, Jing Yi's car swiftly pulled ahead, overtaking from the outside, successfully passing her opponent!","As they sped past, the white Ferrari driver looked to the side, an expression of disbelief on their face.","\"Wow! The red Martin driver's overtaking maneuver was nothing short of perfect! It's hard to believe this is a young girl participating in her first car race!\"","Jing Yi skillfully controlled her car, steadily driving forward, her delicate face still focused.","On the racetrack, cheers and applause rose and fell, with spectators celebrating Jing Yi's overtaking feat.","She continued to sprint, trying hard to catch up with the car in front, but unfortunately, while she had been tangling with the white car, the red and white car ahead had already gained a significant lead.","Jing Yi crossed the finish line in second place!","Jing Zejun excitedly stood up, pulling on Lin Ruiqing's arm beside him, \"Mom, Yi Yi has crossed the line! Second place! Second place!\" Lin Ruiqing was also very happy, craning her neck to look.","Jing Zeqian was also pleased, but thinking of the white car's actions earlier, he was still upset, \"If it wasn't for that white Ferrari, Jing Yi might have won first place!\"","Jing Zeyou was more focused on Jing Yi's sprint time, which should easily secure a top-three finish.","...","Outside the venue, Shen Huaichu leaned back in his seat with his eyes closed, trying to calm his emotions. Listening to the broadcast report, he knew that Jing Yi and Gu Lin's race had already ended.","His thin lips parted, \"Drive.\"","The driver received the instruction and started the car. The black sedan drove off.","Meanwhile, inside the venue, Jing Zejun and the Jing family were still waiting for the final rankings. After the last group finished racing, the big screen was displaying all the drivers' times.","Jing Yi was prominently ranked in second place! This meant Jing Yi had won second place in this race!","Jing Zejun let out an uncharacteristic scream, hugging Shen Xi and jumping up and down, looking as excited as could be. The Jing family members around him were also very happy, especially Jing Zeqian.","Although this championship race was only a nationally renowned competition, and although it was second place, it had been a long time since a female driver had appeared on the podium of a car race.","At the same time, the video of Jing Yi's race was uploaded to the internet and quickly became a trending topic.","The trending video was a clip of Jing Yi overtaking, along with images of her holding the trophy.","In the picture, Jing Yi was wearing a red racing suit, standing in the second-place position. Her almond-shaped eyes were curved like crescent moons, with shallow dimples, smiling happily.","[Wait, I always thought Jing Yi's interest in racing was just talk...]","[This is a real race, right? Not movie special effects?]","[I just want to say, Jing Yi is amazing! This is the North river Supercar Championship, not some exhibition race!]","[Is it really? It's been how many years since we've seen a female driver on the podium? This isn't photoshopped, is it?]","[I think there's still an element of luck. If it wasn't for two cars colliding at the start, affecting some of the drivers, Jing Yi probably wouldn't have gotten second place so easily.]","Online discussions about Jing Yi's race win were intense, with many people questioning the professionalism and value of the competition.","[I was there at the scene, and I just want to say, some people actually think these drivers are actors hired by the Jing family to help Jing Yi win? You guys are really sick in the head. Just look at each driver's car and the packed audience.]","[As a racing enthusiast, I have to say the driving of that red Martin was really impressive!]","[If I hadn't seen the video, I might have said it was fake, but Jing Yi's maneuver was absolutely incredible!]","[To the comment above, I even suspect that if it wasn't for the collision with the white car, Jing Yi might have won first place!]","[I'm only concerned about how Jing Yi said it was just a hobby... turns out I'm the clown.]","Regardless of the online discussions, Jing Yi had already started celebrating with her family.","The trophy was placed on the coffee table in the living room, with the Jing family gathered around. Even Aunt Wang and Uncle Li didn't miss out.","\"Cheers!\" The happy expression hadn't yet faded from Jing Yi's face. This was her first race, after all.","She had originally thought that making it into the top ten would be good enough, and it would help her become familiar with the circle. But unexpectedly winning second place - how could she not be excited?","\"Yi Yi, you're amazing. Taking second place in your first official race,\" said Aunt Wang. She hadn't been at the scene, but hearing about it from Jing Zejun and the others made her very happy for Jing Yi.","Jing Yi chuckled a couple of times, feeling a bit embarrassed.","\"Actually, there was a bit of luck involved. If a few cars hadn't been affected, I probably wouldn't have won a trophy.\"","The others didn't quite agree. Car racing doesn't just test technique, but also strong psychological resilience. Being affected only showed that the other drivers' mental strength wasn't strong enough.","\"If you ask me, it's good that the white car was penalized in the end. Otherwise, it would have been really infuriating,\" said Jing Zeqian.","He put down his glass, still feeling angry about that white car. If it hadn't been for their foul play, Jing Yi might have truly been able to compete for first place with the winning car.","Fortunately, the white car was eventually penalized, so third place went to the green car behind them, which was somewhat satisfying."]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: The Incident of That Year","paragraphs":["\"Ding dong\"","Gu Lin stood in front of Shen Huaichu's villa, pressing the doorbell.","After waiting for a few minutes with no one answering, Gu Lin entered the passcode and went in.","\"Brother?\" No response. Gu Lin peered inside while closing the door behind him.","Walking into the living room, he saw Shen Huaichu lying on the sofa, his brows slightly furrowed.","Feeling worried, Gu Lin quickly approached and touched Shen Huaichu's forehead. The man lying down coldly said, \"What are you doing?\"","Gu Lin sighed in relief and withdrew his hand. He had thought his brother might have fallen ill or fainted due to the racing incident.","\"I thought something happened to you. You weren't answering your phone or the doorbell.\"","Shen Huaichu slowly opened his eyes, pressing his fingers against his temples as he sat up. He looked like he hadn't rested comfortably.","Gu Lin was still concerned, \"Brother, are you okay?\"","Shen Huaichu got up, went to the kitchen to pour a glass of water, and drank it. \"Don't worry, I'm not dead yet.\"","Gu Lin thought: Isn't your standard for being okay a bit too low?","However, since Shen Huaichu said he was fine, Gu Lin didn't press further and just sat down on the sofa.","\"You know, if you don't like it, why did you go watch? Aren't you just torturing yourself?\"","Shen Huaichu appeared nonchalant, but his head was still throbbing. He shook his head slightly and lay back down on the sofa. \"To broaden my horizons.\"","Gu Lin pouted and muttered, \"Who are you kidding?\" Did Shen Huaichu really think he didn't know why he went?","Hearing Gu Lin's words, Shen Huaichu remained silent, lying on the sofa with his eyes closed, lost in thought.","Shen Huaichu's condition worried Gu Lin. \"Brother, why don't you go home for a few days?\"","\"No.\"","Shen Tu would notice his condition immediately.","As expected, he was refused. Gu Lin felt helpless and a bit defeated. \"Then how about I ask your aunt to come take care of you?\"","Shen Huaichu kept his eyes closed, but his voice turned colder. \"Gu Lin, are you threatening me?\"","Gu Lin slumped back into the sofa corner, deflated. \"How is this a threat, brother? I'm worried about you, a lonely young CEO, getting sick at home with no one to take care of you!\"","With no one else at home, if he fainted, there wouldn't even be anyone to call an ambulance.","Shen Huaichu closed his eyes again and said flatly, \"Don't worry, I'll call 120 myself.\"","How was that supposed to be reassuring?","\"How will you call 120 if you're unconscious?\"","Shen Huaichu's tone remained calm, \"The villa gets cleaned daily. As long as I don't deliberately pass out in a corner, I'll definitely be found.\"","Gu Lin thought: I was just about to say, the cleaners might not see you either...","\"I get a physical every year and don't have any sudden illnesses. Even if I'm unconscious for a whole day, I can still be saved.\"","Gu Lin stared at him in disbelief, amazed that someone could discuss such matters so calmly.","He really should let Shen Huaichu's aunt, his own mother, hear this – how her nephew had made such detailed and meticulous plans for survival.","...","At the Wang residence","Wang He put down the documents, the wrinkles on his face more pronounced in the flickering light, but his eyes were filled with sternness.","\"Haven't you started implementing your plan yet?\"","Wang Boqi stood before him, his eyes flickering with unease as he lowered his head slightly. \"I haven't found the right opportunity yet.\"","Since finishing her variety show, Jing Yi had been living a routine life, either at home or at the racetrack. Even at the racetrack, she was practicing intensively.","His father's face darkened further. \"When will be the right opportunity? When Jing Yi makes more headlines and Hengjing becomes even more famous?\"","Recently, Jing Yi had been trending on social media again, boosting the popularity of the Jing family and Hengjing. Meanwhile, his son only had an empty plan.","Feeling the pressure from Wang He, Wang Boqi bowed his head respectfully and replied, \"I've already investigated. I'll start taking action in the next few days.\"","\"Are you sure your plan will succeed?\" Wang He's gaze was full of doubt and disappointment. \"Jing Yi is just a fake heiress. Instead of wasting time on her, why don't you directly target Jing Zeyou?\"","For years, Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou had been on high alert, and he couldn't affect Hengjing at all. He had placed his hopes on his son, only to be met with even greater disappointment.","\"Now you can't even deal with Jing Zeyou, let alone Jing Zeqian...\"","Wang He's words made Wang Boqi's face turn pale. His downcast eyes were filled with anger, and his clenched fists trembled slightly.","Perhaps it was his father's repeated criticism that caused the dissatisfaction in Wang Boqi's heart to suddenly surge.","\"Father, weren't you also unable to overcome Jing Beicheng? Otherwise, you wouldn't have targeted a three-year-old girl back then...\"","\"You insolent brat!\"","Wang Boqi's voice was tinged with mockery. Wang He's gaze turned sharp as a knife, seemingly enraged by his son's words. He threw the folder in his hand at Wang Boqi.","Wang Boqi didn't dodge, taking the hit head-on. The folder left a bloody mark on his forehead, indicating the force with which Wang He had thrown it.","Wang He's sinister gaze was particularly frightening. The atmosphere was tense, as if even the air had become heavy.","Back then, his methods weren't particularly sophisticated. Seeing Hengjing of the Jing family gradually taking the lead in North river, Wang He couldn't accept it and had an idea.","That day, three-year-old Jing Zejun was out with Old Mrs. Jing, giving Wang He, who had been monitoring the Jing family, an opportunity.","Old Mrs. Jing was very cautious. Even when she went to the restroom, she took her granddaughter with her.","But Wang He's men had infiltrated and quickly drugged and took away the three-year-old Jing Zejun.","However, Jing Zejun was truly a lucky person. Wang He had originally planned to have her taken away and settled first, then use her to threaten Jing Beicheng, but she was intercepted halfway.","As a result, Jing Zejun ended up in an orphanage.","\"When did you find out?\" Wang He tried to calm himself down, but his eyes still revealed a hint of anger. This was his son challenging his authority.","\"When I was little, I overheard you on the phone in the study.\"","Wang He had thought only he knew about this incident, but he never imagined that nine-year-old Wang Boqi had overheard his phone call and remembered the whole thing.","And now he was using it to mock him!","Wang Boqi stood with his head bowed, appearing respectful, but the mockery in his eyes hadn't faded.","He knew his father had always disapproved of his methods involving women, but in Wang Boqi's view, it was his weapon, a lethal weapon.","Once Jing Yi turned to his side, the Jing family would be in a precarious position.","Moreover, using a three-year-old girl as leverage? His father's methods weren't exactly righteous either.","They truly were father and son, not much different from each other.","\"I don't care what methods you use. If I don't see results soon, I'll have to reconsider whether your current position in the company is appropriate.\"","Wang He looked up at Wang Boqi, his gaze full of impatience, wanting to end the conversation with his son as soon as possible.","\"Yes,\" Wang Boqi said softly, the corner of his mouth turning up slightly in an almost imperceptible sneer."]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Jing Zeyou's Probe","paragraphs":["The conference hall was brightly lit and spacious, with seats filled by corporate leaders. The staff guided Jing Zeyou to the front row, indicating his seat.","Jing Zeyou sat down, crossing his long legs, looking at the large LED screen on the stage projecting the words 'The 20th North river Financial Summit'.","Jing Zeyou glanced at the seat next to him, where Shen Huaichu's name was displayed.","\"Mr. Jing,\" a cool voice came. Jing Zeyou looked up to see Shen Huaichu.","Shen Huaichu's lips curved into a polite smile, \"Mr. Shen.\"","Shen Huaichu sat down, maintaining his usual expressionless demeanor.","As the conference hadn't started yet, the two began to chat.","Jing Zeyou was still curious about the figure he had seen at Shanchi Racing Track. \"Mr. Shen, did you also go to Shanchi to watch the race recently?\"","A ripple appeared in Shen Huaichu's eyes, \"Yes, I went to watch Gu Lin race.\"","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow imperceptibly, his lips curving slightly, \"I thought I had seen wrong. Mr. Shen really cares about his brother. Coincidentally, Yi Yi was also racing at Shanchi Racing Track at that time.\"","Shen Huaichu responded calmly, \"Is that so? What a coincidence.\" He naturally knew that Jing Yi was racing at Shanchi, otherwise he wouldn't have gone to watch.","Jing Zeyou maintained his composure, speaking in a joking tone, \"I had intended to greet Mr. Shen after it ended, but it seems you left quite early?\"","\"I'm not interested in racing, I just went to take a look.\"","Jing Zeyou's smile deepened, \"But it's a pity Mr. Shen didn't stay until the end. That final overtake was quite spectacular.\" He subtly steered the conversation deeper.","Usually, Jing Zeyou wouldn't deliberately bring up topics the other party disliked, but when it involved Jing Yi, he had to understand Shen Huaichu's thoughts clearly.","A hint of warmth colored Shen Huaichu's gaze, \"It's not really a pity, there will always be a next time.\"","This was exactly what Jing Zeyou was waiting for. The smile in his eyes seemed to carry a different meaning, \"Mr. Shen doesn't like racing this time, but will like it next time?\"","Given how greatly the car accident had affected Shen Huaichu, how could he be certain he'd be able to watch the entire race safely next time?","Jing Zeyou wasn't planning to 'play the spoilsport', but there were some premises he wanted to clarify with Shen Huaichu.","Shen Huaichu's eyes flickered slightly, catching the unspoken implication in Jing Zeyou's words. For a moment, Shen Huaichu wanted to lay all his thoughts bare, his gaze not wavering in the slightest.","\"Mr. Jing, as long as I want to, I can.\"","Jing Zeyou gave a soft laugh, leisurely crossing his arms and leaning back in his chair, \"Well then, we shall see.\"","Shen Huaichu was indeed a formidable person, something Jing Zeyou had never denied. But he didn't believe it was something that could be accomplished just by wanting it.","The distance between Shen Huaichu and Jing Yi was farther than either of them imagined.","While these two were engaged in their verbal sparring, the CEOs of other groups and companies behind them silently looked on. Although they didn't know what the two were discussing, the atmosphere was certainly far from harmonious.","Weren't Hengjing and Huarui Group supposed to be cooperating? Were they always this fierce even as business partners?","At this moment, the summit began, with the host enthusiastically introducing the day's agenda, \"Respected guests, welcome to the 20th North river Financial Summit!\"","\"What?! That Shen Huaichu was there for Jing Yi?!\" So after all this, Shen Huaichu wasn't there for Gu Lin at all, he was there for Jing Yi!","In the Jing family study, upon hearing Jing Zeyou's words, Jing Zeqian stood up abruptly, looking extremely agitated.","Although Jing Zeqian wasn't exactly familiar with Shen Huaichu, he couldn't say he didn't know him. Outstanding ability, ruthless execution, decisive actions - Jing Zeqian didn't deny any of these qualities.","However, no matter how impressive the other party was, let alone being an outsider, even if he were his own brother, Jing Zeqian wouldn't think him worthy of Jing Yi.","Just thinking about the other party having designs on Jing Yi made Jing Zeqian unable to calm down. He paced back and forth in front of Jing Zeyou's desk restlessly, while Jing Zeyou continued to handle his work, seemingly oblivious to the person in front of him.","Seeing his brother still focused on work, Jing Zeqian strode to his desk, \"Brother, how can you still have the mind to work now?\"","Jing Zeyou looked up, puzzled. He was at the age of supporting his family, if he didn't work, was he supposed to waste time watching his brother pace back and forth?","Even though Jing Zeyou didn't speak, Jing Zeqian knew his brother was silently mocking him. His voice tinged with urgency, he said, \"Shouldn't we be thinking of a way to deal with this?\"","\"Deal with what?\"","Jing Zeyou lowered his head again to continue his work, but to avoid Jing Zeqian interrupting him again, he responded to his agitated brother.","\"To stop them, of course!\"","Jing Zeyou paused, looking at Jing Zeqian with an exasperated expression.","If he wasn't afraid of hurting his brother's feelings, he sometimes felt that at least half of Jing Zeqian's success with 'Startrack' was due to luck.","Seeing his brother's speechless look, Jing Zeqian finally realized, \"Oh right, they're not even together yet...\" He laughed awkwardly.","Isn't this just anxiety clouding his judgment?","Thinking about it carefully, they really couldn't do anything. Realizing this was truly frustrating.","\"So, we can't do anything?\" Jing Zeyou was still working with his head down, \"You could always expand 'Startrack', then swallow up Huarui Group, so he won't have time to think about these things.\"","Jing Zeqian silently looked at the person at the desk. Was his brother taking him for a fool?","Seeing Jing Zeqian sit back on the sofa with a frustrated look, Jing Zeyou casually said, \"You're not the Queen Mother of the West in heaven, why are you so keen on breaking people up?\"","Jing Zeyou's mention of this reminded Jing Zeqian of another 'wolf' - Wen Qingyan.","What kind of fate did the two brothers have? Each of them had invited a 'wolf' home.","\"I'm just looking out for them as a brother!\" Jing Zeyou gave him a strange look, \"How are you looking out for them?\"","He was genuinely curious. Surely they couldn't banish someone ten thousand miles away just for showing a bit of interest.","Jing Zeqian stammered, unable to come up with anything.","Jing Zeyou leisurely lifted his eyelids, resting one arm on the desk, \"Don't view people through colored glasses.\"","Moreover, if he hadn't mentioned it, Jing Zeqian would probably still think Shen Huaichu's appearance at the racetrack was just a coincidence. With such 'keen' perception, what did he think he could do?","Jing Zeqian let out a light snort. His brother's words sounded nice, but he was sure his brother had 'warned' those two long ago.","A barking dog doesn't bite! Pah pah pah! Wasn't he insulting himself too with that analogy?!","Jing Zeyou watched Jing Zeqian pat his mouth, ignoring his seemingly random behavior, \"Where's Yi Yi?\" He hadn't seen her since he came back.","\"She left early this morning for the place where Jun Jun is filming. Said she was treating it like a relaxing vacation.\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi, who had already boarded the plane with Shen Xi, was sleeping with an eye mask on, leaning on Shen Xi's shoulder.","It took several hours to fly from North River to where Jing Zejun was filming. The two had fallen asleep like this after boarding the plane, and didn't wake up until the plane was about to land."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Ragged Filming Set","paragraphs":["\"Dear passengers: We have safely arrived at our destination. The aircraft will now taxi to its designated parking position. To ensure your safety...\"","Shen Xi groggily woke up and gently nudged Jing Yi, who was leaning against her.","\"Yi Yi, wake up. I think we've arrived.\"","Jing Yi pushed up her eye mask, still looking sleepy. \"So soon?\" She lazily stretched and took a moment before removing her eye mask completely.","Jing Zejun had left after watching her competition last time, saying she only had two days off and needed to hurry back for filming.","As it happened, the director had seemingly relaxed the confidentiality measures Jing Yi had mentioned before. While photos were still prohibited, visitors were now allowed on set.","Jing Zejun had asked if she wanted to visit the set, and Jing Yi immediately agreed, as she had nothing else to do at the moment.","So Jing Yi decided to head out for a set visit right away, and she even brought along Shen Xi, who was also free at home.","After getting off the plane, the two took a taxi towards the location Jing Zejun had sent.","Upon reaching the filming site Jing Zejun had mentioned, Shen Xi stared blankly at the dilapidated factory in front of her.","\"Yi Yi, didn't you say this was a school drama?\"","Jing Yi was also a bit surprised, scanning the surrounding environment before reminding Shen Xi, \"Didn't I tell you? It's not just a simple school idol drama, it's an infinite flow series.\"","Although Jing Yi said that, she had also previously thought film and TV shooting locations were always crowded, glamorous places.","Shen Xi was still staring at the rundown factory, saying dazedly, \"I don't even know what infinite flow means...\"","All she knew was that she had no desire to enter this factory, and she had every right to suspect that the driver must have brought them to the wrong place!","Before Shen Xi could voice her doubts, someone came jogging over to greet them. \"Sister Yi Yi!\" It was Jing Zejun's assistant, whom Jing Yi had met once before.","Jing Yi smiled and waved, telling Shen Xi, \"Our ride is here.\" Shen Xi looked at the approaching figure with utter despair and shock. So this really was the place?!","The assistant jogged over, still a bit out of breath. Jing Yi patted her back, saying, \"Take it easy, I'm not going to run away.\"","The assistant smiled sheepishly, as she had been worried about keeping Jing Yi waiting.","After catching her breath, the assistant reached out to take Jing Yi's luggage, but Jing Yi quickly pulled the suitcase behind her. \"I can manage, it's too heavy for you.\"","Jing Yi wasn't just being polite – her suitcase was genuinely very heavy, packed with food and supplies she had brought for Jing Zejun.","Seeing this, the assistant didn't insist. She knew both Jing Zejun and Jing Yi were very easy-going people.","She helped carry some of the smaller items and greeted Shen Xi behind them, \"Hello.\"","\"You can call her Sister Xiao Xi,\" Jing Yi said.","The assistant nodded obediently. \"Sister Xiao Xi.\" She had already been informed that Jing Yi would be bringing a friend.","Shen Xi quickly composed her facial expression and smiled politely. \"Hello!\"","\"I'll take you over now. Sister Zejun is still filming inside.\"","As the assistant led Jing Yi and Shen Xi, she chatted about the afternoon tea that had arrived earlier.","\"Sister Yi Yi, the afternoon tea you sent has already arrived.\" When it came, there was a whole cart full of sweets and coffee, enough for nearly everyone.","Jing Yi smiled. \"Is that so? How was the Swiss roll?\" The assistant nodded eagerly, \"Delicious!\"","Jing Yi nodded. She'd have to order some to try when she got back. It was a new product from that shop, and she had only tried the matcha Swiss roll so far.","Soon, the three arrived at the filming location, and the scene before them finally resembled a proper film set.","Crew members bustling about, lights in every corner, and camera operators at various angles.","The crew seemed to be on a break, with many people sitting in different spots enjoying the afternoon tea she had sent.","\"Yi Yi!\"","Jing Zejun spotted her and came jogging over.","Seeing the newcomer, Shen Xi couldn't hide the shock in her eyes.","My goodness! What have they done to my idol?! How did an elegant young lady turn into a dirty beggar?!","\"Xi Xi, long time no see!\" Jing Zejun held Jing Yi's hand while greeting Shen Xi with a smile.","Shen Xi asked in a slightly shocked tone, \"Zejun, aren't you filming a school drama?\"","Looking like this, Shen Xi would believe it was a post-apocalyptic drama. Combined with the appearance of the filming location, she felt she might be on the verge of uncovering the truth.","Jing Zejun looked down at her dirt-covered school uniform and chuckled. \"It's not a school drama in the traditional sense.\"","\"By the way, have you eaten?\"","\"We ate on the plane.\" Although it wasn't very good, it was filling enough.","Seeing Jing Yi's expression, Jing Zejun knew she probably wasn't satisfied with the airplane meal.","She smiled. \"There are snacks and desserts prepared for you in the break room.\" Jing Yi's face immediately lit up with joy.","Many crew members had also noticed Jing Yi. More than being interested in Jing Yi herself, they were curious about her sisterly relationship with Jing Zejun. From what they could see, the sisters seemed to get along quite well.","Wen Qingyan also approached from nearby.","\"Jing Yi.\"","Jing Yi smiled and waved at Wen Qingyan. \"Mr. Wen, long time no see!\"","As expected of Wen Qingyan, even dressed like this, his cultured and elegant demeanor remained unaffected.","Wen Qingyan's lips curved upward, his eyes warm. \"I haven't had the chance to properly congratulate you on winning second place in the racing competition.\"","Jing Yi giggled. \"Thank you!\" She hadn't expected Wen Qingyan to pay attention to her race.","Before they could say much more, the script supervisor reminded them it was time to resume filming.","\"Let's have dinner together tonight then, to celebrate properly.\"","The award-winning actor really doesn't miss an opportunity, does he? Jing Yi's eyes flashed with amusement as she turned to look at Jing Zejun.","Seeing no objection, she smiled and said, \"Sure! Xiao Xi and I will wait for you in the break room until you're done for the day.\"","After the two left, Shen Xi leaned in to whisper to Jing Yi, \"Yi Yi, is Wen Qingyan still pursuing Zejun? That look in his eyes – who would believe nothing's going on?\"","\"Shh, we'll talk about it later.\"","This was a film set after all, with cameras and audio equipment everywhere. They could be recorded at any moment.","Shen Xi understood and closed her mouth.","She was a sensible fan after all! A rational supporter!","Meanwhile, the assistant had led the two to the break room. Jing Yi could finally relax properly, but Shen Xi was clearly still interested in the filming outside.","She asked the assistant, \"Can we go watch them film later?\" The assistant nodded, \"Yes, as long as you don't make any noise or disrupt the normal filming process, it's fine.\"","At this point, Jing Yi had picked up a Swiss roll she wanted to eat and was carefully unwrapping it.","\"Do you want to go watch the filming now?\"","Shen Xi laughed. It was a rare opportunity to watch her favorite celebrity act in person – why not make the most of it?"]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Would you like to make a cameo","paragraphs":["Jing Yi's expression was composed as she began to taste the Swiss roll in front of her, which was matcha flavored.","Not bad, but it would be perfect with coffee!","Jing Yi picked up her coffee and looked at the restless Shen Xi, asking curiously, \"You didn't eat much on the plane, aren't you hungry?\"","At this moment, Shen Xi was completely captivated by the filming outside. This was Jing Zejun filming on location! And the male lead was a famous actor who liked her! What kind of real-life entertainment industry novel was this?","How could she possibly focus on afternoon tea here?","Jing Yi put down her coffee and asked her assistant, \"Qiqi, is it convenient to take us to watch now?\" She wanted to enjoy her food in peace, but this person's restless demeanor was impossible to ignore.","\"Of course, I'll take you over now,\" the assistant said, leading the two towards the outside.","At the stairway entrance to the filming location, a crowd had gathered. In the narrow passage, cameras were steadily positioned at various angles, and sound technicians were closely holding microphones, capturing every subtle sound.","The set was very quiet, with only the actors' voices delivering lines. Jing Yi and Shen Xi couldn't help but soften their breathing.","The protagonists of this scene didn't seem to be Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun, as the two were standing to the side while a female actress stood in front of the cameras.","Was she playing a crazed student?","Jing Yi hadn't read their script either, so she could only guess the character from the actress's performance.","Not far from where the crowd had gathered sat the director of this production, frowning as he watched the monitor. He didn't seem very satisfied.","\"Cut! The feeling's not right! Your movements aren't vicious enough! Again!\"","For the next ten minutes or so, Jing Yi constantly heard the director's various expressions of dissatisfaction.","\"Again!\"","\"Again!\"","\"How many times do I have to say the expression is wrong! Do you even know how to act? If you can't act, give up the role!\"","The actress's eyes were starting to redden. Jing Yi and Shen Xi huddled together, whispering, \"This director is so fierce.\"","\"Jun Jun said she was scolded several times when she was filming too.\"","Jing Yi's gaze cautiously moved towards the director. They didn't dare say more, lest the director overhear and they catch him at a bad moment.","In the end, the actress failed to successfully film the scene, and the director was already arranging for the Assistant Director to find a replacement.","They had to start filming Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun's scenes for now.","Shen Xi and Jing Yi sat to the side, watching intently. The director, looking at the monitor, still frowned. It wasn't that the lead actors were bad, but he was still thinking about the missing crucial character.","Although described as the protagonist of a short story arc, the character only appeared in two episodes, with more emphasis on environment and plot to portray this character.","But these one or two episodes of screen time were extremely important. If they couldn't accurately portray the character, all the previous build-up would be wasted!","The Assistant Director quickly brought the list to the director, who was flipping through it when he inadvertently noticed Jing Yi sitting opposite.","His gaze lingered for a few seconds; she looked familiar.","\"Who's that?\"","The Assistant Director looked over, \"That's Zejun's sister, the other young lady of the Jing family, Jing Yi. The one beside her seems to be her friend. They've come to visit Zejun on set.\"","I wonder if her physical skills could add to this character?","The director suddenly became interested in Jing Yi. He had seen Jing Yi's trending topics and had already begun to imagine how well Jing Yi would fit the role.","He put down the list, \"Go ask her if she's willing to play the role from just now.\"","The Assistant Director opened his mouth, thinking, \"You really want to bring in all the Jing family's young ladies, don't you?\"","He could understand Jing Zejun acting, as it was her profession, but the Jing family's younger daughter wasn't in the entertainment industry. Why would she cooperate?","The Assistant Director was somewhat troubled and felt compelled to remind him, \"If she acts, how will we calculate her payment?\" She was the Jing family's daughter after all. They could handle one Jing Zejun because she had an agent and a company.","How would they arrange for another one?","\"Just ask her first,\" the director waved his hand, uninterested in these issues. It seemed that as long as Jing Yi agreed, any conditions could be met.","The Assistant Director steeled himself and turned to walk towards Jing Yi.","\"Miss Jing\"","Jing Yi looked at the approaching person, stood up to greet him, feeling a bit guilty inside.","Could it be that what she and Xixi just said was really overheard?","The Assistant Director put on a smiling face, appearing amiable, \"Please, sit down. I wanted to ask how you think your sister and the others are doing with the filming?\"","Jing Yi was a bit confused but still responded with a smile, \"It's quite good, quite interesting.\" If the director wasn't so fierce, it would probably be more interesting. Now it was just listening to the director scold people the whole time.","The Assistant Director's smile deepened, \"It's like this, I wanted to ask if you'd be interested in making a cameo as the character from just now?\"","Jing Yi's delicate brows furrowed, even more confused. She pointed at herself, \"Me? Make a cameo?\" The Assistant Director nodded with a smile, \"Yes, if you're interested, you could give it a try. It would be an experience, right?\"","The Assistant Director could only approach from the angle of curiosity. He sincerely hoped Jing Yi was genuinely interested in acting, otherwise he couldn't exactly use payment to attract her!","Meanwhile, Jing Zejun had just finished filming a scene and, seeing the Assistant Director standing in front of Jing Yi, walked over.","\"Yi Yi, is something wrong?\"","The Assistant Director, seeing a professional had arrived, felt a bit more at ease and relayed the director's words to Jing Zejun.","\"A cameo?\"","Jing Zejun recalled the character's attributes and understood more. Seeing the confusion in Jing Yi's eyes, she explained, \"The director probably knows you do sanda, so you might be suitable for this role.\"","Jing Zejun briefly explained the character's personality and background to Jing Yi, letting her consider comprehensively, but assured her that there would be no loss if she didn't accept.","The role the previous actress was playing was for another subplot in the drama called \"Missing Classmate\".","The male and female leads enter another level of the school and discover classmates disappearing one by one, eventually identifying the culprit as the character played by the actress.","The director had also walked over by now. Jing Yi glanced at him carefully, \"I can give it a try, but if I'm not suitable, can you let me go directly?\"","She did want to try, but the image of the director scolding people earlier was still echoing in her mind.","The director's expression stiffened. Had he been too fierce earlier?","The Assistant Director also secretly glanced up at the director. See? She was indeed frightened.","The director coughed lightly, \"Don't worry, just treat it like you're playing a role-playing game. Also, your friend can make a cameo too.\" Of course, mainly in an insignificant 'sidekick' role.","Besides, Jing Yi was just brought in temporarily, he wasn't so ruthless as to demand she possess superb acting skills.","Shen Xi was a bit excited, not expecting to be included.","Jing Yi's gaze moved to Jing Zejun, her eyes full of: He said he won't scold people! Back me up!","Jing Zejun looked at her amusedly and nodded.","Only then did Jing Yi feel reassured, \"Then I'll give it a try.\""]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: The Role Adaptability is Quite High","paragraphs":["The assistant director was overjoyed and quickly handed a script to Jing Yi. She took the script and walked to the stairwell where they were filming.","Meanwhile, the assistant director still needed to discuss payment with Jing Zejun. Jing Zejun smiled and said, \"After the director confirms, I'll talk to the agent and have her negotiate.\" He certainly didn't want his sister to get shortchanged.","On the other side, Jing Yi had already gotten a general understanding of the role she was to play.","The character's name was Chen Xiaoxiao, a tiny girl true to her name, who had been suffering from school bullying until one day when she eliminated her tormentors one by one...","There were two particularly important scenes - one where she deals with the bullies, and another where she confronts the male and female leads.","Jing Yi's eyes flickered slightly, as if revealing something.","\"How is it? Anything you don't understand?\" Jing Zejun came over, worried that Jing Yi might find it difficult.","Jing Yi let out a sigh of relief, a smile spreading across her face, dimples showing. \"Let's give it a try.\" The character actually seemed quite fitting.","Jing Zejun nodded, gently patting her head. \"Don't force yourself. If you don't like it, we won't do it.\" Unlike herself, who truly loved this profession, Jing Yi's aspirations lay elsewhere.","\"Don't worry!\"","The director had already walked over. \"Shall we start now?\"","Jing Yi nodded, \"Mm-hmm.\"","This was Jing Yi's first time acting, with so many people around. She crouched in the corner, closed her eyes, and dredged up buried memories.","'Unwanted child, Jing Yi is an unwanted child.'","'Jing Yi, where's your money? Oh, I forgot, you don't have parents to give you pocket money.'","'Go! Tie her up and throw her in the toilet, damn mad dog, daring to bite me!'","\"Not happy? Tell your parents to come find me, hahaha!\"","The director signaled the supporting actor to approach. A boy in a school uniform quickly changed his expression and kicked Jing Yi in the corner.","\"Hey! Chen Xiaoxiao, why are you hiding so well?\"","Jing Yi, crouched in the corner, flinched. She looked very frightened, her whole body trembling non-stop.","\"We're all classmates, what's wrong with taking a look?\" The supporting actor kept provoking Jing Yi, about to reach out and pull at her clothes.","Suddenly, Jing Yi raised her hand to block him, standing up. Her bright almond eyes were still there, but now they held a hint of coldness.","A laugh escaped her throat, sounding particularly eerie in the abandoned stairwell.","The director stood to the side with folded arms, suddenly pausing, a flash of surprise in his eyes.","This Jing Yi was quite interesting.","The supporting actor seemed angered by her resistance and raised his hand to hit her. Jing Yi's expression remained unchanged as she calmly tilted her head to dodge, quickly striking out at the other's head.","However, she stopped just before making contact. The opposite actor understood and acted as if heavily struck, falling to the ground.","Jing Yi walked over and began hitting repeatedly, until finally picking up a foam brick and violently striking the back of his head.","Jing Yi's pale hand caressed where the actor should have had wounds, as if blood was flowing there, seemingly enjoying the metallic scent permeating the air.","She murmured, \"That's right, what's wrong with taking a look? I'd like to take a look at your brain too, see what's different...\"","Jing Yi's voice echoed around, making the surrounding actors and staff shudder. Even Shen Xi tightly gripped Jing Zejun's arm.","Was this still her lively and adorable best friend?","As the audition ended, Jing Yi blinked, returning to her usual self, smiling as she helped the actor on the ground to his feet.","Acting like this actually made Jing Yi feel quite satisfied. If only she had started learning boxing in her early teens, none of those people back then would have escaped.","The supporting actor looked somewhat afraid. Jing Yi thought she might have accidentally hurt him and hurriedly asked, \"Did I hit you just now?\"","She shouldn't have - she had made sure to pull her punches at the last moment.","The supporting actor quickly shook his head. He wasn't scared of her fists, he was terrified by Jing Yi's eyes! He really thought for a moment that Jing Yi was about to tear his head open with her bare hands!","Unlike the others, the director's eyes were full of delight. \"Get her changed and made up! We're filming this scene right away!\"","Before Jing Yi could react, she was already being pulled away by an assistant.","Wen Qingyan watched her retreating figure. \"Jing Yi is quite impressive.\"","However, when it comes to acting skills, either she truly had a talent for acting, or art often imitates life...","Jing Zejun was also surprised, not expecting Jing Yi to give him such a big surprise.","Jing Yi only had two scenes in total, with the climax being her confrontation with the male and female leads. The makeup artist touched up Jing Yi's makeup - now she looked pale, with blood on her lips, smiling even more like a yandere girl.","The surrounding staff and actors were all secretly looking forward to this scene.","Filming officially began. In the script, the male and female leads needed to uncover the truth behind their classmate's disappearance and prevent the killer from striking again in order to leave.","To stop Chen Xiaoxiao from acting again, the male lead Shen Ji engaged in a confrontation with her.","Chen Xiaoxiao licked the blood at the corner of her mouth, smiling playfully. \"Why? Why don't you ask those people why they didn't leave me alone?\"","Seeming to recall something, Chen Xiaoxiao's lips curved upward, her eyes innocent. \"Oh right, they can't speak anymore...\"","Chen Xiaoxiao looked at the trembling boy hiding behind Shen Ji, letting out a light sigh. It was a pity - give her a few more seconds and she could have finished off the last one.","\"Shen Ji, give me the person behind you. This doesn't concern you.\"","Shen Ji moved half a step, completely shielding the person. Tang Tang also moved to protect the person behind her.","They couldn't hand over the person now, or they might never be able to leave this stairwell.","Chen Xiaoxiao smiled, her voice very soft, her smile becoming more adorably innocent, making those watching feel increasingly creeped out.","\"What? You want to protect him?\" Shen Ji's gaze flashed with reluctance. \"Xiaoxiao, we can use other methods...\"","Chen Xiaoxiao laughed as if she'd heard the funniest joke ever, laughing so hard she even wiped tears from her eyes.","\"What methods? Call the police? Tell the teachers? Or the parents? Shen Ji, I can't even leave this stairwell now. Tell me, what should I do?\"","Shen Ji lowered his head slightly, his gaze filled with shame.","Chen Xiaoxiao didn't let him off, her eyes still fierce. \"Tell me! What exactly should I do to resolve this?!\"","She seemed to get more excited as she spoke. \"If I'd known you had other methods, I wouldn't have acted. You know what? They all shut up in this stairwell, every single one of them, without exception...\"","Suddenly, she stopped smiling, her gaze filled with hatred as she looked at the person behind Tang Tang. \"Except for him!\"","Conflict flashed in Shen Ji's eyes as he looked back at the person behind him. Seeming to sense Shen Ji's hesitation, the male classmate shook his head frantically in fear.","\"Save me! Save me! I was just joking with her! It was just a joke!\""]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Not Gifted, Then...","paragraphs":["Chen Xiaoxiao casually walked over to the stairs and sat down, leaning against the railing as if in no hurry to take action.","\"A joke? Why don't you show them the photos on your phone and let everyone have a laugh?\"","Tang Tang stared at the person beside her in disbelief, her eyes filled with a mix of shock and anger.","\"What photos?!\"","The male student stammered, \"Just, just some rather revealing photos...\"","Tang Tang immediately understood. She grabbed the boy's sleeve, her eyes blazing with fury. Shen Ji quickly tried to calm her down.","\"Why should we save scum like this?!\"","Shen Ji understood, but they still needed to find a way out.","Tang Tang refused to let go. More than Shen Ji, she knew what this kind of bullying meant for a girl.","So that's why Chen Xiaoxiao couldn't leave the stairwell, wasn't it?","Chen Xiaoxiao leaned against the stairs, watching the three of them interact, a mocking smile on her lips.","She stretched lazily, as if growing impatient with the wait. \"Haven't you finished discussing yet?\"","After calming Tang Tang, Shen Ji turned to Chen Xiaoxiao. \"I can hand him over to you, but not now.\" He still needed to find a way out first.","Chen Xiaoxiao's smile grew even sweeter as she uttered three words.","\"Not possible.\"","She was determined to make him die in this stairwell, just like the others.","The air grew tense as both sides faced off once again.","Chen Xiaoxiao looked disinterested, gazing at the window behind the three. That window always let in sunlight, but it never made her feel warm.","Because the brighter the sunlight, the more humiliated and blinded she felt...","As Tang Tang looked at the smile on Chen Xiaoxiao's face, she no longer felt afraid. Instead, a sense of sympathy washed over her. Her eyes glistened with tears as she slowly stepped aside.","Being a cold bystander was already a sin; she couldn't bring herself to become an accomplice.","Gradually, the male student was exposed before Chen Xiaoxiao.","Chen Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a slight smile as she stood up. Shen Ji was still trying to figure out how to negotiate.","In an instant, Chen Xiaoxiao was beside the male student, gripping his neck and pressing him against the windowsill.","\"Don't move!\" Chen Xiaoxiao warned Shen Ji sharply.","The captured student looked down and felt dizzy.","Chen Xiaoxiao seemed not to understand his fear. She stared at him with cold eyes, her lips curling into a smile. \"What? Feeling high? But when I jumped, it actually felt okay.\"","The male student was terrified, his eyes tightly shut as he begged for mercy.","\"Xiaoxiao! Xiaoxiao! I was wrong, please forgive me! You can have anything you want!\"","Chen Xiaoxiao's smile faded, replaced by an icy tone: \"I want you to leave this world forever!\"","Her hand lifted slightly, all her strength concentrated in that single hand. The male student was raised high, his face turning purple.","Shen Ji threw a card from his hand, but Chen Xiaoxiao blocked it forcefully. Shen Ji was shocked; he had thought she would dodge it.","\"You can't save him!\"","The male student gradually stopped struggling. Chen Xiaoxiao let go, and he fell from the windowsill.","Chen Xiaoxiao lay in the sunlight, looking up at Shen Ji and Tang Tang. The pain seemed to gradually return to her body. Looking at the dazzling light, she smiled.","\"At least... at least he was the last one.\"","Suddenly, she felt that the sunlight here wasn't so blinding anymore.","\"Cut!\"","Jing Yi blinked, lying on the ground, unable to snap out of it for a while.","Jing Zejun approached with reddened eyes. She finally started moving her wrists to get up, thinking that it was good she only had a cameo role. If she had to act again, she probably couldn't handle it.","Jing Yi reached out, intending for Jing Zejun to help her up, but he immediately embraced her instead.","Jing Yi found it somewhat amusing. \"I've just finished filming, I'm not really gone. Why are you crying?\"","\"Don't say such things! What nonsense!\"","Jing Yi's eyes curved in a smile. \"Alright, alright, I was wrong. Quick, help me up. My legs are numb. Being an actor really isn't easy!\"","The people around, who had been teary-eyed and immersed in the scene, were instantly pulled out of the moment by Jing Yi's words. If Jing Yi, who had acted so well, found it difficult, wouldn't half the entertainment industry be worked to death?","Shen Xi also came over, her eyes red. \"Xiaoxiao, you did nothing wrong! How can you just disappear like that?!\"","Jing Yi patted her lightly. \"Who disappeared? I'm alive and well.\" She hadn't expected Shen Xi to be even more deeply affected by the live performance than when watching dramas.","\"Jing Yi, I didn't expect your acting skills to be so impressive,\" Wen Qingyan couldn't help but praise Jing Yi's recent performance.","Jing Yi smiled brightly. \"I just immersed myself a bit, and it was only a short scene. If it were any longer, I'd surely have shown my inexperience.\"","The director also looked quite satisfied and even wanted to book Jing Yi for a role in his next film.","Jing Yi refused without a second thought. She had truly just immersed herself for a moment. If she were to take on a real role, who knows how stiff her acting might be. She didn't want to embarrass herself. It's best to leave professional matters to professionals!","The director had no choice but to give up.","\"I'm so tired! Acting for an hour is more exhausting than practicing driving all afternoon!\" Jing Yi collapsed onto the sofa in the rest area, looking completely worn out.","Jing Zejun's eyes were still a bit red as he went to get her a glass of water. \"Is it really that dramatic? I thought you acted quite naturally.\"","Jing Yi quickly shook her head. She hadn't felt natural at all. If she had immersed herself any deeper, she might have actually become Chen Xiaoxiao. She didn't want to try acting again.","Hearing her say this, Jing Zejun stopped joking. Getting too deep into a role was no laughing matter.","\"Zejun, don't you feel like you become that person when you're acting?\" Jing Yi was curious. For a moment, she had truly felt like she was Chen Xiaoxiao...","Jing Zejun pondered for a moment. \"Sometimes, but that kind of acting method is too damaging for actors. It makes it harder to come out of character.\"","When she was still a newcomer, she used to act like that, especially during \"Jun Lin.\" During that time, she couldn't even bear to be called 'Jiu Sheng.'","Because she really couldn't snap out of it. It was only after she had fewer encounters with such roles that she gradually came out of character.","Jing Yi strongly agreed. Not being able to come out of character was quite scary. \"You must distinguish between acting and reality, okay!\" She wasn't an actor, but Jing Zejun was!","Jing Zejun looked at her amusedly. This person was worried about her when she herself had almost fallen too deep into the role.","\"You and Shen Xi rest and recover here. We'll go for dinner after we finish filming the remaining scenes.\"","The production assistant was announcing the start of the next scene. Jing Yi watched Jing Zejun's retreating figure and sighed. Acting was truly profound.","Turning to look at Shen Xi beside her, Jing Yi said helplessly, \"Why are you still crying?\"","Shen Xi sniffled, \"It's because you acted too well!\"","\"Come on, pull yourself together!\"","She had always thought Shen Xi's reactions while watching dramas were intense, but she hadn't expected her immersive experience to be even more dramatic!","A makeup artist approached, intending to remove Jing Yi's makeup. Jing Yi looked at herself in the mirror.","Disheveled hair, pale face, reddened eye corners, and reddened lips – she truly looked like a demon returned for revenge.","\"Can I take a photo first?\" This was ready-made scary material!","\"Of course.\""]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: For the Time of Jingyi","paragraphs":["After Jing Yi posted the photo, just as she was about to remove her makeup, a message from Shen Huaichu came through.","She picked up her phone and looked at it, muttering to herself, \"Well, isn't the big boss busy with work?\" He hadn't even replied to the one she sent to Jing Zeqian.","[Miss Jing, did you do some beauty makeup in your spare time?]","Jing Yi's lips curled into a smile as she typed on her phone keyboard.","[How is it? Scary, right?]","The reply came quickly from the other side.","[This is scary? It looks more like a poor little thing.]","Jing Yi wasn't convinced. She opened the photo again and looked at it, mumbling, \"Isn't it scary? I think it looks quite terrifying.\"","Shen Xi heard Jing Yi's voice and walked over, wiping her tears. \"What's scary?\"","Jing Yi showed her the selfie, \"Isn't it scary?\" This wasn't a big deal, but as soon as Shen Xi saw it, she started crying again.","\"Wuu wuu wuu wuu wuu\"","Jing Yi looked at Shen Xi speechlessly, handed her a tissue, and let her cry off to the side.","She shouldn't have shown it to Shen Xi, now she'll be crying for a while again...","Jing Yi continued chatting with Shen Huaichu.","[This is from a cameo role I did in a drama, probably my only one. Don't you think this makeup is scary?]","The reply came quickly from the other side.","[Whose drama did Miss Jing make a cameo in?]","Jing Yi briefly explained to Shen Huaichu about Jing Zejun's drama and the character she played.","Remembering the praise from the director and others, Jing Yi couldn't help but boast to Shen Huaichu.","[The director and the famous actor both said I acted very well!]","After all, these were renowned directors and a major actor, which was enough for Jing Yi to brag about.","However, she also kept in mind that she shouldn't casually do cameos in the future. Otherwise, her method acting approach would be both emotionally and physically draining.","[Miss Jing, having never acted before, why were you able to perform this story so well?]","Jing Yi's eyebrows raised slightly, a hint of surprise flashing in her eyes. He was truly impressive, no wonder he could rise to become a CEO.","[People always have some experiences, more or less. It just so happened I could put them to use!]","Jing Yi said it casually, but the other side went silent for a moment. Jing Yi didn't receive a message, thinking Shen Huaichu found it boring and stopped chatting with her.","But the next second, Shen Huaichu's call came through.","Jing Yi instinctively looked towards Shen Xi, but the assistant was busy comforting her and didn't notice.","Jing Yi coughed lightly a few times and answered the phone, \"Hello?\" Somehow it felt like they had some kind of improper relationship, being all secretive...","From the other end of the phone, a voice came through. Shen Huaichu's voice, like the man himself, carried a hint of coolness and depth.","\"Is Miss Jing referring to experience in acting, or experience as the character in the drama?\"","Jing Yi didn't catch the low tone in Shen Huaichu's voice and laughed, \"I don't have any acting experience at all.\"","The tone on the other end became somewhat displeased, \"Is that so? Are there still 'capable individuals' who can provide Miss Jing with this kind of experience? I'd like to meet them.\"","Back then, she was far from being a \"Miss Jing,\" just an ordinary student. She was already grateful for that.","\"That was ages ago, who remembers now? Did you call just to ask about this?\"","\"...I've never been one to let bygones be bygones. I prefer the idea of karma coming full circle.\"","So, Miss Jing, it's about time for karma to turn in your favor.","Jing Yi suddenly felt moved. The corners of her mouth turned up slightly as she said softly, \"Shen Huaichu, thank you.\" For the Jing Yi of that time.","\"Who are you talking to?\" Shen Xi's muffled voice came through. A flash of panic crossed Jing Yi's eyes, \"A friend.\"","Jing Yi spoke into the phone again, \"Let's end our chat here then, bye!\" She quickly hung up the phone.","\"Your eyes are all swollen. Qiqi, help me get an ice pack.\"","Seeing that Shen Xi still hadn't recovered, Jing Yi sat down next to her, \"My dear Xixi, you get into character faster than the actors themselves. Are you still going to have dinner with your CP tonight?\"","Jing Yi used her ultimate skill. Shen Xi sniffled, her voice still muffled, \"Of course I'm going!\" She couldn't miss this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","Jing Yi took the ice pack from the assistant and gently applied it to Shen Xi's eyes while continuing to persuade her.","On the other side, Shen Huaichu, who had been abruptly hung up on, looked at the photo Jing Yi had sent, his fingers lightly caressing the screen.","When the photo first arrived, Shen Huaichu's lips had curled into a smile, until he heard Jing Yi mention the director's praise.","He had hoped it was due to Jing Yi's natural talent, but the answer he received was quite the opposite.","Shen Huaichu's thin lips pressed together, a complex emotion stirring in his heart.",".......","After the shooting was over, several people agreed to have dinner together.","However, this meal seemed to be not so relaxed.","Jing Yi smiled apologetically at the two people in front of her, gently tugging at the sleeve of the person next to her.","Shen Xi's gaze was too intense, how could anyone eat comfortably like this?!","\"My friend is a fan of you and Jun Jun, so she's a little excited.\"","To save some face for Shen Xi, Jing Yi very carefully used the word 'little', but in reality, Shen Xi looked like she was using the two of them as appetizers.","Shen Xi hurriedly composed her expression. Wasn't she just trying to vet her idols?","Plus, as a hardcore romantic drama enthusiast, how could she miss such a classic scene?!","Wen Qingyan still smiled gently, \"Thank you for your support, Miss Shen.\" Shen Xi quickly waved her hands, smiling, \"You're welcome! You're welcome! It's my pleasure!\"","Jing Yi looked at the two speechlessly.","[... What's with the 'It's my pleasure'? Xixi, if you keep talking, I won't be able to cover for you anymore!]","Ignoring Shen Xi's choice of words, Jing Yi quickly changed the subject, \"Jun Jun, when will you finish filming?\"","Jing Zejun ladled some soup for Jing Yi and Shen Xi, \"Probably in about six or seven months.\" Jing Yi looked up in surprise, \"Won't you be away from home for most of the year then?\"","Jing Zejun smiled, \"It's not always my scenes, I can still go home occasionally to visit.\" Just like when he went to watch Jing Yi's competition last time.","\"Besides, apart from filming, I have some other ad shoots that I need to attend as well.\"","Jing Yi sighed, \"So busy!\"","Shen Xi quickly chimed in, \"Being busy means an actor is popular.\" She was a career fan of Jing Zejun after all!","Jing Yi nodded in agreement.","Beside them, Wen Qingyan quietly listened to the three chatting, his demeanor elegant and expression gentle.","[I wonder how Wen Qingyan's plan to win back his wife is going? There doesn't seem to be any substantial change yet.]","Jing Zejun's hand holding the chopsticks paused slightly, which was quickly noticed by Wen Qingyan next to him. He lowered his head slightly and asked softly, \"What's wrong?\"","Jing Zejun's eyes darted away slightly as he shook his head, \"Nothing.\" Wen Qingyan didn't think much of it.","On the contrary, Shen Xi across from them once again couldn't control her gaze.","She loved it so much!","Jing Yi resignedly tugged at her sleeve again, \"Xixi, the food in your bowl is about to get cold.\"","Hurry up and focus on eating! Stop treating the two people across from you as side dishes!","\"Oh!\"","Shen Xi lowered her head once more, composing her expression.","The meal was finally finished, surprisingly without incident.","Before leaving, Jing Yi went to the restroom. When she came out, she encountered an unexpected person.","Jing Yi was looking down, wiping her hands with a paper towel, when she bumped into a man coming towards her.","He was dressed in a suit, with a gentlemanly and kind smile on his face, concernedly asking if he had bumped into Jing Yi.","Originally, Jing Yi didn't pay much attention, saying it was fine and preparing to leave, but apparently the man had no intention of letting her go just like that.","\"You're Jing Yi, aren't you?\""]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: Is He Wang Boqi","paragraphs":["The man's words made Jing Yi stop in her tracks. She turned around, puzzled, \"Do you... know me?\"","The man smiled and walked a few steps closer, standing in front of Jing Yi. \"What a coincidence to meet you here.\"","So it really was someone she knew?","Jing Yi furrowed her brow slightly, seemingly trying to figure out who he was.","The man raised a gentle smile and extended his right hand. \"Let me formally introduce myself. I'm Wang Boqi.\"","Jing Yi, standing at the bathroom door, heard the introduction and was slightly stunned.","She asked again, \"What did you say your name was?\"","Wang Boqi, still smiling, repeated: \"Wang Boqi.\"","'She, Jiang Miaomiao, actually did it all for a Wang Boqi!'","'Yi Yi, believe me, I love you. Don't you want the position in the Jing Family too? As long as you help me, you'll be the only daughter of the Jing Family!'","Jing Yi's eyes flickered slightly as she smiled at the man before her, looking him up and down.","\"So you're Wang Boqi?\" She had been wondering who would try to strike up a conversation outside a bathroom.","\"That's right.\"","Wang Boqi thought Jing Yi already knew his identity as the young master of the Wang Family. A hint of mockery flashed in his eyes, but his lips still curved in a gentle smile.","Jing Yi extended her hand, \"Mr. Wang, nice to meet you.\" She smirked, \"You're quite different from what I imagined.\"","It seemed Wang Boqi wasn't as dangerous as she had thought. At least his flirting skills weren't that impressive.","She wondered how Jiang Miaomiao and her former self had fallen for him.","Wang Boqi smiled and shook her hand, saying softly, \"Is that so? I'm quite curious about what's different.\"","Jing Yi lowered her head and smiled without saying anything. Better to leave some room for imagination on both sides.","Wang Boqi didn't pursue the matter further. \"I didn't expect to meet Miss Jing here. Are you here for...?\"","Jing Yi's lips curled upwards. He had come specifically to intercept her, hadn't he investigated that she was here to visit Jing Zejun on set?","\"Zejun is filming here, so I came to visit her on set.\"","Wang Boqi seemed to hear this for the first time and looked surprised. \"Is that so? I didn't know Miss Jing Zejun was filming here. Maybe I should go say hello too. I haven't formally met her yet.\"","Jing Yi immediately refused, \"That's not necessary. She's filming and it's not convenient.\" It would be best if they never met. There was no need to taint Junjun's eyes with the sight of such a person.","Jing Yi's aversion to Wang Boqi wasn't because he was vying for a position in North river, nor because he coveted Hengjing and wanted to bring down Jing Zeyou.","It was because he had never truly valued any woman. In his eyes, they were just tools. Yet, he placed all his hopes for success on these 'tools'.","Jing Yi's refusal didn't anger Wang Boqi, even though he knew Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan were in the next private room, along with one of Jing Yi's friends.","\"Then I suppose we'll meet again when the time is right.\"","Jing Yi smiled. Having a fateful encounter with you probably wouldn't be a lucky thing.","Having left an impression on Jing Yi, Wang Boqi didn't want to linger any longer. Moderation had always been his principle.","\"Well then, Miss Jing, I'll take my leave. It was a pleasure meeting you today. When we're back in North river, I hope I'll have the honor of treating you to a meal.\"","Jing Yi nodded slightly, smiling as she replied, \"It was my pleasure to meet you too, Mr. Wang.\"","As Wang Boqi left, Jing Yi watched his retreating figure with narrowed eyes.","Wang Boqi, you've finally decided to make your move. I thought you'd wait even longer.","\"Yi Yi?\"","Jing Yi had been out for a while, so Jing Zejun and the others came out of the private room to check on her.","Jing Zejun looked in the direction of her gaze, \"Did you run into someone you know?\"","Jing Yi shook her head, smiling as she linked arms with her and Shen Xi. \"No, I just accidentally bumped into someone I don't know.\"","......","In the Jing Family home, a knock sounded on the door of Jing Beicheng's study.","\"Come in.\"","Lin Ruiqing pushed open the door from outside, carrying a tonic prepared by Aunt Wang.","Seeing it was his wife, Jing Beicheng got up and walked over, taking the tray from her hands and placing it on the desk.","\"You could have just told me, and I would have come down to drink it. Why did you bring it up yourself?\" Lin Ruiqing looked at him amusedly as he helped her. \"I'm not seventy or eighty years old, why are you so worried?\"","Jing Beicheng paused. He had been like this for so many years, wasn't it just a habit?","Lin Ruiqing sat down on the sofa, and Jing Beicheng sat down as well.","\"I came to tell you that Mrs. Gu has invited Yi Yi and me to visit.\"","Lin Ruiqing was also surprised by the sudden invitation for her and Jing Yi. Then it occurred to her that the Gu Family had a son a few years older than Jing Yi.","Could it be that they had taken a liking to her Yi Yi?","Jing Beicheng: \"...Yi Yi is still young.\"","Lin Ruiqing glared at him, \"I'm not trying to arrange a marriage for Yi Yi.\" She was just making a reasonable guess about Shen Tu's intentions.","Seeing Lin Ruiqing's thoughts drifting, Jing Beicheng couldn't help but say, \"I heard that Mrs. Gu has been following Junjun's reality show. She really likes Yi Yi, could that be the reason?\"","Shen Tu's husband had indeed mentioned this to him.","At the time, Gu Jin was both excited and helpless, pulling him aside to describe how Shen Tu looked while watching the show, and saying that Shen Tu really liked Jing Yi, insisting that he must relay this to Jing Yi.","Lin Ruiqing was somewhat surprised, \"Is that so? So it's because she likes Yi Yi? I thought she wanted me to...\"","She didn't finish her sentence, but Jing Beicheng's eyes flashed with amusement as he continued, \"You thought she wanted you to arrange a match for Yi Yi?\"","Lin Ruiqing lightly slapped his arm, giving him a warning look.","It was perfectly normal for her to think that way, given that both families had single children of similar ages.","Come to think of it, they should really consider it. The Gu Family's son was only a few years older than Jing Yi, a graduate from a prestigious university, tall and handsome. The only thing was that he was still at an age where he loved to have fun.","Didn't they just see Shen Huaichu at the racetrack last time? That's when Lin Ruiqing learned that Gu Lin was also participating in the race. Doesn't this mean the two children might have common interests?","Thinking of this, Lin Ruiqing's eyes brightened, \"You know, they might actually be a good match!\"","Jing Beicheng, however, felt his wife was getting excited over nothing. Leaving aside whether the two children were suitable for each other, he felt that compared to Gu Lin, it was probably Shen Huaichu who was interested in Jing Yi.","With his brother in the picture, Gu Lin was unlikely to develop any feelings.","\"I'm asking you a question. What do you think?\" Lin Ruiqing gently pushed Jing Beicheng. He took her hand, \"You're overthinking it. Do you really think a daughter of the Jing Family would have trouble finding a husband?\"","\"Of course not!\"","Even if she never married, she could support her.","Jing Beicheng's lips curved slightly, \"There you have it. You finally have two daughters by your side, would you really want to marry them off so early?\"","At least he didn't want to. Besides, things weren't that simple."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Invitation to Shen Tea's Art Exhibition","paragraphs":["Speaking of Shen Tu's invitation, it all started with Gu Lin.","A few days ago, Gu Lin was chatting with Shen Tu about Shen Huaichu, when he accidentally let slip about Shen Huaichu and Jing Yi...","Afterward, Shen Tu launched a series of \"intense interrogations.\"","\"You'd better tell me everything clearly! Don't hide a single thing!\"","Shen Tu's eyes were full of expectation and warning. Gu Jin sat silently on the sofa, drinking tea, not daring to make a sound.","Under questioning, Gu Lin's eyes were blank. He was done for; he had accidentally revealed that his brother liked Jing Yi. His brother would definitely not let him off the hook!","He tried to muddle through, \"Mom, I used the wrong words. It's not 'like,' it's... it's 'admire'! Yes, admire! My brother also watched the livestream and really admires Jing Yi's personality and character!\"","His gesticulating effort to cover up made Gu Jin, who was not far away, feel a bit sad.","He shook his head silently. This skill was far too weak, not even a tenth of his own.","So what exactly had his son inherited?","Shen Tu shot Gu Lin a glare. She wasn't senile yet! How could she believe such a flimsy excuse?","\"...If you're going to cover up, at least find a better excuse.\" He really was far inferior to his father.","Gu Lin clasped his hands together in a pleading gesture, \"Mom, please let me off the hook. If my brother finds out I let it slip, you might not see your son for a long time.\"","Besides, Shen Huaichu hadn't even admitted it; it was all his wild guess!","Shen Tu showed no sympathy for Gu Lin. Instead, she leaned in closer, even more curious.","She coaxed, \"Don't worry! I definitely won't tell your brother it was you who said it!\"","Gu Lin silently looked at her. If Shen Tu showed any sign of knowing about Shen Huaichu's feelings for Jing Yi, there was only one person in all of North River who could have told her!","Shen Tu hesitated for a moment, then said firmly, \"Then rest assured! I absolutely won't show any sign of knowing!\"","Shen Tu's guarantee meant nothing to Gu Lin. Just thinking about it, he knew it was impossible.","Seeing that the soft approach wasn't working, Shen Tu prepared to get tough. She stood up abruptly, \"Anyway, you're going to tell me now, whether you want to or not! Otherwise, I'll go ask your brother directly!\"","What kind of interrogation scene was this? Gu Jin was still silently drinking tea.","Gu Lin had completely given up. No matter what, he was doomed anyway, so he might as well do his mother a favor. At least when his brother vented his anger, he might have somewhere to hide...","So, Gu Lin told Shen Tu everything about the dance and his birthday party.","\"Mom, please take it easy. My brother probably doesn't know as much as you do now. If you suddenly get involved, what if you mess things up?\"","Shen Tu glared at him. Was she the kind of person who didn't know her limits?","Gu Lin pursed his lips, saying nothing, but glanced silently at Shen Tu beside him. Judging by the excitement on her face, was she really someone who could keep a secret?","Shen Tu didn't care about Gu Lin's feelings now. She turned excitedly to Gu Jin, \"Gu Jin! Come and think of a way! What are you doing sitting there drinking tea?\"","Gu Lin looked at Shen Tu in shock, \"Mom! Didn't you say you wouldn't interfere?!\" Before Shen Tu could answer, Gu Jin was displeased, \"Is that how you talk to your mother?\"","Gu Lin: He couldn't stay in this house anymore. He might not even be able to stay in North River!","Shen Tu explained, \"How am I interfering? I just want to meet Jing Yi, is that not allowed? Last time I asked you to invite her over to play, but you didn't make a sound. Now I have no choice but to invite her myself.\"","Gu Lin was a bit anxious, \"It's not that, but even if you want to meet Jing Yi, you need a good excuse, right? Otherwise, what if she gets suspicious?\"","Shen Tu rolled her eyes, \"Do you really think I've been Mrs. Gu for all these decades for nothing? Even though I don't like attending parties, I've been to so many. Finding an excuse to invite someone is a piece of cake for me!\"","That smug expression really made Gu Lin worried.","Seeing that her son wasn't buying it, Shen Tu looked at Gu Jin. Gu Jin immediately understood her meaning, \"That's right, your mother is the perfect wife! In all these years of important 'ladies' social events,' when has she ever been absent?\"","Gu Lin was speechless. He didn't know whether to mock his father's enthusiasm or the term 'ladies' social events.'","\"Even if you find an excuse, how can you be sure that Mrs. Jing will bring Jing Yi along?\" That was the Jing family after all. They didn't need to give face to others, and that Jing family member was known for indulging people.","This was indeed a difficult problem. Shen Tu fell silent, looking back and forth with some seriousness, \"This might still require you two to go?\"","Gu Lin's eyes widened. I'm involved in this too?! This was practically ensuring that Shen Huaichu would know he had leaked the information!","\"Your father will go talk to Jing Beicheng, you'll chat with Yi Yi, and I'll invite Mrs. Jing!\"","Gu Lin: This doesn't look good...","Gu Jin: His wife really thought highly of him...","The more Shen Tu talked, the more feasible it seemed to her!","\"You just say that I'm planning to hold an art exhibition, so I'm inviting them to come and support it!\"","Gu Jin and Gu Lin exchanged a glance, their eyes filled with helplessness and resignation. \"Are you not planning to tell Huaichu about your art exhibition?\" He didn't think this could be kept secret.","Shen Tu waved her hand dismissively, \"If it can't be kept secret, then so be it. It's not like I'm doing anything sneaky.\"","Gu Lin lay on the chair with a look of utter despair.","\"...You can casually decide to hold an art exhibition and meet people, but I'm the one who has to explain to my brother.\"","\"Then you'd better start thinking about how to explain. I need to hurry and finalize the details of the art exhibition!\" With that, Shen Tu hurried off.","Gu Jin sighed, patted Gu Lin's shoulder, and said, \"Good luck.\" Then he waved his sleeve and calmly left.","Gu Lin looked blankly at this scene. What kind of parents were these?","The art exhibition arrived as scheduled.","Shen Tu was entertaining the guests who came to view the exhibition while frequently glancing outside.","She seemed to be waiting for someone.","On the other side, Gu Lin stood in the corner with slumped shoulders, next to Shen Huaichu, who wore an expressionless face and exuded a cold aura.","After that day, Gu Lin thought it over and decided that rather than letting Shen Huaichu find out later and get angry, it was better to confess proactively.","At least he could hope for a 'reduced sentence.'","Gu Lin cautiously looked up, \"Brother, maybe Mom just genuinely likes Jing Yi, that's why she invited...\"","As Shen Huaichu looked over, his voice got lower and lower. Even he felt guilty saying these words.","Gu Lin silently lowered his head again.","Shen Huaichu's cold voice came, \"Report to Huarui Group tomorrow.\"","Gu Lin knew Shen Huaichu wouldn't let him off easily, but he didn't expect it to be so soon. His leisurely, enjoyable life was over just like that.","Gu Lin looked completely deflated.","\"What are you two doing standing over there?\" Shen Tu called out to the two standing in the corner.","Shen Huaichu adjusted his expression and strode over, with Gu Lin following behind with his head down.","\"The exhibition is about to start, why hasn't Mrs. Jing arrived yet?\"","Lin Ruiqing had agreed when invited earlier, but not seeing her made Shen Tu a bit anxious."]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: She Likes You Very Much","paragraphs":["Outside the exhibition hall, a black sedan pulled up, and Jing Yi and Lin Ruiqing stepped out of the car.","Jing Yi was initially surprised, not understanding why Shen Tu had specifically invited her to see the art exhibition.","Then Gu Lin had called, speaking earnestly, almost saying that if she didn't go, it would become one of the great regrets of his mother's life.","Jing Yi found it a bit amusing and agreed to go.","Jing Yi linked arms with Lin Ruiqing, \"Mom, it turns out Mrs. Gu is an artist? Is she the cool and aloof type?\"","Jing Yi was quite curious about people with artistic identities, feeling that those who studied art all had a unique aura about them.","Cool and aloof?","Lin Ruiqing smiled, recalling her impression of Shen Tu. Although she hadn't interacted deeply with Shen Tu, from what she could tell, she probably wasn't as Jing Yi described.","\"Mrs. Gu is quite friendly, you'll see when you meet her.\"","As they chatted, they arrived at the entrance of the exhibition hall.","Shen Tu, who had been lingering at the door, brightened up and came out to greet them.","\"Mrs. Jing\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded with a smile, \"Mrs. Gu\"","Shen Tu's gaze shifted to Jing Yi beside her, her smile deepening, \"This must be Yi Yi, finally meeting you in person!\"","If she had known earlier, she would have skipped that art association meeting during Lin Ruiqing's birthday no matter what, regretting missing the chance to meet Jing Yi.","Shen Tu looked at Jing Yi with a beaming smile, the fondness in her eyes quite obvious. Jing Yi felt a bit overwhelmed but still smiled politely.","\"Hello, Mrs. Gu.\" She had thought Gu Lin was exaggerating, but it seemed his mother really did like her quite a bit.","\"No need to be so formal. I heard you know Gu Lin, why don't I have him show you around?\"","People of the same age should be more comfortable talking to each other, and moreover, she meant not just Gu Lin, but also Shen Huaichu beside him.","This was included in the package.","However, he shouldn't be so awkward as to not know how to interact with girls, right?","Shen Tu expressed some concern.","Jing Yi glanced at Lin Ruiqing, who gently patted her hand and said with a smile, \"It's alright, go have fun with your friends. I'll chat with Mrs. Gu for a while.\"","\"Xiao Lin, Huaichu, come show Yi Yi around,\" Shen Tu called out behind her.","Jing Yi only then realized that Shen Huaichu was there too. She nodded obediently, said goodbye to Shen Tu, and followed Gu Lin and the others into the exhibition hall.","Shen Tu watched their retreating figures, especially Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu, unable to contain the joy in her eyes.","Lin Ruiqing took in Shen Tu's expression, her eyes flickering slightly, thinking that her previous guess might have been correct - Shen Tu was here for her son, with Jing Yi in mind.","After entering the exhibition hall, Jing Yi curiously looked around.","The entire hall was spacious and quiet, permeated with a calm and unique artistic atmosphere.","The white walls were smooth as mirrors, with soft, warm lighting around the paintings, highlighting the brilliance of the exhibits.","In the center of the hall, rows of meticulously created paintings were arranged, colorful and seemingly very healing. Each painting was like a story, narrating the emotions and thoughts of the creator.","\"Gu Lin, did Mrs. Gu paint this too?!\"","Jing Yi stood in front of a painting, her eyes wide open, filled with surprised light.","In the fading light of dusk, an oil painting of a sunset over the sea slowly unfolded. In the center of the image, a faint orange gradually disappeared from the horizon. The sky's colors transitioned from deep blue to light blue, then to pale purple, and finally to golden yellow.","She loved this painting, even using it as her wallpaper for a while.","\"What? Did you think she was just hosting an exhibition for fun?\" Gu Lin's smile carried a hint of pride. \"At least in the domestic art world, she's quite famous.\"","Jing Yi was still looking at the painting with surprise and admiration.","Gu Lin had guessed right - she had thought it was just a wealthy lady's pastime, but it turned out she was a real artist!","Most of Shen Tu's exhibited works were oil paintings, as colorful as they appeared at first glance, mainly depicting the colors of nature.","Jing Yi murmured with slightly parted lips, \"Your mother must have a brilliant and warm world in her heart.\" Shen Huaichu quietly watched her, his eyes revealing a barely perceptible tenderness.","Gu Lin smiled, \"I should note that down and tell her later.\"","As he spoke, Gu Lin noticed Shen Huaichu, half a step behind, watching Jing Yi.","Now was his best chance to make a move!","Gu Lin quickly smiled and said, \"Um, Jing Yi, let my brother entertain you for a bit. I need to go take care of something.\"","Jing Yi didn't think much of it and nodded, continuing to walk to the side to look at the paintings, with Shen Huaichu leisurely following behind her.","\"Shen Huaichu, your aunt is really amazing!\"","\"If you like, I can ask her to paint one for you.\"","Jing Yi turned to look at him, her round eyes very lively, \"Wouldn't that be too much trouble for Mrs. Gu? Is it convenient?\"","The corner of Shen Huaichu's mouth lifted slightly. If Jing Yi had asked any later, he would have thought she really didn't want to trouble anyone.","He nodded, \"It's convenient.\"","Jing Yi caught the teasing look in Shen Huaichu's eyes, but she didn't mind. It would be a pity to miss out because of politeness.","Besides, it wouldn't hurt to use Shen Huaichu's influence.","\"But if it's difficult for Mrs. Gu, then forget it.\"","His aunt would probably be happy to, \"She likes you very much.\"","Jing Yi was puzzled, not understanding why Shen Huaichu suddenly mentioned this. Shen Huaichu added, \"So she won't refuse.\"","This was already the third person to say something like this to her. Jing Yi was quite curious.","\"Why does Mrs. Gu like me so much?\"","Shen Huaichu gazed directly at Jing Yi, \"I have the same question.\" His deep eyes hid barely detectable emotions, making him seem different from usual.","Jing Yi looked into those eyes, her heart suddenly beating a little faster. She quickly averted her gaze, her tone becoming a bit flustered.","\"What's there to question? Of course, it's because this young lady is quite likable!\"","That face was really too deceptive! Jing Yi, don't let him bewitch you!","Jing Yi turned her head, pretending to continue appreciating the paintings, her mind frantically trying to stay clear.","A glimmer of amusement flashed in Shen Huaichu's eyes, \"Since Miss Jing knows how likable she is, what else is there to ask?\"","Jing Yi glared at him. She was trying to have a serious conversation, but he kept going off on tangents.","Seeing that she was a bit annoyed, Shen Huaichu smoothly changed the subject, \"I haven't congratulated Miss Jing on winning second place in the competition yet.\"","Not wanting to be outdone, Jing Yi deliberately teased, \"Such empty words of congratulation? The mighty CEO of Huarui Group seems rather ordinary in his generosity.\"","\"How can you call it empty words? Didn't I already promise Miss Jing to ask for a painting?\"","Shen Huaichu seemed unaware of the gentleness in his voice."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: The one who has eyes for Jing Yi is not Gu Lin","paragraphs":["Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu in disbelief. She never expected that the esteemed president of Huarui Group could be so petty.","Hadn't he generously added nearly 20 million during their bidding war at the auction last time?","Jing Yi crossed her arms and frowned, looking Shen Huaichu up and down with an expression that clearly said, \"You're not okay.\"","\"Mr. Shen, isn't asking for the painting just empty words? Besides, even if I got it, it would be a gift from Mrs. Gu to me.\"","Just as Jing Yi finished speaking, Shen Tu's voice came from behind, \"What gift?\" Jing Yi quickly lowered her arms and greeted her politely.","\"Mrs. Gu—\"","Shen Tu stepped forward with a smile, warmly grasping Jing Yi's hand. \"Just call me auntie, no need to be so formal!\" The fondness in her eyes was impossible to hide.","Shen Tu had seen the two chatting happily from afar. If she hadn't wanted to talk to Jing Yi herself, she really wouldn't have wanted to interrupt them.","\"Yi Yi, I've adored you ever since I saw you on 'Dear Family.' If only I had known earlier...\"","Jing Yi was still a bit overwhelmed by Shen Tu's enthusiasm. She could truly feel Shen Tu's affection for her and secretly glanced at Shen Huaichu.","Don't think she couldn't tell he was enjoying the show just because his face was expressionless!","Jing Yi turned back to Shen Tu with a sweet smile, \"Thank you, auntie!\" Shen Tu patted Jing Yi's hand, liking her more and more. \"Oh right, what gift were you talking about earlier?\"","\"Ah?\" Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu with some difficulty.","Although she had agreed so readily before, when it came to actually saying it in front of the person involved, Jing Yi felt a bit embarrassed.","The corner of Shen Huaichu's mouth turned up almost imperceptibly as he answered for her, \"Miss Jing really likes your paintings. I said I could ask you if she could have one as a reward for her racing competition.\"","Shen Tu was even more delighted to hear this. \"Of course she can! I'm thrilled that you like my paintings. What kind do you like? I'll start painting as soon as I get home!\"","Jing Yi's eyes curved into crescents, not expecting Shen Tu to agree so readily.","\"Thank you, auntie! I'm sure anything you paint will be beautiful!\"","Shen Tu beamed even more, \"But Huaichu, why am I the only one giving Yi Yi a gift? Haven't you prepared anything?\" In the end, it still fell to her to take action.","Surprised by this unexpected bonus, Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu with a triumphant gleam in her eyes. \"Auntie, Mr. Shen asking you on my behalf is already his gift to me.\"","Shen Tu frowned slightly, clearly disagreeing. \"How can that be?! He still needs to give you a proper gift. How is asking a favor considered a gift?\"","Jing Yi's eyes grew even more smug as she said innocently, \"Wouldn't that be too much trouble for Mr. Shen?\"","\"What trouble? It's what he should do. How can a grown man be so stingy about giving a gift?\"","Shen Huaichu stood silently to the side listening to Shen Tu's scolding. He raised his eyes to look at Jing Yi, a hint of helpless amusement flashing in his gaze.","...","\"I told you before, Mrs. Gu has definitely taken a liking to Yi Yi!\"","After returning from the art exhibition, Lin Ruiqing eagerly pulled Jing Beicheng aside to discuss this, her eyes still gleaming with excitement.","Unfortunately, she hadn't seen much of Gu Lin at the exhibition. She had originally wanted to properly assess him as well.","Jing Beicheng pulled her down to sit beside him with a resigned look. While it seemed Mrs. Gu had indeed taken a liking to someone, who exactly that someone was remained to be seen.","\"Didn't you say Shen Huaichu was there too?\"","Lin Ruiqing paused. Shen Huaichu? Why was he suddenly mentioning Shen Huaichu?","Then she recalled that it was indeed Shen Huaichu who had been accompanying Jing Yi around the exhibition. She hadn't seen Gu Lin at all.","So, was Shen Tu trying to match Jing Yi with Shen Huaichu rather than Gu Lin?","Lin Ruiqing frowned slightly, sinking into thought.","In terms of ability, few in North River could compare to Shen Huaichu. As for looks, he was flawless. But choosing a suitable partner wasn't just about these factors.","\"Although, isn't Shen Huaichu about the same age as our Qian?\" And compared to the sunny and humorous Gu Lin, Shen Huaichu's personality was too cold.","Holding Lin Ruiqing's hand, Jing Beicheng calmly said, \"Let's not even discuss whether he's suitable for Yi Yi. Isn't it too early to be considering this now?\"","Lin Ruiqing looked troubled. \"But shouldn't we investigate in advance? We have two beautiful daughters at home. What if they get bullied?\" She glared at Jing Beicheng. \"Don't you care?\"","Jing Beicheng raised an eyebrow. How could he not care? Weren't they his daughters too?","\"Even if you're worried, you can't decide who she likes, can you?\" Lin Ruiqing hesitated for a moment before nodding slightly. \"That's true...\"","Even if she investigated everyone here, it would be pointless if Jing Yi didn't like them.","However, Lin Ruiqing narrowed her eyes, \"How do you know she's trying to match her with Shen Huaichu and not Gu Lin?\" This man clearly knew before but didn't tell her, letting her busy herself for nothing.","Jing Beicheng remained impassive. \"Just a reasonable guess.\" He wasn't deliberately concealing anything; there was simply no need to tell Lin Ruiqing about something that wasn't even close to happening yet.","A guess?","Lin Ruiqing looked doubtful. How could a guess be so well-founded and just happen to be correct?","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was in the study discussing Wang Boqi's situation with Jing Zeyou.","Wang Boqi's ultimate goal was to bring down Hengjing. Although Jing Yi knew the general outline of his plan, she couldn't pinpoint any specific times, details, and so on.","It was impossible for her alone to figure out Wang Boqi's entire plan. As the saying goes, leave professional matters to professionals. She just needed to provide support.","\"You suspect he's targeting Hengjing?\"","Jing Zeyou frowned slightly, his dark, calm eyes filled with seriousness.","Sitting across from him, Jing Yi's expression was equally serious. \"It's not a suspicion, it's a certainty.\"","[Even if the encounter outside the restroom was coincidental, Wang Boqi definitely wouldn't pass up such a useful 'tool' like me.]","Jing Zeyou's jawline tightened, a flash of darkness passing through his eyes.","From the hackers appearing at the company to Jiang Miaomiao, the Wang family's activities had been escalating in recent years.","However, what angered Jing Zeyou most was Wang Boqi's intentions toward Jing Yi. Even without the precedent set by Jiang Miaomiao, he knew Wang Boqi's character all too well.","And now, that man had set such filthy intentions on Jing Yi!","\"You shouldn't get involved. I'll discuss this matter with dad.\" Jing Zeyou's voice carried a coldness rarely heard from him.","Jing Yi's eyes widened as she abruptly stood up. \"No way, I want to join in! This is such a great opportunity! Since Wang Boqi wants to use me, his plans will definitely pass through my hands. That way we can find out exactly what he's up to.\"","[What a perfect undercover plan!]","Jing Zeyou's serious expression didn't soften in the slightest at Jing Yi's words.","He admitted that having an 'undercover agent' would allow them to counterattack more quickly, but that didn't mean he was willing to send his own sister into the lion's den."]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: I Will Protect You","paragraphs":["A tense atmosphere permeated the study.","While Hengjing was indeed crucial to both Jing Zeyou and the Jing family, Jing Zeyou refused to compromise Jing Yi's safety for it.","Seeing that Jing Zeyou wouldn't budge, Jing Yi began to analyze the situation word by word.","\"If Wang Boqi thinks he can use me as a weak point, why not play along with it?\"","[Whether he thinks he has leverage over me or assumes I'm as easily manipulated as Jiang Miaomiao, I want to see where his confidence comes from.]","\"As long as he believes he can use me, he'll definitely implement his plans through me.\"","[Once I become the person executing his plans, everything will fall into place.]","\"Then, I'll be able to figure out what he's really up to, and you'll be better prepared to defend against it, won't you, big brother?\"","[Best to eliminate this hidden threat once and for all!]","Jing Zeyou's furrowed brows remained tight as he replied, \"Yi Yi, you're thinking too simply. Wang Boqi isn't someone who can be dealt with easily.\"","The reason Jing Yi thought Wang Boqi's methods weren't sophisticated was because she had been on guard from the beginning.","However, Jing Zeyou knew clearly that even with Jiang Miaomiao's precedent, Wang Boqi wasn't as foolish as Jing Yi imagined.","That man was skilled at 'hunting' - he thoroughly understood his target's every weakness and vulnerability, and possessed absolute patience. He wasn't someone to be taken lightly.","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zeyou, her eyes equally serious. \"Big brother, I'm not underestimating him. This is simply the best solution.\"","Jing Zeyou fell silent. He was absolutely unwilling to let Jing Yi take such risks. Not only would he disagree, but if they held a family meeting, no one else would agree either.","Seeing that the direct approach wasn't working, Jing Yi decided to try another tactic, looking at Jing Zeyou with pleading almond-shaped eyes.","\"Big brother, please let me do this! Otherwise, I'll keep worrying about what Wang Boqi is planning. Besides, North River is so big - do I have to keep avoiding him? Why should I? I haven't had enough fun in this area yet, why should I...\"","Seeing that Jing Yi was now employing Jing Zeqian's whining tactics, Jing Zeyou felt a headache coming on.","[Wang Boqi remains a hidden threat, and if this approach doesn't work with me, who knows if he won't try to target someone else...]","Jing Zeyou froze, his heart growing heavy. \"Yi Yi, this might be the best solution, but it's also the one I'm least likely to choose.\"","Even if Jing Yi listed a hundred benefits, none would outweigh the possibility of her being in danger.","His lips pressed together firmly. \"Yi Yi, I brought you back because the Jing family could provide you with a better, safer environment, not to push you out front when crisis strikes.\" His voice carried a hint of hoarseness. \"You're my sister, not a tool for fighting external threats.\"","He pronounced the last two words very clearly.","Jing Yi paused briefly, her heart gradually sinking. She knew Jing Zeyou was worried about her, which made her happy, but it also strengthened her resolve to do this.","A smile spread across her lips. \"Brother, how do you know I don't want to become the Jing family's sharpest sword?\"","Rather than being protected, she preferred to be the protector.","[I will protect Hengjing and every member of the Jing family.]","Jing Zeyou gazed at her, his throat bobbing as he let out a light sigh, seemingly giving in.","He stood up and walked to Jing Yi's side, gently patting her head. \"Alright, go ahead, but everything must be predicated on keeping yourself safe. There can't be any mishaps.\"","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving into crescents, her dimples deepening as joy spread across her face.","\"No! Wang Boqi isn't someone easy to deal with. Having Yi Yi cooperate is too risky!\"","Jing Beicheng sat in the study, his face serious, his eyes reflecting strong disapproval.","After learning of Jing Yi's plan, Jing Zeyou had called a brief meeting with Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeqian.","As expected, upon hearing Jing Zeyou's words, Jing Beicheng immediately voiced his opposition.","Beside him, Jing Zeqian was even more angry. \"Brother, how can you put Yi Yi near someone like that? Have you forgotten about what happened to Jiang Miaomiao?!\"","No matter how capable Jing Yi was, she was still a girl, and Wang Boqi was such a despicable person!","Jing Zeyou calmly said, \"This isn't about what we want anymore. Yi Yi has already made up her mind.\"","Jing Zeqian grew anxious. \"I'll go make her give up this idea!\"","\"You won't be able to convince her.\"","Jing Zeyou stopped him. Someone who got so worked up after just a few words wouldn't be able to have a proper discussion.","Jing Zeqian stopped in his tracks, standing silently without turning back. No one understood Wang Boqi's vileness better than he did.","Jiang Miaomiao was one thing, but what would he do if Jing Yi fell into the same trap?","Jing Zeyou shifted his gaze back to Jing Beicheng, who was still sitting tensely at his desk.","\"I talked with Yi Yi. She said a lot, and I also opposed her taking such a risky action, but...\" Jing Zeyou paused before continuing, \"but her desire to protect the Jing family is very strong.\"","Jing Beicheng understood what Jing Zeyou meant. His brow furrowed even deeper as he closed his eyes.","When he opened them again, Jing Beicheng sighed, \"Fine, let's do as Yi Yi says.\"","Jing Zeqian exclaimed in disbelief, \"Dad! You know what kind of people the Wang family are?!\"","Jing Beicheng gave him a calm look. \"I know, but I also know how shameful it is that two sons need their little sister's protection.\"","Jing Zeqian fell silent, waves of shame washing over him, making him feel like he wanted to disappear.","Especially him - not only did he need Jing Yi to worry about him being deceived and falling into traps, but now she had to put herself in danger for his sake. What right did he have now to try to dissuade her?","Jing Beicheng glanced at the dejected Jing Zeqian but didn't criticize him further. \"Protect Yi Yi during this time. As for your mother...\"","\"Yi Yi said she doesn't want mom to worry, and since Jun Jun is still filming, she doesn't want to distract her either.\"","Jing Beicheng nodded gravely. That would have to do for now.","After discussing everything, Jing Beicheng left the study.","Jing Zeyou patted Jing Zeqian's shoulder, consoling him: \"Dad's right. It's embarrassing enough that we need Yi Yi's protection, but if we let her get hurt, we really couldn't show our faces.\"","He understood Jing Zeqian's feelings, but now wasn't the time for sentimentality.","\"Come with me. At least we need to prepare some self-defense items for Yi Yi.\"","Jing Zeqian followed Jing Zeyou out with slumped shoulders and a dejected expression.","\"This is one of Hengjing's products. I had the team upgrade it.\"","Jing Zeyou explained the device to Jing Yi in detail. He had made many upgrades, including tracking, self-defense, and communication features.","\"This button is for contacts, and this small opening contains a sharp weapon. Be careful not to hurt yourself when using it...\"","Jing Yi looked at the bracelet in his hand in amazement, surprised that such a small accessory could have so many functions.","However, more importantly, \"Big brother, I'm just in North River, not meeting someone from the internet...\" Wasn't this a bit excessive?"]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Clash, Officially Begins","paragraphs":["\"Is this really necessary?\" Jing Yi looked up bewildered at Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian was displeased, \"North river is so big! What if he lures you into some corner? I think we should add more self-defense tools.\" He truly wasn't at ease with just this small thing.","Jing Yi sighed, \"Second brother, if I'm carrying so many defensive items, wouldn't even an idiot like Wang Boqi notice something's off?\"","[Moreover, if anything were to happen, direct action would be more effective than using tools.]","Jing Zeqian was at a loss for words, realizing she had a point.","\"Besides, I haven't even started meeting Wang Boqi yet, why prepare so much already?\"","Jing Zeyou handed the bracelet to Jing Yi, \"It's better to be prepared in advance, so we can have some peace of mind.\"","So Jing Yi had no choice but to obediently go along with their arrangements. After all, it was her choice to get involved in this.","Jing Yi's guess was correct. Since Wang Boqi had already started making moves, his actions wouldn't be slow. Within a few days, she received an invitation from Wang Boqi.","Jing Yi glanced into the Western restaurant. Inside, apart from Wang Boqi standing up, there were only waiters.","It seemed the whole place had been reserved, he really went all out.","Jing Yi adjusted her smile and followed the waiter inside. \"Mr. Wang, sorry to keep you waiting.\"","Wang Boqi smiled warmly, \"Waiting for a beautiful lady is never too long.\"","Jing Yi smiled politely, still feeling as uncomfortable as ever.","She pretended to look around curiously, \"This restaurant seems quite empty?\"","A flash of contempt crossed Wang Boqi's eyes, but his expression remained gentle, \"For my first dinner with Miss Jing, I wanted it to be more formal.\"","Jing Yi feigned surprise, smiling as she lowered her head.","Whether it was truly for formality or to avoid being seen by others, probably only Wang Boqi knew.","The entire dinner process was indeed formal and solemn. Wang Boqi didn't mention anything about the Jing family at all, as if he was truly there just for Jing Yi herself.","\"Miss Jing, until we meet again next time.\"","Jing Yi smiled and waved at the person outside the car window. Only when she saw the sedan gradually drive away did the curve of her lips drop.","Wang Boqi, our game begins now. I hope you won't disappoint me too much.","I want to see what kind of magic you possess that caused both Jiang Miaomiao and 'Jing Yi' to suffer because of you.","......","At Startrack Entertainment, Jing Zeqian watched the artists performing their self-introductions in front of him, his brows furrowed as he flipped through their profiles.","Beside him sat Startrack's department heads, occasionally taking notes, but always keeping an eye on Jing Zeqian's displeased expression.","As time went on, these people grew increasingly nervous.","Finally, \"Stop!\" Jing Zeqian's tone was full of impatience. He looked up at the boys in front of him, his whole demeanor exuding authority.","\"Is this all you have to show after more than half a year?\"","Jing Zeqian had started preparing to create a boy group a year ago. This was an area Startrack was currently lacking in. Although the company had several popular singer-dancers, they had never successfully formed a group.","More importantly, this was the current market trend and audience preference.","Seeing Jing Zeqian's displeased expression, the talent director beside him hurriedly explained, \"The time was indeed a bit short...\"","Jing Zeqian's brows remained furrowed, \"I'm not asking them to perform on stage right now, but can you explain why their current stage presence is even worse than their initial auditions?\"","He remembered these boys all had dance backgrounds. How did they regress after more than half a year of training?","The talent director stammered, unable to speak. What could he say?","After joining Startrack, based on the previous star-making plan, they had opened social media accounts for each of them to document their training process. Thanks to Startrack's star-making system, they all had a small fan base now.","People tend to become lazy once they can see the path ahead...","Plus, seeing that the data looked good, he hadn't managed them too strictly.","The boys huddled together, their eyes full of panic. They figured they would become famous anyway, so why bother being so serious? In today's entertainment industry, who cares about your abilities? As long as you're good-looking, that's enough.","Jing Zeqian's face darkened. He didn't mind artists using Startrack as a stepping stone, after all, it was mutually beneficial. But this was the first time he had heard of people getting cocky before even becoming famous.","It seems he had been too lenient with the company's people. No wonder Jing Yi looked down on his company's artists. Bringing out people like this would simply be embarrassing!","\"Terminate the contracts!\" Jing Zeqian didn't mince words. He didn't care about wasting all that time. These people were already ruined, there was no point in wasting more time on them.","The boys' faces turned pale. Before they could say much, Jing Zeqian had already left the training room with his entourage.","It turned out they were never indispensable. The entertainment industry never lacked new talent.","\"Everyone involved in this 'S' boy group project will have their annual bonuses deducted. As for Director Chen, you're demoted. You'll be transferred from your current project management role and start over as a basic talent agent.\"","Jing Zeqian's voice brooked no argument. Director Chen's face turned pale. He wanted to explain something, but Jing Zeqian didn't give him the chance. \"The remaining work will be handed over to Deputy Director Li.\"","The person mentioned raised her head. A flash of joy crossed her eyes, quickly suppressed as she said seriously, \"Understood, Mr. Jing.\"","Jing Zeqian stopped walking. The displeasure in his eyes hadn't dissipated. \"I hope everyone understands the importance of focusing on their own duties. Don't put the cart before the horse. We'll have an internal training session next week.\"","Really, Startrack had so many issues. Did he need to personally oversee every single one?","The more Jing Zeqian thought about it, the angrier he became. All that time wasted! It would have been better to directly sign those talent show boys Jing Yi had seen!","Suddenly, Jing Zeqian seemed to think of something. He turned to the newly promoted Director Li and instructed, \"There's a trainee reality show on Blue TV recently. Go check it out, focusing on a few specific contestants.\"","What were their names again? Never mind, he'd ask Jing Yi to send him the list later.","\"I'll send you the list later.\"","\"Understood.\"","Since they were in the business of creating stars anyway, rather than wasting time on those 'losers', it would be better to create a few that Jing Yi found interesting. At least she might come to Startrack more often out of interest, right?","Meanwhile, before the mess at Startrack was fully resolved, Jing Zeyou threw another challenge at Jing Zeqian.","\"Hongli's banquet? Brother, can't you just go yourself? Why drag me along?\" Jing Zeqian looked annoyed. He already hated Wang Boqi to the bone, why should he attend his banquet?","He crossed his arms and leaned back on the sofa, looking completely resistant.","Jing Zeyou leaned back in his office chair, looking calm and unruffled.","\"If we don't let you show up, how will Wang Boqi know how far his plan has progressed?\"","Wang Boqi had been frequently inviting Jing Yi out lately, for dinners, go-karting, and various other entertainment activities. Apart from normal meals and casual chats about daily likes and habits, he hadn't shown any other intentions.","He hadn't even mentioned the Jing family or the Wang family, as if their interactions were purely personal.","Jing Zeyou knew what Wang Boqi was waiting for.","He was waiting for news to come from the Jing family."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Testing Jing Zeqian's Attitude","paragraphs":["\"So, you mean I have to put on a show?\"","Upon hearing this, Jing Zeqian put away his impatient expression, sat up, and looked serious and earnest.","Jing Zeyou chuckled, \"It's not a show. Just express your emotions normally, but leave out the part about Yi Yi.\" He believed that just the matter of Jiang Miaomiao would be enough to stir Jing Zeqian's emotions.","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, \"I still don't quite understand. If you want him to know that Yi Yi didn't tell us about this, why not just test you directly?\"","Why go through the trouble of using him to achieve this purpose?","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow slightly, \"Do you think he can test anything out of me?\" Jing Zeqian suddenly understood. His brother was such a shrewd and calculating person.","If Wang Boqi really tried to test Jing Zeyou, he would not only worry about whether he could get any information but also bear the risk of being discovered.","But if it were him, it would be different. Although he was reluctant to admit it, testing him would indeed be more secure.","Jing Zeqian's lips curled slightly as he looked at Jing Zeqian's expression of \"unwilling but agreeing.\"","\"So, what you need to do is vent all your dissatisfaction with Jiang Miaomiao's matter towards Wang Boqi,\" Jing Zeyou said seriously. \"Remember, do not mention Yi Yi.\"","Jing Zeqian nodded solemnly and agreed to the task.","At the banquet hall of the Wang Family Hongli Group","Wang He and Wang Boqi were chatting with the boss of a cooperative company, the atmosphere appearing quite harmonious.","Not far away, two middle-aged men in suits were whispering to each other.","\"I hear that the old man is already preparing to pass the position to his son.\" One of the men casually turned his head towards the direction of Wang He and the others.","The person he was talking to curled his lips slightly, \"Rumors are not reliable.\"","He didn't believe Wang He had such determination. He had held onto the position for so many years; how could he let go of it so easily?","Wang He was not Jing Beicheng.","The man chuckled, \"That's why you're so steady.\" He raised his champagne glass and clinked it with the person beside him, just as he was about to take a sip, he saw someone entering the door.","The man's eyes flashed with surprise, \"Jing Zeyou and Shen Huaichu are here?\" The person beside him quickly looked over, also with an unexpected expression.","Shen Huaichu met Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian at the door, and the four of them entered together, along with Gu Lin, who had just arrived at Huarui Group for an \"internship.\"","Wang Boqi noticed the group and subtly reminded Wang He beside him.","Wang He's gaze shifted to Jing Zeyou, and he walked over with a wine glass, his expression filled with the satisfaction of an elder looking at a younger generation.","\"Zeyou\"","\"Mr. Wang\"","Wang He still smiled kindly, seemingly not minding Jing Zeyou's choice of words, \"It's been a long time since I heard you call me Uncle Wang. You're getting more and more formal now.\"","Jing Zeyou's lips curled slightly, \"After all, I've grown up a bit.\" He used to be a junior, but now, in this setting, he was the president of Hengjing Group, not a junior to Wang He.","Just as it was Wang He, not Wang Boqi, who was receiving him.","Wang He smiled and chatted for a few moments before greeting Shen Huaichu and Jing Zeqian.","\"Boqi, you young people have more to talk about. Take Zeqian over and chat.\"","Jing Zeqian stood to the side, his eyes flashing with a hint of mockery. It seemed that in Wang He's mind, his level wasn't quite up to par.","Gu Lin, who had been forcibly brought over: ...Did I say anything?","Shen Huaichu's eyes flashed with a sharp light, but he didn't speak. He planned to find another opportunity to ask Jing Zeyou.","Something was off with the Jing family's recent behavior.","Wang Boqi smiled gently and stepped forward to take Jing Zeqian over for a chat.","Jing Zeqian was initially displeased, but after Jing Zeyou gave him a look, he reluctantly agreed to follow Wang Boqi.","In Wang Boqi's view, Jing Zeqian was just restraining his temper because Jing Zeyou was present.","At the side of the banquet hall, Jing Zeqian stood with his arms crossed, his expression showing displeasure and annoyance.","\"There's no need to take me over. You should know that I really don't want to be in the same space as you,\" he said bluntly, not caring if anyone else heard.","Wang Boqi's gaze flickered with a hint of darkness, but it quickly disappeared, and his gentle smile returned.","\"Zeqian, it seems you have some prejudice against me. After all, we grew up together...\"","\"Stop!\"","Jing Zeqian's eyebrows knitted tightly, his eyes filled with disgust, \"Don't talk nonsense. It's disgusting. Do you think I can't find out about you just because Jiang Miaomiao didn't say anything?\"","Just because of Jiang Miaomiao?","Wang Boqi's eyes flickered slightly, the tight string in his heart loosening a bit, but he didn't relax his guard, \"What do you mean? Who is Jiang Miaomiao?\"","Jing Zeqian was so angry that he wanted to punch Wang Boqi hard if there weren't so many people around.","He gritted his teeth and said in a low voice, \"Wang Boqi, don't forget, she's still inside carrying your child!\"","The angrier Jing Zeqian became, the more pleased Wang Boqi felt.","If just a Jiang Miaomiao could make Jing Zeqian so angry, what would happen if Jing Yi really did something?","Wang Boqi picked up a glass of champagne from the table and handed it to Jing Zeqian, who didn't take it. He didn't mind and took a sip himself, raising an eyebrow slightly.","\"Zeqian, you can eat whatever you want, but you can't talk nonsense. I'm still single. What girl would want to be with me after you say that?\"","Jing Zeqian's gaze was sharp as a knife, \"Really? Do you think someone like you can find a partner?\" How could he so casually brush this matter aside!","Wang Boqi chuckled, \"Maybe. There might still be a few girls willing to go through fire and water for me.\" The gentler his smile, the more Jing Zeqian felt like the person in front of him was a poisonous snake!","Jing Zeqian clenched his fists, his eyes filled with so much hatred that it almost manifested in his fists.","'Remember, your anger comes only from Jiang Miaomiao, not from Yi Yi.'","Jing Zeyou's reminder echoed in Jing Zeqian's mind, and he calmed down, loosening his fists.","Jing Zeqian's lips curled in mockery, \"Is that so? The son of the Wang family is quite something, relying on women to rise.\" He sneered, \"Then I wish you success,\" and turned to leave.","Wang Boqi tightened his grip on the wine glass, his gaze cold and slippery, making people shudder.","Jing Zeqian's final mockery did make Wang Boqi a bit angry, but it also served as a reassurance.","It seemed his guess was right. Jing Yi was definitely not as harmless as she appeared; at least, she had thoughts about the Jing family.","Next, it was time to move on to the next step of the plan."]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Jing Zeyou's Delight","paragraphs":["Meanwhile, after a brief conversation with Wang He, Jing Zeyou and Shen Huaichu quietly gathered to the side.","Shen Huaichu held his wine glass, discreetly glancing in Wang Boqi's direction. The two people over there were discussing something, and Jing Zeqian's expression was far from pleased.","Moreover, given Jing Zeqian's personality, he shouldn't have liked attending such occasions, especially with someone who was his enemy.","Indeed, the Jing Family seemed to be planning something lately. Was this related to Jing Yi, who had been too busy to think lately?","Shen Huaichu's eyes held a hint of darkness as he said, \"Mr. Jing, Miss Jing Yi seems quite busy recently.\"","A flash of understanding crossed Jing Zeyou's eyes as his lips curved slightly upward. He said softly, \"Indeed, quite busy.\" Busy dealing with Wang Boqi and regularly reporting progress to him.","She could only occasionally go to the racing track to practice, and several times she encountered Wang Boqi there trying to gain favor, so she had to deal with him again.","Shen Huaichu stared in Wang Boqi's direction, his voice growing colder, \"Being the Jing Family's daughter must be quite taxing.\"","Jing Zeyou didn't explicitly say anything, but Shen Huaichu read something from these few words.","Gu Lin stood silently nearby. Although he couldn't understand what his brother was discussing with Jing Zeyou, it didn't prevent him from detecting the dissatisfaction in Shen Huaichu's tone...","So, which word triggered the mechanism, and why couldn't he understand anything?","Jing Zeyou remained unconcerned, even showing a rare trace of pleasure in his expression, \"I also think it's somewhat difficult, but as the beneficiary, I must admit, I'm in good spirits.\"","His sister wanted to protect him, and while Jing Zeyou was concerned, he admitted feeling subtly pleased.","Especially saying this in front of Shen Huaichu, his mood improved even further.","\"Also, Mr. Shen, thank you for your concern about my sister.\"","Jing Zeyou knew the source of Shen Huaichu's displeasure, but Shen Huaichu currently had no position to discuss this matter with him.","At least, that's what Jing Zeyou believed.","Shen Huaichu narrowed his eyes, cold glints appearing in his dark pupils, which only highlighted the pleasure in Jing Zeyou's gaze.","\"Don't mention it, Mr. Jing has indeed... surprised me.\"","The sarcasm in Shen Huaichu's tone became increasingly obvious. Gu Lin softened his breathing, carefully glancing at Jing Zeyou.","The other party wasn't angered by Shen Huaichu's unpleasant tone; instead, he seemed to be in a good mood.","What on earth were they talking about?!","Wasn't Jing Zeyou Jing Yi's older brother? Shouldn't a future brother-in-law try to get along? Why was his brother speaking this way?!","And what were they talking about anyway?! With their fragmented conversation, he couldn't understand anything!","No wonder Shen Huaichu wanted to give him special training. In his current state, he felt there was a deep wall between him and these two business tycoons...","At this moment, Jing Zeqian walked over with a stern face.","Jing Zeyou looked at him, and Jing Zeqian blinked to signal something before returning to his clearly displeased expression.","Shen Huaichu shifted his gaze to Jing Zeqian, curiosity flashing in his eyes.","Jing Zeqian forced a smile that didn't reach his eyes, \"Mr. Shen, I didn't expect to meet you at this banquet. What a surprise.\" Shen Huaichu replied coolly, \"I'm equally surprised to meet you, Young Mr. Jing.\"","The tension between them was obvious, and Gu Lin was already dumbfounded.","Jing Zeqian snorted. If it weren't for fear of disrupting Jing Zeyou and Jing Yi's plan, he wouldn't have come to torture himself!","Just seeing Wang Boqi's face made him want to vomit! Add Shen Huaichu's presence, and one made him sick while the other irritated him!","However, compared to Wang Boqi, Shen Huaichu was much better. At least he had real ability and wouldn't use underhanded tactics.","But different matters should be treated differently, and besides, there weren't just these two men in Jiangbei!","Shen Huaichu was unaware of being compared, as he was still pondering the conversation between Jing Zeqian and Wang Boqi.","He wasn't interested in the content of their conversation, but rather curious about Jing Zeyou's decision to let them talk. Was this also part of the Jing Family's plan?","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was lazily lying on her bed, talking on the phone with Shen Xi.","\"Jing Yi, what have you been busy with lately?\" The voice on the other end carried a hint of complaint and grievance.","Shen Xi hadn't seen much of Jing Yi this month. Whenever she tried to make plans, Jing Yi said she was busy but wouldn't explain why. She was starting to suspect Jing Yi was deliberately avoiding her.","Jing Yi was also somewhat tired, \"Shen Xi, I really am busy, and there's something very important that I can't tell you about right now.\"","She had just said she wouldn't do immersive acting anymore, but this month she had been doing almost nothing but that!","She was exhausted every day when she got home, and still had to prevent Wang Boqi from meeting Shen Xi. If anything slipped through Shen Xi, not only would this strategy be wasted, but she also feared Shen Xi might be in danger.","The other end of the phone muttered, \"Being so mysterious all day...\"","Jing Yi rolled over, changing the subject, \"Never mind about me, have you been hanging out with your sunshine brother lately?\"","The other end giggled a few times, sounding somewhat embarrassed.","\"Just met up a few times casually.\"","A smile spread across Jing Yi's face as she teased, \"Well, well, this is the longest I've seen you interested in any handsome guy.\"","The other end denied it, \"What do you mean interested? We're just friends.\"","Friends? Yeah, right.","Last time when Shen Xi saw that sunny handsome guy at the banquet, she was drawn to him like a magnet, zooming right over. How could there be no feelings involved?","But Jing Yi was indeed surprised that Shen Xi's emotional withdrawal seemed a bit slower this time.","Usually, Shen Xi had three steps with handsome guys: First step, love at first sight; Second step, getting to know each other; Third step, goodbye handsome guy.","Each time after saying goodbye, Shen Xi would casually say, \"When it feels right, it feels right. When the timing's wrong, feelings fade. What can I do about it?\"","Thinking about Shen Xi's past behavior, Jing Yi had reason to suspect that maybe the guy hadn't developed feelings for Shen Xi.","Although thinking this way about her best friend seemed a bit 'cruel,' Jing Yi felt she was close to the truth.","Sure enough, the voice on the phone said, \"What else could we be besides friends? He's thoughtful, yes, but he definitely keeps everything within friendship boundaries. As for any interest from him, well, I haven't really felt any so far.\"","\"Then why do you still like him so much?\"","\"Hehe, Yi Yi, it's not like you just met me today.\"","Jing Yi couldn't help but laugh. It was precisely because she knew Shen Xi so well that she asked such a question.","But when would this end? Did she want someone to like her, or not like her?"]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: That's the Real Jing Yi","paragraphs":["\"Jing Yi, over here.\"","Jing Yi looked toward where Wang Boqi was waving, her lips curving into a smile. As always, he had reserved the entire place.","If Jing Yi hadn't known Wang Boqi's true intentions, she might have thought this was just another romantic gesture typical of a wealthy young master.","Jing Yi sat down in the chair Wang Boqi pulled out for her and asked with a smile, \"Have you been waiting long?\" She wondered if today's invitation was just for another simple meal.","Although Jing Zeyou had recently warned her that Wang Boqi might make his move soon, Jing Yi remained vigilant.","Wang Boqi returned to his seat and replied gently, \"Of course not.\" He opened the menu and expertly ordered Jing Yi's favorite dishes with the waiter.","Jing Yi watched him, her eyes curved in amusement, seemingly accustomed to his behavior.","\"That's all for now.\"","Wang Boqi handed the menu back to the waiter and turned to find Jing Yi watching him, his lips curving upward.","\"Why are you looking at me like that?\"","Wang Boqi gazed at Jing Yi, his eyes tender and filled with warmth.","Jing Yi shook her head with a light laugh, \"Nothing, just thinking how well you've come to know my food preferences.\"","Could it be that she was just being polite? The dishes Wang Boqi ordered weren't nearly as good as Aunt Wang's cooking!","\"Jing Yi, you know I want to understand more than just your food preferences.\"","Wang Boqi's gaze was deeply affectionate, and Jing Yi lowered her head slightly, appearing shy as she avoided his intense stare, but in reality, she was suppressing the urge to roll her eyes.","When she looked up again, Jing Yi's expression showed both joy and hesitation. \"Boqi, may I ask you something?\"","Wang Boqi gave her an encouraging look, \"Of course.\"","Jing Yi seemed to struggle before finally asking, \"The incident with Jiang Miaomiao, was that your doing?\"","Wang Boqi's eyes narrowed slightly, a barely noticeable darkness flashing across them. He wasn't afraid of her bringing up this matter; in fact, he had been waiting for it.","\"Jing Yi, did your second brother tell you about this?\" Wang Boqi probed.","Jing Yi nodded slightly, looking down, \"You know, I was the one who stopped that incident, so he didn't hide anything from me and told me some of the truth behind it.\"","The last few words were spoken softly, as if she was reluctant to believe them.","Wang Boqi stood up and knelt before Jing Yi, holding her hand, his phoenix eyes carrying a hint of sadness.","\"Do you also think I did it?\"","The struggle in Jing Yi's eyes became more apparent. She tried to pull her hand away from Wang Boqi's tight grip, but he held on firmly!","Why was this bastard gripping so tightly! She would have to wash her hands ten times when she got back!","Wang Boqi naturally had no intention of letting go.","Jing Yi spoke with difficulty: \"I don't want to believe it was you, but...\"","Wang Boqi interrupted her, still maintaining his tender expression, \"Would you like to hear a story?\" Jing Yi glanced at him, her bright eyes rippling with emotion.","The current problem was - please let go of her hand! Sit back down properly and spin your tale!","For the next fifteen minutes or so, Jing Yi listened to a story about a wealthy young master who was heartlessly abandoned by a famous actress, and it was even because of Jing Zeqian.","Jing Yi: ...I really want to stab these ears deaf!","No matter how far-fetched Wang Boqi's story was, Jing Yi was supposed to be someone deeply immersed in his affection, so naturally, she had to act like a complete romantic!","Jing Yi's eyes welled up with tears, her gaze filled with complex emotions, seemingly heartbroken and disappointed for the wealthy young master in the story.","A barely noticeable trace of contempt flashed through Wang Boqi's eyes - Jing Yi seemed easier to handle than he had imagined.","He gently wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes, but Jing Yi slightly dodged his touch.","Wang Boqi seemed even more pleased with Jing Yi's shy state. \"So you haven't told your second brother about us, right?\" Jing Yi kept her head slightly lowered, her voice carrying a hint of stubbornness, \"This is my personal matter, it has nothing to do with them.\"","Wang Boqi's lips curved upward, though his eyes showed sympathy.","\"I'm sorry that because of me, you have to face such opposition from your family.\"","The girl before him spoke softly, yet with a hint of resentment, \"Family? You're overestimating my relationship with them.\"","Jing Yi rambled on, seemingly treating Wang Boqi as a confidant, expressing all her dissatisfaction with the Jing family and Jing Zejun.","And Wang Boqi believed every word she said.","He remained convinced that the Jing Yi he had investigated overseas was the real Jing Yi.","...","After finishing another round of acting competition with Wang Boqi, Jing Yi prepared to head home.","However, she unexpectedly received a call from Shen Huaichu.","It was the familiar dark red sports car again, and the somewhat familiar figure of Shen Huaichu standing at the company entrance.","Jing Yi tilted her head, \"Mr. Shen, is your car broken again? Need a ride?\" Was he really treating her as his personal driver?","Shen Huaichu nodded, his eyes flashing with guilt. Although it wasn't because his car was broken, his ultimate goal was indeed to get a ride.","After he got into the car, Jing Yi teased, \"Mr. Shen, being such a big company's boss, couldn't you buy a better car?\"","What kind of car breaks down every other day? Was it salvaged from a junkyard?","The bodyguard, driver, and employees who saw Shen Huaichu getting into the car at the entrance: ...","The employee watched in surprise as Shen Huaichu got into the dark red sports car, just as they had discussed in their group chat.","He muttered, \"So Mr. Shen's girlfriend is picking him up again?\" The bodyguard beside him gave him a look - how come he didn't know about Mr. Shen having a girlfriend? Shouldn't he be the first to know?","Noticing the look from the person beside him, the employee's eyes lit up, \"Brother Li, you follow Mr. Shen all day, have you seen his girlfriend? Is she pretty?\"","The bodyguard-driver coldly replied, \"Mr. Shen doesn't have a girlfriend.\" At least not yet.","He did know that she was the Jing family's daughter, but their current relationship wasn't exactly that of boyfriend and girlfriend.","The employee didn't believe it and looked at the bodyguard suspiciously. Could it be that he was keeping secrets for Mr. Shen?","After all, as a bodyguard and driver who spent time alone with Shen Huaichu every day, confidentiality was a basic professional requirement.","The employee nodded in agreement, feeling he had probably guessed right. He sighed, giving the bodyguard an appreciative yet sympathetic look before quietly walking away.","Leaving the bodyguard still standing at the company entrance: ...","Meanwhile, Jing Yi kept her eyes on the road, driving steadily.","\"Seriously, you should get a new car when you have time. If I hadn't happened to be out, I wouldn't have accepted your request.\"","Shen Huaichu turned to look at her, his entire demeanor softer than usual. He hadn't expected Jing Yi to actually drive over to pick him up; he had only wanted to find an opportunity to talk to her.","Now it seemed his luck wasn't too bad after all."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Not Wearing a Formal Dress Today","paragraphs":["\"Miss Jing, were you out on business?\"","Jing Yi kept her eyes on the road ahead, responding calmly, \"Yes.\" How else could she have coincidentally been able to pick him up?","Thinking of the earlier incident with Wang Boqi, Shen Huaichu casually probed, \"Was it a date?\"","Jing Yi frowned slightly, as if recalling something unpleasant.","\"How could it be!\" She added, \"Let's just say it was work involving some acting.\"","A barely noticeable smile played at the corners of Shen Huaichu's lips. \"Is it that demanding? Does the Jing family heiress need to juggle multiple roles?\"","Life isn't easy, Yi Yi sighed.","\"What can I do? I took on this task myself.\"","Though she said that, if given another chance, Jing Yi would still make the same choice.","\"Is there somewhere you'd like to go?\" Shen Huaichu suddenly asked. Jing Yi looked ahead, confusion flashing in her eyes. \"Where?\"","Wasn't she supposed to be taking him home?","The 'Ghost' stopped by the roadside. Looking down, there was a deep flight of stairs. Shen Huaichu had already stepped out of the car.","Jing Yi followed suit, admiring the verdant forest below. It was truly beautiful.","\"Shall we?\" Shen Huaichu extended his hand to her again.","Jing Yi looked up at him, seemingly reminded of that figure on the cruise ship. \"I'm not wearing an evening gown today.\" So she didn't need help with the stairs.","Besides, these stairs weren't that steep.","Shen Huaichu nodded slightly, saying softly, \"I know.\"","You know, yet your hand is still extended?","Jing Yi pressed her lips together slightly before placing her hand in his, once again feeling his cool fingers.","Shen Huaichu led her down, step by step, with a hint of carefulness, until they reached the last step.","It was a small platform offering views of the lake, bridge, and highway, though the North River was nowhere in sight.","Jing Yi curiously ran to the wooden platform, taking in the scenery before her.","\"It's so beautiful! Is this your secret hideout?\"","Shen Huaichu's lips curved into a slight smile as he slowly walked to her side.","\"You could say that.\"","He would occasionally come here to feel the breeze and clear his mind. Since hardly anyone came to this area, it really was like a secret hideout.","Jing Yi glanced around the ground briefly, chose a spot with a good view, and sat down, patting the space beside her.","\"Don't just stand there, sit down.\"","She was acting as if this was her own home, already playing host.","Amusement flickered in Shen Huaichu's eyes as he sat down beside her.","They sat quietly for a while, neither speaking, but Jing Yi felt at ease.","She had been spending almost every dream lately acting alongside Wang Boqi.","Sometimes dreaming of Jing Zeqian questioning her predecessor, sometimes of Jiang Miaomiao mockingly comparing them while heavily pregnant, sometimes of her predecessor completely selling out Hengjing and Huarui Group.","She felt she was on the verge of a nervous breakdown.","Jing Yi suddenly recalled what Lin Ruiqing had told her about Shen Huaichu, instantly relating to his experiences.","She gazed at the lake's surface, which sparkled with light, her eyes reflecting glimmers of brightness.","\"Shen Huaichu, isn't acting exhausting?\" Jing Yi asked vaguely. Shen Huaichu paused slightly, his voice becoming low, \"I don't find it particularly tiring.\"","His great revenge remained unfulfilled, and his uncle and aunt's family were all wary of him. They wanted him to be someone unthreatening, so that's exactly who he pretended to be.","Whether it took ten years or twenty.","Jing Yi closed her eyes slightly, concealing the emotions within them.","How could it not be exhausting? She was worn out after just a few months, let alone Shen Huaichu who had been acting for over a decade.","\"Jing Yi, if you find it exhausting, you don't have to wade into these troubled waters.\" Whatever needed to be done, he could handle it.","Jing Yi smiled. As expected of Huarui Group's CEO - though this plan was known only to the Jing family, Shen Huaichu had still figured out the general idea.","\"Shen Huaichu, I also have people I want to protect.\"","Though she hadn't been with the Jing family long, apart from her grandmother at the orphanage, this was the first family she had managed to have in either of her lives.","Jing Yi cherished this hard-won kinship dearly and wanted to protect them.","Shen Huaichu gazed at her, his deep eyes filled with unfathomable emotions, internally sighing slightly.","He had originally planned to work directly with Jing Zeyou, but now it seemed that might not be the best approach.","Jing Yi turned to look at him, her round almond eyes curved like crescents, dimples appearing one deeper than the other, \"Don't you think I'm impressive?\"","Her eyes were clear and bright, seeming to capture the sparkling reflections from the lake's surface.","Shen Huaichu's lips curved upward as he nodded, saying softly, \"Very impressive.\"","The pride in Jing Yi's eyes couldn't be more obvious. Shen Huaichu stared at her intently, his gaze lingering on her form.","\"By the way, how is Aunt Shen lately?\"","Shen Huaichu withdrew his gaze, a faint smile playing at his lips, \"She's doing well, though she still mentions you occasionally.\"","Jing Yi had been very busy lately, and Shen Huaichu had only seen her a few times. Meanwhile, Shen Tu was unusually interested in their progress, often making subtle inquiries.","\"Then you must help me tell auntie that I didn't mean to neglect visiting her.\" It's just that she had been truly busy lately.","Shen Huaichu nodded, \"I understand.\"","They continued chatting by the lake, and whether it was the incredibly peaceful environment, the comfortable gentle breeze, or simply Jing Yi's exhaustion...","Jing Yi appeared to be losing consciousness, thoroughly overcome with fatigue. She leaned against the platform's railing, her head nodding repeatedly.","Shen Huaichu noticed this and grew concerned, unconsciously steadying her shoulder. Slowly, Jing Yi gently leaned against his shoulder.","Her breath tickled his neck, causing Shen Huaichu to stiffen slightly, instinctively holding his breath before gradually relaxing.","Shen Huaichu lowered his gaze to look at the person resting on his shoulder, his deep eyes containing barely perceptible emotions.","This was the first time he had seen Jing Yi so close up, with her defenses down, soft and peaceful.","For a moment, Shen Huaichu found himself reluctant to look away, but after a while, he finally shifted his gaze, adjusting to make Jing Yi more comfortable.","Looking at the sunset before them, his heart felt more content than it had in a long time.","......","Night, Jing Family Residence","Jing Yi carefully glanced toward the villa's living room before approaching Uncle Li, who had just come out of the building.","\"Uncle Li, has my second brother returned?\" Her voice was barely above a whisper, as if afraid of disturbing someone.","\"The second young master returned in the afternoon.\" Jing Yi drew in a sharp breath - surely fate was conspiring against her!","Uncle Li added with a smile, \"Though he should be in his room now, the living room is empty.\""]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: Jing Zeqian's Address","paragraphs":["Ever since Jing Yi started her plan, Jing Zeqian had become even stricter in watching over her.","Coming home so late today, she didn't know how to explain herself if she really ran into Jing Zeqian.","Fortunately, after checking with Uncle Li, Jing Yi knew it was safe to return now. She could quietly go back to her room and claim she had been back for a while!","But plans rarely go as expected.","Just as Jing Yi was trying to sneak upstairs quietly, a figure blocked her path. Jing Zeqian stood at the stairs in his loungewear, arms crossed.","Jing Yi quickly put on an innocent smile, \"Second Brother, why aren't you resting so late?\" Jing Zeqian replied coldly, \"How could I rest when our Miss Jing Yi hasn't returned home?\"","Jing Yi gave a few dry laughs, hoping to brush it off, but Jing Zeqian had no intention of letting her go.","\"Come down with me.\"","[Oh no! There's no escaping now!]","Jing Zeqian sat on the sofa, crossing his long legs and leaning back lazily.","Jing Yi stood before him with her head lowered, appearing apologetic.","\"Explain why you're coming home near midnight.\"","If he hadn't called to confirm that Jing Yi wasn't with Wang Boqi, Jing Zeqian would have gone looking for her hours ago.","\"It's not quite midnight yet...\" It was just past eleven, wasn't it?","\"It's almost dawn, if not midnight. Instead of picking at my words, you'd better think about how to explain yourself!\"","Jing Yi stammered, unsure how to explain.","[I can't exactly say I fell asleep while chatting with someone, and then got hungry when I woke up, so I went to grab a meal...]","Jing Zeqian couldn't even describe his complicated feelings. Fell asleep while chatting? Could there be a more ridiculous way to fall asleep?","\"Who were you out with?\"","Jing Yi lowered her head even more.","\"Shen Huaichu\"","Her voice was so soft that Jing Zeqian couldn't hear clearly. He frowned and asked again.","\"Who did you say?\"","Jing Yi carefully glanced up at Jing Zeqian and repeated, \"I was with Shen Huaichu.\"","Oh, so it was Shen Huaichu.","\"Shen Huaichu?!\"","Jing Yi stepped back half a step, startled by Jing Zeqian's volume. Even though they lived in a detached villa, such volume would surely disturb their sleeping family members.","Jing Zeqian had no time for such concerns. He never expected this – when he managed to guard against one person, another would slip through!","\"It's bad enough that you went out with him, but to stay out so late?\"","More importantly, you fell asleep right in front of him – don't you know that guy has feelings for you?!","Jing Yi felt somewhat wronged, \"Second Brother, I didn't mean to come home so late, it's just that...\"","[Just that I fell asleep while chatting, right?]","\"Just what?\"","Jing Yi blinked, not daring to say it.","Jing Zeqian was nearly furious. He had emphasized so many times, yet she still remained so unguarded.","Later, Jing Yi listened to Jing Zeqian's lengthy lecture for half an hour, feeling a headache coming on.","Upstairs, Lin Ruiqing hazily woke up, watching Jing Beicheng's figure rise.","\"Is Yi Yi back?\"","Jing Beicheng returned to bed, tucking the blanket around his wife, saying softly, \"She's back. Zeqian is lecturing her downstairs.\"","He had initially wanted to tell Jing Zeqian to keep his voice down, but as the voices gradually became quieter, he let it be.","Lin Ruiqing, still drowsy, said, \"Tell him to wrap it up. It's so late, Yi Yi needs to rest.\" Though she didn't know what Yi Yi had been busy with lately, she wasn't worried since Jing Zeyou and the others were watching over her.","Lin Ruiqing didn't dwell on it further.","Jing Beicheng quietly agreed, and Lin Ruiqing quickly fell back asleep.","...","\"Zejun?\"","Wen Qingyan looked questioningly at Jing Zejun, who seemed somewhat distracted lately.","Jing Zejun came back to her senses, \"Brother Qingyan, did you call me?\"","Wen Qingyan looked concerned, \"Are you too tired from filming lately? You've been often lost in thought.\" Was it because the drama was approaching its end, making her feel more pressured?","Jing Zejun shook her head slightly, \"No, I'm just thinking about some things.\"","Hearing this, the worry in Wen Qingyan's eyes didn't fade, \"Is there anything I can help with?\"","Jing Zejun sighed slightly. Let alone Wen Qingyan, even Jing Zeqian would have a low chance of being able to help.","During this time, Jing Zejun could sense that Jing Yi seemed to be busy with something, but she hadn't paid much attention, assuming her sister had her own matters to attend to.","Until last month, when Jing Zejun returned to North River for a birthday banquet, she saw Wang Boqi there.","She and Jing Yi were all too familiar with Wang Boqi and Jiang Miaomiao's story, so why was he invited?","More importantly, Jing Zejun caught a glimpse of Jing Yi and Wang Boqi's familiarity. Though not intimate, it exceeded the boundaries of ordinary friendship.","Being at the banquet, Jing Zejun didn't make a scene then, but she immediately cornered Jing Yi afterward.","From Jing Yi's explanation, Jing Zejun learned that she and Jing Zeyou were planning to deal with Wang Boqi.","Jing Zejun was very surprised, \"Why does it have to be you dealing with Wang Boqi?\" She asked with urgency and confusion, not understanding how Jing Zeyou could agree to this.","Jing Yi explained the whole situation to Jing Zejun, but this didn't ease Jing Zejun's concerns.","Jing Yi said she was the only suitable person for this task.","\"...Has he done anything to you?\"","Jing Zejun still remembered Jiang Miaomiao's final fate, and Jing Yi was also a girl.","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving, \"Zejun, you forgot that I know Sanda. He can't get close to me, and besides, our brothers have given me some protective items.\"","Jing Yi eagerly showed Jing Zejun her bracelet, demonstrating all the functions of its decorative buttons.","But even so, there was no guarantee that Wang Boqi wouldn't resort to underhanded methods, which was still worrying.","Since that banquet, Jing Zejun had been thinking about this matter. As she had told Wen Qingyan, she couldn't help much either.","Now she could only hope this matter would end soon, so Jing Yi wouldn't have to remain in such a dangerous situation.","\"It's alright, I'm just worried about Yi Yi,\" Jing Zejun said to Wen Qingyan with a gentle smile.","It seemed like something he truly couldn't help with. Wen Qingyan didn't push further, \"You know you can always contact me if you need me.\"","Jing Zejun smiled gracefully, looking even more elegant, \"Thank you, Brother Qingyan.\"","Come to think of it, during these days of filming, Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan had grown closer.","Though Jing Zejun couldn't pinpoint when it started, she had gradually become more natural in her interactions with Wen Qingyan."]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Wang Boqi, are you investigating me","paragraphs":["Two racing cars appeared at the Shanchi Racing Track, competing head-to-head.","A red and a white car were battling for first place, their competition seemingly intense.","However, only Jing Yi knew that she wasn't really trying her best, just to avoid making Wang Boqi lose too badly.","Unlike her usual focused demeanor while holding the steering wheel, Jing Yi had time to observe Wang Boqi's car, a mocking smile playing at her lips.","It seemed the young master of the Wang family really wanted to win.","But she deliberately wouldn't let him have his way!","Jing Yi's eyes suddenly changed, as she adjusted the steering wheel back and forth, executing a simple drift at the upcoming curve to overtake the white car.","Jing Yi drove straight toward the finish line, while Wang Boqi, slightly behind, gripped his steering wheel tightly, staring at the red car ahead with intense dissatisfaction.","This wasn't his first time accompanying Jing Yi to the race track, but he had never beaten her. What's more, Wang Boqi had the distinct feeling that she was just toying with him, like playing with a dog.","This filled Wang Boqi with deep resentment and humiliation.","Yet each time, Jing Yi would put on an expression of admiration and joy, leaving him nowhere to direct his emotions.","When the white car crossed the finish line and stopped, Wang Boqi stepped out with no trace of negative emotions on his face, maintaining his usual gentle and gentlemanly demeanor.","Jing Yi removed her helmet, smiling brightly, \"Boqi, you were amazing! I almost couldn't beat you!\" She figured it was appropriate to say something diplomatic, otherwise this young master might have a breakdown.","Wang Boqi's expression froze momentarily before quickly recovering his smile. \"Really? So I've been acknowledged by a professional racer?\"","Jing Yi seemed amused by his words, \"As if you need anyone's acknowledgment!\"","Just don't let this get out! She had worked hard to maintain her second-place ranking, and a few words could ruin her reputation!","After one lap, both tacitly agreed not to suggest another race.","Jing Yi felt it was frustrating having to deliberately let Wang Boqi win.","As for Wang Boqi, he wasn't particularly interested in racing to begin with. If it weren't for trying to cater to Jing Yi's interests, he wouldn't have stooped to playing along time after time.","Yet this Jing Yi seemed single-minded, making him lose face every time!","As they slowly walked to the stands, Wang Boqi casually brought up Jing Yi's Financial Management major.","Jing Yi looked uncomfortable, wondering if he was planning to test her professional knowledge. She had barely managed to graduate, how could she remember all those details now!","Wang Boqi caught every nuance of Jing Yi's expression, a cold smile flickering across his lips.","Her reaction seemed to confirm his suspicions.","This made things easier; since they were cut from the same cloth, Wang Boqi felt no need to probe further.","\"Yi Yi, have you ever thought about showing your talents at Hengjing? It would be a waste of your overseas education otherwise.\"","His voice was very deep, like a demon tempting humans to trade their souls.","Jing Yi's pupils constricted slightly. Here it comes!","She avoided Wang Boqi's gaze, her expression evasive, \"Boqi, what are you saying? You know I'm just an adopted daughter of the Jing family...\"","Just a coward who dares to dream but not show it - this was Wang Boqi's assessment of Jing Yi's reaction.","However, he thought, this might be better; such people are easier to control.","Wang Boqi chuckled, his eyes gleaming with cold malice where Jing Yi couldn't see.","\"Yi Yi, are you holding back even with me?\"","Jing Yi's eyes showed hesitation and struggle, and Wang Boqi knew it was time to add fuel to the fire.","\"I just don't want your dreams to shatter, especially after you've prepared for so many years.\"","Jing Yi lowered her head, concealing the deeper meaning in her eyes.","So, this was Wang Boqi's biggest bargaining chip.","Jing Yi's eyes flickered slightly, realizing that Wang Boqi must have investigated everything about the original Jing Yi's life abroad.","He knew about the original Jing Yi's feelings for Jing Zejun, her thoughts about the Jing family, and even her ambitions regarding Hengjing, which was why he was so confident.","So, 'her' biggest weakness lay here.","\"Yi Yi, you know that while our Wang family may not be all-powerful, we certainly have more than enough influence to help you take over Hengjing.\"","Jing Yi raised an eyebrow slightly, keeping her head down to prevent Wang Boqi from noticing anything amiss.","What nonsense! If they were really that powerful, how could the Jing family have become the dominant force in North River region fifteen years ago?","Jing Yi concealed the mockery in her eyes, and when she looked up again, her expression showed wariness, \"Wang Boqi, you investigated me?\"","At this moment, Jing Yi was like someone whose mask had been stripped away, trying to maintain composure while clearly flustered.","Wang Boqi was unfazed, his gentle and indulgent expression masking the triumph in his eyes as he stepped forward and took Jing Yi's hand.","\"Yi Yi, I like you, so naturally I want to know everything about you!\"","Jing Yi's eyelashes trembled. What did I just hear?! Is that your excuse for invading someone's privacy?","Seeing Jing Yi softening, Wang Boqi gripped her hand tighter, \"So I want to help fulfill every single one of your little wishes.\"","Jing Yi didn't know where to begin criticizing, but the current situation left no time for that.","She needed to make Wang Boqi believe his words had moved her.","Jing Yi slowly raised her head, still with those bright sparkling eyes, now filled with emotion, \"Boqi, thank you! No one has ever been so good to me...\"","Contempt flashed in Wang Boqi's eyes. See? Whether it's Jiang Miaomiao or Jing Yi, they're all the same, equally easy to manipulate.","But Jing Yi didn't agree immediately. Her expression showed some hesitation, \"However, I need a few days to think about it.\" Wang Boqi gladly agreed.","As night fell, in Jing Zeyou's study","Jing Zeyou narrowed his eyes, \"He's ready to begin?\" Jing Yi nodded, saying she could feel Wang Boqi pushing her step by step toward a decision, so this couldn't be just a test.","If that's the case, she'd add some fuel to the fire!","Jing Yi looked at Jing Zeyou with bright eyes, enthusiastically suggesting, \"Big brother, isn't my birthday coming up soon? Let's send Wang Boqi an invitation.\"","Jing Zeyou's eyes showed disapproval, \"You want to put on an act for him at the party?\" This would be Jing Yi's first birthday since returning - how could they ruin it for someone like Wang Boqi?","\"It's not me who'll be acting, it's all of you.\"","If Wang Boqi truly saw how the Jing family appeared 'indifferent' to her, he would surely become more proactive.","\"Isn't that the same thing?\" This was no different from directly ruining Jing Yi's birthday party.","Jing Yi waved her hand dismissively, feeling it made no difference to her. She would have to play the role of an elegant young lady from a wealthy family anyway.","Since everyone had to act, they might as well all do it together, keeping everyone busy.","Jing Zeyou: ...That's not what I meant at all."]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: The Dinner Battleground","paragraphs":["In any case, the birthday party arrangements were unilaterally decided by Jing Yi.","For Jing Yi, everything now had to make way for resolving the Wang Boqi situation as quickly as possible!","Jing Zeyou remained silent, unsure why, but he felt that Jing Yi seemed to be racing against time...","Even tonight's dinner party was the same.","Since when had Jing Yi become interested in dinner parties? To be precise, she had hardly shown interest in any social gatherings, yet today she attended as Jing Zeyou's companion.","Jing Zeyou watched Jing Yi yawning in the car and couldn't help but smile, \"If you're this tired, why insist on accompanying me to the party this late?\" He glanced out the car window, \"While there's still time, shall I have the driver take you home to rest?\"","Jing Yi immediately shook her head, \"No, I'm all prepared.\"","[She had done her makeup and changed into her evening gown - she would go even if it was raining knives!]","Jing Yi hadn't really wanted to come herself, but hadn't she heard that Wang Boqi would be here? She had to seize every opportunity to make him anxious!","Jing Zeyou was slightly stunned; he truly couldn't understand Jing Yi's thinking, but if she wanted to go, then so be it.","The car stopped at the hotel entrance. Jing Zeyou got out first and extended his hand to help Jing Yi.","Jing Yi adjusted her smile and elegantly took Jing Zeyou's arm as they entered the banquet hall.","Unlike previous social gatherings, the hall was set up with round tables.","It really did look like they were here just to eat.","While Jing Yi was observing her surroundings, searching for Wang Boqi, she didn't see him but instead spotted someone unexpected!","Why was Shen Huaichu here?!","Seeing him look in her direction, Jing Yi instinctively avoided his gaze.","Jing Zeyou noticed Jing Yi's reaction and asked, \"What's wrong?\" Jing Yi forced a laugh, \"Nothing, nothing.\"","On the other side, Shen Huaichu had naturally spotted Jing Yi. She was wearing a simple black strapless dress tonight, her long hair loosely pinned up with two slightly curled strands falling down.","So, why was she pretending not to see him?","While Jing Yi was having a mental storm, debating whether to greet him or pretend they weren't acquainted, before she could decide, Wang Boqi also appeared in her line of sight.","Jing Yi closed her eyes briefly - now she was really done for!","Why had she insisted on taking on the porcelain business?! She clearly didn't have the skills for it!","Why couldn't she have taken things slowly? What was the point of provoking him?!","While Jing Yi was internally berating herself, pretending to be blind to both men's presence, Jing Zeyou had already led her to their seats and pulled out her chair.","Jing Yi obediently sat down, fixing her gaze firmly on the decorative flowers in front of her. Oh, there were even water droplets on them - how fresh, how fresh indeed.","Jing Zeyou gave her a strange look. Hadn't she been full of fighting spirit earlier? How had she suddenly turned into such a timid quail?","Could it be because of him? Jing Zeyou discreetly glanced at Shen Huaichu in the distance, then back at Jing Yi, who was intently admiring the flowers.","\"Mr. Jing\"","A real estate mogul sat down beside them, and Jing Zeyou turned his attention to chat with the newcomer.","Jing Yi's attitude was something Wang Boqi could rationalize - after all, they couldn't appear too close right now, especially in front of Jing Zeyou.","However, if Jing Yi could come with Jing Zeyou, didn't that mean his plan was almost halfway complete?","A glint flashed in Wang Boqi's eyes as he smiled and quietly moved away from the woman beside him.","Since the plan was about to begin, he should maintain a 'clean' image. After all, a sense of security was most effective with women.","As for Shen Huaichu, once his rationality returned, he could guess Jing Yi's intentions. Was she avoiding him in front of Wang Boqi? Or in front of Jing Zeyou?","He could understand all this, but he couldn't accept it.","Shen Huaichu stared at her, his lips curving slightly upward as he walked over.","Then, under everyone's gaze, he approached Jing Yi's side.","Jing Yi continued to keep her head down, playing the timid quail: No! What was he trying to do?!","Jing Zeyou narrowed his eyes, watching Shen Huaichu: What was this young man up to now?","Wang Boqi gripped his wine glass tightly: Had the relationship between Huarui Group and Hengjing grown this close?","Others: ...Why were they all just standing there?","Shen Huaichu wore a black suit, the dark color making him appear particularly elegant. He slowly bent down, and Jing Yi, thinking he was going to speak to her, closed her eyes and quietly moved away slightly.","Shen Huaichu raised an eyebrow slightly, a hint of amusement flashing in his eyes, then turned to Jing Zeyou, \"Good evening, Mr. Jing.\" Jing Zeyou's smile didn't reach his eyes as he replied,","\"Mr. Shen.\"","This greeting was his last gesture of politeness.","Shen Huaichu didn't mind and casually sat down next to Jing Yi. After staring at her for two seconds, he said with a half-smile, \"Miss Jing, it's been a while.\"","Jing Yi awkwardly forced a smile, \"Yes, it's been a while, indeed.\" Even though he had just given her a ride a few days ago, and they had chatted by the river.","It somehow felt like putting on an act in front of acquaintances.","Shen Huaichu hadn't really intended to say much to Jing Yi; after greeting her, he began conversing with Jing Zeyou.","To others, it appeared that Shen Huaichu had only sat next to Jing Yi to talk with Jing Zeyou, and Wang Boqi thought the same.","Others didn't matter, but the only one suffering was Jing Yi - her toes were about to dig through her shoe soles! Why did they have to talk across her?!","Shen Huaichu noticed Jing Yi's discomfort and asked quietly, \"Would you like to switch seats with me?\" Jing Zeyou's brows furrowed slightly - she was his sister, what would it mean for her to sit next to Shen Huaichu?","Jing Yi herself was even more confused.","What? Move her over there to make it easier for him to talk to her brother? What kind of move was this?","Before she could ask, Jing Zeyou made the same offer, \"Would you like to switch seats with me?\" Shen Huaichu silently looked over.","Should she move?","Jing Yi looked at the seat next to Jing Zeyou, but the CEO next to her brother also wanted to talk business with him, and was eagerly waiting for a chance to speak with Jing Zeyou.","Maybe she should just sit at a different table altogether?","Jing Yi's smile was becoming stiff, \"No, I'll just stay here.\"","Seeing this, Shen Huaichu stopped talking to Jing Zeyou. He had only been making conversation to have an excuse to watch her anyway, so if she was uncomfortable, he'd stop.","The dinner began, and all the invited guests had mostly taken their seats, with Wang Boqi sitting directly across from Jing Yi.","This was a relatively casual dinner party, so most people had brought dates. Shen Huaichu hadn't, but a beautiful woman still sat beside him - a real estate tycoon's daughter.","The real estate heiress was actively trying to make conversation with Shen Huaichu, appearing quite eager, but unfortunately, he was as responsive as a brick wall.","She was met with only an icy face and a few cold \"hmms.\"","Jing Yi had become somewhat numb to it all.","Everything else aside, if the dinner's food turned out to be mediocre, she would really lose her temper."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: He Can't Eat the Cake","paragraphs":["At the banquet, all the attendees were people of considerable status in North River, especially those seated at Jing Zeyou's table.","The evening's cuisine was merely a complementary aspect of the event; no one particularly cared about the food quality. Rather than savoring the dishes, most preferred to discuss business development with those around them.","After all, a few casual conversations could potentially bring substantial profits to their companies.","Thus, among all the guests at this luxurious banquet, only Jing Yi was genuinely focused on the food.","She was so engrossed that everyone at the table could read her 'verdict' on each dish through her facial expressions.","A slight upturn of her lips meant the dish was quite good; a neutral expression with extra chewing suggested it was average; a slight frown indicated it wasn't to her taste.","So far, the banquet's cuisine seemed to be above average, and the other guests unconsciously began making similar assessments.","Shen Huaichu watched her, amusement hidden in his eyes, occasionally serving some dishes he knew she liked.","Jing Yi, while keeping an eye on Wang Boqi's direction, covered her mouth and whispered, \"What are you doing!\" Though meant as a warning, it sounded soft to Shen Huaichu's ears.","He ceased his actions, sighing inwardly.","Though somewhat inappropriate, Shen Huaichu felt like he was acting like someone trying to tempt another into an affair...","The real estate heiress sitting nearby hadn't noticed their eye contact and was still seeking opportunities to talk with Shen Huaichu.","She had been drawn to him since arriving, attracted by his cold, dignified demeanor that commanded attention. Though his expression remained impassive, his well-defined features made him even more striking.","Upon learning he was the CEO of Huarui Group, her interest grew even stronger.","\"Mr. Shen, could you please help me reach that hawthorn cake? I can't reach it,\" she asked with an affected shy expression and a coquettish tone.","Jing Yi looked up, showing slight disdain.","She had tried that hawthorn cake - it wasn't good.","Shen Huaichu frowned, his impatience becoming more evident, \"I apologize, I'm allergic to hawthorn.\" The heiress's smile froze.","Jing Yi almost choked - who could come up with such an excuse? She shook her head helplessly.","The heiress hadn't given up. She composed herself and plastered another smile on her face.","She picked up a piece of mousse cake from the table and moved closer to Shen Huaichu again.","\"Mr. Shen, this cake is quite delicious,\" she added, \"And it doesn't contain any hawthorn.\"","Shen Huaichu's eyes darkened, his gaze suddenly sharp as a knife, so cold it sent chills down one's spine.","The heiress's breath caught as she felt a wave of coldness from head to toe.","\"He can't eat cake,\" Jing Yi's voice came through.","The previously chattering table fell silent, even Jing Zeyou looked over. Their faces clearly showed one question: How did you know he couldn't eat cake?","The coldness in Shen Huaichu's eyes gradually receded as he looked at the somewhat flustered Jing Yi. He lowered his gaze, hiding a gentle smile in his eyes.","After speaking, Jing Yi realized something was amiss - why had she intervened?!","She had discovered Shen Huaichu's aversion to cake at a previous banquet. It wasn't mere dislike, but deep revulsion.","Though she didn't know why he disliked it, she had instinctively spoken up to help him!","Seeing Jing Yi becoming increasingly uncomfortable, Shen Huaichu stepped in to smooth things over, \"So Miss Jing remembers my cake allergy from last time. Thank you for the reminder.\"","Jing Yi quickly nodded, \"Yes, yes, he had an allergic reaction to cake at the last banquet, his face was covered in scary red rashes.\" Shen Huaichu paused, a hint of helpless amusement flashing in his eyes.","The others at the table seemed to believe this, immediately expressing concern for Shen Huaichu's condition while praising Jing Yi's attentiveness.","Wang Boqi remained skeptical but withdrew his suspicious gaze.","The real estate heiress beside Shen Huaichu quietly withdrew her cake, thinking to herself that it wasn't the cake he was allergic to - it was her!","So he had someone already - why hadn't he said so earlier!","The heiress felt angry and was about to throw the cake back on the table when she remembered Shen Huaichu's earlier glare. She shuddered and quietly set the cake down instead.","Just as Jing Yi was about to breathe a sigh of relief that no one was pursuing the matter further, she caught Jing Zeyou's complex expression.","She gave a dry laugh, her eyes pleading.","Jing Zeyou sighed helplessly, throwing a displeased look at Shen Huaichu. Though his face remained expressionless, he could sense the other man's smug satisfaction.","The banquet proceeded without further incident.","Afterward, Jing Yi had lost her appetite, having been scared half to death.","As the banquet ended and Jing Zeyou was preparing to leave with Jing Yi, Wang Boqi approached them.","Wariness flashed in Jing Yi's eyes as she tightened her grip on Jing Zeyou's arm.","Jing Zeyou maintained his composure, showing no unusual reaction. His mere presence beside Jing Yi was enough to calm her nervous state.","\"Mr. Jing, it's quite regrettable we didn't get to chat more during the banquet,\" Wang Boqi said.","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly, maintaining his cultured demeanor, \"You're too kind, Mr. Wang. There will be plenty of opportunities, and I would also like to learn more from you.\"","Though both men wore smiles, the atmosphere crackled with underlying tension.","Jing Yi composed her expression and stood quietly beside them, listening to their casual conversation.","Throughout their exchange, Wang Boqi's eyes occasionally swept over to Jing Yi, gauging her attitude.","Wang Boqi felt displeased - she still hadn't given him an answer after all this time. She had the intention but lacked the courage; perhaps he needed to pressure her a bit more?","Wang Boqi contemplated how to make Jing Yi agree to help him with that matter more quickly.","However, this wasn't the time to discuss it. After chatting briefly, Wang Boqi prepared to leave, but made a point of saying goodbye to Jing Yi.","\"Oh, I almost forgot to mention, Miss Jing, you look particularly radiant today,\" he said with a slight smirk before turning to leave.","Behind him, Jing Yi shuddered at his oily compliment, while Jing Zeyou's gaze darkened - it seemed Wang Boqi was quite confident of his victory.","Watching his retreating figure, Jing Yi spoke softly to Jing Zeyou, \"Brother, see? He's even daring to hint at me in front of you now. He's getting impatient.\"","While Wang Boqi's matter was indeed important, the situation with Shen Huaichu couldn't be overlooked either.","For a moment, Jing Zeyou felt stretched thin, reminiscent of when he first took over Hengjing years ago.","\"What was that about the cake?\"","How close did they have to be for her to instinctively know what food he disliked?","Jing Yi's heart skipped a beat as she explained, \"I really did discover his dislike for cake at a banquet.\" She had remembered it because of Shen Huaichu's memorable expression at the time.","Jing Yi didn't know if it was related to Shen Huaichu's cousin, but seeing his discomfort, she had taken it upon herself to help refuse.","Jing Zeyou sighed softly. Jing Yi might not have noticed the change in her attitude toward Shen Huaichu, but to him, it was quite obvious."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Get Your Invitation","paragraphs":["\"Brother, what do you think about giving this to Jing Yi?\"","Gu Lin held his phone up to Shen Huaichu, showing the gift he planned to give to Jing Yi.","Shen Huaichu glanced at it and nodded without saying a word.","Looking at the photo, Gu Lin seemed quite satisfied. \"When I give it to her, she should be happy, right?\"","He had really liked the gift Jing Yi gave him last time, and it was obvious she had put a lot of thought into it, so naturally, he couldn't be too casual with his return gift.","Hearing this, Shen Huaichu looked up and asked, \"When? What time?\" He didn't even know when to give Jing Yi a gift, so how did Gu Lin know?","Shen Huaichu hadn't received Jing Yi's invitation. She had told him beforehand that the party was part of a plan, so she wouldn't let him attend.","Gu Lin gave Shen Huaichu a strange look. \"Of course, at Jing Yi's birthday party,\" he mumbled. \"When else would it be?\"","Shen Huaichu's eyes flickered slightly, a dangerous glint passing through them. \"She sent you an invitation?\"","Noticing Shen Huaichu's unusual reaction, Gu Lin cautiously probed, \"Brother, didn't you receive one?\"","No way? Not sending his brother an invitation to the birthday party? Was this meant to be a rejection?","Upon getting his answer, Shen Huaichu's eyes narrowed, a dark light passing through them, making his angular face appear even more unfathomable.","She sent an invitation to Gu Lin but not to him? Was she that afraid he would interfere with her plans?","Meanwhile, Jing Yi, who was still discussing the 'performance' details with Jing Zeyou, received a text from Shen Huaichu.","[Shen Huaichu? Why is he calling at this time?]","Jing Yi looked up at Jing Zeyou, \"Big brother, I'll go take this call.\" As she walked out of the room, she didn't notice Jing Zeqian suddenly standing up behind her.","\"What are you doing?\" Jing Zeyou called out to Jing Zeqian, who was about to follow her out.","Jing Zeqian turned back, saying matter-of-factly, \"Going to eavesdrop.\"","Jing Zeyou felt a headache coming on. \"Please, just behave yourself.\"","Jing Zeqian protested, \"It's late at night, that guy definitely has ulterior motives. Shouldn't I go keep an eye on things for Jing Yi?\"","Jing Zeyou sighed - this wasn't just about keeping an eye on things anymore.","Just as he was about to persuade Jing Zeqian, Jing Yi poked her head in from outside, \"Big brother, Second brother, I'm going out for a bit, I'll be right back!\" Before either could react, she had turned and left.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian looked at each other, and Jing Zeqian exploded, \"See! I told you I should have gone to eavesdrop!\"","Jing Zeyou gave him a helpless look - he had already said it wasn't about eavesdropping. Even without eavesdropping, wasn't it obvious that Jing Yi had been called out by Shen Huaichu?","Meanwhile, at the villa's main entrance, a figure stood in the moonlight, casting a long shadow, his expression indifferent as he gazed ahead.","Until a silhouette appeared, and a hint of a smile flickered in his cold eyes.","Jing Yi approached with curved eyes and a smile, \"What's wrong, Mr. Shen, coming to find me so late?\"","Of course, Shen Huaichu had come for the invitation. He looked down at Jing Yi, \"Miss Jing, I'm here for my invitation.\"","Jing Yi asked puzzled, \"What invitation?\"","\"The birthday party invitation.\"","Jing Yi stared at him with wide eyes. Hadn't she already told him before? There were important things to be done at the party, and she wouldn't have time to entertain him, so she wasn't inviting him.","Shen Huaichu was strangely persistent. \"I don't need to be entertained.\"","Jing Yi sighed helplessly, \"It's just a party, what's so great about attending?\" Was this some kind of hobby among CEOs? Always wanting to attend various parties?","\"Then why can't I come?\" After all, Gu Lin could go, Wang Boqi could go, so why couldn't he?","Jing Yi paused. Wasn't it because she was worried about being stretched too thin? Besides, she had a feeling that if Shen Huaichu appeared at the party, things would definitely become more complicated.","\"Well, do you have any particular reason why you must attend?\"","A particular reason?","Shen Huaichu leaned slightly forward, lowering his gaze. His deep eyes carried a meaningful emotion as they fixed steadily on the person before him.","In that instant, Jing Yi seemed to understand the meaning in Shen Huaichu's eyes, and warmth spread from her cheeks to her ears.","She nervously shifted her gaze away, \"Fine, fine, come if you want!\"","Seeing Jing Yi's surrender, a gentle light flickered in Shen Huaichu's cold eyes, and an almost imperceptible smile played at his lips.","The moon emerged hazily from behind the clouds, its silver light falling on the dappled tree shadows. There was no wind, but the two figures stood in complementary silhouette.","...","The first-floor parking area was filled with luxury cars, and guests attending Jing Yi's birthday party were gradually entering the banquet hall.","Today she wore a two-piece formal dress that showed off her slender waist, with puff-shoulder long sleeves adorned with pearls, paired with a cream-colored silk skirt.","The pure diamond on her chest emitted a soft glow, the necklace's main body traced by two strands of top-grade round white diamonds - a gift from Jing Beicheng.","Her slightly curled long hair cascaded over her bare shoulders, the black tresses making her skin appear even more like jade.","At this moment, Jing Yi was arm-in-arm with Lin Ruiqing, greeting various guests while keeping an eye on Wang Boqi, who had already arrived at the banquet hall.","Jing Yi called this party a large-scale performance venue, with only one audience member - Wang Boqi.","\"Brother, how much longer is this going to take?\" Jing Zeqian cast a casual glance at Wang Boqi on the other side, his eyes flashing with impatience.","From putting Jing Yi in danger to now having her birthday party serve this plan, this was the first time Jing Zeqian had doubted Jing Zeyou's work capabilities.","Jing Zeyou slowly raised his wine glass, the liquid inside rippling slightly, \"Soon.\"","Wang Boqi was a suspicious person, and these repeated tests were necessary to firmly fix his perception of 'Jing Yi' in his mind.","Jing Zeqian looked dissatisfied at the person beside him, \"How soon is 'soon'?\" Always using such vague words to brush him off.","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly upward as he raised his glass in a subtle gesture toward Wang Boqi in the distance, saying softly, \"He won't allow the cooperation between the two companies to succeed.\"","This was what Jing Yi had analyzed with Jing Zeyou, gradually unraveling the mystery in his mind.","Jing Zeqian paused - the cooperation with Huarui Group?","He raised a wine glass to his lips, concealing his gaze toward Shen Huaichu.","Compared to the cooperation between Hengjing and Huarui, Jing Zeqian was more concerned about Shen Huaichu's feelings for Jing Yi. They had agreed not to invite Shen Huaichu, yet he had still managed to appear in the banquet hall.","\"Can't believe he still managed to worm his way in!\" Jing Zeqian's expression carried traces of anger.","Jing Zeyou lazily lifted his eyelids - Jing Yi, Wang Boqi, Shen Huaichu - how was this setup so similar to the last banquet?","He had a feeling this party wouldn't be as peaceful as they had imagined."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: I also want to invite Miss Jing to dance","paragraphs":["Wang Boqi didn't disappoint Jing Yi. From the moment he arrived at the banquet, he began observing the interactions between the Jing family members and Jing Yi.","The longer he watched, the more certain he became of his suspicions about the relationship between Jing Yi and the Jing family.","The only thing Wang Boqi couldn't understand was why Shen Huaichu was here.","Perhaps it was just out of respect for Jing Zeyou, Wang Boqi speculated.","Huarui Group and Hengjing were business partners, so attending the birthday party of a partner's sister was perfectly appropriate.","However, after the last time when Jing Yi had inadvertently mentioned Shen Huaichu's food preferences, Wang Boqi had his doubts.","But Wang Boqi preferred to believe it was just a coincidence. Besides, even if Jing Zeyou wanted to form a marriage alliance with the Shen family, the target should be Jing Zejun, not Jing Yi, the fake daughter.","While Wang Boqi was lost in thought, Jing Yi walked over, holding up her dress.","She smiled brightly, \"Boqi, thank you for coming to my birthday party.\"","Wang Boqi maintained his gentle and gentlemanly demeanor. He lifted his hand as if wanting to fix her stray hair but restrained himself due to the presence of others around them.","A passionate yet courteous man.","\"You look beautiful today.\"","This was Wang Boqi's genuine sentiment. He even thought that after acquiring Hengjing, he might consider having some fun with Jing Yi.","Jing Yi lowered her head shyly, while her eyes remained cold.","Wang Boqi looked around, \"Your sister didn't come?\" He hadn't seen Jing Zejun since his arrival.","He remembered how grand Jing Zejun's party had been, like a star surrounded by admirers. In comparison, Jing Yi's party was much more modest.","Seemingly struck by Wang Boqi's observation, Jing Yi smiled awkwardly, \"She's still filming...\" Wang Boqi's lips curved into a slight smile, while his eyes showed sympathy.","\"Is this how they treat you?\"","Jing Yi lowered her head, appearing unwilling to let someone who cared about her witness this undignified scene.","\"I can't stay with you too long, they'll get suspicious.\"","Wang Boqi nodded understandingly, maintaining his devoted expression even as Jing Yi turned away.","As she turned, Jing Yi's eyes grew cold, and she walked straight towards Jing Zeyou.","It was time for the birthday girl's first dance.","Jing Zeqian stood to the side, visibly annoyed. His displeasure wasn't directed at Jing Yi, but at Jing Zeyou.","The decision about who would dance with Jing Yi was made by drawing lots, just as it had been for Jing Zejun's birthday.","What irritated him was that his father, who had already danced with Jing Zejun, was participating in their lottery! Even more frustrating was that he had lost again!","Now he could only watch as Jing Zeyou danced with Jing Yi.","Jing Yi wasn't skilled at dancing, and despite Jing Zeyou's numerous lessons, she was still quite awkward. She was now extremely nervous, afraid of missing a step.","Jing Zeyou tried to ease her tension, \"Yi Yi, don't be nervous, just follow my lead.\" Jing Yi kept staring at their feet, \"Big brother, dancing is really hard.\" Her tone was utterly pitiful.","While leading his sister through the steps, Jing Zeyou kept an eye on Shen Huaichu in the distance.","\"Do you see Shen Huaichu?\" Jing Yi's eyes flickered, showing a hint of guilt, \"Yes.\" She had told him to stay quiet, and so far, he seemed to be complying.","Jing Zeyou had wanted to ask Jing Yi why she had invited Shen Huaichu when they had agreed not to, but seeing the guilt in his sister's eyes, he held his tongue.","At this point, what was there left to ask?","However, until Shen Huaichu met his expectations, he shouldn't be allowed to get too cocky.","Perhaps because she was lost in thought, Jing Yi relaxed a bit and managed to complete the dance following Jing Zeyou's guidance.","But before Jing Yi could catch her breath, Wang Boqi approached. By all logic, he shouldn't have come forward, still mindful of the Jing family's suspicions.","And most importantly, she really didn't want to dance a second time!","Nearby, Shen Huaichu had been quietly observing until this scene unfolded before him.","Wang Boqi and Jing Yi stood at the center of the dance floor, with the man extending his hand gentlemanly, waiting for the radiant young woman's favor.","What a beautiful picture.","In Shen Huaichu's deep, profound gaze, a current of jealousy surfaced. Even knowing it was all an act, he couldn't help but feel envious.","It seemed as though everyone had more right to stand beside Jing Yi than he did.","At that moment, all of Shen Huaichu's self-control seemed to vanish. He made his way through the crowd, step by step, towards Jing Yi, bending slightly and extending his hand.","\"As it happens, I'd also like to request a dance with Miss Jing.\"","Wang Boqi's arrival had already caught Jing Yi off guard, and as she was trying to figure out what to do, another person appeared before her.","Jing Yi froze, looking up to meet those deep, dark eyes that seemed to reveal hidden emotions.","When she came to her senses, she finally realized the predicament before her.","What was Shen Huaichu doing? Hadn't she told him to stay quiet?!","The air around them suddenly froze, and the guests stood stunned, watching the scene unfold.","Jing Zeqian frowned deeply and was about to rush forward, but Jing Zeyou held him back.","If Shen Huaichu hadn't approached, he might have let Jing Zeqian go up to help, but now with representatives from three families standing there, it was too conspicuous.","Nearby, Wang Boqi was equally surprised. Why had Shen Huaichu come forward? Was this also about business cooperation?","Hesitation showed in Jing Yi's eyes. Whether for the sake of the plan or for other reasons, she couldn't choose Shen Huaichu.","She began to raise her hand toward Wang Boqi, who showed a flash of triumph in his eyes.","Suddenly, Shen Huaichu grabbed Jing Yi's hand and pulled her to him, \"Thank you for the honor, Miss Jing.\"","The guests: ...Are we blind?","Before Jing Yi could react, Shen Huaichu had already wrapped an arm around her slender waist and led her to the dance floor.","Left behind, Wang Boqi stared at the scene with wide eyes, furious. He never expected the prestigious CEO of Huarui Group to do something so shameless!","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was startled by Shen Huaichu's actions, \"Shen Huaichu, didn't I tell you to stay quiet?\"","Shen Huaichu gently held Jing Yi's hand, drawing closer, \"It's just one dance, Miss Jing. I haven't wished you happy birthday yet.\" Jing Yi's steps were unsteady; she was in no mood to hear birthday wishes.","\"This isn't just about dancing! What if he becomes suspicious?\"","Shen Huaichu's thin lips pressed together. Was he some shameful third party?","\"That's simple enough to handle, isn't it? Miss Jing, someone as charming as you deserves multiple suitors, don't you think?\"","Jing Yi's heart fluttered, her heartbeat inexplicably quickening as she let Shen Huaichu lead her in the dance.","\"What... what are you saying?\"","Spots of light sparkled around them as Shen Huaichu turned slightly right, guiding Jing Yi in her white gown through a graceful arc.","\"I'm saying, would someone who might never be able to participate in your hobbies,\" Shen Huaichu's gaze was serious, \"be qualified to be one of your suitors?\""]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: A Mad Dog Gone Insane","paragraphs":["Shen Huaichu was doing what a pursuer should do—confessing his feelings.","At that moment, time stood still, and Jing Yi was stunned, her long eyelashes trembling slightly.","She quietly gazed into Shen Huaichu's eyes, and the surrounding music seemed to vanish instantly, leaving only the sound of her heartbeat.","Shen Huaichu gradually slowed his steps, his gaze still fixed on Jing Yi, a hint of unease flashing through his deep eyes as he patiently waited for her answer.","Watching Jing Yi smile sweetly at another person, just thinking that everything about her didn't belong to him, Shen Huaichu found it difficult to maintain his cool composure.","Even if this was all pretense, it still felt the same.","Under Shen Huaichu's direct gaze, Jing Yi tried to organize her chaotic thoughts, struggling to calm her uncontrollable heartbeat.","No! Now wasn't the time to discuss this!","Her heart still racing, Jing Yi blinked and said, \"Mr. Shen, I'm looking for a boyfriend, not a coach.\" What did it matter whether he could race cars with her or not?","Jing Yi hadn't directly answered his second question, but for Shen Huaichu, it was already somewhat good news.","But before joy could appear in his eyes, Jing Yi added, \"However, Mr. Shen, this isn't a yes! You still need to think about how to dispel his suspicions!\"","Shen Huaichu's mood plummeted from cloud nine to rock bottom. He sighed softly, \"Step on me.\" Jing Yi frowned, confused, \"What did you say?\"","Shen Huaichu looked at her, resignation flashing in his eyes, \"Don't we need to dispel his suspicions? Why not treat me as a shameless pursuer?\"","Like a mad dog that had lost all reason, regardless of whether it was part of the plan or if there were many people around, he just wanted to keep her by his side.","Jing Yi's almond eyes showed hesitation, \"...Are you sure? Don't you want to see what I'm wearing first?\" She was wearing high heels today.","A hint of amusement showed in Shen Huaichu's eyes, \"I'm sure.\" The moment he came up, he had already thought of a solution. He couldn't let his selfish desires disrupt Jing Yi's plans.","Jing Yi hesitated, but there was no better option. A flash of sympathy crossed her eyes.","\"...Remember to apply medicine when you get back.\"","Shen Huaichu's lips curled slightly, but in the next second, pain shot through his foot, freezing the smile on his face.","She really hadn't held back at all.","Shen Huaichu continued to hold her hand firmly, completing the dance despite the circumstances.","To onlookers, Jing Yi had clearly shown her dislike for Shen Huaichu.","Meanwhile, Jing Zeqian watched Jing Yi's actions and drew in a sharp breath—was she dancing on the floor or on Shen Huaichu's shoes?","\"Brother, it's good you stopped me, otherwise I might be crippled now...\" Jing Zeyou glanced at him. Though that wasn't what he meant, the thought wasn't wrong.","Jing Zeyou looked in their direction, thoughtful. So this was Shen Huaichu's solution?","It seemed he needed to think more highly of him.","As the ballroom music drew to a close, the dance ended.","Under everyone's gaze, Jing Yi put on an innocent expression and apologized to Shen Huaichu: \"I'm sorry, Mr. Shen, I'm not very good at dancing.\" Then she turned and left.","Shen Huaichu remained standing there, amusement and indulgence flashing in his eyes. He was about to turn and leave.","\"Mr. Shen.\"","Wang Boqi approached.","Shen Huaichu gave him a cold look, like a bottomless dark pool.","Wang Boqi's smile deepened. He hadn't missed the earlier 'show,' and as for Shen Huaichu's displeasure, it was merely embarrassment and anger at being rejected by Jing Yi.","\"I didn't expect Mr. Shen would be the one to dance the second dance with Miss Jing. I thought that fortune would smile upon me.\"","Wang Boqi's voice carried a hint of smugness, his eyes filled with contempt.","So what if he had taken over Huarui Group? So what if he was capable? Jing Yi still favored him over Shen Huaichu.","Shen Huaichu stood opposite him, his gaze stern, maintaining that aloof expression as he spoke in a deep, calm voice.","\"Then I hope Mr. Wang will have such good fortune next time.\"","Wang Boqi chuckled, \"Well, Miss Jing certainly has qualities that make one's heart flutter.\" He stared at Shen Huaichu for two seconds, with a meaningful smile, \"Isn't that right, Mr. Shen?\"","Shen Huaichu narrowed his eyes, his lips drawing into a straight line, \"Naturally, a beautiful lady attracts all gentlemen, nothing strange about that.\" A sharp, fierce intent lurked in the depths of his eyes.","Surprised by Shen Huaichu's frank admission, Wang Boqi was momentarily stunned. Thinking about how Shen Huaichu's object of affection would favor him instead, he grew even more smug.","\"There's nothing strange about it indeed, but Mr. Shen, you can steal something once, but not twice.\" Wang Boqi's voice carried mockery, deliberately drawing out his words, showing off shamelessly as if victory was already his.","Every word seemed deliberately designed to provoke Shen Huaichu's nerves. Even knowing it was all pretense, murderous intent still churned coldly in his heart.","The two men faced off, tension thick in the air.","Not far away, Jing Yi, who was arm-in-arm with Lin Ruiqing, watched this scene with worry flashing in her eyes. Thinking of Wang Boqi's presence, she discreetly looked away.","Seeing Wang Boqi growing more smug, Shen Huaichu finally responded slowly, his tone cold, \"Steal? Mr. Wang, in what capacity are you saying this? Or has the relationship between the Jing and Wang families become that close?\"","Wang Boqi's expression changed, the smugness in his eyes instantly freezing as if a sore spot had been hit. \"Just casual conversation, Mr. Shen. Don't take it to heart.\"","Shen Huaichu watched Wang Boqi's figure, his gaze ice-cold.","Gu Lin hurried over, looking concerned, \"Brother, what did that person say to you?\" Why did his brother look so upset?","Shen Huaichu shook his head, saying nothing, only gesturing for Gu Lin to come closer and placing a hand on his shoulder.","Gu Lin drew in a sharp breath, looking at his foot in shock, \"Jing Yi is really ruthless!\"","What could Shen Huaichu say? He deserved it. \"Don't talk nonsense, my leg is just numb.\" Gu Lin's expression was complicated—you must really be in love.","Just as Gu Lin was about to help him walk to the side, Jing Zeqian approached again.","Gu Lin looked at Shen Huaichu, then at Jing Zeqian—who was really the protagonist of this party?","Shen Huaichu removed his hand from Gu Lin's shoulder and calmly greeted the approaching Jing Zeqian.","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow, his tone playful, \"How are you, Mr. Shen? Need me to call an ambulance?\" If only he could hide the schadenfreude in his eyes, Shen Huaichu might have believed his concern was genuine.","\"Young Mr. Jing is too kind. Yi Yi just doesn't know how to dance and accidentally stepped on my foot a few times.\"","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms, clearly annoyed by Shen Huaichu's attitude, his tone provocative, \"I suppose so. My Yi Yi hardly weighs anything—surely no man would be so injured by just a few steps that he couldn't walk?\"","Gu Lin silently looked at Shen Huaichu's foot, noting several dents in his shoes.","Shen Huaichu remained completely unruffled, his voice still devoid of warmth, \"Of course.\""]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Ah Birthday Gift of a Huge Gold Bar","paragraphs":["Jing Zeqian clicked his tongue, finding it pointless to talk with Shen Huaichu. Shen Huaichu looked at him and asked, \"Does Mr. Jing have something to discuss?\" Surely he hadn't come just to mock him.","Jing Zeqian casually glanced in Wang Boqi's direction and said, \"Nothing much, just thinking it's interesting how any random nobody can strut around in front of Mr. Shen these days.\"","His tone was utterly discourteous, dripping with sarcasm.","While Gu Lin thought the insult was aimed at Wang Boqi, Shen Huaichu knew that Jing Zeqian wasn't sparing anyone – after all, what kind of person was he to allow nobodies to parade around in front of him?","Shen Huaichu's lips twitched slightly as he replied methodically, \"Should Mr. Jing bark back every time a dog barks at him?\"","The smile instantly vanished from Jing Zeqian's face as he cast a cold glance at Shen Huaichu. \"Wasn't Mr. Shen just barking? Or did I hear wrong?\"","Why put on such airs? Did he really think he was that impressive? If he were truly impressive, he wouldn't be so easily provoked. It was only because Shen Huaichu hadn't disrupted Yi Yi's plans; otherwise, he would have had him thrown out!","Gu Lin thought to himself: Why are these two so childish?","Shen Huaichu couldn't even be bothered to pretend anymore. Fidgeting with his watch, he asked directly, \"Mr. Jing, surely you didn't come just to mock me?\" Just get to the point.","Evidently, Shen Huaichu had guessed wrong. Jing Zeqian had indeed come specifically to mock him. He raised his eyebrow, his tone still provocative, \"Yes, that's exactly why I'm here.\"","Shen Huaichu: \"...\" He rarely found himself speechless with anyone, but Jing Zeqian was an exception.","If he weren't Jing Yi's second brother, that \"nobody\" comment would have been thrown right back at him.","\"...Since you've had your fun mocking me, I'll take my leave.\" Shen Huaichu walked past Jing Zeqian with a cold expression, with Gu Lin hurriedly following behind.","Jing Zeqian let out a cold snort and also left the troublesome area.","Jing Zeyou excused himself from the guests and walked toward Jing Zeqian. \"Back from picking a fight?\" Jing Zeqian's eyes widened as he protested, \"What do you mean picking a fight? I went to teach him a lesson.\"","Jing Zeyou couldn't help but laugh at this – he'd rather believe that Shen Huaichu had shown mercy.","Seeing that Jing Zeyou didn't believe him, Jing Zeqian insisted, \"Didn't you see him fleeing in panic?\" Jing Zeyou glanced at Shen Huaichu's retreating figure, noting that his walk seemed somewhat unsteady – it seemed Jing Yi had kicked him quite hard.","It must have been difficult for Shen Huaichu to endure both the pain and the urge to fight back.","Fleeing in panic? He certainly needed to escape – when dealing with someone like that, what else could he do?","...","When the banquet ended and they arrived home, Jing Yi immediately collapsed onto the sofa, muttering, \"Why do we have to hold so many banquets? Why do we have to attend so many banquets?\"","Jing Zeqian followed behind, carrying some gifts from the guests, while Jing Zeyou and Uncle Li were handling the rest.","\"Where should I put these gifts?\" he asked. Jing Yi replied wearily, \"In my room, thanks.\"","She had previously felt excited about opening gifts, but now she couldn't muster any interest at all.","\"What about this one?\"","Jing Zeqian put the other gifts on the floor and helplessly lifted an extremely eye-catching piece – a massive, solid gold sculpture.","What made this gift stand out wasn't just its size, but that it was a dazzling golden hedgehog made of pure gold.","When Jing Zeqian first saw it, he questioned reality, wondering who had such poor taste to not only give gold but specifically make it into a hedgehog?","When he learned it was from Shen Huaichu, he was even more speechless.","It wasn't just his bias against Shen Huaichu; he had never seen anyone court someone with such a gift.","Jing Yi slowly opened her eyes, saw the golden hedgehog in Jing Zeqian's hands, and couldn't help but laugh.","Jing Zeqian watched her laughing heartily and felt even more helpless.","So, what exactly was funny about this?","Jing Yi actually quite liked the gift and planned to keep it in her room, thinking it would brighten her mood to look at it every day.","\"Put that in my room too.\"","Realizing she hadn't tried lifting it yet, she called out to Jing Zeqian, \"Second brother, let me take it.\"","Seeing the eagerness in Jing Yi's eyes, Jing Zeqian handed her the golden hedgehog, but not without warning, \"Careful, it's quite heavy.\"","Jing Yi took the golden hedgehog from Jing Zeqian's hands, and although she had expected it to be heavy, her hands still dipped from the weight.","[It really is heavy!]","Jing Zeqian looked at her mockingly – how could it not be heavy? It was solid gold, and quite a large piece at that.","\"Be careful not to prick yourself.\"","Jing Zeqian was thoroughly disgusted, feeling that even looking at it was an insult to his eyes!","Jing Yi looked at the hedgehog in her arms, smiling with crescent-moon eyes.","Her clear almond eyes sparkled with an indescribable liveliness, clearly showing how much she loved the gift.","[It's quite cute, and such a large piece of gold too, though I'm not sure why it's a hedgehog.]","Jing Yi carefully touched the spikes on the hedgehog's body, finding them quite soft and not prickly at all.","Watching her expression, Jing Zeqian still couldn't understand, \"You really think this hedgehog is cute?\" Since when had Jing Yi's taste become like this?","Jing Yi couldn't help but defend the gift, \"It is cute! Look at its little expression.\" She held it closer to him, wanting him to get a good look at its face.","Jing Zeqian frowned and leaned back, unable to see anything cute about it.","He glanced at it once – it looked strange. He looked again.","Jing Zeyou walked into the living room and saw their equally complex expressions. \"What are you discussing?\" His gaze moved to the golden hedgehog in Jing Yi's arms, and he raised an eyebrow.","This hedgehog looked somewhat familiar.","Jing Zeqian crossed his arms and lounged lazily on the sofa, \"We're talking about the person who sent that gift.\" Jing Zeyou sat down nearby, took the tea brought by Aunt Wang, took a small sip, and asked, \"From Shen Huaichu?\"","Jing Yi nodded, gradually feeling the weight becoming heavier in her hands, and carefully placed it on the sofa, which sank deeply under its weight.","Seeing this, Jing Yi burst out laughing again.","Jing Zeqian looked at her helplessly and couldn't resist asking, \"So, what's so funny?\" This was the second time already.","Could it be some kind of 'love makes everything beautiful' situation?","The thought made Jing Zeqian feel a bit sour inside.","Jing Yi wiped away her tears of laughter and pointed at the hedgehog sitting on the sofa, \"Don't you think it's funny? It looks so cute, and then it just sinks down so heavily.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she started laughing again.","Jing Zeqian was beyond words, but seeing Jing Yi so happy, he couldn't help but laugh along.","Looking at the two laughing foolishly, Jing Zeyou shook his head helplessly, though the corners of his mouth couldn't help but turn upward."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Who Said I Was Rejected","paragraphs":["Gu Lin stared intently at the thin, circular bruise on Shen Huaichu's foot, his expression tense as if he himself had been injured.","Perhaps because the bruise on Shen Huaichu's foot was too painful to look at, even after the doctor had applied medicine, Gu Lin still maintained a worried expression.","\"Brother, was the rejection really that brutal?\"","Gu Lin naturally assumed that Shen Huaichu had been rejected after confessing his feelings, which was why Jing Yi had stepped on him so forcefully.","However, when others get rejected, they usually just get water splashed on them, or if they're lucky, receive the classic \"you're a good person, but we're not compatible\" speech. How did it become so violent with his brother?","Compared to Gu Lin's anxiety, Shen Huaichu seemed completely unfazed, his attention focused on his phone screen as he asked Jing Yi if she liked the gift he had sent.","Whatever Jing Yi said on the other end must have been good, as a hint of a smile appeared in Shen Huaichu's eyes.","Hearing Gu Lin's words, he replied leisurely, \"Who said I was rejected?\" Although Jing Yi hadn't accepted him, her response clearly wasn't a rejection either.","He admitted that in his excitement, he had indeed chosen a rather inappropriate timing.","\"What?!\"","Gu Lin's mouth fell open, the shock evident in his eyes.","If this level of injury didn't count as rejection, would they need to call an ambulance when the actual rejection came?","Shen Huaichu put down his phone and said casually, \"You don't understand. I was the one who disrupted her plans.\" This minor injury was nothing; if he had truly interfered with her plans, her anger would have been much worse.","At this thought, Shen Huaichu's lips curved upward, his expression softening.","Gu Lin, watching from the side, could barely stand to look. His foot was black and blue, yet here he was, acting out some pure romance drama?","He'd never seen anyone's courtship involve getting injured every other day, especially when they weren't even dating yet! Earlier it was bruises on his body, and now, though slightly better, it was just his foot.","Was this why Shen Huaichu thought he hadn't been rejected?","Gu Lin wanted to speak but held back. Was this romance really worth pursuing? At this rate, would their next meeting be in a hospital room?","However, Gu Lin didn't dare voice these thoughts. He shook his head and slouched lazily on the sofa, unable to suppress a hint of schadenfreude.","The most important thing now was that he might be getting a nice long holiday!","Gu Lin's smile widened as he tentatively asked, \"Brother, I guess you won't be able to leave the villa for the next few days?\" He refused to believe his brother would be stubborn enough to go to work in a wheelchair!","If Shen Huaichu couldn't go to the office, it meant he wouldn't have to go to Huarui either! No more working under his brother's watchful eye!","Just thinking about it made Gu Lin excited.","Shen Huaichu glanced at Gu Lin, hearing the anticipation in his voice. \"Yes, I won't be able to go.\" Gu Lin's eyes immediately lit up.","Finally! He was finally going to enjoy some long-overdue leisure time!","But before Gu Lin could celebrate for more than a few seconds, Shen Huaichu's calm voice continued, \"So, until I can move around, you'll stay at the villa and work with me.\"","The words struck like lightning from a clear sky, leaving Gu Lin frozen in place, his joy turning to shock.","He widened his eyes, somewhat anxiously protesting, \"Brother, I can't be of much help to you here!\"","Shen Huaichu leaned back on the sofa, seemingly in a good mood, \"At least you can serve as a crutch.\"","Gu Lin: ...You win this time!","Meanwhile, after the banquet ended, Wang Boqi went directly to see Wang He, ready to implement his plan.","Wang He put down the folder in his hand, his weathered eyes sharp with intensity. \"Are you saying you're completely confident you can use Jing Yi to disrupt the cooperation between Hengjing and Huarui Group?\"","Wang Boqi stood before him, slightly bowing his head, \"Yes, now is the perfect timing.\" The press conference was just days away; there couldn't be a better opportunity.","More importantly, they needed to convince Jing Yi quickly, as she was the key to this plan.","Wang He pondered for a moment before asking sternly, \"How do you plan to do it?\" Wang Boqi's face carried a hint of malice as his lips curved upward.","Wang Boqi's target was Hengjing, though his motivations differed from Wang He's.","Wang He was concerned about the Wang family's status in North River, while Wang Boqi had only one goal from the beginning.","That was to defeat Jing Zeyou!","Simply destroying Hengjing Group would be too wasteful; he wanted Jing Zeyou to watch with his own eyes as his most prized possession was destroyed.","\"So I'll arrange for Jing Yi to steal the cooperation data between the two companies.\"","A beautiful woman was valuable, but merely admiring her would be a waste. She would be most valuable as his pawn.","Besides, wasn't he helping Jing Yi achieve her wish of becoming the Wang family's daughter?","Wang He's expression darkened slightly, offering no opinion on Wang Boqi's plan, neither approval nor disapproval.","\"Are you so certain Jing Yi will work for you?\"","He still felt this move was far too risky. Even if Jing Yi had no blood relation to the Jing family, she was still undeniably a member of their household.","Was it really okay to place their bet on such a person?","Wang Boqi's eyes flashed with displeasure, though his face remained calm as he said, \"Don't worry, I've been observing for a long time.\" If he hadn't tested both the Jing family members and Jing Yi multiple times, Wang Boqi wouldn't dare place a Jing family member in such a position.","Moreover, hadn't his father also had people investigate? Why wouldn't he trust him!","Wang He sighed inwardly. Things had already progressed to this point, and saying more would be pointless, especially since Wang Boqi seemed so confident.","\"If that's the case, go ahead with your plan.\"","All he could do now was remain vigilant, just in case the Jing family had any countermoves planned.","Wang Boqi's face suddenly darkened. Although Wang He hadn't said anything explicit, he could still sense his father's disapproval...","Wang Boqi couldn't understand why his father thought so little of him, when he was Wang He's only son!","In his father's heart, was he really so inferior to Jing Zeyou?!","Wang Boqi's hands clenched quietly at his sides, his head slightly lowered to hide the cold fury in his eyes.","...","\"So, they're ready to make their move?\"","Before the press conference, Jing Zeyou met with Shen Huaichu to discuss Wang Boqi's situation.","Since their target was the cooperation between both companies, Jing Zeyou had to brief Shen Huaichu to avoid any misunderstandings that might affect the outcome.","Jing Zeyou had endured the Wang family for many years, and just as Wang Boqi wanted to take down Hengjing in one strike, Jing Zeyou was also prepared to completely eliminate the threat posed by the Wang family.","Now it was just a matter of who was more capable."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: Probe","paragraphs":["\"If I'm not mistaken, Wang Boqi should be making his move soon.\"","With the upcoming press conference between the two groups, Jing Zeyou was certain Wang Boqi wouldn't have the patience to wait.","Shen Huaichu's eyes flickered with concern, \"What about Jing Yi?\"","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow, calmly lifting his coffee cup, and emphasized, \"Mr. Shen, we're discussing business matters right now.\"","Shen Huaichu didn't back down, meeting Jing Zeyou's gaze, \"Hasn't she already been dragged into your business matters?\" His neutral tone carried a hint of displeasure.","Jing Zeyou's lips curled into a meaningful smile, \"Mr. Shen, as I mentioned before, you're not in a position to discuss this.\"","He would protect his sister himself. As for Shen Huaichu, what right did he have to speak about this?","Shen Huaichu pressed his lips together, his eyes turning cold.","Dealing with Jing Zeqian was difficult enough, but Jing Zeyou was even more challenging.","Jing Zeyou had been wanting to have a proper conversation with Shen Huaichu, and since the latter brought it up, he didn't need to find another opportunity.","\"Mr. Shen, there are some things I think we should discuss sooner rather than later.\" He set down his coffee, his eyes profound, \"As a brother, I don't consider you a suitable match for Yi Yi at all.\"","Shen Huaichu's expression darkened, his face impassive, his eyes revealing complex, indecipherable emotions.","\"The only reason I've allowed her to associate with you is because I want Yi Yi to follow her chosen path.\" Jing Zeyou's smile faded, \"But if you become an obstacle...\"","Jing Zeyou left the sentence unfinished, but the warning in his eyes said everything.","Shen Huaichu met his gaze unflinchingly, his eyes carrying a sharp edge, \"If that time comes, Mr. Jing won't need to intervene.\"","If he ever became an obstacle to Jing Yi, he would remove himself.","Jing Zeyou's lips curved slightly, but he remained silent.","Promises were the least reliable things.","The atmosphere in the office grew tense, an indescribable pressure building between the two men.","...","Wang Boqi had arranged to meet with Jing Yi.","Jing Yi casually looked at the message on her phone, her lips curving upward. Wang Boqi was more impatient than she had imagined.","After informing Mr. and Mrs. Jing Beicheng, she left the Jing residence and drove to meet Wang Boqi.","\"Yi Yi, have you made up your mind?\"","Wang Boqi didn't want to let Jing Yi see his urgency, but he genuinely wanted a quick answer.","Jing Yi bit her lip, appearing to struggle internally, \"Is this really reliable?\"","Her hesitation irritated Wang Boqi, but he maintained his gentle demeanor.","\"Yi Yi, trust me! How could I let you fall into danger? Moreover, I just want to help you reclaim what belongs to you.\"","While Jing Yi appeared moved on the surface, she inwardly dismissed his words. She had never felt that the Jing family belonged to her, and whether he was helping her or himself, they both knew the truth.","When she turned her gaze to Wang Boqi, the conflict in her eyes was replaced with determination.","\"What do I need to do?\"","Wang Boqi controlled his excitement and elation, discreetly glancing around before lowering his voice: \"I need the data information about the cooperation between Hengjing and Huarui Group...\"","As expected, he was after the cooperation between the two companies.","Jing Yi's eyes flickered, showing appropriate confusion, \"Huarui Group? Isn't our target Hengjing?\"","Irritation flashed in Wang Boqi's eyes as he moved closer to Jing Yi, his face showing just the right amount of jealousy, \"What can I do? Who made him steal my second dance?\"","Now Jing Yi was genuinely confused. Why did Wang Boqi always treat her like a fool? Or did she really appear that naive?","Seeing no reaction from Jing Yi, Wang Boqi's lips curved upward, his eyes dark, \"Or perhaps after dancing, you found Shen Huaichu better than me?\"","Wang Boqi was certain that Shen Huaichu had some interest in Jing Yi, perhaps targeting the merger of Hengjing and Huarui Group, or perhaps interested in Jing Yi herself.","He leaned toward the former explanation.","Wang Boqi didn't care about any of this, but if Jing Yi had developed feelings, that would complicate matters.","Jing Yi instantly became wary. Was Wang Boqi testing her?","She laughed as if hearing a joke, \"How could that be possible? I'd never like someone with such an icy face. Didn't you see how I pretended not to know how to dance and kept stepping on his feet?\"","Wang Boqi stared at Jing Yi for a few seconds, his lips curving into a smile, \"I was just joking.\"","He began briefly explaining the cooperation between Hengjing and Huarui Group, \"...so we can't let this cooperation succeed, or it'll be harder for you to take over Hengjing later. Do you understand now?\"","Jing Yi inwardly sighed with relief, pretending to have a sudden realization as she nodded, placing her coffee cup on the table and returning to their previous topic.","\"By the way, how do I get the data you mentioned?\"","Wang Boqi's lips curved upward as he took out a small device and placed it in Jing Yi's hand.","Looking at the USB-like device in her hand, Jing Yi's eyes flashed with understanding. Was this Wang Boqi's 'secret weapon'?","Her heart pounded as she gripped the device tighter. Could this small thing really break up the alliance between Hengjing and Huarui Group so easily?","This wasn't just any USB drive. Despite its small size, Wang Boqi had spent a long time preparing it to ensure success.","All she needed to do was connect it to Jing Zeyou's computer. Once connected, Wang Boqi would easily access all the data on Jing Zeyou's computer.","Over the years, Wang Boqi had made numerous attempts against Hengjing Group, from poaching employees to hiring hackers, all of which had been thwarted by Jing Zeyou. Now, he wanted to see how Jing Zeyou would defend against his own sister.","The mere thought of defeating Jing Zeyou this way filled Wang Boqi with pride.","He would soon prove to his father that he, Wang Boqi, was no less capable than Jing Zeyou! He would lead the Wang family to the pinnacle of North River!","Unlike Wang Boqi's excited state, Jing Yi was struggling to control her emotions. They were at the final step, and she couldn't afford any mistakes at this crucial moment.","Seeing her nervous expression, Wang Boqi thought she was afraid and chuckled, \"Yi Yi, don't worry, it's simple. You just need to plug it into Jing Zeyou's computer.\"","Wang Boqi didn't explain further; after all, Jing Yi was just a courier. Knowing too much wouldn't benefit either of them.","Jing Yi clutched the device tightly and nodded, \"I need to test the waters at Hengjing first. I'll let you know when I find the right opportunity.\"","Wang Boqi smiled and held Jing Yi's hand, his eyes unfathomable, \"Good, I'll wait for you.\" Looking at her beautiful face, Wang Boqi slowly leaned closer.","Jing Yi's eyes flashed with disgust as she instinctively leaned back.","Wang Boqi's dark eyes narrowed as he stared at Jing Yi. This wasn't the first time she had avoided him.","Was she truly conservative, or did she simply dislike his advances?"]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: It's Time to Show Off Your Acting Skills","paragraphs":["Evasion was Jing Yi's instinctive action, but the next second she realized,","Her reaction was a bit too intense!","Sure enough, Wang Boqi said with a smile, \"Yi Yi, you really don't like me getting close to you, do you?\" The smile didn't reach his eyes.","Jing Yi had shown her conservatism from the beginning, and Wang Boqi hoped to completely win her heart rather than just her body.","Perfectly acting the type the other person likes was something Wang Boqi was good at.","However, after a long time, doing this over and over again became boring...","Jing Yi's body tensed, and there was only one thought in her mind: she must quickly dispel Wang Boqi's suspicions!","She looked up in shock, her eyes misted with tears.","\"Wang Boqi, what do you mean? Are you suspecting that I'm using you? Or do you think something has to happen for it to be true love?\" Jing Yi stood there stiffly, as if she had suffered a great injustice, her face on the verge of tears, with tears already welling up in her eyes.","Wang Boqi stared intently at Jing Yi, then returned to his usual gentle demeanor, his expression tinged with a flustered apology.","\"Yi Yi, I didn't mean it that way...\" He reached out towards Jing Yi, but she dodged.","Jing Yi's voice was tinged with sorrow, \"Then what do you mean?! Do you think I have nothing better to do than play this kind of game with you? Or am I so bored that I would risk my entire life to do those things?!\"","To seize the moral high ground first, throw all the problems at the other person, and make them doubt themselves.","However, the effect of pinching the thigh was too good! It hurt so much!","Jing Yi looked utterly dejected, \"I thought my efforts were enough to show my sincerity. You said I was different from those girls, but it seems I still didn't become your exception.\"","Oh my goodness!","Wang Boqi's doubts gradually dissipated, and he lowered his hand, crouching in front of Jing Yi, softly saying, \"I'm sorry, Yi Yi, I shouldn't have doubted you. I was just too nervous about you...\"","Wang Boqi kept apologizing, and Jing Yi deliberately played hard to get for a while until the timing was right, then ended this exhilarating act.","Jing Yi left with slightly swollen eyes, feeling a lingering fear. It was a close call, almost failing...","That night, in Jing Zeyou's study.","Jing Yi opened her palm, revealing a small, U-shaped tool, which was what Wang Boqi had given her.","Jing Zeyou took the item and examined it carefully.","He hadn't checked the internal structure of the tool yet, but according to what Jing Yi said, it should be a professional hacker's tool.","Was it meant to infiltrate his computer?","If things had gone according to Wang Boqi's plan, even if Jing Yi couldn't enter his office, with this small device, she could easily steal other data from Hengjing.","Jing Zeyou had to admit that Wang Boqi's move was well-thought-out.","However, Wang Boqi overlooked the most crucial point.","Jing Yi didn't interrupt Jing Zeyou's thoughts, quietly sitting across the desk, waiting for his next move.","Jing Zeyou looked at Jing Yi, who was lounging on his desk, bored, and his lips curled slightly.","\"You'll tell Wang Boqi in a few days that you can't get into my office, but you can get close to the CEO's office. Then I'll arrange for the company to prepare another computer.\"","Jing Yi looked up, her eyes filled with confusion, \"Why should I say that to him?\"","Jing Zeyou looked at the tool in his hand, his expression inscrutable. Now, it wasn't just Jing Yi and Wang Boqi's game anymore, but his game with Wang Boqi.","Wang Boqi was a suspicious person, every step he took was very cautious.","If Jing Yi easily entered his office and easily obtained the data Wang Boqi wanted, it wouldn't be good news for Wang Boqi, but rather, it would easily arouse his suspicion.","Then, all of Jing Yi's hard work over the past few months would be in vain.","After hearing Jing Zeyou's analysis, Jing Yi looked at the calm and composed Jing Zeyou with a complex expression.","[This is like a mountain road with eighteen bends. In comparison, I'm just a small fry...]","Jing Zeyou's eyes revealed an imperceptible smile.","With this matter settled, it was time to discuss another matter.","\"Besides this, did something else happen between you and Wang Boqi today?\"","Jing Yi subconsciously touched the corner of her eye, noticing Jing Zeyou's gaze, she chuckled dryly and withdrew her hand.","[I thought I had covered it up pretty well, but it should have faded by now, right? Big Brother's eyes are too sharp...]","Jing Zeyou looked at her helplessly. The redness around her eyes was indeed not obvious, or rather, there was hardly any trace.","What caught his attention was Jing Yi's behavior, acting all evasive—anyone could tell something was wrong.","\"It's nothing really, just to dispel Wang Boqi's suspicions. This afternoon...\" Jing Yi told Jing Zeyou about what had happened earlier.","Jing Zeyou's brows furrowed deeper, his expression clouded with worry, \"Yi Yi, leave the rest to me. Don't see Wang Boqi anymore.\"","Jing Zeyou wanted to ensure Jing Yi's safety first. After all, he wasn't infallible, and the closer they got to the end, the more he worried that Wang Boqi wouldn't play by the rules.","Jing Yi saw the worry in Jing Zeyou's expression and smiled sweetly.","\"Don't worry, Big Brother. It's almost over. If I don't see him now, it might raise his suspicions, and that would be a waste of all our efforts.\"","Jing Zeyou looked at Jing Yi's smiling face and sighed inwardly. He was increasingly feeling that Jing Yi was also a very stubborn person.","She seemed so obedient on the surface, but once she made a decision, no one could change her mind.","...","At Shanchi Racing Track, a racing car sped past on the track.","The car's low and wide body, with a retro red color shining like a burning flame under the sun, and white paint on the roof and windows, gave it a sleek design reminiscent of a poised cheetah.","The racing car roared past, the entire track enveloped by the roar of the engine, the driver expertly maneuvering the steering wheel to pass the curves at the fastest speed.","At the critical moment, the car almost skimmed the track surface, sparks flying.","The coach beside the track couldn't help but exclaim, \"Brilliant!\" He seemed very satisfied with the driver's performance.","The red racing car crossed the finish line first, and the driver took off the helmet—it was Jing Yi.","She patted the car's body with satisfaction.","This was a gift from Jing Zeyou to Jing Yi, a Bugatti DI racing upgrade, different from Jing Zeqian's 'Fiery Horse' with its bold and individualistic appearance. This racing car had a unique and contradictory blend of wildness and elegance.","Several other racing cars also crossed the finish line one after another."]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: Can I Be Your Boyfriend","paragraphs":["From the racing car emerged a few men, the one leading with a head of red hair, was none other than Li Chengsheng, the brother Jing Zeqian had introduced to Jing Yi last time.","\"Yi Yi, you're really amazing!\" Li Chengsheng praised.","This wasn't just flattery; he genuinely marveled at Jing Yi's progress.","The last time they met, the gap between them and Jing Yi was within three to four seconds, now it was becoming increasingly evident.","Jing Yi smiled, modestly deflecting the compliments, and started chatting with the group.","Compared to her confrontations with Wang Boqi, racing like this was much more exhilarating.","During this period, Jing Yi had been frequenting the racing track to get accustomed to her new car, inevitably encountering Jing Zeqian's friends.","Initially, Jing Yi felt a bit awkward, but these guys started challenging her during her training sessions, and over time, they became familiar with each other.","Li Chengsheng approached, circling the red racing car a few times, his eyes filled with admiration. \"A Bugatti DI! How cool is that!\"","His companion chuckled, \"I'm afraid it's not just the car that's cool, the driver is even cooler, right?\" With Jing Yi's driving skills, he even wanted to record it to watch repeatedly.","The others nodded in agreement. Jing Yi laughed, \"You're exaggerating too much, you're just being too supportive.\"","Jing Yi didn't take their words seriously, thinking they were just praising her out of respect for Jing Zeqian.","Li Chengsheng smiled helplessly. It was tough dealing with girls these days; whether you spoke truth or jest, they didn't take it to heart.","After being defeated by Jing Yi, Li Chengsheng had completely given up the idea of pursuing her.","There was no way; Jing Yi was too strong, and he had no confidence in winning over such a girl, not to mention Jing Zeqian's watchful eyes warning him from behind.","However, being friends was quite nice.","\"By the way, are you going to participate in the GT Challenge Cup League in the second half of the year?\"","If Jing Yi's previous race was more like a 'celebrity race', this professional league was a contest among professional racers.","In such a professional event, racers from various regions would compete, truly putting their skills to the test.","If one could secure a place in the rankings, it would undoubtedly make a name for themselves in the racing world.","\"Of course.\"","Jing Yi's voice came through, her tone naturally confident.","Li Chengsheng wasn't surprised by Jing Yi's answer. After all, with her abilities, not participating would be a waste.","The group didn't linger long. Seeing Jing Yi's coach approaching, Li Chengsheng and the others said their goodbyes and left.","\"How do you feel?\"","Jing Yi smiled, discussing her driving experience with the coach.","The coach handed Jing Yi a data logger, which recorded her telemetry data from the race.","He explained the details of Jing Yi's racing, analyzing the data in the logger to help her better understand how to further improve her driving skills and competitive level.","\"These are your next training plans.\"","The coach had already mentioned the GT professional league to Jing Yi beforehand.","During this period, Jing Yi had been frequenting the racing track more often, and the coach was formulating the next training plan based on the event and Jing Yi's actual level.","As for Wang Boqi's matter, Jing Zeyou said not to rush, it was better to let him stew in his anxiety for a while. Otherwise, if it was too easy to get, Wang Boqi might start to doubt.","Thus, Jing Yi began to focus on building rapport with her new car without any worries.","The dark red phantom warship sports car stopped at the entrance of the Jing family mansion. Jing Yi looked at the person at the gate.","Shen Huaichu was standing there, seemingly waiting for someone.","Jing Yi coughed lightly, poking her head out of the car, \"Mr. Shen, what a coincidence.\" Shen Huaichu's eyes stirred, walking towards Jing Yi, his lips curving slightly, \"What a coincidence, Miss Jing.\"","To Jing Yi's surprise, Shen Huaichu agreed with her. Jing Yi couldn't help but smile, \"Mr. Shen, if I'm not mistaken, this is my house.\"","Wasn't that a bit too much of a coincidence?","Seeing Jing Yi's smile, Shen Huaichu's mood also brightened, his lips curling into a smile as he simply said, \"Coincidence.\"","He wasn't a lucky person; standing here was just his way of turning chance into certainty.","Jing Yi felt a bit uneasy under Shen Huaichu's gaze and shifted her eyes. \"By the way, how's your foot?\" At the time, she had been quite forceful, and although Shen Huaichu said it was fine, Jing Yi felt it wasn't as simple as he made it out to be.","Thinking of this, Jing Yi didn't wait for Shen Huaichu's reply and continued, \"Do you still have that medicine? If not, I'll get you a few more bottles. It really is quite... effective.\"","Before Jing Yi could finish, Shen Huaichu bent down, the distance between them suddenly shrinking. Jing Yi could see her reflection in his eyes.","\"Miss Jing,\"","Shen Huaichu's gaze lingered on Jing Yi, his eyes seemingly containing some unusual emotion. \"I have something to tell you.\"","For a moment, Jing Yi's heart raced faster, her hands gripping the steering wheel tightly.","\"Last time, what I said was impulsive...\" Jing Yi suddenly looked up at Shen Huaichu, \"Impulsive?\"","So, you only confessed to me on impulse?","\"I originally wanted to wait, to say it in a more formal setting. As you can see, I couldn't hold back.\"","Jing Yi was stunned, her heartbeat momentarily stopping, as if the dark clouds in her heart suddenly dispersed.","Shen Huaichu pursed his lips, his eyes flickering with a hint of nervousness, as if weighing his words.","\"I may never like racing. I think that's fatal, so I tried, and I missed you.\"","\"As you can see, I failed.\"","\"Jing Yi, I don't know how much I like you, but it's enough that even knowing the speed and roar of cars would annoy me, I still want to get on your sports car.\"","'Thump, thump, thump'","Her heart pounded, Jing Yi listened to the rapid beats.","Oh no, it seemed she really had fallen for him.","In front of her, Jing Yi's lively eyes sparkled, she looked at him, her voice soft.","\"Shen Huaichu, your ears are red...\"","Even in confession, Shen Huaichu's expression seemed steady as ever, but the peach blush on his ears revealed his nervousness and discomfort.","Shen Huaichu was taken aback, instinctively covering his ears.","Realizing it, his eyes showed a mix of helplessness and tenderness, the usual coldness in his eyes gone.","So, after all that, Jing Yi only noticed his ears were red?","Shen Huaichu leaned in, his hand propped on the car door, his index finger gently tucking a stray hair behind her ear.","\"So Jing Yi, can you answer my previous question now?\" Jing Yi's eyes didn't blink, clearly feeling his warm breath.","\"Can I be your boyfriend?\"","After a while, Jing Yi finally prepared to say something."]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Running Away in Panic","paragraphs":["At the Jing family's front gate, a sudden honking interrupted the conversation between Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu.","\"Hey, you in front! What are you doing?!\"","The driver, still unsatisfied, pressed the horn several more times, the aggressive honking conveying their irritated mood.","Jing Yi suddenly snapped back to reality, pushing aside her jumbled thoughts.","She looked back and saw it was Jing Zeqian. The panic in her eyes became more evident. \"Um, um, we'll talk about this later, I need to go!\" She couldn't worry about Shen Huaichu anymore - better for everyone to just stay safe for now!","With that, Jing Yi started her car and drove through the gate.","Oddly enough, Shen Huaichu felt that even the car's silhouette seemed to convey a sense of fleeing in panic...","He felt somewhat disappointed, and also annoyed at being interrupted, as he coldly turned to look at the car behind.","Jing Zeqian was there, furiously sticking his head out, glaring at him fiercely.","Shen Huaichu froze slightly, the coldness in his eyes diminishing somewhat.","What a coincidence it had been.","Jing Zeqian was driving home when he spotted Jing Yi's distinctive sports car from afar, along with a somewhat familiar-looking man.","Upon closer inspection, wasn't that Shen Huaichu?","Why were they standing so close? Shen Huaichu was practically leaning into the car!","Jing Zeqian drove closer and glared at Shen Huaichu. \"Mr. Shen, what a coincidence!\" A coincidence to catch him right at their front gate!","Jing Zeqian spoke through gritted teeth, while Shen Huaichu maintained a calm demeanor. \"Good afternoon, Mr. Jing.\"","Jing Zeqian forced a smile, feeling anything but good!","\"Surely Mr. Shen isn't just passing by our house on his way home from work?!\"","He heavily emphasized the words 'our house.'","Shen Huaichu wasn't sure how to respond. If he told the truth, he worried about Jing Yi's situation later; if he lied, claiming he was just passing by the Jing residence after work would be quite far-fetched.","\"...Miss Jing dropped one of her gifts from last time, I came to return it.\"","Jing Zeqian almost laughed from anger. Did returning a gift require leaning your entire body into the car?!","\"Is that so? Did you manage to give her the gift then?\"","Shen Huaichu was genuinely caught off guard. \"Not yet.\"","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow. \"Then let me help you, Mr. Shen. I'll give it to Yi Yi.\"","He wanted to see how Shen Huaichu would get out of this one!","Shen Huaichu was already in an awkward position, but suddenly he seemed to remember something and reached into his suit pocket.","He actually had something prepared?","Jing Zeqian's eyes flashed with surprise; he had assumed it was just an excuse.","Until he saw the actual gift.","It was a miniature golden hedgehog, identical to the large one Jing Yi already had.","Jing Zeqian gave Shen Huaichu a complicated look.","He really couldn't understand what was wrong with this man's taste. How did he always manage to give such unexpected gifts?","Jing Zeqian walked into the living room with the small hedgehog, but Jing Yi was nowhere to be seen. He snorted.","No matter - he had a 'hostage,' so Jing Yi would have to come to him eventually.","Jing Zeqian casually tossed the small hedgehog up and caught it again before heading upstairs to his room.","That evening, in the Jing family living room.","Jing Yi sat cross-legged on the sofa, occasionally sneaking glances at Jing Zeqian.","In contrast, Jing Zeqian seemed oblivious to Jing Yi's glances, contentedly watching a Republican-era drama starring Jing Zejun.","As for Jing Zeyou and the others, they had long noticed the strange atmosphere between the two. Though they all had their own matters to attend to, they gathered in the living room, ready to watch the show unfold.","Several times, Jing Yi seemed about to speak but held back, while Jing Zeqian pretended not to notice.","[This isn't right... Second Brother should have questioned me as soon as he got back. Why hasn't he said anything yet? If he won't speak up, how am I supposed to get the small one back...?]","Hearing this, Jing Zeqian's eyes gleamed with satisfaction.","See? With his 'hostage,' Jing Yi would have to speak up eventually.","Jing Zeyou and the others chatted leisurely, quietly waiting for the show to begin.","Finally, Jing Yi couldn't resist anymore and sidled up to Jing Zeqian with a sweet smile.","\"Second Brother.\"","Jing Zeqian gave a casual \"Mm\" without looking at her.","[Whatever! Better to get it over with!]","Steeling herself, Jing Yi decided to be direct with Jing Zeqian. \"Second Brother, don't you have something to give me?\"","Jing Zeqian seemed confused by her meaning. \"What thing?\"","Now it was certain - Jing Zeqian was deliberately teasing her!","[I knew something was off when he didn't question me right away. So this was his plan all along!]","Jing Yi puffed up her cheeks and secretly glared at him. Since he wouldn't take the bait, she had no choice but to confess.","Her voice softened. \"Second Brother, Shen... he was just talking to me briefly this afternoon.\" She glanced nervously at Jing Zeyou and the others, feeling guilty.","Though Jing Yi hadn't said it directly, Jing Zeyou and the others already knew it was about Shen Huaichu - they were just pretending to chat casually in the living room.","Jing Zeqian let out a smug snort. \"Well, well, I thought you'd keep quiet until dawn. What little hedgehog? You're more like a little turtle.\"","He said the last part very quietly, and Jing Yi didn't catch it. \"Little what?\"","Jing Zeqian coughed lightly, his eyes shifting. \"Nothing. Is this the little thing you mean?\" He pulled something from his pocket.","Jing Zeyou saw the tiny golden hedgehog and paused with his cup midair.","This was... hard to evaluate.","Jing Yi's eyes brightened, and she nodded quickly, reaching for it. \"Hold on.\" Jing Zeqian pulled his hand away.","He wasn't planning to let Jing Yi off so easily - he still hadn't gotten to the bottom of this afternoon's events.","Seeing it wouldn't be so simple, Jing Yi deflated, her shoulders drooping.","[Looks like there's 'no escape'... This Shen Huaichu, causing me so much trouble even when he's not here! If he had something to give me, why didn't he just hand it over? Why spend so much time hemming and hawing this afternoon...]","Lin Ruiqing turned her head toward Jing Beicheng, unable to suppress her smile. Even Jing Beicheng's eyes were twinkling with amusement.","A flash of humor crossed Jing Zeqian's eyes before he quickly resumed his serious expression.","\"Tell me, what did he want with you this afternoon?\"","Jing Yi's pale fingers twisted together as she said softly, \"...Just, just talking about something.\"","[How am I supposed to explain?! Tell them he confessed? Making such a big deal about it would be too embarrassing!]","Remembering Shen Huaichu's confession, Jing Yi's cheeks grew warm, and she lowered her eyes to hide her emotions.","Jing Zeqian snorted coldly. He clearly had ulterior motives - who needs to lean their entire body into a car just to \"talk about something\"?","Nevertheless, he handed the small hedgehog to Jing Yi, though he couldn't resist one last jab.","\"Here you go. Looking at how nervous you are - if you like this little thing so much, I could give you a hundred of them.\"","Jing Yi was surprised that Jing Zeqian would give it to her so readily.","Looking at the tiny hedgehog in her hand, she couldn't help but smile, finding it adorable from every angle. \"Thank you, Second Brother!\"","Lin Ruiqing gave Jing Zeqian a knowing look - it wasn't the gold that Jing Yi loved, but rather the person who gave it to her."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: She is a very lucky person.","paragraphs":["\"Everything has been prepared, President Jing,\" Assistant Chen reported, standing in front of the desk.","Jing Zeyou shifted his gaze from the computer screen. \"Let's take a look,\" he said, rising and walking toward the CEO's office.","The 'preparation' referred to a computer that Jing Zeyou had arranged - one that would convince Wang Boqi that data had been stolen. Setting up this computer wasn't a simple task, and to maintain secrecy, only Assistant Chen and the Software Development Director were involved.","They had put considerable effort into making the data appear authentic enough to convince Wang Boqi that it belonged to Hengjing Group.","In a separate office within the executive suite, the Director responsible for final checks sat at his workstation, eyes fixed intently on the screen.","Upon seeing Jing Zeyou enter, the Director quickly stood up.","\"President.\"","Jing Zeyou gave a slight nod and approached the computer to examine the prepared 'materials.'","The collaboration launch event with Huarui Group was just days away, and Wang Boqi would likely make his move soon.","Yesterday, Jing Yi had approached Jing Zeyou, saying, \"Brother, Wang Boqi seems to be getting anxious.\" Three consecutive phone calls suggested they were approaching a critical moment.","Lost in thought while looking at his fountain pen, Jing Zeyou mused, \"He's indeed planning to use this launch event.\" The anxiety was good - it meant he'd be less likely to question the authenticity of the data.","Setting down his pen, Jing Zeyou looked up at Jing Yi. \"Yi Yi, you can tell Wang Boqi now. Come to Hengjing the day after tomorrow, and I'll handle the rest.\"","Jing Yi nodded seriously and left Jing Zeyou's study to complete his final task.","Jing Zeyou carefully examined every piece of data on the computer. One mistake would mean total failure.","He had to deal with Wang Boqi and the Wang family decisively - not just for Hengjing, but for Jing Yi as well.","\"Here, here, and these areas all need adjustment.\"","Jing Zeyou pointed out several spots, and both the Director and Assistant Chen hurried over to carefully note his concerns.","...","\"Congratulations on wrapping up filming, Zejun,\" Wen Qingyan approached with a bouquet of flowers.","The affection in Wen Qingyan's eyes was unconcealed. Jing Zejun's gaze flickered slightly as she smiled and accepted the flowers.","\"Thank you,\" she said softly, her voice as gentle as if covered by feathers.","Wen Qingyan's lips curved upward involuntarily, his gaze growing even more tender. He was grateful that Jing Zejun had agreed to take on this role.","During this time, their relationship seemed to have grown closer, as Jing Zejun no longer treated him with the formality reserved for senior colleagues.","The atmosphere in the break room grew quiet once again, with undeniable romantic tension filling the not-so-small space.","Jing Zeyou's assistant had quietly slipped away at some point, as the crew had already figured out the nature of their relationship.","Everyone was even anxiously wondering when Wen Qingyan would finally win her heart.","\"When are you planning to return to North River?\" Wen Qingyan broke the silence.","He still had some scenes to film, so he couldn't return yet.","Surrounded by the subtle fragrance of the flowers, Jing Zejun smiled and replied, \"Tomorrow afternoon's flight.\"","The crew had planned a wrap party for tonight, but Jing Zejun had decided to leave early as time was getting tight.","She was still worried about the unresolved situation between Jing Yi and Wang Boqi.","Wen Qingyan nodded, lowering his eyes to hide his disappointment - it would be a while before he could see her again.","Holding the flowers, Jing Zejun looked at him sincerely, \"Thank you for everything during this time, Brother Qingyan.\" During the filming, Jing Zejun had noticed a clear improvement in her acting skills.","Though Wen Qingyan hadn't mentioned it, she could feel his dedication.","Wen Qingyan's eyes suddenly constricted, his tone revealing panic, \"Have you made your decision?\" Hadn't they agreed she would give him an answer later? The filming had just wrapped up, was she already preparing to reject him?","Jing Zejun's words sounded too much like a polite dismissal, as if she was about to say: you're great, but we're not compatible, thank you for taking care of me during this time...","How could Wen Qingyan not be anxious?","Noticing his unusual reaction, Jing Zejun paused, then realized the misunderstanding.","Her eyes sparkled with amusement as she spoke gently, \"Brother Qingyan, you've misunderstood. I was simply expressing my gratitude, not...\"","Meeting Wen Qingyan's panicked yet loving gaze, Jing Zejun seemed to flinch and her voice trailed off.","She lowered her head to avoid his gaze, tightening her grip on the flowers.","Wen Qingyan smiled while looking down, relieved. He gazed at Jing Zejun, his eyes filled with undissolving affection.","The atmosphere grew tense again, and Jing Zejun appeared somewhat uncomfortable.","He shouldn't push her too hard - getting even a small response from Jing Zejun was already the greatest reward.","Wen Qingyan's lips curved into a smile as he returned to his usual gentle demeanor, \"Do you need any help with the situation at the Jing family?\"","Though he probably couldn't be of much help given his abilities, and he didn't really know what the Jing family, or rather Jing Yi, was doing.","All he could sense was Jing Zejun's concern for Jing Yi.","Jing Zejun's lips curved into a smile as she said, \"It's nothing major, my brother and the others have almost resolved it.\" At least that's what Jing Yi had told her.","Jing Zejun hadn't told anyone about Jing Yi and Wang Boqi's situation - each additional person who knew increased the risk.","She had privately investigated the Wang family. On the surface, they seemed to maintain a non-confrontational relationship with the Jing family, but higher-ranking noble families were well aware of the Wang family's ambitious designs on North River's status.","Jing Zejun could find very little information, mostly surface-level details that were even less revealing than what she learned from Jing Zeyou.","However, through Jiang Miaomiao's connections, Jing Zejun had discovered some things about Wang Boqi.","Wang Boqi was an extremely cautious person, so much so that he had crafted an almost obsessively 'perfect' image. He seemed to possess almost every quality that would define an ideal man.","There seemed to be nothing about him that Jiang Miaomiao didn't like.","Except for one thing - he strongly disliked being compared to others. Jiang Miaomiao's assistant had occasionally overheard Wang Boqi's barely contained anger from inside rooms.","Especially when he was compared to members of the Jing family.","What Jing Zejun found strange was Wang Boqi's attitude toward her.","She had only met Wang Boqi a few times at formal events, and from her perspective, it would be a stretch to say they were acquainted.","But Wang Boqi's behavior suggested he knew her, and according to Jiang Miaomiao's assistant, Wang Boqi seemed to think she was a very fortunate person.","Fortunate? Was it just because she had been found and brought back by the Jing family?"]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: Press Conference Controversy","paragraphs":["\"Dear distinguished guests, good morning! Thank you all for attending the 'Technology Towards Innovation' press conference jointly hosted by Hengjing Group and Huarui Group. It is an honor to be gathered here with you all. Hengjing Group has always been committed to...\"","Jing Zeyou and Shen Huaichu sat side by side in the front row, clapping along with everyone else, while the sound of cameras clicking occasionally echoed around them.","Not to mention the collaboration between the two major groups of North River, just the sight of these two sitting together was enough to make the cover of this news.","The reporter looked at the photos he had taken, full of admiration. They were so pleasing to the eye!","Wang Boqi sat in the second row, clapping, his gaze occasionally drifting towards Jing Zeyou in front of him. His lips curled slightly, his eyes as cold and sharp as a snake's.","It was evident that this press conference was grand, but the more grand it was, the harder Jing Zeyou would fall later.","He glanced at the time on his watch; there were still thirty minutes left. In half an hour, Hengjing Group's most proud capital would turn into a joke.","On the other side, the host had already begun to introduce the Hengjing Group's president, who was about to take the stage.","Jing Zeyou stood up and walked to the center of the stage, taking the microphone.","Dressed in a well-tailored dark suit, Jing Zeyou smiled and began to detail the latest product developed in collaboration with Huarui Group, including its innovative functions and breakthrough technologies.","His eyes inadvertently swept over the direction where Wang Boqi was sitting, a fleeting glance before he continued his speech with composure.","The time for their confrontation to reach a conclusion had come.","\"Has the press conference started?\"","Shen Xi leaned over to Jing Yi, who was watching the live broadcast of the Hengjing Group's press conference.","Jing Yi nodded, her gaze fixed on the screen.","There he is!","She spotted Wang Boqi's figure.","Seeing his expression, Jing Yi knew that Wang Boqi was still immersed in his plan, unaware that Jing Zeyou had already taken action.","The worry on Jing Yi's brow eased a bit; now, they just had to wait for the outcome.","Shen Xi glanced at Jing Yi, whose expression was changing rapidly. \"Yi Yi, are you up to something?\" Jing Yi looked up, her face full of mystery. \"I'm saving Hengjing.\"","\"Hahaha... I'm sorry, I didn't mean to laugh at you!\"","Jing Yi looked at Shen Xi, who was already laughing uncontrollably beside her. In this day and age, telling the truth isn't believed anymore.","Ignoring the laughing Shen Xi, Jing Yi turned back to the screen, still keeping a close eye on Wang Boqi.","As for the person next to him, Shen Huaichu, she didn't even glance at him!","He was wearing a dark blue suit today, leaning back in his chair, his dark eyes gazing at the stage, his expression calm and indifferent, unruffled.","He seemed a bit handsome...","Shen Xi noticed Jing Yi's gaze and grinned mischievously. \"What's wrong? Do you think he's a bit handsome?\"","Jing Yi jumped up as if she had been stepped on, trying to cover it up. \"I wasn't looking at Shen Huaichu!\"","Shen Xi crossed her arms and teased, \"I don't think I mentioned you were looking at Shen Huaichu, did I?\" Jing Yi's eyes fluttered in panic, her ears turning red.","Shen Xi found it more and more intriguing and circled around Jing Yi a few times.","\"Did I see wrong? Our Miss Jing is blushing?\"","Jing Yi pursed her lips lightly and ignored Shen Xi, turning back to watch the live broadcast.","But Shen Xi wouldn't let it go that easily. It was clear that something had happened between these two!","Shen Xi gently bumped her shoulder, gossiping. \"You didn't tell me about any progress? I'm your best friend! Spill the beans, did something happen between you two?!\"","Jing Yi couldn't stand her pestering and had to slowly tell her about the incident where Shen Huaichu had blocked her at the door.","The press conference was still ongoing.","Wang Boqi checked his watch more and more frequently, his brows furrowing deeper, the unease in his eyes becoming more apparent.","What was happening? Why hadn't the company followed the plan?","On stage, Shen Huaichu had also finished his brief speech.","Jing Zeyou, with his legs crossed, clapped, his gaze catching the uneasy Wang Boqi, a faint smile playing on his lips.","He couldn't wait any longer!","Wang Boqi decided to leave the press conference. Before he could stand up, his secretary rushed over in a panic, glancing cautiously at Jing Zeyou's direction and whispering in Wang Boqi's ear.","\"The police just took the CEO away, saying he's suspected of stealing commercial secrets and tampering with company accounts...\"","Wang Boqi's face turned pale as he looked at Jing Zeyou.","Jing Zeyou noticed the commotion and turned his head, meeting Wang Boqi's gaze, a small curve forming on his lips.","You lost.","Wang Boqi clenched his fists on both sides of his trousers, the sound of his knuckles cracking, his entire body radiating with rage.","He understood now; he had been played by Jing Yi and Jing Zeyou from the very beginning!","Wang Boqi's face turned green with hatred, his body trembling as he clenched his teeth. \"Let's go!\" The secretary quickly followed Wang Boqi's steps.","Wang Boqi got into the car and lay down in the back seat, closing his eyes, but anyone could see his anger.","The secretary cautiously glanced at the rearview mirror. \"Young Master Wang, where should we go now?\" With the company's chairman arrested, the group was in chaos.","When he opened his eyes again, Wang Boqi's gaze was filled with malice, a strange smile curling his lips.","\"Let's go see an interesting friend.\"","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was still chatting with Shen Xi about Shen Huaichu, unaware that Wang Boqi had left the press conference.","Shen Xi was immersed in the love story of Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu.","Jing Yi almost spat out the coffee in her mouth. \"What love story?! Is that how you summarize the plot?\"","Shen Xi chuckled a few times. It would become a love story sooner or later, so saying it a bit early didn't matter.","Jing Yi gave her a helpless look. With the time approaching, she also needed to meet up with Jing Zeyou.","Big Brother was just over-cautious, worrying that Wang Boqi hadn't been caught and not letting her go out alone.","In broad daylight, would Wang Boqi really dare to grab her in front of so many people?","As Jing Yi was about to stand up, she noticed several black cars stopping by the roadside, and a familiar figure getting out.","Wang Boqi?","Jing Yi's brow furrowed. How did he know she was here? She should have known better than to rush out to meet Shen Xi!","Jing Yi was already regretting her carelessness.","There was no time to think anymore. Jing Yi grabbed Shen Xi and ran out the other door.","Shen Xi almost couldn't keep up with her pace, stumbling a bit. \"What's wrong, Yi Yi?!\"","Wang Boqi noticed their movements. He narrowed his eyes, raised his hand, and signaled his men to block them.","Jing Yi led Shen Xi in running, glancing back at the people chasing them.","No! They couldn't escape like this. If it were just her, it would be fine, but Shen Xi was with her."]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Playing So Big Blocking People on the Street","paragraphs":["Jing Yi glanced at the people chasing after her and said, \"Xi Xi, listen to me. You should leave through the small path on the left and then contact Shen Huaichu.\"","Shen Xi didn't know Jing Zeyou's contact information, but both Shen Huaichu and Jing Zeyou should still be at the press conference.","Shen Xi looked nervously at the burly men behind her and asked, \"What about you?! How will you handle so many people?!\"","Although she didn't know what was happening, the group's aggressive approach clearly meant they weren't to be trifled with. Even if Jing Yi knew martial arts, she couldn't handle so many people.","\"Don't worry about me! They're after me. You need to get out and call for help. Otherwise, we both won't be able to escape! Tell Shen Huaichu to inform my brother. He knows how to find me!\"","Soon, they reached the small path Jing Yi mentioned. She pushed Shen Xi in and turned to run in another direction.","As expected, the black-suited men were only targeting Jing Yi and didn't pay attention to the suddenly missing Shen Xi.","Shen Xi kept running until no one was chasing her, then quickly took out her phone.","Her eyes were red, and her trembling fingers dialed the number.","The call connected!","Shen Xi's voice was choked with sobs, \"Uncle! A group of people is chasing after Yi Yi. Please come and save her!\"","Meanwhile, on the other side, Jing Yi was cornered in an alley.","She looked at the black-suited men in front and the people following behind. It seemed she couldn't escape.","She wondered how there were so many deserted alleys!","Standing in the alley, Jing Yi casually tied up her hair and flexed her fists.","A burly man suddenly emerged from the shadows, attempting to surprise Jing Yi with an attack. Relying on her reflexes, Jing Yi instinctively dodged his punch.","She quickly counterattacked with a left hook to his abdomen, surprising him.","The surrounding men exchanged glances and rushed at Jing Yi together.","She deftly dodged one man's charge, swiftly turned, and kneed another in the chest and abdomen, causing him to bend over in pain. But the others' attacks didn't stop.","Jing Yi leaped up to avoid a low kick from behind, each move hitting the opponents' vital points accurately.","Despite her best efforts, Jing Yi was outnumbered. She dodged a slash, but the knife still grazed her arm, and blood gushed out.","Seeing the wound, Jing Yi frowned slightly. Before she could catch her breath, the opponents launched another round of attacks, making her increasingly exhausted.","The continuous running had already drained her energy. Jing Yi's breathing was heavy and labored, sweat dripping down her forehead and temples, soaking her T-shirt.","She tried to regulate her breathing, took a deep breath, and stood up.","\"You really don't play fair. So many of you to corner me, and you even brought knives?\"","The group didn't respond, instead closing in to form a circle, trapping Jing Yi inside.","Jing Yi's eyes flashed with shrewdness. It seemed a direct assault was unlikely.","As she pondered how to handle the situation, the group stopped moving. A man walked out from behind them, clapping and smiling without reaching his eyes.","\"Impressive indeed!\"","Wang Boqi looked at Jing Yi, shaking his head with a pained expression.","\"Tsk tsk, these men really don't know how to appreciate beauty. Such a pretty face wasted.\"","Jing Yi wiped the blood from the corner of her mouth and smirked, \"Long time no see, Wang Boqi.\"","Wang Boqi approached her and whispered, \"Why are you running, Yi Yi? Just a few days ago, we were so close. Now you avoid me like a snake. It really hurts me.\"","His voice carried a chilling coldness.","Jing Yi lifted her chin, her bright eyes looking at him, and laughed, \"With so many people coming after me, if I didn't run, I'm afraid I wouldn't know how I'd die.\"","He seemed puzzled, turning to look at the hired thugs, \"You mean them?\" He sneered, \"I've known you for so long. Your abilities, I know them well.\"","Jing Yi smiled, \"Thank you for your affirmation, but I'd rather you praise my acting skills.\" She taunted, \"How is it? My acting isn't bad, right?\"","You were completely fooled.","Wang Boqi dropped the fake smile from his lips, \"I'm curious, what did the Jing family give you to make you so loyal to them?\" His cold eyes stared at her, \"Don't tell me it's that disgusting thing called family?\"","Jing Yi chuckled, \"Loyalty is a bit much, but I'm willing.\" After all, her life was a second chance.","Wang Boqi's face showed a few traces of malevolence. He didn't like Jing Yi's appearance, so battered, her curls a bit loose, her clothes and face stained with dirt.","Yet, even in such a state, Wang Boqi could still see a unique sharpness in her.","He sneered, not sparing his harsh words.","\"You're willing to risk your life for the Jing family, but I don't think they value you that much. After all, you're just a foster child. Why take it so seriously?\"","He wanted to shatter their false facade!","Jing Yi seemed indifferent to Wang Boqi's words. The more he lost control, the greater her chance of escape.","She unobtrusively scanned the enemies, quickly calculating a way to escape, deliberately relaxing her tense body, appearing nonchalant.","\"Oh, it's just a small effort.\"","Wang Boqi clenched his fists, his expression contorted for a moment, \"You really don't care about anything.\" He sneered, \"However, I'm quite curious. I've never misjudged anyone, except you, Jing Yi.\"","Jing Yi acknowledged that Wang Boqi was indeed good at reading people. The original owner had indeed worked for him, causing significant crises for Hengjing and Huarui Group. But Wang Boqi never expected the biggest variable to be Jing Yi.","Jing Yi smiled, accidentally pulling at the wound on her lip, but her calm demeanor was unaffected.","\"Mr. Wang, this is a lesson for you, isn't it? Never underestimate women.\"","Her words made Wang Boqi burst into laughter, as if it were the funniest thing. He wiped the tears from the corners of his eyes.","\"'Never underestimate women'? Hahaha, Jing Yi, what right do you have to say that?\"","Jing Yi sat quietly, unaffected by Wang Boqi's spine-chilling laughter. Her frail figure still exuded strength.","Wang Boqi looked at her, his malevolence deepening, \"Women are women, born that way!\" He stretched out his hand and slowly clenched it into a fist.","\"Look, so easily caught by me. You are, Jiang Miaomiao is, they all are! Playthings in my hands. Honestly, you should be like them, obedient, and I might be patient enough to coax you.\""]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: Coincidentally, I'm Not a Soft-Hearted Person Either","paragraphs":["Jing Yi met Wang Boqi's cold gaze with a mocking smile on her lips, remaining silent.","She was waiting for Wang Boqi to come closer.","Wang Boqi stared at Jing Yi intently, his eyes filled with hatred. The calmer she appeared, the deeper his anger grew. \"People who misbehave like you can only be slowly tortured, struggling until their last breath.\"","\"Do you think you're some kind of hero? How naive. Whether here or in the Jing family, you're nothing but a pawn!\"","Just as Wang Boqi finished speaking, Jing Yi quietly reached for the self-defense tool that Jing Zeyou had prepared for her on her bracelet. Suddenly, she moved swiftly, instantly controlling Wang Boqi and pressing the sharp knife against his throat.","\"Nobody move!\" she commanded coldly.","The surrounding henchmen immediately froze, anxiously looking at Wang Boqi.","Wang Boqi's expression changed - he had been outmaneuvered by Jing Yi again, losing due to his carelessness!","\"Jing Yi, well done! Very well done indeed!\" Wang Boqi laughed bitterly in his rage.","Jing Yi's lips curved slightly as she lifted her gaze, her expression remaining calm as she finally responded to his earlier words.","\"A pawn? Did you think you could break me with just words? Wang Boqi, you're far too confident. I now understand why Jiang Miaomiao and the others were so kind to humor your tiny ego, but let me tell you something, Wang Boqi.\"","Her red lips parted as she pronounced each word clearly: \"You've lost. Lost to me, Jing Zeyou's sister.\"","These simple words struck Wang Boqi like a heavy blow.","His eyes changed suddenly, becoming bloodshot and frighteningly fierce. \"No! I will never lose to you people! Never!\"","Jing Yi had lost patience with his ranting. She carelessly glanced at the blood flowing down her arm and faced the group before her.","\"Move aside,\" Jing Yi's voice was firm and cold, brooking no argument.","The thugs exchanged glances. With their boss held hostage, they didn't dare act rashly and hesitantly prepared to clear a path.","\"Don't let her through! Whoever kills her will get a hundred times the usual payment!\"","Wang Boqi's hoarse voice carried a hint of manic desperation. \"Jing Yi, if I die, I'm taking you with me!\"","Hearing this, greed flickered in the thugs' eyes as they closed in again.","Jing Yi remained unfazed, a smile playing on her lips while her eyes remained cold, increasing the pressure of the blade.","\"What's wrong? Is Mr. Wang betting that I won't do it? Coincidentally, I'm not a soft-hearted person either.\" Wang Boqi clearly felt blood trickling down his neck.","For a moment, he truly believed Jing Yi would kill him.","The deeper Jing Yi's smile grew, the more terrifying her aura became, causing the thugs to freeze in place.","How could she manage to be so ruthless while maintaining such an innocent appearance?!","\"A hundred times? That's only if he lives to pay you. I said, move aside!\"","Both sides reached a stalemate.","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu was gripping his steering wheel tightly, his knuckles white with tension as time ticked by, growing increasingly anxious.","His eyes kept scanning the small dot on the screen.","Ten minutes earlier, Shen Huaichu had received a distress call from Shen Xi.","When he received Shen Xi's call, panic immediately flooded his usually impassive eyes.","He found Jing Zeyou, who had just finished a press conference. \"Yi Yi has been kidnapped by Wang Boqi!\" Jing Zeyou's breath caught - his worst fear had come true. He hadn't expected Wang Boqi to become this unhinged!","He forced himself to stay calm, realizing he needed to regain his composure quickly.","The tracker! Jing Yi was wearing the tracker he had given her!","Jing Zeyou immediately took out his phone and began operating it. Shen Huaichu angrily demanded: \"What are you standing around for?!\"","Jing Zeyou continued operating his phone, speaking rapidly: \"I'm Wang Boqi's biggest enemy. Whatever his purpose, he'll contact me first. I need to keep him stable. Yi Yi has the tracker I gave her, and I'm arranging manpower.\"","Shen Huaichu's eyes were filled with anxiety and unease. \"Send me the location!\" He couldn't just stand by watching Jing Zeyou make arrangements.","He couldn't stay still!","Jing Zeyou looked up at him with a complex expression. \"Can you drive?\"","Shen Huaichu repeated, \"Send me the location!\" Of course he could drive - he wouldn't let the car accident remain his weakness.","The two men began working separately.","Meanwhile, in the standoff, seeing Wang Boqi losing more blood and growing increasingly pale, the thugs finally cleared a path.","Jing Yi smiled slightly, dragging Wang Boqi step by step toward the exit.","Just as Jing Yi was about to make a clean getaway, a vicious glint flashed in Wang Boqi's eyes. Taking advantage of her vigilant watch on the thugs, he suddenly struggled violently, trying to break free from her control while simultaneously striking her abdomen with his elbow.","Jing Yi reacted quickly, shifting her body slightly and forcefully kicking Wang Boqi's knee, forcing him to kneel.","The knife's point returned to his neck wound, and Wang Boqi winced, furrowing his brow. Jing Yi said coldly, \"I told you, I'm not a soft-hearted person.\"","Jing Yi's gaze swept over the circle of people behind her, the thugs too frightened to move.","\"Jing Yi, you can't escape unless you plan to keep me with you forever.\"","Ignoring Wang Boqi, Jing Yi calmly continued surveying her surroundings. The alley's exit wasn't far, but she probably couldn't run very far in this condition...","A horn sounded from the alley entrance - Shen Huaichu was waiting there in a black sedan.","Joy flashed in Jing Yi's eyes as she breathed a sigh of relief. Looking at Wang Boqi with a hint of triumph, she said, \"Looks like luck is on my side.\"","Wang Boqi saw Shen Huaichu in the distance, his face contorting with rage, veins bulging.","\"It's because of him?!\"","Wang Boqi suddenly lost all reason, even believing that Jing Yi had betrayed him because of Shen Huaichu.","Jing Yi found it amusing but kindly didn't explain. \"What goes around comes around. Didn't you make Jiang Miaomiao betray my second brother?\"","As they approached the alley entrance, Jing Yi suddenly shoved Wang Boqi away and quickly jumped into the driver's seat that Shen Huaichu had already vacated. The engine roared to life, and the car sped away.","Wang Boqi fell to his knees, clutching his bleeding wound, his eyes filled with rage and humiliation.","\"After them!\"","A group of people rushed out, leaving Wang Boqi staring at the blood on his hands, his menacing gaze growing increasingly disturbing.","As Wang Boqi was about to leave, a bracelet on the ground made him pause. He lifted his chin, signaling his subordinates to bring it to him.","He took the bracelet, narrowing his eyes - it was Jing Yi's bracelet.","Though she had escaped, she'd left something behind that he could use.","After all, his ultimate target was only Jing Zeyou!"]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: Shen Huai Chu, do you believe me","paragraphs":["In the car, Jing Yi had no time to greet Shen Huaichu, despite having many questions racing through her mind.","Why was he here? Since when could he drive? How did he know she was in danger?","But now wasn't the time for questions. Jing Yi gripped the steering wheel tightly, stepped on the gas, and the engine roared as the sports car instantly accelerated forward.","\"Boss, what should we do?\"","Behind them, the thugs arranged by Wang Boqi watched the departing vehicle in panic.","Another thug viciously smacked him, \"What else can we do?! Find a car and chase them! Otherwise, we're all dead meat!\"","The tires screeched against the ground. Shen Huaichu's brow furrowed in pain as he gripped the door handle tightly, his arm muscles tensing. The pain came in waves, making it difficult for him to concentrate.","Taking a deep breath, Shen Huaichu tried to stay calm, \"Turn left!\"","Jing Yi turned the wheel, maneuvering skillfully through traffic, expertly controlling the vehicle to avoid obstacles.","The pursuing cars quickly caught up, trying to force Jing Yi to stop, but she continued adjusting her speed and direction, weaving through the narrow spaces.","\"Turn right at the intersection!\"","Jing Yi noticed something off in Shen Huaichu's voice and quickly glanced at him, concern flashing in her eyes. \"Are you okay?\" Shen Huaichu looked no better than her, his face pale and cold sweat forming on his forehead.","She hadn't known he would react so strongly to being in a car, but they couldn't stop now, or it might be the end for both of them.","Shen Huaichu gritted his teeth, \"I'm fine. How's your wound?\"","Jing Yi shook her head. The moment she grabbed the steering wheel, her heart had started racing, her blood burning with adrenaline, leaving no room to feel the pain from her injuries.","The vehicle suddenly entered a crowded downtown street, with cars packed together. A large truck appeared abruptly on the left side of their black car.","Shen Huaichu's eyes showed clear panic as memories of his parents' car accident began flashing through his mind.","The shattered glass, twisted metal, the screeching of tires against pavement, and the sound of impact with the truck...","These images suffocated him, pulling him into a dark spiral he couldn't escape, his body trembling involuntarily.","Jing Yi calmly considered her next move. They absolutely couldn't stop - those people behind them were as crazy as Wang Boqi, pursuing them recklessly!","She bit her lip, her gaze shifting to the truck ahead, determination gleaming in her eyes.","\"Shen Huaichu, do you trust me?\" she asked.","Her voice pulled him from his shattered memories, his rapid breathing steadying slightly. He looked at her profile and suddenly smiled.","Unlike his usual icy expression that Jing Yi was accustomed to seeing, his eyes now held a gentle warmth, as if expressing his inner feelings.","\"I trust you.\"","Those two simple words made Jing Yi's lips curve upward, her eyes bright with joy.","She floored the gas pedal, charging straight toward the truck without hesitation!","The pursuing thugs watched in disbelief, \"Are they crazy?! Do they have a death wish?!\"","The truck's massive tires rumbled loudly, its imposing presence bearing down on them. Jing Yi felt the powerful air current hitting them head-on. As the truck grew closer, her nerves stretched to their limit.","She aimed for the gap under the truck, planning to slip through at the last possible moment. Time seemed to slow to a crawl, each second feeling like an eternity.","The black car almost touched the truck's undercarriage as Jing Yi sharply turned the wheel. The car body swayed violently, metal scraping against metal with a piercing screech as sparks flew.","The car skillfully passed under the truck, escaping the life-or-death situation.","Jing Yi let out a relieved breath, quickly turning to escape the thugs' line of sight. \"Mr. Shen, I told you my driving was steady!\" she said with a triumphant smile.","Shen Huaichu had kept his eyes fixed on her the entire time, until they completely cleared the truck.","His lips curved up involuntarily, his grip on the handle loosening slightly.","As the car slowed down, the pain in her body demanded Jing Yi's attention again.","Shen Huaichu noticed her furrowed brow and said worriedly, \"I'll take you to the hospital first.\"","The pursuing vehicles hadn't reappeared, meaning they were safe now. Jing Yi didn't insist on driving anymore and switched seats with Shen Huaichu, clutching her wound.","Blood seeped through her fingers as she leaned back in her seat, saying weakly, \"Need to tell my brother first, just him alone.\"","She worried Wang Boqi might have more tricks up his sleeve and wanted to warn Jing Zeyou to be careful.","Meanwhile, Jing Zeyou received photos from Wang Boqi showing the bracelet he had given to Jing Yi.","His heart clenched instantly, his body tensing. \"Wang Boqi, what exactly do you want?!\" Worried sick, Jing Zeyou immediately called, assuming Wang Boqi had captured Jing Yi.","The voice on the other end seemed relaxed, \"Mr. Jing, I don't want anything special.\" The sinister voice continued, \"I just want both you and Jing Yi dead.\"","Jing Zeyou struggled to maintain his composure, his voice unable to hide his anger: \"I'll agree to any demands as long as you don't harm Jing Yi.\" His fists were clenched so tight his nails dug into his palms.","Laughter erupted from the other end of the line, \"Shouldn't you be feeling proud, Jing Zeyou? You completely defeated Huarui Group, even played me for a fool, so why are you begging me now? Aren't you the mighty President of Hengjing?\"","Jing Zeyou tried to suppress his rage, asking coldly, \"Just tell me straight - do you want the data or your father's release?\" He was willing to pay any price to ensure Jing Yi's safety.","Wang Boqi sneered on the other end - none of these things interested him anymore. \"Sorry, Mr. Jing, I don't want any of that.\"","He no longer cared about Hengjing or saving his father; he just wanted Jing Zeyou to disappear from this world completely!","The unease in Jing Zeyou's heart grew stronger - Wang Boqi was truly insane!","Wang Boqi coldly watched Jing Zeyou from a distance, his eyes icy. His men were still chasing Jing Yi, but whether they caught her or not, he had a chance to deal with Jing Zeyou as long as he remained unaware of her escape.","Thinking of his thugs who hadn't reported back yet, Wang Boqi's expression darkened - he needed to eliminate Jing Zeyou before he learned that Jing Yi had escaped!"]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Jing Ze You, I Didn't Lose","paragraphs":["Wang Boqi cared about the Wang Family, right? Did he care about the company?","No, he didn't care about any of those things. Everything he did was just to defeat Jing Zeyou, that's all.","It was laughable. He had lived for over thirty years with only one goal: to defeat Jing Zeyou.","A long time ago, Wang Boqi understood that he had only two paths in life.","Either become Jing Zeyou, or defeat Jing Zeyou.","To the death.","Wang Boqi stood opposite Jing Zeyou, \"Jing Zeyou, you always win. It's about time you lose once, don't you think?\" Jing Zeyou paused, \"Wang Boqi, I never thought of competing with you.\"","The Jing and Wang families were in different industries, and he had thought there was no competition between them, until the Wang Family started making frequent moves.","Wang Boqi seemed angered by Jing Zeyou's words. He stared intensely at Jing Zeyou, his hatred evident.","\"Yes, you never thought about it, but Jing Zeyou, I hate you for that!\"","He was like a clown, chasing after Jing Zeyou for so many years, only to find out in the end that he wasn't even considered a rival!","Wang Boqi suppressed the rage bubbling within him and forced a smile.","\"But let's not forget, your sister is quite like you. Even after I beat her like that, she wouldn't give in. That pretentiousness, just like you.\"","\"You touched her?!\"","Jing Zeyou's voice raised a few notches, his eyes darkening with a chilling intent.","Finally breaking Jing Zeyou's calm facade, Wang Boqi was quite pleased, \"I thought you didn't care about anything. But it seems Jing Yi succeeded, huh? She managed to evoke your pity for your sister?\"","Jing Zeyou clenched his phone, struggling to suppress his anger and stay calm.","Wang Boqi sneered, \"I'm curious, knowing Jing Yi's intentions, how could you let her return to the Jing Family?\" He didn't believe that something the Wang Family could easily find out, Jing Zeyou couldn't.","Wang Boqi was right. Before Jing Yi returned, Jing Zeyou had already investigated everything, including Jing Yi's feelings for Hengjing.","He even discussed it with Jing Beicheng.","\"Forget it, Zeyou. Since your grandmother wants us to take care of her, let's do that. As long as she doesn't endanger the Jing Family, let her do what she wants.\"","Until they heard Jing Yi's true thoughts.","Jing Zeyou had never been so puzzled. How could there be such a contradictory person?","But compared to those cold investigation reports, Jing Zeyou preferred to believe what he saw with his own eyes.","\"Mr. Wang, this is probably the difference between us.\" He trusted his family.","Wang Boqi's face turned green, his bloodshot eyes like demonic red, his face filled with anger.","\"What a joke, just a burden!\" He waved his hand, and his men surrounded them, but the sound of police sirens echoed around.","Wang Boqi looked up sharply at Jing Zeyou, meeting his gaze, \"Wang Boqi, I told you, this is the difference between us.\"","He and his family cared for each other.","Before Wang Boqi came down, Jing Zeyou had already received a message from Shen Huaichu reporting safety.","A group of people rushed in, controlling Wang Boqi's men.","\"Wang Boqi, we suspect you are involved in a kidnapping case. Please come with us to assist in the investigation.\"","Wang Boqi was unwilling. How could he be willing? Just a little more, just a little more and he could have dealt with Jing Zeyou, just a little more!","Every time it was just a little short, he would never be able to surpass Jing Zeyou! Never!","He struggled, his eyes bloodshot, glaring at Jing Zeyou, who remained composed.","Noticing Wang Boqi's resistance, the arresting officers tightened their grip on him.","Wang Boqi's gaze at Jing Zeyou was filled with gloom and madness, muttering, \"I didn't lose, I didn't lose...\"","Jing Zeyou didn't want to engage further. The rest would be handled by others. He needed to check on Jing Yi. Shen Huaichu said they were on their way to the hospital, and he was worried.","As Jing Zeyou turned to leave, Wang Boqi stared at his back, even more frenzied.","\"Jing Zeyou, I didn't lose! Do you think you won? You're wrong. From the moment Jing Zejun was kidnapped, you! Jing Beicheng! The Jing Family! You all lost! I'm still the winner! Forever!\"","Wang Boqi laughed, chilling to the bone.","Jing Zeyou paused, then turned sharply, striding to Wang Boqi and grabbing his collar.","\"What did you just say?! What does Jing Zejun's kidnapping have to do with you?!\"","Wang Boqi's eyes gleamed with satisfaction, his voice sickly mad, \"How does it feel, not finding your sister for over twenty years? I saw her, tiny and helpless, at the amusement park restroom entrance...\"","Jing Zeyou clenched his teeth and couldn't hold back a punch, surrounded by people trying to stop him.","\"Mr. Jing, we will investigate the matter thoroughly. You should...\"","Wang Boqi was taken away, leaving with a sinister smile. Jing Zeyou watched, deeply feeling that Wang Boqi was truly mad.","Meanwhile, at Jiangbei Hospital.","Shen Huaichu sat by the bed, watching over the unconscious Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's wounds had been bandaged, but she still looked pale, possibly from exhaustion or blood loss.","A commotion outside the door grew louder. The door opened, and the Jing Family arrived.","Jing Zeqian had just received a notice from Jing Zeyou and rushed over with his family. Seeing Jing Yi lying in bed, he felt deep guilt and remorse.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zejun quickly approached the bed, almost shedding tears at the sight of Jing Yi.","Shen Huaichu made way, and the Jing Family noticed someone else in the room.","\"Mr. Shen, did you save my daughter?\"","\"No.\" Shen Huaichu shook his head.","Even if he hadn't intervened, Jing Yi could have escaped on her own. By the time he arrived, she was already badly injured. He didn't deserve to claim he saved her.","Jing Beicheng looked deeply at Shen Huaichu, then back at Jing Yi, his eyes filled with worry. The usually lively girl now lay quietly in bed, truly heart-wrenching.","\"What did the doctor say?\"","Shen Huaichu looked at Jing Yi and softly said, \"The doctor said it's nothing serious, just some superficial injuries...\"","Perhaps it was the extra breaths in the room, or the feeling of a tight grip, Jing Yi slowly woke up.","She opened her eyes, seeing the group in the room, her voice hoarse, \"Mom?\"","Seeing Jing Yi awake, Lin Ruiqing moved closer, her eyes red, \"Yi, you're awake! How do you feel?\""]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: The Newly Appointed Boyfriend, Kicked Out","paragraphs":["After Jing Yi woke up, Lin Ruiqing and the others surrounded her with concern. Fortunately, apart from the injury on her arm, the rest were just minor flesh wounds.","However, Lin Ruiqing was still very angry that the whole family had kept her in the dark and allowed Jing Yi to engage in such a dangerous task.","Jing Zeqian and Jing Beicheng stood to the side, not daring to make a sound.","Jing Zejun, seeing Lin Ruiqing's gaze, also felt a bit guilty.","Seeing this, Jing Yi quickly spoke up, \"Mom, it was me who asked Dad and the others to keep it from you...\" Moreover, it was her carelessness that had given Wang Boqi the opportunity.","【If we're going to talk about it, it's all my fault...】","But this time, Lin Ruiqing wasn't so easy to placate. She looked stern and said, \"Yi Yi, you should rest well and not talk.\" Her gaze shifted to the two men beside her, \"You two, come out with me.\"","It was better to give Jing Yi some peace in the hospital room, so any scolding should be done outside.","Jing Yi could only give Jing Zeqian an apologetic and helpless look. She thought, if it weren't for her injuries, she would definitely be among those being scolded.","Jing Zejun's eyes flickered with amusement as he tidied up Jing Yi's blanket, carefully examining the wound on her hand, which was so deep that it showed through to the outside.","Jing Yi turned her head to see Jing Zejun's expression and laughed nonchalantly, \"Jun Jun, it just looks scary, but it's really not that bad.\"","【It's not like I didn't get anything out of it; Wang Boqi's injuries probably aren't much lighter than mine.】","Jing Zejun glared at Jing Yi, who still seemed a bit smug, and was about to say something when he noticed someone standing in the corner.","Shen Huaichu stood there silently, not uttering a word.","Jing Zejun looked at Jing Yi, questioning with his eyes, what was this person doing here?","Jing Yi's expression became a bit awkward. Jing Zejun, who understood immediately, smiled and said, \"Yi Yi, are you hungry?\"","Jing Yi was bewildered, \"Ah?\" Jing Zejun slightly turned his head, glancing at Shen Huaichu, \"I mean, should I go buy you something to eat?\"","Jing Yi felt even more awkward, \"...Okay.\"","【...Am I that obvious?】","Jing Zejun: Very obvious.","With only Jing Yi and Shen Huaichu left in the room, Jing Yi, who was initially a bit nervous, looked at Shen Huaichu standing quietly by the bed and laughed, \"Why aren't you saying anything? Don't you have questions to ask me?\"","Shen Huaichu quickly glanced at her, meeting Jing Yi's watery eyes, her playful expression seemingly reminding him of something.","His throat moved as he swallowed, and he opened his mouth, hesitating.","\"...Does it still hurt?\"","\"...Is that all you want to ask?\"","He quietly sat beside Jing Yi, looking at her wound. If this incident hadn't happened, Shen Huaichu might have started questioning Jing Yi about the previous proposal of being her boyfriend.","But now, all he wanted was for her to be okay.","Shen Huaichu stared intently at Jing Yi, his deep eyes hiding an unspeakable emotion, no longer as indifferent and composed as usual.","\"Does it still hurt?\" he asked again.","When he saw Jing Yi, her sleeve was already stained red with blood from her wound. He didn't know how she had managed to fend off so many people by herself.","Shen Huaichu felt a dull, heavy pain in his heart.","Jing Yi was taken aback, her smile deepening.","Her beautiful almond-shaped eyes curved into crescents, like brilliant fireworks, dazzling and captivating.","\"Shen Huaichu, I just had a feeling, and it seems we're quite compatible.\"","\"So, your previous question is approved!\"","Their gazes met in the air, and Shen Huaichu's heart pounded like a drum, the joy almost overwhelming him.","He gently touched Jing Yi's hand, until he finally held it fully in his own.","\"Yi Yi...\" he was about to say something.","\"Jing Yi Yi!\"","Jing Zeqian pushed the door open, his slightly loud voice deliberately trying to break the moment.","Jing Yi instinctively pulled her hand back.","【I'm not sneaking around like I'm in a secret relationship, why the secrecy?】","Although she thought that, Jing Yi still felt a bit guilty. No matter how quickly she moved, Jing Zeqian still saw their clasped hands.","He knew it! Leaving the two of them alone in the room was never a good idea!","Jing Zeqian looked at Shen Huaichu with an increasingly displeased expression, \"Mr. Shen, don't you have work to do at Huarui Group?\" The hint to leave was clear.","Had Shen Huaichu just started his new position and was already being sent away?","He looked at his newly minted girlfriend, Jing Yi, who chuckled awkwardly, burying her face in the soft blanket, leaving only her lively eyes full of apology visible.","Well, there was no one to back him up now, not even his own girlfriend.","Shen Huaichu stood up, his lips curving slightly in a friendly manner, \"There are indeed some tasks at the company, so I'll leave Yi Yi in your care, Second Brother.\"","Before Jing Zeqian could object, he leaned closer to Jing Yi, gently tidying her stray hair with his long fingers, and softly said, \"I'll be leaving now, I'll come to see you tomorrow.\"","Jing Zeqian watched his retreating back with a huff, turning to see Jing Yi's flushed face, feeling even more annoyed.","...","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou stood in the corridor, the atmosphere around them much more subdued compared to the lively scene in the ward.","\"You mean, the incident where Jun Jun went missing was orchestrated by the Wang family?\" Jing Zeyou's expression was calm, but his heart was seething, \"The specifics are still under investigation, but according to what Wang Boqi said, it's likely connected to the Wang family.\"","He didn't think Wang Boqi was lying; that man always aimed to surpass him. If it were just a fabricated story, Wang Boqi would likely feel ashamed.","Jing Beicheng's face darkened as he tightened his grip on the railing.","\"Mom, the incident happened so long ago, no one blames you, so why won't you come back with me to the country?\"","\"If you want me to live a few more years, don't mention these things about going back.\"","\"Jun Jun, I'm sorry! Grandma is sorry for you!\"","\"Jun Jun's disappearance might have been the Wang family's doing.\"","Jing Beicheng's body trembled slightly, his eyes filled with unconcealed hatred and sorrow. Suddenly, his vision darkened, and he swayed, supported by Jing Zeyou who quickly stepped forward.","\"Dad! Are you okay?\" His father's condition worried Jing Zeyou.","Jing Beicheng closed his eyes, sitting down with Jing Zeyou's support. He began to speak, \"Zeyou, I'm sorry for your grandmother, and I'm sorry for your mother, sorry for Jun Jun, I'm sorry for them!\"","If he hadn't been so headstrong in his youth, how could he have overlooked the Wang family's intentions? If it weren't for his negligence, how could the Wang family have taken advantage?","How could his mother have carried the guilt for nearly twenty years?!","Tears welled up in Jing Beicheng's eyes.","This was the first time in Jing Zeyou's life that he had seen his father in such a state."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: The Truth Unveiled","paragraphs":["Jing Zejun's disappearance had always been a heartache for the Jing family.","For so many years, the Jing family had been in turmoil because of Jing Zejun's situation. Although they hadn't turned against each other, his wife, his mother, and his children all harbored a knot in their hearts.","Due to this incident, his wife's health deteriorated, and his mother had lived alone abroad for nearly two decades!","Now that Jing Zeyou told him this was not an accident but a long-planned scheme, how could Jing Beicheng not feel hatred!","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou remained silent in the corridor for a long time.","Seeing the sorrow in his father's eyes, Jing Zeyou's eyes showed concern as he softly asked, \"Should we tell Mom about this?\" Jing Beicheng snapped back to reality, his words turning into a sigh.","Should they tell Lin Ruiqing? This was also a dilemma for Jing Beicheng.","Privately, he didn't want his wife to be affected by this matter again, but no matter what, she should be entitled to know the truth.","Jing Beicheng gazed into the distance, where Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zejun were also heading towards them, feeling a heavy stone pressing on his heart.","\"Xiao You, why are you only coming now...\"","Jing Beicheng's thoughts were in disarray. He stood up, holding Lin Ruiqing's hand, his solemn expression making her uneasy.","She panicked and asked, \"Is something wrong with Yi Yi?\" She was about to rush to the ward when Jing Beicheng quickly stopped her, \"It's not Yi Yi.\"","Lin Ruiqing stopped, looking at him puzzled, \"What's going on?\"","Jing Beicheng's throat tightened, \"I have something to tell you.\" Since he had decided to reveal the truth, he might as well do it all at once.","Jing Zejun looked towards Jing Zeyou's direction, seeing him also looking serious, so what exactly had happened?","Jing Zejun followed the three into the ward, feeling confused.","In the ward,","Jing Zeyou repeated what he had told Jing Beicheng earlier, and the room fell into a momentary silence.","Jing Yi was stunned for a few seconds, feeling a mix of emotions.","[So, it was all because of the Wang family.]","Lin Ruiqing recalled the face of Jing's grandmother and the image of young Jing Zejun, feeling a piercing pain.","\"It's all my fault, my fault...\" The grief made her throat dry, her voice hoarse.","Jing Zejun's disappearance had always been their fault, the child was theirs, and they hadn't taken good care of him. Even if it was the Wang family, they were targeting them.","How selfish she had been, putting all the guilt and self-blame on her mother to avoid her own collapse!","Lin Ruiqing's hands trembled, looking very pained, feeling a sticky liquid surge from her throat.","\"Ruiqing!\"","\"Mom!\"","\"Mother!\"","If not for Jing Beicheng supporting her, Lin Ruiqing might have already fallen to the ground.","The ward was in chaos for a moment.","In the ward, another bed was added. Jing Yi looked at Lin Ruiqing lying beside her and sighed. Compared to her, Lin Ruiqing's complexion seemed even paler.","The doctor hadn't expected that just after leaving the ward, another patient would be added.","Fortunately, it was just a case of acute anger, and after a few words with Jing Beicheng and others, he left the ward, glancing at the others cautiously before leaving.","Lin Ruiqing lay on the hospital bed, staring blankly at the ceiling. Jing Beicheng held her hand tightly, also bearing this regret.","Jing Zeqian sat in the corner, his head drooping, staring at the ground, lost in thought, and even Jing Zejun's eyes were slightly red.","Seeing the complex expressions of everyone in the ward, Jing Yi sighed.","[It's really like going back to the liberation era. What's the difference between this state and the one at Grandma's memorial service?]","The sorrowful atmosphere in the ward paused for a moment.","Jing Yi looked at Lin Ruiqing beside her and said earnestly, \"Mom, isn't this something to be happy about? Zejun has been found, the bad guys have been caught, and the truth has been uncovered. We should be happy.\"","Jing Yi genuinely felt some happiness. She had successfully escaped danger, the misunderstandings between Jing's grandmother and the family had been resolved, the bad guys had been caught, and she had even gained a boyfriend.","Jing Zeqian snapped back to reality, suddenly looking up. He just knew! Something must have happened between Shen Huaichu and Jing Yi! In just a short time, his sister had become someone else's!","A hint of bitterness surfaced in Jing Zeqian's heart, dispersing some of the sadness.","The sorrow in Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng's eyes also faded slightly.","Jing Yi smiled, \"Dad, Mom, Grandma never blamed anyone. In her heart, Mom has always been a gentle and virtuous daughter-in-law, and Dad has always been a dutiful and filial son.\"","[Although Grandma always complained about Dad's stubbornness and nagging...]","Jing Beicheng's expression suddenly paused, a hint of helplessness flashing in his eyes.","Jing Yi didn't know what the others were thinking and continued, \"Grandma's greatest wish was to find Zejun. Now that he's been found, if she knew that Big Brother had caught the mastermind behind Zejun's abduction, she would be even happier!\"","Her grandmother was never one to dwell on such things. She lived clearly and freely, and even those few short years were enough for Jing Yi to benefit from for a lifetime.","\"I want to live longer, maybe one day I'll really find Zejun, as long as I see him safe and sound.\"","\"Instead of wallowing in guilt and regret every day, I might as well do something real.\"","\"My only selfishness is that I always hope there will be a kind person who will treat Zejun with a little more care.\"","Jing Yi smiled with her eyes curved, thinking of the kind old lady, her eyes sparkling, revealing a sweet smile.","Lin Ruiqing wiped away the tears at the corners of her eyes, trying to sit up with her hands, and Jing Beicheng quickly helped her up.","Lin Ruiqing sat beside Jing Yi, gently stroking her hand, \"Yi Yi is right, Mom will be happy.\"","So, Yi Yi, you are the person she worried about the most before she left. You should live freely and unrestrainedly, and she will be even happier.","Lin Ruiqing didn't say much, but seeing her gaze, Jing Yi's eyes moistened slightly. She held Lin Ruiqing's hand tightly and whispered, \"Yes, it will be.\"","A warm atmosphere spread throughout the corner.","...","The days of recuperation in the hospital bed were just as Jing Yi had imagined, with everything at hand and meals served, almost like living the life of being taken care of in old age.","There was only one thing, it was sometimes a bit noisy.","Jing Yi glanced at Shen Huaichu, who was sitting beside the hospital bed peeling grapes for her. She didn't expect that the president of Huarui Group would also do such things. Jing Yi felt a bit proud.","[This newly appointed boyfriend is quite competent, though he looks more like a kept man I've taken care of, hehe.]","But her pride didn't last long. A few light coughs from Jing Zeqian on the other side of the bed brought Jing Yi's thoughts back.","She quickly withdrew her gaze and obediently sat on the hospital bed eating the apple that Jing Zeqian had peeled and cut for her.","However, the apple lacked a bit of 'fruit tension,' and coupled with Jing Yi's condition of recuperating, it made her look even more like she was just recovering from illness.","[...It's a bit tasteless.]"]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Jing Zeqian VS Shen Huaichu","paragraphs":["Jing Yi sneakily glanced at the peeled grapes Shen Huaichu was preparing, but under Jing Zeqian's watchful gaze, she quickly shifted her eyes back.","Jing Zeqian, seeing Jing Yi's eager expression, knew all too well that she loved grapes.","But he wasn't unwilling to peel them; he just hadn't been able to outpace Shen Huaichu.","Tomorrow, he'd buy dozens of pounds and place them right in front of Shen Huaichu, seeing how many he could peel! Once he was done, Jing Zeqian would take all the flesh and squeeze it into juice!","\"Mr. Shen, you're here early again today, aren't you?\"","Jing Zeqian's tone was dripping with sarcasm, causing Jing Yi to pause and speed up her apple-eating by half a beat.","[Here we go again, here we go again. Who can save me!]","Shen Huaichu's lips curled slightly, his usually indifferent expression softening a bit. \"The work has been done through overtime, but now it's more important to focus on Yi's health. I'm a bit worried about her, so it's better for me to come and check on her myself.\"","As if bewitched, Jing Yi's lips unconsciously lifted into a smile. Realizing the tension between the two men, she resumed gnawing on her apple.","Jing Zeqian snorted coldly, crossing his arms. \"If you can finish work through overtime, it means the workload isn't enough. Huarui Group needs to work harder.\"","With that time, why not learn from Jing Zeyou and see how to be a capable 'workaholic'? Stop hovering around Jing Yi like a fly!","\"...Brother, can't you just speak nicely?\" Jing Yi said helplessly.","[Why does every sentence have to be so sharp?]","Jing Zeqian glared at her. He hadn't even tried to shoo Shen Huaichu away, which was already quite polite of him!","Shen Huaichu, unfazed, continued peeling the grapes. Seeing the plate was full, he moved it in front of Jing Yi and wiped his hands roughly with a wet wipe.","\"Indeed, we need to work harder, or else I won't be worthy of Hengjing's heiress.\"","Jing Zeqian: ...So, Shen Huaichu is also quite thick-skinned.","Jing Yi, munching on the grapes, watched Shen Huaichu's wiping motion.","[A beauty is a beauty. Even wiping hands looks so pleasing to the eye.]","Jing Zeqian was speechless. Could it be that Jing Yi was just bewitched by Shen Huaichu's face?","At that moment, a knock sounded, and Jing Zejun pushed the door open.","Seeing Jing Zeqian and Shen Huaichu in the ward, her steps faltered, even considering leaving for a while.","It wasn't that Jing Zejun was hesitant; she had already encountered such scenes a few times. The best way was to avoid them. Jing Yi on the bed couldn't avoid, but she could...","Before she could retreat, Jing Yi's delighted voice rang out, \"Junjun! You're here!\"","Looks like there's no escape now, Jing Zejun thought with a hint of helplessness and walked in.","She intended to place the lunch she brought for Jing Yi on the table, but it was already piled with various fruits. Jing Zejun had to move some aside to make room.","\"Smells so good! Did Aunt Wang make me some porridge today?\"","Jing Yi leaned over to sniff the lunchbox, her eyes brightening. At this moment, no beauty could compare to Aunt Wang's cooking.","Shen Huaichu's eyes flickered with amusement as he stood up to give Jing Zejun some space.","Jing Yi looked up at him, noticing he had taken his coat. \"Aren't you staying to eat before heading back to the company?\"","Huarui and Hengjing had just held a press conference, and there were still many things to handle, so Shen Huaichu had been quite busy lately.","Shen Huaichu's expression softened. \"Tomorrow, I'll have lunch with you tomorrow. What would you like? I'll have someone prepare it.\"","Jing Zeqian, habitually wanting to mock, saw Jing Yi's happy expression and just pursed his lips, not saying anything.","After Shen Huaichu left, Jing Yi hurriedly opened the lunchbox. The table in front of her was filled with fruits, and she looked up at Jing Zeqian.","\"Brother...\"","Jing Zeqian gave her a sour look, helping to move the fruits off the table, muttering, \"You only call me Brother when you need something; otherwise, it's just Jing Zeqian.\"","Jing Yi glanced at him, defending herself, \"When have I ever called you Jing Zeqian? I'm always very polite, okay.\"","Jing Zeqian pursed his lips. Very polite, my foot!","After a bit of bustling, the three managed to arrange Jing Zejun's lunchboxes on the table.","Jing Zejun had already eaten, so Jing Yi first served a bowl of porridge to Jing Zeqian and then one for herself.","As they ate, they chatted.","\"Seriously, Brother, can we stop competing? I suspect my fruit intake is almost exceeding the limit.\"","Jing Zejun chuckled at Jing Yi's words, picking up a plate of cut fruit to eat.","Jing Zeqian retorted, \"Why don't you tell Shen Huaichu to stop competing?\" Jing Yi looked helplessly at the surrounding fruits.","[Because two-thirds of them are your doing...]","Jing Zeqian was momentarily stumped but stubbornly said, \"I prepared all these for your good, full of essential vitamins! You need to recuperate, so eating more fruit is always beneficial.\"","Jing Yi looked at him helplessly, realizing it was futile to argue. She'd just have to work hard to consume the fruits, pretending it was truly for her health.","She continued sipping her porridge, while Jing Zeqian looked disdainfully at the porridge in his bowl.","Although Aunt Wang had done her best to make it flavorful and nutritious, adding many side dishes, it was still just porridge—how could it compare to something more savory?","Jing Zeqian glanced at Jing Yi, then downed the porridge in one go, causing Jing Yi and Jing Zejun to stare at him in astonishment.","Jing Zejun tentatively asked, \"Brother, are you in a hurry?\" Jing Zeqian looked up, bewildered, \"Huh? No, not really.\"","Seeing his empty bowl, Jing Yi thought he hadn't had enough and reached out, \"Shall I get you some more?\" Jing Zeqian shook his head, \"No, I'll head back to the company in a bit.\"","First, he'd deal with the extra lunch and then get to work.","Watching Jing Zeqian's retreating figure, Jing Yi was more puzzled. \"Didn't he say he wasn't in a hurry?\" But with Jing Zeqian gone, she could finally vent.","\"I sometimes feel like Brother is here just to pick a fight with Shen Huaichu. Every time they argue, they leave one after the other. It's like they're not here to visit me at all.\"","Jing Zejun burst out laughing, affectionately tapping Jing Yi's forehead. \"If Brother hears that, you won't have a peaceful month.\"","Jing Yi chuckled, \"I only dare to complain to you, Junjun. If Brother hears, I'm done for.\""]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Too Many Soft Spots, a Fatal Flaw","paragraphs":["\"But seriously, how did you two get together so quickly?\"","Jing Zejun was still curious about the relationship between Shen Huaichu and Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's face showed a rare awkwardness. \"Because he said he believed in me.\"","In truth, Jing Yi couldn't quite explain why, but she felt those words carried a lot of weight. Few people had ever said such things to her.","Just like the grandmother at the orphanage who always doubted her ability to take care of herself. She knew it was a form of care, that elders instinctively looked after and worried about you.","But over time, she also felt a sense of helplessness. She truly believed she had the capability to take care of herself.","The people she met rarely believed she could live well on her own. Whenever others learned she was an orphan, their first reaction was always sympathy and pity.","Yet, no one ever truly believed that she had lived well on her own for so many years.","For Jing Yi, 'belief' was a beautiful and powerful word.","One day, someone suddenly told her that they believed in her...","\"Mr. Jing, you only have half an hour.\"","Jing Zeyou nodded slightly. Wang Boqi, sitting across from him, looked a bit haggard.","Wang Boqi glanced at the person opposite him, chuckled, \"What? Mr. Jing, coming to me for the truth?\" His voice was a bit hoarse.","Jing Zeyou frowned, not expecting the man to have deteriorated so much in such a short time.","Wang Boqi leaned back in his chair nonchalantly, speaking to himself, \"You're here to find out about the incident when Jing Zejun was kidnapped, right?\"","He had no intention of hiding anything. After all, the Wang family was finished, and so was he. There was no point in keeping this secret any longer.","Jing Zeyou remained silent, waiting for him to speak.","Wang Boqi smirked, \"You're quite patient, Mr. President. Fine, if you won't ask, I'll tell you myself.\"","The incident was indeed as Jing Zeyou had suspected. The battle between the wealthy families had affected a three-year-old girl.","\"Boss, the old lady from the Jing family has taken her granddaughter out.\"","\"No one else with them?\"","\"No, Jing Beicheng and his wife are out too.\"","\"Find an opportunity to take the girl.\"","\"Yes!\"","At that time, Wang Boqi was standing at the door, witnessing his father's 'business tactics' for the first time. He didn't try to stop it; he just wanted to see where they would take the girl.","He went out and found the amusement park mentioned by Wang He and his men. He saw the girl holding a balloon, being covered by someone his father had arranged, and taken from the restroom, then carried into a car.","Wang Boqi watched this scene and suddenly felt a chill. The girl was only three years old...","During that period, Wang Boqi was somewhat out of sorts. He didn't dare to ask his father where they were taking the girl or if she was still alive.","\"What do you mean, the girl is missing?! What am I paying you for? How could you lose a three-year-old girl!\"","\"I don't want to hear any excuses! Clean up the mess!\"","At that moment, Wang Boqi didn't know whether to feel relieved or disappointed.","In the end, he gradually let go of the matter.","Jing Zeyou clenched his fists so hard that his fingertips turned white. It was one thing to guess, but another to hear it from the horse's mouth.","He furrowed his brows, his thin lips pressed into a line, his voice filled with suppressed anger, \"She was only three years old!\"","Wang Boqi chuckled lightly, \"Jing Zeyou, in the Wang family, we don't care about such things. We only care if someone is beneficial to the family.\" His words were cold and detached.","This was one aspect where he felt the Jing family was inferior to the Wangs. \"Your family cares too much about 'relatives.' Your brother is the same, and even that newly found fake heiress. Too many weaknesses, a fatal flaw.\"","Seeing that he was already in this situation, Wang Boqi kindly reminded Jing Zeyou.","For example, last time, a bracelet was enough to make Jing Zeyou lose his composure. If it weren't for a mistake in the Jing Yi link, Wang Boqi would have won.","Jing Zeyou didn't think much of it. The education and values he had been brought up with were vastly different from Wang Boqi's. For him, family was the most important thing, nothing could compare.","Jing Zeyou looked deeply at Wang Boqi, \"Do you want to know about your father's current situation?\" In exchange for him revealing the truth about the past.","Wang Boqi paused for a moment, then quickly returned to his indifferent demeanor, raising his chin slightly, indicating Jing Zeyou to go ahead.","\"He took all the blame on himself.\"","Wang Boqi visibly stiffened, his expression freezing for a few seconds, his mouth twitching awkwardly, \"Is that so? My father probably hoped to leave some people for the Wang family.\"","Despite his nonchalant tone, Jing Zeyou could still feel the impact of Wang He's news on him.","Jing Zeyou stood up, ready to leave, not noticing Wang Boqi behind him moving his lips, smiling bitterly with a hint of bitterness.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi, still recovering in the hospital, was chatting with Shen Xi.","\"What?! You're dating my uncle?!\"","Jing Yi quickly glanced outside, \"Keep it down, this is still a hospital.\" Fortunately, it seemed no one was outside.","But hearing Shen Xi's address, Jing Yi still felt it was strange. How come Shen Huaichu's generation was so high?","Shen Xi immediately covered her mouth, though the shock in her eyes was still evident. She just couldn't help it; her best friend's relationship had made such a breakthrough, how could she not be surprised?","\"When did this happen?! After you escaped? I haven't heard the details yet. Were you touched by him coming to save you? Or did you suddenly realize he was the right person after coming to the hospital?\"","Shen Xi's eyes sparkled as she looked at Jing Yi, her words flowing without pause.","Jing Yi was speechless, watching Shen Xi develop the plot on her own. It had always been like this; give her a keyword, and she could weave a complete love story.","\"Which question do you want me to answer first?\"","Shen Xi tried to suppress her excitement, looking at Jing Yi with curiosity, \"When did you get together? After coming back?\" Jing Yi had to briefly recount Shen Huaichu's confession to her.","Perhaps because the story wasn't exciting enough, Shen Xi's expression showed some disappointment, \"Is that it?\" She had expected something more thrilling.","Jing Yi lightly tapped her forehead, \"Do you think I'm acting in Titanic?\" Shen Xi chuckled, \"Well, escaping from those people was thrilling enough.\"","Thinking back, Shen Xi still felt a bit scared, holding Jing Yi's hand and earnestly advising, \"You should take more bodyguards with you in the future! No matter how strong you are, you can't fight a whole group.\"","Shen Xi almost couldn't walk after making that phone call, curling up in place waiting for news, terrified that something might happen to Jing Yi.","After that accident, Shen Xi's family was also worried for a long time, arranging several bodyguards for her."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Not Aligned with the Overbearing CEO Persona","paragraphs":["Jing Yi was no stranger to being constantly reminded by her family.","Jing Zeqian was already quite nagging, and after this incident, he became even more so.","The problem was, almost everyone in the family had turned into Jing Zeqian...","Except for Jing Beicheng, who wasn't much of a talker, but even he had increased his concern for Jing Yi significantly.","Jing Yi flopped onto the bed in resignation, \"I feel like I'm turning into a salted fish.\" Shen Xi chuckled at her helpless demeanor, \"Isn't becoming a salted fish your lifelong goal?\"","Jing Yi's muffled voice came through, \"...Not a salted fish that can only lie on a hospital bed. I want to be a free salted fish.\"","Are salted fish really divided into free and unfree?","Shen Xi could only comfort her that she would be discharged in a few days, though Jing Yi had heard this countless times already.","Jing Zeqian, who had been nagged by Jing Yi, brought the snacks she had requested to the hospital, only to find her missing from the room.","Jing Zeqian looked puzzled at Lin Ruiqing, \"Mom, where's Jing Yi?\" After asking him to buy so many things, she wasn't even in the room.","Was that reasonable?","\"She went out to bask in the sun with Zeyou.\"","Lin Ruiqing noticed the snacks Jing Zeqian was carrying and frowned slightly, \"Why did you bring those snacks? Yi needs to recuperate and can't eat these miscellaneous things.\"","Jing Zeqian felt utterly wronged. It wasn't his idea to bring them; Jing Yi had insisted on it! She had even specified each store, fearing he would casually skimp on her.","But Jing Zeqian didn't dare tell the truth to Lin Ruiqing. Since she had already scolded him, there was no need to let Jing Yi get scolded again.","Seeing Lin Ruiqing about to confiscate the snacks, Jing Zeqian quickly hid some, trying to slip by unnoticed, but Lin Ruiqing caught him.","Jing Zeqian grinned, \"I'll eat these myself, myself.\" He stuffed the snacks into his pocket as he spoke.","Lin Ruiqing looked at him disapprovingly, muttering, \"You're so old and still eating these snacks.\" She also reminded him, \"Don't tease Yi with them in front of her.\"","Jing Zeqian felt even more wronged. Was it easy for him to let Jing Yi have a taste of what she wanted?","Walking in the hospital's small park with Jing Zeyou, Jing Yi stretched and took a deep breath, savoring the long-awaited sunshine.","Jing Zeyou helped Jing Yi to a bench to rest, then crouched in front of her, handing her the sunscreen shirt he had brought, remembering her usual sunbathing essentials.","\"Big Brother, my injury is almost healed. Can I go home now?\" Her voice sounded pitiful.","\"I'll ask the doctor later. If there's no problem, I'll take you home in a few days.\"","Jing Yi smiled brightly, her tone full of joy, \"That's great! Finally, I can go home!\" She now understood how Lin Ruiqing felt during her hospital stay.","Jing Zeyou smiled at her and sat beside her, enjoying the sun together.","The environment of this small garden was excellent, with a sea of green and a quiet atmosphere, the sunlight filtering through the leaves onto them.","\"It's been a long time since I've sunbathed with Big Brother!\"","Jing Zeyou's lips unconsciously curved upwards. It had indeed been a while since the last time, which was when Jing Yi first came to the Jing family. Little did he expect so much would happen during this period.","Jing Yi closed her eyes, enjoying the sun, and said, \"Big Brother, do you have something on your mind?\"","\"Why do you ask?\"","He wasn't one to show his emotions easily, so Jing Zeyou was a bit surprised that Jing Yi could so keenly sense his mood.","\"Just a feeling.\"","Jing Zeyou was taken aback, then smiled gently, \"There are some things I can't figure out.\"","Jing Yi opened her eyes and sat up straight, \"Do you want to talk about it?\"","[Today's 'Sister of Understanding' is online!]","Jing Zeyou's eyes carried a faint smile as he told Jing Yi about his meeting with Wang Boqi.","The hostility from the Wang family towards the Jing family didn't surprise Jing Zeyou, but he had never thought his influence on Wang Boqi would be so profound.","Jing Yi nodded in agreement, thinking of her previous provocations towards Wang Boqi. The impact was indeed significant, almost to the point of obsession.","How much of the 'defeat Jing Zeyou' concept had Wang He instilled in Wang Boqi to create such a deep-rooted obsession?","Jing Zeyou wouldn't let Wang Boqi off the hook. Not only because of Jing Zejun's incident, but also because Jing Yi had suffered so much because of him.","However, he and Wang Boqi had known each other since childhood. He had imagined they might become enemies, but he hadn't expected such a stark opposition.","Jing Yi listened quietly to Jing Zeyou, knowing that he was not in a good place emotionally. As the CEO of Hengjing, he seemed glamorous, but Jing Yi knew how much Jing Zeyou had sacrificed after joining the Jing family.","[Being 'someone else's child' isn't that easy.]","Although Jing Yi often teased Jing Zeyou as a 'workaholic,' it was for Hengjing that he pushed himself so hard.","Looking at Jing Zeyou, Jing Yi suddenly said, \"Big Brother, do you know? You're the least like a domineering CEO I've ever seen.\"","His decisiveness and wisdom couldn't hide the fact that Jing Zeyou was inherently kind.","Hearing this, Jing Zeyou was puzzled. What did it mean to be unlike a domineering CEO?","Jing Yi's lips curved suddenly, her cheeks showing a deep and shallow dimple, revealing a touch of natural cuteness.","Jing Beicheng was stern, Jing Zeqian was arrogant, Shen Huaichu was cold.","Only Jing Zeyou, she didn't know how to describe him with a single word, or rather, she felt that no word could fully capture the goodness of Jing Zeyou.","To her, Jing Zeyou felt like an unfinished sketch, not perfect, just with a rough outline.","But the artist couldn't add any more strokes, because each stroke wouldn't make the sketch better.","\"In short, being a relative or friend of Big Brother must be a very happy thing.\"","For a moment, Jing Zeyou was taken aback, feeling something in his heart touched.","For over thirty years, he had heard all kinds of praise, whether it was for his intelligence or his resourcefulness, none had been as touching as Jing Yi's words.","After a while, his lips curved slightly, \"This is the most pleasing compliment I've heard in so many years.\"","Jing Yi couldn't help but smile, her dimples faintly visible, shining brightly under the sun.","The breeze rustled the leaves, and Jing Zeyou sat beside Jing Yi, feeling the warmth of the sun on his body, his heart filled with peace.","\"Brother! Jing Yi!\"","Well, the peace was shattered.","Jing Zeyou opened his eyes to see who it was, and for a moment, he wondered if his dear brother couldn't stand to see him idle."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: The 'United' Operation","paragraphs":["The brief moment of relaxation was over. Jing Zeyou escorted Jing Yi back to her ward, preparing to find the doctor to inquire about her discharge.","After taking just a few steps, he stopped and turned to see Jing Zeqian following behind, feeling somewhat helpless.","\"Why are you following me?\"","Jing Zeqian took half a step forward, whispering mysteriously, \"Brother, have you talked to Jing Yi about Shen Huaichu?\" Jing Zeyou gave him a strange look. \"No.\"","Jing Zeqian widened his eyes in disbelief. \"What? You've been down here for so long, and you haven't even mentioned Shen Huaichu?\"","He had thought his brother had come down to enjoy the sun just to have a good chat with Jing Yi, but it turned out they were just sunbathing! How much did they enjoy this sunbathing activity!","\"Why would we talk about Shen Huaichu?\"","Jing Zeqian widened his eyes even more, clearly not expecting Jing Zeyou to ask such a question.","Why? Of course, it's to understand your sister's love life!","Jing Zeyou had never been too pleased with Shen Huaichu, but now he didn't even ask about it?","Jing Zeyou did feel that Shen Huaichu was not suitable for Jing Yi, but since they were already dating, he couldn't interfere too much unless Shen Huaichu hurt Jing Yi.","Thinking of this, a hint of coldness flashed in Jing Zeyou's eyes.","Jing Zeqian frowned and snorted, \"How do you know he'll treat Jing Yi well? What if Jing Yi still gets hurt?\" Although Jing Zeqian's concerns made sense, Jing Zeyou still wasn't entirely at ease.","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow at his words. \"You're not the Queen Mother, why are you always trying to break people apart?\" His voice carried a subtle hint of laughter.","Jing Zeyou's life philosophy was—everything must be experienced personally to understand.","No matter how much one talks, it's all part of Jing Yi's life. He hoped she could walk the path she wanted, not the one planned by her family.","On this path, Jing Zeyou could advise, even scout ahead, but he couldn't interfere.","Moreover, it should be discussed with Shen Huaichu, about how he should treat Jing Yi better, rather than with Jing Yi, putting her in a dilemma.","\"Besides, if persuasion worked, didn't Jing Yi always advise you to be wary of Jiang Miaomiao? Did you listen?\"","At that time, Jing Zeqian himself wasn't taking it seriously either.","Jing Zeqian was about to retort but found himself somewhat convinced by Jing Zeyou's words.","Jing Zeyou continued walking forward, \"Stop worrying so much. Instead of this, why not think about your company's future development?\" If he didn't put in more effort, how would 'Startrack' dominate the industry?","Jing Zeqian silently watched Jing Zeyou's back. His brother always talked about work in three sentences.","He sighed and turned back to the ward.","Inside the ward, Lin Ruiqing and her husband were absent, leaving Jing Yi alone on the bed, bored and playing a racing game.","Jing Zeqian approached, looking somewhat disdainful. \"You even play racing games? What's the fun? I'll take you to the wilderness!\"","Jing Yi didn't even look up, still focused on the screen. \"No, you're too bad at it.\"","Jing Zeqian was the type who was bad at games but had a big appetite for them. Take the last wilderness game, for example. He didn't care how many opponents there were, just charged forward with his gear, yelling for her to support him.","Support, my foot! The five opponents ganged up on him, and he didn't even have time to wait for rescue.","\"And you want to take me? When have you ever made it into the top ten?\"","\"That's because they had the numbers! Besides, they had better gear! Just wait, I'll get a few internal accounts, and I won't believe I can't win!\"","Jing Yi put down her phone, giving him a helpless look. \"Brother, if this keeps up, you'll have to buy the game to win.\"","Jing Zeqian: \"...Not a bad idea.\" He'll have them open an internal account for him, one he can dominate!","Jing Yi rolled her eyes, not bothering to argue with him.","【Bad at games but addicted】","Jing Zeqian wasn't angry. He slowly took out a few packs of snacks from his pocket, deliberately waving them in front of Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's eyes lit up, reaching out to grab them. \"How did you get these? I thought Mom took them all.\"","When Jing Yi returned, she saw Lin Ruiqing holding a large bag of snacks. She was very familiar with it because Jing Yi had asked Jing Zeqian to bring them for her.","But before Jing Yi could say anything, Lin Ruiqing started scolding Jing Zeqian, saying how he was so old and still eating these snacks, deliberately showing off in front of her.","Jing Yi didn't dare to speak, letting Lin Ruiqing take the snacks away, though she was crying inside.","To think she could still get a few packs!","Jing Zeqian looked at her triumphantly. \"How about it? Still think your second brother is bad at games? You don't know how much trouble I went through to hide these snacks.\"","Jing Yi looked up at him, her eyes smiling. \"Thank you, Second Brother!\" Then she eagerly tore open the packaging and started tasting them.","Jing Zeqian chuckled at her. \"Mom really should see this, who's the real child here.\" He couldn't understand how she was so obsessed with food.","Seeing Jing Yi enjoying the snacks, Jing Zeqian also took one to try, frowning slightly. \"The taste is just average.\"","And then he kept eating one after another.","Jing Yi glanced at him but didn't say anything.","【Considering how hard he worked to bring her snacks, she won't complain, but he always does this! Says it's average, then eats it all in one go!】","Jing Zeqian paused, that complaint still reached his ears.","Before he could confront Jing Yi, the voices of Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zeyou came from outside the ward.","\"Is that so? Will Yi Yi be discharged soon?\"","Inside the ward, Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian exchanged a glance, seeing the panic in each other's eyes, and simultaneously pushed the snacks to each other.","\"You take them!\"","\"Quick, take them away!\"","Jing Zeqian panicked, clutching all the packaging to his chest. \"Where should I take them?!\"","Jing Yi had no time to care about him. \"Anywhere!\" She frantically waved away the snack smell, checking for any missed spots.","Just as Lin Ruiqing was about to enter, Jing Zeqian could only rush to the window sill, holding the snack packages in his clothes, staring blankly outside.","Lin Ruiqing saw this scene and looked at him strangely. \"Xiao Qian, why are you standing there?\"","Jing Zeqian forced a laugh, awkwardly saying, \"The flowers outside are in full bloom, quite beautiful, just admiring them...\"","Lin Ruiqing: ?","There's a lake outside, where are the flowers?","Jing Zeyou seemed to sense something and looked at Jing Yi, who also had an unnatural expression.","He observed discreetly. Why was Jing Zeqian holding so tightly? His gaze shifted to the ground.","A small snack package.","So, just sneaking snacks?","Jing Zeyou sighed, did they have to be so childish?","He silently walked over and stepped on the snack package."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Jing Yi's Cameo","paragraphs":["\"Look! Isn't that the CEO's sister?!\"","\"What are you talking about? Of course she's in Jing Zejun's drama - she's the female lead!\"","\"No, I mean Jing Yi!\"","\"What?! Let me see!\"","At Startrack, two employees were discussing the recently popular drama \"19th Floor Campus,\" starring Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan.","After its release, the drama quickly topped the rankings on all major streaming platforms.","The previously dismissive employee stared intently at the screen - that character called 'Chen Xiaoxiao,' who else could it be but Jing Yi?!","She was shocked, \"Is it just a cameo? Why wasn't this mentioned in any promotions?!\"","The director of \"19th Floor Campus\" had deliberately kept it secret, after all, she was someone who required complete confidentiality during filming - it was meant to be a surprise.","The two became engrossed as they watched, immersed in the latest episode.","\"You know what, Jing Yi's acting is really good.\"","\"But do you think she's planning to enter the entertainment industry?\"","Her colleague, who quite liked Jing Yi, wasn't pleased with that comment, \"Who said that? She probably just did a cameo, and besides, isn't her acting better than 80% of celebrities out there?\"","\"You're being way too biased.\"","\"What cameo?\" a familiar, clear voice came from behind them.","Their hearts skipped a beat as they quickly looked up to see Jing Zeqian standing behind them, his slender eyes scanning both of them.","\"Mr. Jing!\"","One employee hastily turned off her phone, though Jing Zeqian had already caught a glimpse of the screen showing his sister's new drama with Wen Qingyan.","\"Watching dramas during work hours?\"","Jing Zeqian deliberately emphasized each word with an air of casual indifference.","The two looked even more flustered, but one of them bit her lip and tried to maintain composure: \"Mr. Jing, we... we were analyzing data. Mr. Wen's drama is trending right now, and we were discussing how to capitalize on the traffic.\"","Jing Zeqian raised an eyebrow. He hadn't actually intended to do anything about it - some relaxation was good for employee wellbeing, especially since it was the company's own actor's drama.","\"Don't let it happen again.\"","The two sighed in relief and stood at attention, \"Yes, sir!\"","\"What were you saying about a cameo?\"","The employee quickly turned her phone screen back on, pausing the video on Jing Yi's scene, \"We were just discussing Miss Jing Yi's cameo.\"","The other employee sneaked a glance at Jing Zeqian, unable to contain her curiosity.","\"Mr. Jing, is Miss Jing Yi planning to enter the entertainment industry?\"","She was genuinely curious. Of the CEO's two sisters, Jing Zejun apparently wasn't planning to join Startrack, so she wondered if Jing Yi would.","They had to get at least one of the sisters, right?","Jing Zeqian looked at Jing Yi's image on the screen, his brows slightly furrowed - how come he hadn't heard about Jing Yi acting in a drama?","\"Play it.\"","The employee was stunned for a moment before realizing Jing Zeqian wanted to watch Jing Yi's scene, and quickly pressed play.","\"Oh! Right away!\"","'You can't save him, I won't... let anyone go...'","She actually acted quite well, which surprised Jing Zeqian. \"She won't join. This was probably just a cameo for Zejun's sake,\" Jing Zeqian explained, unusually forthcoming.","Given Jing Yi's personality, she wouldn't be interested in something as troublesome as entering the entertainment industry, especially since she was already busy with her racing career.","The news of Jing Yi's cameo in Jing Zejun's new drama quickly became a trending topic online.","[Am I seeing things?! That's Jing Yi, right?!]","[Yes, yes! The director really knows how to keep a secret - not a single leak all this time?]","[It's really Jing Yi?! I thought it was just someone who looked like her...]","[Seriously, director, you didn't even promote this?]","[I told you! Jing Yi definitely wants to enter the entertainment industry! That variety show appearance was part of the plan all along.]","[Don't tell me she's really entering the entertainment industry? Kind of disappointing.]","[Nobody said she's entering the entertainment industry. She probably just did a cameo to help Jing Zejun.]","[Why would she do a cameo if she's not entering the industry? I get it now, it's all calculated.]","Negative comments gradually began appearing in the discussion.","Wu Yuqing, Jing Zejun's manager, was the first to notice.","With \"19th Floor Campus\" being such a hit, Jing Zejun, as the female lead, naturally reaped significant benefits. As her manager, Wu Yuqing needed to help Jing Zejun capitalize on this surge in popularity.","\"I just want to confirm - your sister really has no interest in entering the entertainment industry?\"","Wu Yuqing told Jing Zejun about the trending topics, and those netizens' comments seemed quite convincing, making even her doubt.","She had asked Jing Zejun before, and Jing Zejun had dismissed it without much thought.","Jing Zejun remembered how terrified Jing Yi had looked after finishing filming and found it amusing, \"She's definitely not interested in entering the entertainment industry.\" Besides, Jing Yi had other things she wanted to do more.","Wu Yuqing nodded, not feeling particularly disappointed. Having one of the Jing family's daughters under her management was already incredibly fortunate.","Firstly, the company wouldn't dare force unnecessary social obligations on Jing Zejun, which made her job much more pleasant. Wu Yuqing herself despised the practice of making artists attend \"dinners\" with investors to gain resources.","Secondly, Jing Zejun herself was a talented actress with career ambitions, and most importantly, she was already trending toward stardom.","\"I'll contact the production team and discuss releasing a statement to explain the situation.\"","Although Jing Yi's appearance had brought new attention to the drama, the current direction of public opinion wasn't good, and Jing Zejun probably wouldn't want to use this for publicity.","Sure enough, Jing Zejun immediately said, \"Thank you, Sister Wu.\" They needed to address this before it completely blew up and started affecting Jing Yi's normal life.","Half an hour later, \"19th Floor Campus\" official account released a statement explaining Jing Yi's cameo.","Jing Zejun, Wen Qingyan, and other main cast members reposted it.","[Wow, so Jing Yi was just visiting the set and got cast on the spot?]","[I have to say, Jing Yi's acting is really good.]","[Everyone, I just watched the new episode, it's amazing!]","[Exactly, I don't understand why you're all arguing here instead of watching the drama?]","While the subject herself remained unaware, the trending topic situation had already been resolved.","At that moment, Jing Yi was driving her beloved car 'Ghost' on her way to Huarui Group.","Looking at the bright sunny weather outside, Jing Yi was in particularly good spirits - finally able to go for a drive after being discharged from the hospital and returning home!","Meanwhile, Shen Huaichu, who had received Jing Yi's message, wasn't in a hurry. He had one more matter to handle.","Shen Huaichu's eyes revealed a hint of ruthlessness, \"Just leave him barely breathing.\" He was giving instructions about Wang Boqi to someone on the phone.","The person on the other end seemed to say something, making Shen Huaichu slightly furrow his brows, \"Don't worry about Jing Zeyou's side, just do what you need to do.\""]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: The Widely Circulated 'Sports Car and Beauty'","paragraphs":["After finishing his explanation, Shen Huaichu hung up the phone and looked at the message from Jing Yi, his expression softening slightly.","He turned off his phone, grabbed his coat, and walked out of his office.","The assistant quickly stood up, seemingly surprised that Shen Huaichu would come out at this time, his hands holding documents with a hint of nervousness.","\"Mr. Shen, I was just about to bring in the progress report for the new project...\"","Shen Huaichu paused, took the documents, and scanned the report. After a brief review, he stopped flipping through the pages and turned to look at his assistant.","\"You've been working overtime a lot lately. Notify the investment department that this month's salary will be doubled, including yours.\"","The assistant was stunned, his eyes flashing with delight. He excitedly said, \"Thank you, President!\" Shen Huaichu nodded slightly and strode away.","After Shen Huaichu left, the assistant returned the documents to his office. Just as he closed the office door, he turned around to find a crowd gathered behind him, startling him.","He patted his chest and said irritably, \"What are you all doing here? Don't you want your jobs anymore?\"","The group eagerly gathered around him – compared to work, gossip about President Shen was far more important!","Just now! Just moments ago! The 'sports car beauty' they'd been talking about had come to pick up Shen Huaichu again!","Everyone had clearly seen the smile on Shen Huaichu's face!","Previously, people had speculated that the woman in the sports car was Jing Yi, the daughter of the Jing family.","A colleague approached and whispered, \"Assistant, did you know that sports car beauty came to pick up President Shen again?\"","\"...How would I know?\"","Seeing that the assistant didn't know, everyone started chattering about what they'd seen at the entrance.","The assistant had an odd expression – no wonder the president seemed to be in such a good mood today, or rather, he'd been in good spirits lately.","Noticing the assistant's peculiar expression, everyone's eyes lit up. \"So, are they dating?!\" The assistant came to his senses and felt like he'd fallen into a wolf den.","\"You really must not want your jobs if you're gossiping about the president's private life?\" Besides, how would he know if they were dating or not?","The colleagues looked disappointed that there was no more gossip to be had.","The assistant sighed, \"Don't take advantage of the president's good mood lately and get carried away.\"","Surprisingly, this comment made everyone nod in agreement – they wouldn't have dared to be so obvious otherwise. At the same time, their gossip fire reignited as they exchanged knowing looks.","So the romance must be real!","The president's mood has been so good lately that it shows on his face – what else could it be but love?","While colleagues continued whispering gossip, the assistant ignored them. He had no time for gossip; he could finally leave work early today. He hoped the president would stay in such a good mood every day!","Meanwhile, sitting in the passenger seat, Shen Huaichu was unaware that his employees were collectively discussing his private life.","Shen Huaichu took in all her reactions, his expression warming, \"Are you that happy?\"","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving, \"Of course! I finally get to come out and let loose, my 'Ghost' was about to gather dust!\"","The mention of 'Ghost' reminded Shen Huaichu of how Huarui Group employees talked about Jing Yi.","\"Sports car beauty?\"","Jing Yi's voice carried surprise and amusement.","Shen Huaichu had only accidentally heard this term from company employees. Although Jing Yi had only visited a few times, the term seemed to have spread throughout the company.","However, Jing Yi seemed to think the term wasn't bad – at least she was being called a beauty.","She laughed, \"Then isn't our President Shen at a disadvantage? Has all the authority you've built up at the company been affected by this 'sports car beauty'?\"","\"You might have a point there.\"","Hearing him agree so readily, Jing Yi felt slightly unhappy. Just as she was about to say something, Shen Huaichu continued.","\"But I like hearing it. I'm considering giving them a raise.\"","Jing Yi looked ahead, amused, \"Is President Shen so easily pleased? This makes you happy?\"","Shen Huaichu lowered his head slightly, concealing the tenderness in his eyes as his smile spread.","He had always known he wasn't exactly a gentleman, but when he first heard their discussions, he felt a guilty pleasure.","...","\"Brother Li, it seems like we haven't seen Yi Yi at the racing track for a while?\"","Li Chengsheng glanced at the speaker and teased, \"I never noticed you had such feelings for Yi Yi before?\"","The speaker quickly waved his hands, \"Don't say that! If Young Master Jing heard that, he'd skin me alive!\" He just found racing against Jing Yi exciting.","Though he couldn't keep up with her, he admired strength!","Li Chengsheng laughed and called him a 'coward.'","He had heard some news about the big commotion between the Jing family and the Wang family. He'd heard that Jing Yi had been injured and was probably still recovering at home.","His friend seemed worried, \"Wonder if it's serious? Should we go visit her?\"","Li Chengsheng lovingly wiped his car, \"I asked Young Master Jing. He said it wasn't anything serious, she's already been discharged and is back home.\" As for coming to practice racing, that would probably have to wait a while.","\"Ah, wonder if we'll see Yi Yi before the GT Cup.\" His tone was disappointed.","Li Chengsheng raised an eyebrow, stopped wiping his car, and said seriously, \"Even if you see Yi Yi, she'll just crush you. How's that any different from playing with us?\"","Whether you're getting crushed by her or not, does last place care who's in first?","His friend shot him an annoyed look, angry but not daring to speak up. Though the logic was sound, getting crushed by a beauty was totally different from getting crushed by your bros!","As they were chatting, a group of people appeared near the track.","Shanchi Racing Track was usually only open to members, and it was rare to see so many people at the track outside of professional events.","The outer circle of people wore dark clothes and carried various equipment, while the few people in the center were dressed brightly.","Li Chengsheng frowned, looking at the group, and asked, \"Who are those people?\" His friend shook his head, unclear about it, \"I'll call the manager and ask.\" He made a phone call.","Soon, a middle-aged man appeared in their view, \"Young Master Li, Young Master Zhao!\" He hurried over, still catching his breath.","Li Chengsheng crossed his arms, leaning against his car, and jerked his chin toward the group, \"Who are those people?\"","The manager wiped the sweat from his forehead, \"That's a TV show crew. There's a variety show with a celebrity who's a race car driver, so they're here to film.\"","Though his confusion was resolved, Li Chengsheng wasn't happy, his brow still furrowed as he looked at the manager.","\"Why weren't we notified in advance?\" His voice carried obvious displeasure."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Uninvited Guest at the Racetrack","paragraphs":["\"I was planning to notify everyone in advance, but they arrived suddenly, so...\"","A flash of panic crossed the manager's eyes.","They were a crew from a celebrity lifestyle reality show. One of the male celebrities was a racing enthusiast who came to Mountain Speed to film some footage.","It wasn't a big deal - they had simply held a brief meeting and approved it, especially since the offered payment was substantial.","They had meant to inform Jing Zeqian and the others beforehand, since members valued their privacy, and these individuals weren't just members but investors as well.","However, with recent events piling up, he had forgotten about it. Plus, he hadn't expected the show crew to arrive early and run into them!","The manager glanced up at the still displeased Li Chengsheng and cautiously asked, \"If you're uncomfortable with this, I can ask them to leave first.\" They could forgo the money, but they couldn't afford to offend these VIPs!","\"No need.\"","Li Chengsheng wasn't opposed to sharing the race track with others. Rather, as an investor himself, he was annoyed that he hadn't received any notification about a TV crew coming to film.","A friend beside him couldn't help saying, \"It's just us today. If Young Master Jing had run into this situation, you could have kissed your manager position goodbye.\"","The manager nervously swallowed, too frightened to even breathe, and quickly bowed in apology.","Seeing the crowd of people standing on the race track, surrounding the celebrities and chattering about something unknown, Li Chengsheng's frown deepened.","He had finally escaped his family's restrictions to come out and relax, but how could he enjoy himself now?","\"Forget it, just my bad luck. Let's go.\"","His companions, also feeling disappointed, followed Li Chengsheng out.","Not far away, the show crew had noticed the situation. It was impossible not to - Li Chengsheng's car and his entourage were too eye-catching.","A girl standing in the middle covered her mouth and laughed, \"That car is really... flamboyant.\" The camera panned to Li Chengsheng's direction, capturing his car.","The girl, unaware of the situation, could mock freely, but Song Yuanye didn't dare say anything. He had noticed at first glance that the car's price was frighteningly high.","However, since the show was live streaming, he couldn't show his true reaction and instead said diplomatically, \"Well, race car modifications are a matter of personal taste. Everyone has different preferences.\"","[My brother is so gentle and polite!]","[Brother looks so handsome at the race track!]","[How can Cheng Shu be so rude! Don't corrupt my brother!]","[That car... never mind criticizing its modifications, just the price tag is untouchable.]","[Get lost, Cheng Shu! Stop leeching off my brother!]","Cheng Shu secretly gritted her teeth while maintaining a gentle smile on her face.","She was in a manufactured celebrity couple situation with Song Yuanye, but the problem with riding on someone's popularity was that even though they had high exposure, it always looked one-sided, like 'a barber carrying his pole with enthusiasm on just one end.'","Moreover, Song Yuanye was such a hypocrite! She would bet that the live stream comments were all criticizing her right now!","Meanwhile, the manager noticed the cameras pointing in their direction and his heart skipped a beat. He quickly walked over.","He put on a stern face and pulled the director aside.","\"Director, I remember we agreed that you would only film the necessary racing scenes and not disturb our clients.\"","The director had researched Mountain Speed Racing Track's background, and although reluctant, he didn't dare argue and agreed.","Song Yuanye witnessed this exchange.","He was also a member of Mountain Speed, and although the annual fees were frighteningly expensive, the membership helped solidify his public image.","He walked over with a smile, \"Manager, I'm sorry, did we disturb those two gentlemen? Should I go talk to them?\"","The implications might not be clear to online viewers, but how could the manager, with his twenty years of experience, miss it?","Just being a celebrity made him so condescending? He wouldn't even rank in North River, let alone at the race track.","The manager maintained his serious expression, \"Sir, that won't be necessary. Those two aren't fond of attention.\"","You'd better stay away from them!","Song Yuanye's expression froze, not expecting such a blunt rejection. Usually, people would be grateful for his offer.","[Oh ho, didn't expect to get shut down, did you? Lost face there, didn't you?]","[Well well, looks like there are still people who won't kiss up to our big celebrity Song! Manager, I salute your bravery.]","[What's wrong with this manager! My brother was just being kind!]","[Exactly, treating kindness with ingratitude! No wonder you're just serving others here!]","[What the hell! Who do they think they are, it's just a crappy race track!]","[That red-haired guy looks awful! Terrible taste, such a bumpkin!]","[This... there's no need to attack random people, right?]","[...Crappy race track? Maybe you fans should research Mountain Speed's reputation before coming here?]","[You fans are so subservient, don't you realize this is Mountain Speed's manager? His monthly salary probably equals fifty times yours.]","Cheng Shu stopped in her tracks, seeing Song Yuanye's expression, and felt relieved. She had also wanted to show her face and help mediate, but fortunately, she had been slow to act.","The director, seeing Song Yuanye's expression, quickly directed the cameraman to film others and pulled the manager aside.","\"We understand, don't worry! We'll try our best to avoid filming other members.\"","The manager glanced at Song Yuanye, who had already resumed his gentle expression, but paid him no mind.","\"Director, I hope we can all get along during this period, but you arriving early today has already violated our agreement...\"","While the director was still negotiating with the manager, Song Yuanye continued explaining racing knowledge with an unchanged expression, and the comment section was once again flooded with fans' \"Brother is amazing\" messages.","At the same time, Jing Zeqian received a call from Li Chengsheng.","He sat in the living room, legs crossed, \"TV crew? Why wasn't I informed about this?\" His voice carried displeasure.","After listening to something from the other end, Jing Zeqian's brows furrowed slightly, \"Alright, I understand. I'll first arrange for his subordinate to come up and see how he performs.\"","Jing Zeqian hung up the phone, and Lin Ruiqing walked over, handing him a sweet soup.","Jing Zeqian stood up to take it, \"Thank you, Mom.\" Lin Ruiqing noticed his troubled expression and asked, \"Did something happen?\"","\"There's a small issue at the race track, but nothing major.\"","Lin Ruiqing nodded, relieved it wasn't anything serious.","Jing Zeqian took a spoonful of the sweet soup and put it in his mouth.","Red bean soup?","His expression showed distaste as he fished out the mochi from the bowl, \"Why is it sweet? And this, is it mochi?\"","How could a grown man like him drink something so sweet late at night? What would people think?"]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: The Worried 'Little Girl'","paragraphs":["Lin Ruiqing elegantly savored the mochi red bean soup in her bowl. Aunt Wang had prepared it specially - the red bean paste was perfectly sweetened, complementing the soft, chewy mochi.","If it weren't so late and her health wasn't poor, she would have definitely gone for an iced version, though this warm one was quite delicious too.","\"Just eat what's available. I had Aunt Wang make this specially for Yi Yi.\"","Jing Zeqian silently drained his bowl of red bean soup, aggressively chewing the mochi in his mouth.","Specially saving some for Jing Yi? That girl isn't even home at this hour, why bother saving any for her?!","Meanwhile, the very Jing Yi they were discussing had just finished dinner with Shen Huaichu. Despite his stern protests, she still insisted on dropping him off at his doorstep.","Standing at his front door, Shen Huaichu couldn't quite figure out when their roles had gotten reversed.","He felt like a \"girlfriend\" whose \"boyfriend\" was worried about her getting home safely so late at night.","\"...Are you sure you don't want me to take you home?\"","Jing Yi poked her head out, giving him a puzzled look. \"What are you talking about? I just dropped you off at your place, and now you want to take me home? Then you'd have to go back home again? Why make things so complicated? That's weird!\"","Shen Huaichu silently stared at her, wondering who was really being weird here.","Jing Yi was about to turn the steering wheel to leave, but seeing Shen Huaichu standing there dazed, she found it oddly adorable.","She beckoned to him with her finger, a hint of mischief in her expression.","Confused, Shen Huaichu thought she had something to say and leaned closer to Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's lips curved into a smile as she hooked one hand around Shen Huaichu's neck, pulling him down gently.","Her lips pressed against his thin ones.","Shen Huaichu froze, the warm sensation on his lips reminding him of what Jing Yi was doing...","The tingling sensation on his lips, along with Jing Yi's gentle touch, stirred something in him. His gaze grew intense, and just as he was about to embrace her-","Jing Yi had already pulled away.","She smiled happily, dimples appearing on her cheeks, making her look even more radiant and captivating.","\"Shen Huaichu, good night.\"","Watching her drive away, Shen Huaichu felt increasingly puzzled about whether their relationship dynamics were really normal.","He remained lost in thought for a long while, fingers lightly touching his lips, corners of his mouth unconsciously turning upward.","After 'teasing' her boyfriend, Jing Yi returned to the Jing residence in high spirits, humming a tune as she walked into the living room after parking her car.","Jing Zeqian and Lin Ruiqing were chatting in the living room. Seeing Jing Yi's bright smile, Jing Zeqian snorted.","\"Well, someone's in a good mood today, looking like there's a flower blooming on your face.\"","Jing Yi took it as a compliment about her beauty and smiled even more radiantly, which only soured Jing Zeqian's mood further.","Lin Ruiqing asked Aunt Wang to bring out the sweet soup, smiling as she watched Jing Yi sit down beside her.","She had no objections to her daughter dating Shen Huaichu, especially seeing how happy Jing Yi was.","\"Did you have fun today?\"","Jing Yi nodded, taking a sip of the sweet soup. Her eyes brightened, \"This is delicious!\"","Lin Ruiqing watched her daughter with tender eyes.","After chatting with Lin Ruiqing for a bit, Jing Yi noticed only the two of them were in the living room and asked, \"Where are Big Brother and Dad?\"","[Don't tell me they're working overtime at the company again?]","As for Jing Zejun, she was at her busiest period. The explosive success of \"Nineteenth Floor Campus\" had significantly increased her workload with variety shows, commercials, and magazine shoots.","In short, she was flying all over the world.","\"Your brother is in the study, and your father has an appointment today, he hasn't returned yet.\"","[Sure enough, Big Brother's overtime knows no boundaries.]","Jing Yi shook her head helplessly, wondering when her brother would learn about 'work-life balance.'","Jing Zeqian quipped that his brother probably thought working overtime from home in the study already counted as work-life balance.","\"Have you had enough fun these past few days?\"","Jing Yi eyed Jing Zeqian warily. She had only been out for a few days, finally free from the hospital, and now he wanted to drag her somewhere?","Jing Zeqian: ...Why did she make him sound like a kidnapper?","He said irritably, \"I meant to ask if you want to prepare for your GT Super Cup?\" The race track suddenly had more people, so if Jing Yi wanted to train, he needed to make arrangements.","Jing Yi immediately sat up straight, \"Yes!\" She had been planning this for a long time - the GT Super Cup would be her first official race in her racing career!","Lin Ruiqing had been worried about Jing Yi's injuries not being fully healed, but seeing her excitement, she couldn't bring herself to say anything.","Jing Zeqian informed Jing Yi about the additional people at the race track. Since she wanted to train, he would need to arrange for the track to be cleared - as the biggest investor, he had that authority.","\"It's fine, they can film while I train. They won't affect me.\"","[They won't be on the track twenty-four hours a day, right? We can just avoid their filming schedule?]","Jing Zeqian frowned slightly, not particularly fond of such roundabout solutions. He preferred handling things more directly.","However, since Jing Yi insisted...","\"Alright then, I'll have the track staff arrange the schedule to avoid conflicts with them.\" He just hoped these people would finish filming and leave quickly.","Jing Zeqian took the GT Cup competition very seriously. As Jing Yi said, no race car driver would want to miss this competition.","If Jing Yi could stand out in this race, it would pave her way to becoming a professional race car driver.","\"Yi Yi, are you sure those people won't affect you?\"","Lin Ruiqing usually didn't like Jing Zeqian's way of handling things, but when it came to Jing Yi, she couldn't help but worry more.","Jing Yi put down her bowl and held Lin Ruiqing's hand.","\"Mom, don't worry. If there's really any problem, I'll go straight to Second Brother. He's the biggest boss of the race track - they can't afford to offend him, right?\"","Jing Yi's playful words made Lin Ruiqing laugh, and she affectionately stroked her daughter's hair.","\"Alright, let your Second Brother back you up then.\"","Jing Zeqian couldn't help feeling proud on the side. He actually hoped Jing Yi would make use of her identity as the Jing family's daughter, to prevent any troublemakers from getting in her way.","Jing Yi smiled sweetly, leaning against Lin Ruiqing.","She wasn't entirely joking - this competition was truly important, and when necessary, she might really need to rely on Jing Zeqian's status.","...","Meanwhile, Jing Zejun, who had just finished an interview, returned to her hotel from the recording venue.","She lay on the couch, saying wearily, \"Qiqi, don't busy yourself anymore, go get some rest.\"","Her assistant was still preparing tomorrow morning's outfits, too busy to even look up.","\"Sis, I'll be done soon.\"","While working, she relayed the manager's instructions.","Finally, after preparing everything, the assistant breathed a sigh of relief. \"Sis, I've got everything ready. I'll come back at seven tomorrow morning. What would you like for breakfast?\"","Jing Zejun was almost asleep on the couch, \"Anything is fine, get some rest early.\""]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Object Check-in VS Reporting Work","paragraphs":["After the assistant finished tidying everything up, she reminded, \"Sis, don't forget to rest in your room.\" Jing Zejun softly replied, \"Okay.\" It was clear from her voice that she was already nearly asleep.","Early the next morning, there was a knock at the door. Jing Zejun lazily rolled over, feeling a slight chill that helped bring her to consciousness.","She slowly sat up, put on her slippers, and went to open the door.","Thinking it was her assistant Qiqi, Jing Zejun didn't pay attention to the person behind her after opening the door, turning instead to head to the bathroom to get ready.","\"Qiqi, did you sleep well last night?\"","Jing Zejun's voice came from the bathroom. When she didn't hear her assistant's response, she didn't think anything of it.","She continued talking to herself, \"You know what? I dreamed all night long. Guess who I dreamed about?\" As she spoke, Jing Zejun walked out of the bathroom.","\"Who did you dream about?\"","Standing at the doorway was Wen Qingyan, holding breakfast in his hands and smiling at Jing Zejun.","Jing Zejun felt dazed for a moment. Was she still not fully awake? Was this still part of her dream?","Seeing her confused expression, Wen Qingyan smiled tenderly and said, \"I could keep standing at the door, but the others will probably wake up soon...\"","Jing Zejun snapped back to reality and hurriedly invited Wen Qingyan in.","\"Brother Qingyan, why did you come so early?\"","Wen Qingyan placed the items he was carrying on the table and began laying out the breakfast items one by one.","\"I noticed you seemed interested in the hotel's breakfast, so I brought you some.\"","Jing Zejun was slightly stunned, feeling a warmth spreading through her heart. What touched her wasn't that Wen Qingyan had gotten up early to bring her breakfast, but that she had only briefly mentioned the hotel's breakfast yesterday.","\"Come try it.\" Though he had brought many varieties, the portions were small.","Jing Zejun smiled gently, her eyes lighting up with joy.","\"Have you eaten?\"","Wen Qingyan shook his head with a smile; of course, he hadn't come just to deliver breakfast.","Jing Zejun invited Wen Qingyan to sit down and eat together. She sat on the sofa and picked up a crab roe soup dumpling, the city's signature dish that Jing Yi had mentioned to her several times before she left.","The dumpling was slightly hot, with skin as thin as paper and delicious crab roe soup bursting in her mouth.","\"How is it? Is it good?\"","Instead of eating right away, Wen Qingyan waited for Jing Zejun's review.","Jing Zejun nodded with a smile, \"It's delicious!\" Wen Qingyan gazed at her, his expression softening with affection.","Seeing her enjoying the food, Wen Qingyan also picked up a soup dumpling to taste. It was indeed quite good.","\"By the way, who did you say you dreamed about earlier?\"","Jing Zejun paused briefly, coughing lightly with a flash of panic in her eyes. \"Oh? No one, I was just joking with Qiqi, haha.\"","Wen Qingyan raised an eyebrow but didn't pursue the matter further.","Jing Zejun lowered her head to eat the other breakfast items, though compared to the amazing soup dumpling, the rest seemed rather tasteless.","It wasn't just about the food; it was also the influence of the person sitting beside her.","At that moment, her assistant pushed open the door from outside, also carrying breakfast.","While closing the door and watching the breakfast in her hands, she said, \"Sis, are you up? Look what I brought you! Yesterday you said you wanted to eat...\"","The assistant's eyes widened when she saw Wen Qingyan sitting on the sofa. Her first thought was: Did Wen Qingyan sleep here last night?! Should she notify Manager Qing to start preparing the relationship PR strategy?!","\"It's not what you're thinking, he just brought me breakfast.\"","The assistant sat on the sofa, eating the breakfast she had brought – she had no choice since her artist had already been fed by someone else's artist.","Well, at least Wen Qingyan hadn't spent the night here.","\"Sis, are you sure you don't want me to prepare some PR strategies first?\"","Even though... she still thought it would be better to have plans ready in advance.","Jing Zejun poked her head out from the bathroom, \"What nonsense are you talking about! Just eat your breakfast, we need to go to rehearsal soon.\"","The assistant ate her sandwich while watching Jing Zejun's flustered retreat, sighing lightly. It was bound to happen sooner or later, so why try to hide it?","She had watched Jing Zejun's changes all along, and she didn't believe Jing Zejun had no feelings at all.","...","Jing Yi had officially begun her daily preparation for the GT Cup. Apart from occasional 'harassment' calls from Shen Huaichu, everything was going quite smoothly.","The phone rang right on schedule. Jing Yi helplessly took off her helmet, placed it on the car roof, and answered the phone, though a careful look would reveal a smile in her eyes.","Jing Yi's voice carried a teasing tone, \"Mr. Shen, punctual as always with your check-in.\"","On the other end, Shen Huaichu's lips curved in an almost imperceptible smile. \"What can I do? My girlfriend is too free-spirited, so I can only be a 'supportive partner' quietly.\"","The smile in Jing Yi's eyes grew stronger. \"Well then, dear supportive partner, what have you been up to today?\"","Shen Huaichu looked toward the overseas business delegation examining the project in the distance. \"Investigating investment projects.\"","Jing Yi clicked her tongue a couple of times, pretending to be dissatisfied. \"Aren't you supposed to be my supportive partner? How come your own career is flourishing so well?\"","\"What should I do then? Come keep you company?\"","Shen Huaichu's slightly parted thin lips held a faint smile. He was serious – if Jing Yi agreed, he could return immediately.","Jing Yi leaned against the race car, her face blooming with a bright, heartfelt smile.","\"Mr. Shen, you're so clingy.\"","Jing Yi had never let Shen Huaichu come to watch her train, and this time was no different. Shen Huaichu didn't particularly like racing, and she didn't want him to feel uncomfortable in any way.","She coaxed him, \"You be good and focus on work, that way I'll have something to brag about when I introduce you to others!\" Shen Huaichu lowered his eyes and laughed softly, his heart melting with tenderness as he said, \"Alright.\"","After a few minutes, Shen Huaichu hung up the phone, still looking reluctantly at the name displayed on his screen. He had never known he could become such a romantically sentimental person.","\"Mr. Shen.\"","A middle-aged man in a suit approached – the director of the cooperating business association.","Shen Huaichu put away his phone, returning to his usual cool and detached demeanor.","\"Chairperson Chen.\"","The middle-aged man had noticed his demeanor while on the phone, and being experienced in such matters, he knew the other party had been talking to his girlfriend.","He joked, \"Checking in with your better half?\"","Shen Huaichu was momentarily stunned before understanding the middle-aged man's meaning. The phrase was rather novel to him.","With a barely noticeable smile at the corner of his mouth, Shen Huaichu replied, \"No, I was reporting my work.\" Chairperson Chen was taken aback, thinking he had misunderstood.","But then he realized – Shen Huaichu was the CEO himself, who would he need to report to?","Tsk tsk tsk, \"reporting work\" – especially with Shen Huaichu saying it with such a straight face, the impact was at least doubled.","Chairperson Chen gave a dry laugh, suppressing the goosebumps all over his body, exchanged a few pleasantries, and quickly left.","It was too much to handle – at his age, he still had to witness these young people showing off their romance."]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: Crash into Song Yuanye","paragraphs":["The racing engine roared as the dazzling red car traced an elegant arc on the track.","Jing Yi's race car swiftly weaved through the circuit. Her body was tense, seemingly becoming one with the vehicle. During high-speed driving, she had to control not only the speed but also maintain the car's stability and balance.","The race car crossed the finish line and came to a stop.","Jing Yi got out of the car, her expression less than satisfied. Having not practiced for a while, her touch wasn't quite there yet.","The Coach walked over from the other side. Seeing Jing Yi's expression, he knew exactly what she was thinking and said with a smile, \"You're just recovering from illness, don't be too hard on yourself.\"","In his view, Jing Yi had already regained about eighty percent of her former condition.","Jing Yi knew she couldn't rush things. She nodded and continued discussing the shortcomings of her performance with the Coach.","Shortly after, as Jing Yi was preparing for another few laps, a group of people in the distance caught her attention.","The Coach looked over as well, seemingly remembering something, his expression turning unpleasant. \"It's those people again. I don't know what the Manager is thinking, turning Mountain Racing into something like a marketplace.\"","If they were genuine racing enthusiasts, he probably wouldn't have minded much - after all, they'd all be people who loved racing, and practicing at the venue wouldn't be an issue. Besides, the racing track wasn't his property.","But whenever this group came, they just put on airs, acting as if they were the world's biggest racing enthusiasts.","As Jing Yi listened to the Coach's grumbling complaints, she suddenly realized his Chinese seemed to be getting better and better...","Jing Yi looked toward the group - so these were the people Jing Zeqian had mentioned.","Meanwhile, the Manager and his deputy were still entangled with the filming crew.","He was about to lose it!","If he had known earlier, he would never have agreed to this, and now his position was nearly compromised.","He tried to negotiate patiently with the directing team. No matter what, he couldn't let them in today - the daughter of the Jing family was inside, Jing Zeqian's precious sister. He couldn't afford to offend them!","Song Yuanye stood at a distance, watching the scene unfold. Such a scene certainly couldn't be broadcast live, but he was also having trouble concealing his irritation.","He had come here to film a variety show to strengthen his public image and gain followers, but who would have thought even a manager wouldn't give him face!","Cheng Shu observed his expression while trying to maintain the atmosphere in the livestream.","Although they were streaming on different platforms, being together now meant her viewership would benefit from Song Yuanye's traffic.","If things got too ugly, she wouldn't benefit either.","As luck would have it, this guy had probably caught the love bug recently and wanted to test the waters with a fake relationship, probing his fans' reactions. And of course, she happened to be from the same company as Song Yuanye.","The situation had been dragging on for a while, and Jing Yi couldn't focus on her training. She asked a staff member about it.","The staff member explained the situation to Jing Yi.","According to the Manager's schedule, Jing Yi and this group weren't supposed to overlap.","But Jing Yi had been training for several consecutive days, and the show's production team complained about the waiting time being too long. Their filming schedule couldn't afford delays, so they suddenly decided to come film.","\"...so the Manager is still discussing with them.\"","Jing Yi looked over. The situation had dragged on long enough - if it could be resolved, wouldn't it have been done already?","\"Never mind, tell the Manager to let them film. I'm done with my training for today anyway.\"","The Coach looked at her disapprovingly, \"Jing, you don't need to accommodate them. Your matters are far more important!\"","Jing Yi smiled indifferently, \"Weren't you the one who told me not to be too strict? It's fine, today wasn't without its gains.\"","The staff member looked at Jing Yi, and after receiving her permission, quickly walked over to the Manager to quietly relay this information.","The Manager turned to look at Jing Yi in the distance, but instead of feeling relieved, his expression grew even more troubled.","This was bad - having the boss's sister make way for others, if Jing Zeqian found out about this...","The show's crew successfully entered the racing track. Song Yuanye walked straight past him, a flash of arrogance in his eyes.","The Manager watched his retreating figure, feeling both angry and exasperated. Running into these people was truly his misfortune!","Despite the earlier unpleasantness, the director quickly took control of the situation.","\"Yuanye, are you going to demonstrate some racing for everyone today?\"","Song Yuanye smiled warmly, looking at the vast racing track before him. \"Yes, Mountain Racing is one of the top racing venues in the country, providing car maintenance services for premium members,\" he subtly flaunted his status.","[Wow, could our brother really be some rich young master?]","[I remember some super fans mentioned before that brother does have some background.]","[This seems so high-end, maintaining vehicles and all. The annual membership fee must be expensive, right?]","[...Really showing off.]","[Get out of here, hater! This is Song Yuanye's livestream.]","After calming down the Coach, Jing Yi let him leave and took out her phone.","She needed to tell Li Chengsheng about this. They had originally planned to do a few laps at the racing track, but now it would have to wait for another time.","However, before she could make the call, Song Yuanye approached with a group of cameramen.","Jing Yi's fine eyebrows furrowed slightly as she put her phone away.","\"Hello, miss.\"","Song Yuanye smiled confidently, thinking she would surely recognize him. Her Bugatti was far superior to his car worth just a few hundred thousand - perhaps he could ask to drive it...","Jing Yi didn't know what he wanted, but she politely nodded in greeting, \"Hello.\"","Song Yuanye finally recognized who she was, his eyes lighting up as he stepped forward, \"You're Jing Yi?\" The Jing Yi who had been in the spotlight recently, Jing Zeqian's sister?","Jing Yi smiled awkwardly and took half a step back, \"I am.\" She should have fled this place earlier, and now she was stuck here.","[Who's that? Why does our brother look so happy?]","[Who is this woman?!]","[It's Yi Yi! Jing Yi Yi!]","[Long time no see, Jing Yi Yi!]","[Oh, so it's Jing Zeqian's sister.]","Song Yuanye was excited because Jing Yi's value was far higher than Cheng Shu's. If he could create dating rumors with her, wouldn't that elevate his status even further?","And if she actually fell for him...","Well, that wouldn't be so bad either. He could let Rui Rui down gently - after all, this was the Jing family!","As Song Yuanye's thoughts wandered further, Jing Yi watched his expression, growing more wary.","\"So you race too? What a coincidence! Why don't we do a lap together?\" His words oozed confidence, as if certain his racing skills would impress Jing Yi.","Jing Yi's furrowed brow revealed traces of annoyance. Just as she was about to refuse, a playful voice called out, \"How about racing me instead?\"","Li Chengsheng walked over with a smile, his gaze sweeping toward Song Yuanye."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Why use a butcher's knife to kill a chicken","paragraphs":["Li Chengsheng stood in front of Jing Yi, smiling as he looked at Song Yuanye with his chin slightly raised. \"Why use a butcher's knife to kill a chicken? Let me compete with you instead.\"","Li Chengsheng's words were not at all polite. Last time, these people had disturbed his mood, and now they were surrounding Jing Yi again, with who knows what intentions.","Having been an internet celebrity for so many years with millions of fans supporting him, Song Yuanye naturally didn't appreciate Li Chengsheng's attitude.","His eyes revealed his displeasure as he replied with a fake smile, \"Sure, but we'll see who turns out to be the chicken.\"","The tension between the two was palpable, and this certainly stirred up their fan bases. The live comments started flooding in frantically, filled with all sorts of insults.","Standing in the corner, Cheng Shu was struck by Li Chengsheng's appearance when she saw him. So that colorful car belonged to him - he was quite handsome indeed.","Jing Yi watched the cameras that were still recording, feeling concerned. The man opposite them was presumably a popular celebrity, and she had experienced the madness of internet fans before, especially those of famous stars.","She wanted to warn Li Chengsheng, but he seemed completely unconcerned, his smile growing even more provocative.","Having lived the life of a wealthy young master, he didn't even know how to spell the word 'restraint.' Just a few fans making noise? If things got too heated, he'd deal with their idol directly!","Li Chengsheng gestured to Jing Yi not to worry, then asked the manager to bring out his beloved car. He looked at Song Yuanye with an air of unruly defiance.","\"Please bring out this gentleman's car as well.\"","The manager bowed and agreed, then turned to ask Song Yuanye for his membership number, his preferential attitude obvious.","Song Yuanye's face turned ashen. He knew that once the cars were brought out, he would lose the first comparison, but now that he was in too deep, he could only hope to save face during the actual race!","[I want to complain about this racing club! That manager is just a bootlicker!]","[What's with this red-haired guy acting all alternative?!]","[He's obviously that woman's lover. Green tea b*tch! What a perfect match for this scumbag!]","The fans were getting worked up with their insults, but there were also netizens who had come because they admired Jing Yi. When they saw the situation, they were shocked to find that the fans were dragging Jing Yi into their insults, using particularly offensive language.","The netizens who had been following Jing Yi since \"Dear Family\" couldn't stay silent.","[What's wrong with you fans?! How is this Jing Yi's fault?! Your idol was the one who approached her!]","[Exactly, Yi Yi hasn't said a single word!]","[Look, just let them curse. They might not know Jing Yi, but don't they know Hengjing? Don't they know about legal letters?]","[Also, that red-haired guy you're calling a 'lover' is someone your idol can't afford to offend. Ever heard of L Family luxury brands? The luxury items your idol has to borrow? That's his family's business.]","The war of words continued, but these comments made many fans calm down. They remembered the previous incident when Hengjing had sent legal notices to internet trolls, and realized that the person before them wasn't just some celebrity they could freely insult, but the daughter of the Jing Family.","The manager quickly arranged for Li Chengsheng's and Song Yuanye's cars to be brought out. Indeed, the value of the racing cars alone told the whole story.","Li Chengsheng glanced at Song Yuanye's car and smirked. Though he didn't say anything, his eyes seemed to say, \"Is that all?\"","Song Yuanye clenched his fists and turned to change into his gear.","Meanwhile, after putting on his racing suit, Li Chengsheng casually ran his fingers through his red hair. \"Yi Yi, watch me defeat him!\"","He smiled mischievously before putting on his helmet.","Being somewhat like an older brother to Jing Yi, he had to win back some face!","Jing Yi wasn't particularly concerned about who would win, as she was well aware of Li Chengsheng's skill level.","Li Chengsheng rested his hands on the steering wheel, completely composed.","Focus, start, accelerate - his movements were fluid and seamless. Before long, he had left his opponent far behind, completely dominating the race.","As expected, Li Chengsheng won.","Song Yuanye's expression grew even darker, but with the cameras still rolling, he couldn't make too much of a scene.","With a stiff smile, he said, \"Indeed, Mountain Drive is full of experts. I wasn't in my best condition today. I hope to have another chance to learn from you.\"","Looking at Jing Yi again, Song Yuanye smiled gently, \"I also hope to have the honor of racing with Miss Jing Yi next time.\"","Standing behind them, Cheng Shu was so embarrassed her toes were curling.","Not in best condition? How could he say such shameless words?","Li Chengsheng laughed in disbelief, lazily leaning against his race car. \"Well, let's compete again when you're in your best condition. Hope you can get there.\"","\"Also...\" Li Chengsheng looked at the disgruntled Song Yuanye and smiled mockingly, \"if you can't even beat me, there's no point in challenging Yi Yi. Amateurs should stay with amateurs.\"","He was basically demoting him! And he still wanted to race with Yi Yi? Go play at the kids' table!","Song Yuanye hadn't expected such a ruthless response, and his expression suddenly darkened.","Meanwhile, the live stream comments surged again. Despite the previous warnings, fans tend to lose all restraint when insulting others, sometimes even attacking the celebrity's parents.","[Are you deaf?! Didn't you hear our brother say he wasn't in good condition?!]","[What are you so proud of? It's just because you have a better car. Do your parents know you're wasting their money like this?]","[This is hilarious. What's so great about that Jing Yi? She's just hiding in the back like a turtle!]","[You think she's so amazing? She's just a runner-up in some competition. Who knows how she got that?]","[This makes my blood boil!!! Jing Yi's runner-up title is worth several times more than your idol's entire career!]","[Look, Jing Yi's profile clearly states she's a professional race car driver. An amateur dares to challenge a pro?]","[Song Yuanye's fans really don't know what's good for them.]","Jing Yi understood the male celebrity's intentions and couldn't help but laugh. Did she look that easy to take advantage of? Did everyone think they could step on her to climb higher?","She smiled faintly, her gaze towards Song Yuanye turning cold.","\"No need for racing. I'm quite busy. Brother Sheng, let's go.\" Running into these people was just her bad luck, a waste of time.","Li Chengsheng walked past Song Yuanye, the mockery in his eyes unmistakable.","Mindful of the ongoing livestream, Song Yuanye watched their retreating figures, gritting his teeth and clenching his fists.","Cheng Shu caught the director's pleading look and internally sighed before putting on her sweet smile and approaching.","\"Brother Yuanye, winning and losing is normal in competitions. Even top racers can't win every time, and...\"","Before she could finish, Song Yuanye turned and left with a cold expression, completely ignoring the film crew and a somewhat embarrassed Cheng Shu behind him."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: I Dare Not Agree with That","paragraphs":["\"Oh, Sister Li, don't worry, I understand, I understand, nothing inappropriate will appear...\"","The director hung up the phone, his smile fading as he closed his eyes and sighed.","The assistant director beside him leaned in cautiously and asked, \"What's wrong? Did Song Yuanye's agent say something?\"","The director gave a cold snort. \"What else could they say? They want PR, they want editing, they want all negative stuff about Song Yuanye cut out.\"","The assistant director frowned. \"But this is live broadcasting.\" The director sighed. \"Luckily, I told the cameramen to be sharp.\"","When it seemed things were going south, the director had instructed the cameramen following Song Yuanye to be discreet. Fortunately, the situation didn't escalate too much, and PR wasn't a huge issue.","\"Then why are you still worried?\"","The director looked towards the nearby indoor set where the variety show guests had gathered. He hadn't forgotten that there was also a 'Startrack' artist among them, whose career path overlapped with Song Yuanye's.","He had thought this would be a hot topic, but now it seemed like a 'landmine'!","Inside the room, everything was still peaceful. Song Yuanye quickly adjusted his state of mind and sat at the dining table chatting with everyone. Directly across from him was the 'Startrack' artist mentioned by the director.","Lu Yichi, a newly debuted singer-dancer, was gaining quite a bit of popularity.","What's more, this kid looked somewhat similar to him, and 'Startrack' had obviously invested a lot in cultivating him.","Thinking of this, Song Yuanye frowned, his eyes flashing with displeasure, but he quickly returned to his usual sunny demeanor.","\"......I heard from the production team that you guys went to the racetrack today, Yuanye?\"","Song Yuanye's expression stiffened as he smiled at the speaker, an experienced actor in the entertainment industry.","\"Yes, I like racing cars in my spare time, so I went for a drive.\"","The actor was quite surprised. \"That's impressive.\" Song Yuanye shyly smiled. \"It's okay.\"","Cheng Shu sneakily glanced up at Song Yuanye's face, then quickly lowered her head to continue eating. She wanted to avoid any involvement in this topic!","On the opposite side, Lu Yichi smirked. He had just overheard the production team discussing what happened during the day.","He hadn't expected Song Yuanye to coincidentally run into his boss's sister, Jing Yi, and even more so, he hadn't expected this guy to have the audacity to keep up his 'racing driver' persona.","Oh no, he had forgotten what his agent said about managing his expressions.","Lu Yichi quickly suppressed his smile, which the live viewers didn't catch, but Song Yuanye did.","He looked up at the person across from him, his lips curling into a meaningful smile as he asked, \"What's wrong, Yichi? Did you want to say something?\"","In an instant, all eyes in the room were on Lu Yichi. He inwardly cursed Song Yuanye's cunning, but who could blame him? After all, Song Yuanye was a senior and had more popularity.","Lu Yichi obediently smiled. \"What could I possibly want to say? Just like Brother Zhou, I think you're very impressive, Brother Yuanye.\"","However, he wasn't that obedient.","Just as Song Yuanye was about to further pressure him, hoping to divert all the fans' anger towards Lu Yichi, he heard the latter say something.","\"It's just a coincidence, but our CEO's little sister, Jing Yi, also likes racing.\"","Song Yuanye's smile froze, his eyes turning sharp, while Lu Yichi continued to smile brightly, as if completely unaware of the events of the day, merely mentioning it casually.","[Oh, Lu Yichi is quite brave, huh?]","[What? What? Did I miss something?]","[Hey, upstairs, you missed something explosive earlier. Basically, Song Yuanye challenged Jing Yi to a race at the track, only to be utterly crushed by her subordinate.]","[That's so explosive!!]","Soon, these comments were drowned out by fans' messages, with some major fans deliberately trying to cover up the morning's incident.","Song Yuanye calmed down and smiled. \"Yes, it was quite a coincidence. I met her today.\" Cheng Shu, holding chopsticks, paused slightly, lowering her head and closing her eyes. This meal was going to be anything but peaceful.","Lu Yichi seemed quite surprised by this and smiled even more brightly. \"Really? That's quite a coincidence. I often hear our CEO talk about how skilled Jing Yi is at racing. Isn't that right, Brother Yuanye?\"","Cheng Shu inwardly admired how Lu Yichi's words hit the mark.","Song Yuanye's smile slowly faded. Indeed, anything related to 'Startrack' was just annoying.","\"I've often heard about it too, but I haven't seen it. However, racing is quite dangerous. With Jing Yi being such a beautiful young lady, it's probably not suitable for her to engage in such activities. It's too dangerous.\"","This statement completely left Lu Yichi speechless, and he couldn't help but smile, his eyes filled with a hint of sympathy. \"I wouldn't dare agree with that. If our CEO heard, I'd be out of a job.\"","This wasn't him exaggerating. Not only was the CEO, Jing Zejun, extremely doting on his sister, Jing Yi, but if such words reached him, it would definitely mean the end of his career.","Besides, her family hadn't said anything against it, so what right did an outsider have to comment?","[Is Song Yuanye brainless or what?]","[Whether Jing Yi can race or not, even the Jing family hasn't said anything. Who does this guy think he is, with his old-fashioned mindset?]","[I'm not a fan of Song Yuanye, nor am I a hater, but his comment is just baffling.]","[What should a girl be doing? Playing with Barbie dolls or staying home to take care of kids?]","[More importantly, how good is he at racing? I've only heard his fans bragging. Where are the results?]","[He's just an amateur racer, heavily promoted, but if we're talking real skills, Jing Yi's racing videos have been reposted by top racers like Ross. Check it out on foreign platforms.]","[The guy was just being considerate, so sweet. Why are you all overreacting?]","[Exactly, I don't get it. He's such a gentle and considerate person, why are there so many haters?]","[Girls shouldn't be doing this! What's with racing, just putting on a show!]","Although Song Yuanye's fans were deliberately flooding the chat with positive messages, the general audience wasn't buying it, and the comments became even more heated.","Originally, the incident with Jing Yi had been suppressed, but the intense discussion in the live chat made it resurface.","Song Yuanye stiffened, realizing he had let his anger get the better of him, completely forgetting about Jing Yi's brother, Jing Zejun, and the Jing Family's influence.","He forced a smile. \"Guess I spoke out of turn.\" He smiled at the camera. \"I hope CEO Jing and Miss Jing don't mind.\"","Unbeknownst to him, the suppressed hot search topic had resurfaced.","The people at the dining table gradually sensed the tension but continued chatting naturally, creating a warm and lively atmosphere indoors."]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: The Heat That Came for Free","paragraphs":["Despite Song Yuanye's team's intervention once again, the issue still made it to the trending searches.","The agent paced back and forth in the room, occasionally glancing at her phone with an anxious expression.","Song Yuanye leaned back on the sofa with his eyes closed, trying to dispel his restless emotions.","\"Why are you pacing back and forth? Just take down the trending search directly.\" The agent stopped in her tracks, turning to him in disbelief. \"Did I not try to take it down?! I've spent money multiple times, yet it still made it to the trending searches!\"","This was probably the characteristic of a high-profile celebrity: plenty of fans, but also a significant number of haters, making it nearly impossible to remove the trending search.","Thinking about this, the agent felt even more frustrated. She had repeatedly told him to be more discreet, to be more discreet. Even if he was dating, she could manage the fans with some clever maneuvering.","But this was a live broadcast! One misstep and he had entangled himself with the young master of a luxury brand! And that Jing Yi, didn't she know what Song Yuanye was up to?!","She had been with him for quite a few years, and to put it bluntly, if Song Yuanye even twitched his butt, she knew what he was about to do!","Fine! Even if all that wasn't a big deal! But since it had already been suppressed, why did he bring it up again himself?!","He really was getting too wild, thinking he was invincible just because of a few fans.","Song Yuanye was already simmering with anger, and the agent's accusatory tone only made his temper flare.","\"Are you blaming me? Instead of wasting time pointing fingers, why not come up with a solution!\" He scanned the agent with disdainful and critical eyes. \"What a waste, what kind of top agent are you?\"","The agent's anger surged at his words.","However, Song Yuanye was no longer the little star she could manipulate at will. Moreover, she still needed to rely on this big tree to maintain her status as a top agent in the company.","The tense atmosphere filled the air. The agent suppressed her inner rage and forced a smile. \"Yuanye, let's both calm down. What's important now is to handle this situation. Let's both stay composed.\"","Song Yuanye snorted coldly but didn't respond.","The agent clenched her phone tightly, her eyes flashing with displeasure, but she managed to smile as she presented a solution.","The only way out now was to confirm that Song Yuanye was in poor condition. As long as he was deemed unwell, whether he lost the competition or made inappropriate remarks later, they could manage it, and it might even garner some sympathy from the fans.","After some thought, Song Yuanye agreed. Regardless of the method, he just wanted to quickly fade this matter away!","The agent immediately prepared to contact gossip journalists and private hospitals, ensuring the performance was thorough.","\"Wait.\" Song Yuanye stopped the agent. \"Sign me up for the upcoming racing competition.\" He needed to reclaim his lost face.","The agent hesitated, feeling troubled. Although Song Yuanye had marketed himself well and his fans loved his racing persona, he was at best an average enthusiast.","Seeing her hesitation, Song Yuanye's face darkened. \"Just like before, find an entertainment-related one, and then market it again!\"","Did he need to spell it out for her?","The agent sighed, knowing it wasn't that simple. Every racing event Song Yuanye participated in was for entertainment purposes, and almost all of them were paid for by her to solidify his image.","Among all her tasks, this was the one she least wanted to handle. But since Song Yuanye had spoken, she had no choice but to take it on.","...","That night, the news of Song Yuanye's hospitalization made it to the trending searches. The footage, taken from a sneaky angle, showed Song Yuanye being weakly escorted into the hospital.","Soon, messages of fans' heartache flooded the trending search comments.","When the news had sufficiently fermented, Song Yuanye posted a message.","The gist was that he was fine, just a bit unwell, and he also apologized for his inappropriate behavior and remarks during the live broadcast.","Accompanying the post was a photo of him looking weak in the hospital.","[Ah! So heartbroken! Brother, get well soon!]","[Where are those who mocked Song Yuanye? Your apologies, where are they?]","[Brother clearly mentioned he wasn't in good condition, and that Young Master Li forced him to compete. Is this the so-called \"quality\" of the wealthy?]","[And that Jing Yi, isn't she going to apologize to our brother?]","Among the comments, there were also many onlookers. While some felt sorry for Song Yuanye, they weren't pleased with the mention of Jing Yi.","[What does it have to do with Jing Yi? Did she beg your brother to stick to her?]","[Sick? Being sick is an excuse for losing the competition? And for saying nonsense?]","[Don't drag our Jing Yi into this! Or else I'll have to @Jing's CEO and Young Master Jing!]","[Song Yuanye being sick = the whole world is wrong?]","There was also a small group of fans attracted to Li Chengsheng's looks.","[Losing and then pretending to be sick, really can't afford to lose!]","[Blatant lies? It was your brother who wanted to play, and now that he's lost, it's suddenly \"forced\"?]","[Tsk tsk, your brother lost, the car was low-end, and so was the person!]","After the situation escalated, Jing Zeqian received a complaint call from Lu Yichi.","\"It's fine, continue with the program, I'll handle it.\"","After hanging up, Jing Zeqian clicked on the trending search and scrolled through the comments, his brows furrowing deeper, his expression clearly displeased.","Sick? A worn-out excuse.","He made a call, and it connected.","\"Li Chengsheng, what's going on? I told you to go for some practice, and you caused all this trouble.\"","On the other end, Li Chengsheng cried out in protest. How was it his fault? He was also unfairly scolded by so many netizens.","While complaining, Li Chengsheng also took the opportunity to accuse Song Yuanye, insisting that he had ulterior motives.","Jing Zeqian's face darkened as he listened to Li Chengsheng's rambling complaints.","He had initially thought it was just Song Yuanye's group disturbing Jing Yi, but it turned out the other party had such intentions.","Did they really think he, Jing Zeqian, was easy to bully?","An hour later, the public relations team from 'Startrack' stood in Jing Zeqian's office, reporting all the 'private' deeds Song Yuanye had done over the years.","Dating? Plagiarism? Being arrogant? Craving for both popularity and secretly keeping lovers behind the fans' backs, and not just one? He had done quite a few shady things privately.","Jing Zeqian lightly tapped the desk and arranged, \"Assign a few influencers to expose Song Yuanye's deeds.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, the head of the public relations department immediately took over, \"We've already contacted several gossip media outlets, and they will release the first expose immediately. Afterwards, we will use paid comments and fake accounts on social media to amplify the impact rapidly.\"","This was free heat, not taking advantage of it would be a waste!","Jing Zeqian nodded in satisfaction. He wanted to see how Song Yuanye would scheme against Jing Yi now."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Are Overbearing Presidents Reluctant to Go to the Hospital","paragraphs":["When Song Yuanye was in a state of complete distress, Jing Yi was in a good mood because Shen Huaichu had finished his overseas project inspection, and they had arranged to meet today.","Shen Huaichu glanced at the time; their appointed meeting time was approaching. He massaged his temples, attempting to relieve his physical discomfort.","He had already been feeling somewhat unwell on the plane yesterday, but meeting Jing Yi was more important to him right now.","\"Shen Huaichu!\"","Jing Yi waved from afar, smiling as she greeted him.","He stood on a bustling street, wearing a dark gray lapel casual shirt paired with dark casual pants. His hair was slightly disheveled, as if it had been carelessly arranged.","Several people wanted to approach him, but were deterred by his aloof gaze.","Hearing Jing Yi's voice, a gentle light appeared in Shen Huaichu's eyes, his lips curving slightly upward, his entire demeanor softening considerably.","Seeing Jing Yi jogging towards him, Shen Huaichu unconsciously moved forward, raising his arms to catch her as she ran.","Jing Yi stopped half a step in front of him, causing Shen Huaichu to pause, a flash of disappointment crossing his eyes.","Jing Yi's lips curved into a slight smile, her dimples appearing faintly on her cheeks, looking absolutely lovely.","She gently held Shen Huaichu's fingers, \"Have you been waiting long?\" Shen Huaichu raised an eyebrow, his faint smile carrying a hint of resignation, \"No, I just arrived.\"","He reached out to fix her bangs with one hand while his other hand held onto hers.","They had planned to go for a meal, and Jing Yi was about to ask Shen Huaichu what he wanted to eat when she noticed something strange about his hand.","She frowned slightly, holding his hand with both of hers, carefully feeling his temperature.","Shen Huaichu smiled, his thin lips curving slightly, thinking Jing Yi was being playful, and covered her hands with his other hand.","Now Jing Yi could clearly feel the temperature of Shen Huaichu's palm, and she looked up at him, observing carefully.","Looking at him now, his face didn't look well at all.","She raised her hand to feel his forehead temperature, and when she saw him trying to back away, she said seriously, \"Why are you dodging?\"","Shen Huaichu's lips twitched, his temples throbbing, but he didn't dare move away.","Jing Yi placed her hand on his forehead and stared at him in disbelief, \"What's wrong with you? How can you not feel how hot you are?!\" His head was hot enough to fry an egg!","Shen Huaichu forced a smile, taking her hand down and holding it in his palm.","\"It's not that hot. I'm just a little unwell. By the way, what would you like to eat?\"","At a time like this, he was still trying to change the subject?","Jing Yi glared at Shen Huaichu, saying she would take him to the hospital.","Shen Huaichu held Jing Yi back, his lips somewhat pale, \"I'm really fine.\" He felt a bit dizzy, but such a minor illness didn't warrant a hospital visit.","Jing Yi's expression was very serious, her eyes full of disapproval, \"No, you must go to the hospital. You're burning up like this, if you keep running this fever, you'll become an idiot!\"","Shen Huaichu chuckled lightly, \"It's not that dramatic.\" Seeing his dismissive attitude, Jing Yi became even more angry.","It wasn't that she was exaggerating - couldn't he see his own complexion or feel how unwell he was?","Shen Huaichu's expression became particularly gentle as he looked at Jing Yi's unhappy face.","\"Really, I'm fine. I'll just take some medicine when I get back.\"","Jing Yi noticed Shen Huaichu's resistance and sighed heavily, wondering if all these CEO types were averse to hospitals.","The hospitals might as well be decorative pieces in their eyes!","Jing Yi ranted internally but compromised nonetheless - she couldn't exactly knock him out and drag him there.","...","This was Jing Yi's first time visiting Shen Huaichu's home.","However, she wasn't in any mood to be curious, as the person beside her looked even worse.","Jing Yi helped him to the bedroom, her face full of concern, \"Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital? Are you certain?\" Shen Huaichu's lips curved slightly, looking quite weak.","\"Really, there's no need. I'll be fine after taking some fever medicine.\"","Jing Yi sighed and asked where his medicine cabinet was, then busied herself getting a wet towel from the bathroom.","When she returned with the medicine, Shen Huaichu was already lying on the bed in a daze, his face flushed with fever.","Jing Yi helped him sit up, \"Come on, take your medicine first.\" Perhaps because Shen Huaichu was so weak, her voice unconsciously became gentler.","Shen Huaichu obediently took the medicine and lay back down, watching Jing Yi as she continued tucking him in.","\"I'm sorry.\"","Jing Yi looked up, asking curiously, \"What are you sorry for?\"","\"...I was supposed to take you on a date.\"","Jing Yi looked at him helplessly, sat down beside him, and said sarcastically, \"Right, that's exactly what I want - to make my boyfriend who's burning up with fever take me shopping.\"","Shen Huaichu's expression became serious, and he shook his head slightly, \"That's not what I meant. I just wanted to spend more time with you. I haven't seen you for so long.\"","How surprising - a sick Shen Huaichu was quite the smooth talker.","Jing Yi felt his forehead through the towel, checking if he had really been made delirious by the fever, though she knew the medicine couldn't have taken effect so quickly.","\"Did you really miss me that much?\"","Shen Huaichu nodded seriously. If he had known that working overtime to make time would only result in this fever, he would have taken things slower.","But he knew that even if he could go back to a few days ago, he would still compress all his time just to see Jing Yi.","Jing Yi couldn't suppress her smile, her eyes full of joy, \"Don't think that sweet-talking now will get you off the hook. You're sick but still refuse to go to the hospital. You're a thirty-year-old CEO, yet still so stubborn.\"","Shen Huaichu, who had been somewhat drowsy, opened his eyes wider at Jing Yi's words, his voice slightly hoarse.","\"I'm not thirty!\"","Why did that sound so familiar?","Jing Yi was stunned, then rolled her eyes - he was just like her second brother, what was the point of quibbling over one year?","Shen Huaichu was unusually insistent. He was already a few years older than Jing Yi, and now she was adding another year - how could he not mind?","\"The point is, Mr. CEO, you're being quite stubborn.\"","Shen Huaichu understood what Jing Yi meant, but he just didn't want to go to the hospital, didn't want to stay in those stark white wards, didn't want to lie sickly in a hospital bed.","Shen Huaichu fell silent, and Jing Yi noticed his dampened mood. Thinking about it now, in such a large villa, there was only Shen Huaichu alone.","She held his hand, her dimples appearing as she smiled, \"It's good that I'm here, you're lucky to have me!\" Shen Huaichu gazed at Jing Yi's smiling face for a long time, his deep eyes filled with emotion and joy.","His thin lips parted, \"Yes, I really am lucky.\" His tone was completely serious, \"If they were here, they would definitely like you.\"","Jing Yi's heart trembled - 'they' must be Shen Huaichu's parents.","She smiled gently, still holding his hand tightly, \"What kind of people were they?\"","Shen Huaichu's gaze fixed on the distance, as if lost in memories, as if trying to sketch his parents' images in his mind.","What kind of people were his parents?"]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: Jing Yiyi How dare you stay out all night","paragraphs":["Shen Huaichu closed his eyes, a helpless smile playing at the corners of his mouth. It had been so long—so long that the only memory left was the final image of the car accident.","So long that Shen Huaichu no longer knew how to introduce his parents to Jing Yi.","\"Yi-yi, do you think they would be disappointed?\" he asked.","They had both been such outstanding people, yet their son had become like this. He had promised to become an excellent person when he grew up, promised to become their pride.","If it weren't for Jing Yi, he would have been neither truly alive nor dead.","He hadn't been joking earlier—meeting Jing Yi was truly his fortune. He selfishly wanted to keep this last ray of light by his side.","He knew perfectly well that Jing Zeyou and the others didn't approve of him. If he were in their position, he wouldn't want his sister dating someone like him either.","In the end, it was all just his selfishness.","While Shen Huaichu was still lost in these feelings of helplessness, Jing Yi gave his arm a firm pat.","Shen Huaichu looked at Jing Yi, his eyes filled with confusion.","\"How could they be disappointed?! If you were my son, I'd be grinning even in death!\"","Though she was exaggerating, Jing Yi truly meant it. If it were her son who had survived that car accident, helped avenge her, and recovered their property...","\"Which part of that isn't worth being proud of?\"","While she felt sympathy for him, if she were in his position, she definitely wouldn't advise him to let go of his hatred and live peacefully, because she knew deep down that would be impossible.","His parents had died before his eyes, while his enemies possessed what belonged to his family, and their son had treated him like a dog—how could he possibly give up?","Something stirred deep in Shen Huaichu's heart. He tugged at the corner of his mouth and said, \"Yi-yi, just because I'm sick, doesn't mean you can take advantage of me.\"","\"...Alright, alright! Heaven and earth are vast, but the patient comes first. Close your eyes and rest.\"","She hadn't expected him to notice she was taking advantage even while sick—she'd thought his mind would be too muddled by now.","\"What about you?\"","\"I'm not leaving, I'll sleep in the room next door later.\"","Shen Huaichu mumbled drowsily, \"Stay next door then. There are toiletries in the bathroom cabinet, and new clothes in the wardrobe, though they're all men's clothes. I should have prepared some things for you, but I was afraid you'd think I had ulterior motives...\"","He gradually drifted off to sleep.","How strange that he became so talkative when sick?","Jing Yi carefully felt his forehead—the fever seemed to have gone down, probably no need for the compress anymore.","She removed the towel and quietly left the bedroom, stretching as she returned to the living room.","Now she finally had time to appreciate Shen Huaichu's home.","The living room of Shen Huaichu's villa was decorated in black and gray tones, with a large L-shaped dark gray leather sofa being the largest piece of furniture.","There was only one huge abstract oil painting on the wall—she couldn't make out what it depicted. Perhaps it was painted by his aunt?","The ceiling had hidden wall lamps, but even with all of them on, the room wasn't particularly bright. She wondered why he preferred such a dark living room.","The most intricate design was probably the coffee table—a black marble surface, simple and elegant, with only some coffee machines and coffee supplies on top.","It really was big and empty—must be easy to clean, she thought while looking around and making mental notes.","Wait, why did that look so familiar?","Jing Yi walked closer to the tea table, examining a bonsai decoration that seemed completely out of place with the living room's style.","Wasn't this the bonsai decoration that Shen Huaichu had snatched from her at the auction?","She touched the translucent pink morganite, her lips curving into a smile. He must really treasure it—well, it was worth over twenty million, so of course he would.","While Jing Yi was still admiring Shen Huaichu's living room, her phone rang.","Only then did she notice the time—was it that late already?","She hurriedly answered the phone; it was \"Big Brother\" Jing Zeyou calling.","Before Jing Zeyou could speak, Jing Zeqian's angry voice came through, \"Jing Yi-yi, you've only been dating for how long, and you're already staying out all night?!\"","Jing Yi did feel somewhat guilty—she should have called ahead, but it wasn't really staying out all night, was it? It wasn't even midnight yet.","\"Lower your voice. Yi-yi, is something wrong? Do you need me to pick you up?\"","Jing Yi quickly explained, \"No, Big Brother, Shen Huaichu has a fever, and I'm at his place taking care of him.\"","Jing Zeqian's angry voice came through again, \"You're WHERE?!\"","On the other end, Jing Zeyou again told Jing Zeqian to keep his voice down. \"Why not take him to the hospital?\"","Jing Yi couldn't easily explain Shen Huaichu's situation, so she just said he was much better and the fever was almost gone.","\"Should I call a doctor to come over?\" Jing Zeqian's angry voice came through again, \"What doctor?! This is ridiculous! Who doesn't go to the hospital for a fever?!\"","\"It probably won't be necessary, but I might not be able to come back until tomorrow.\" After all, he had just gotten over his fever, and she'd better keep an eye on him.","There was a commotion on the other end, and Jing Zeqian grabbed the phone, \"Tomorrow?! So you're planning to spend the night at his place? A man and woman alone?!\"","Jing Yi replied irritably, \"He's still sick, what could happen?\" She couldn't just leave him here alone, with no one else in the house.","Jing Zeqian strongly disagreed with Jing Yi's words. He even doubted whether Shen Huaichu was really sick, let alone the fact that Jing Yi was planning to spend the night at his place!","As a man, he knew all too well how crafty men could be, especially someone like Shen Huaichu with his hundred and eighty schemes!","\"Second Brother, I'm not a child anymore.\"","\"If you were a child, I wouldn't be so worried!\"","\"?\"","After some argument, Jing Zeqian finally compromised, \"Fine, fine, he's sick, right? I'll come help you take care of him.\"","\"...This is your compromise?\"","Wasn't this already a compromise? He was making such a huge sacrifice—when had he ever taken care of anyone else, let alone another man!","In the end, Jing Yi couldn't argue her way out of it and had to accept that he was coming too. Having one more person around was probably good, right? At least better than leaving Shen Huaichu alone at home.","......","In the morning, Shen Huaichu slowly woke up, staring at the familiar ceiling, taking a moment to gather his thoughts.","He sat up and turned his head to stretch his neck, feeling much better overall.","There was a note on the bedside table.","'I'm next door.'","Shen Huaichu's eyes softened as he carefully put the note in the drawer.","Leaving the room, he noticed sounds coming from the kitchen and headed downstairs.","The thought of seeing Jing Yi first thing in the morning made Shen Huaichu's mood as light as clouds drifting in the sky.","\"Yi-yi...\"","Instead of the person he'd imagined, there was a six-foot-tall man in the kitchen, eating breakfast.","The smile froze on Shen Huaichu's face.","Jing Zeqian looked up, raising an eyebrow with a mischievous smile, \"Good morning, Mr. Shen. Feeling better?\""]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Good Morning from Jing Zeqian","paragraphs":["To be honest, waking up in the morning and not seeing your loved one, but instead seeing a man...","This could be considered Shen Huaichu's most horrifying incident of the year, especially since that person was Jing Zeqian - this horror story was second to none!","Shen Huaichu accepted the breakfast made by Jing Yi, \"Thank you, Yi Yi.\" He sat dazedly on the sofa, trying to calm his nightmare-like panic.","Jing Yi looked amusedly at the smug Jing Zeqian and explained to Shen Huaichu: \"My second brother heard you were sick and was very worried, so he came over late last night.\"","Shen Huaichu didn't know what expression to make. \"...Thank you.\" He had every reason to believe that Jing Zeqian came to check if he was dead yet or not.","Actually, even Jing Yi didn't quite believe what she just said.","[That's all I can say, I tried my best.]","Jing Zeqian sat on the nearby sofa with his coffee, making himself at home like he owned the place.","He even showed concern: \"How are you? Feeling better? You don't know how worried I was yesterday!\" Afraid he might miss the moment Shen Huaichu kicked the bucket.","\"I rushed over overnight, and last night I was worried you'd burn yourself stupid or kick off your blankets, so I had to keep checking your temperature throughout the night. Touching, isn't it?\"","Jing Zeqian said through gritted teeth.","He had no choice - Jing Yi was worried Shen Huaichu might develop a fever again at night and said she wanted to check on him. How could he possibly let Yi Yi go to such a dangerous place?!","That was Shen Huaichu's dangerous territory! The place most saturated with Shen Huaichu's presence!!!","Jing Yi: ...Why are you making Shen Huaichu sound like some wild beast?","The final solution was for Jing Zeqian to take over this task.","Shen Huaichu shuddered, forcing a smile, \"...Thank you for your concern, Second Brother.\"","Touching? How could he not be touched? He was so touched that he thought Jing Zeqian must be mentally ill!","Thinking about how it was Jing Zeqian who covered him with blankets in the middle of the night made Shen Huaichu feel even more uncomfortable.","This was exactly the effect Jing Zeqian wanted; his eyes grew even more smug as he calmed down and elegantly took a sip of his coffee.","Jing Yi usually didn't get involved in their 'battles,' and now was one of those usual times.","She looked at Shen Huaichu who was eating breakfast and reached out to feel his forehead temperature, immediately prompting a cough from Jing Zeqian.","Jing Yi looked helplessly at Jing Zeqian, \"Second Brother, I'm just checking if his fever has gone down?\"","Jing Zeqian wouldn't accept this excuse. He asked Shen Huaichu with a stern face, \"Where's your thermometer?\" Don't try to take advantage of his sister!","Shen Huaichu thought seriously for a moment, \"Second Brother, I don't have a thermometer.\" Then he looked up at Jing Yi, eyes filled with mirth, seemingly anticipating something.","Jing Zeqian: ...Why didn't you just die from the fever?!","\"Then I'll do it!\"","Jing Zeqian stood up, looking solemn as if he was about to 'make a heroic sacrifice.'","Both Shen Huaichu and Jing Yi were stunned. Seeing Jing Zeqian approaching, Shen Huaichu immediately leaned back and said seriously, \"Thank you, Second Brother, but I feel much better now, no need to trouble yourself.\"","Jing Zeqian snorted coldly. Did this kid think he couldn't handle him?","Jing Yi shook her head helplessly; these two were truly born to be at odds with each other.","...","Seeing that Shen Huaichu was mostly recovered, Jing Yi was 'dragged' home by Jing Zeqian. Even until they walked through their front door, Jing Zeqian was still endlessly lecturing.","\"Don't think he's weak just because he's sick. Men are very cunning - what if he's just pretending? Even if you know self-defense, you can't guard against him playing weak. I'm telling you, you need to be more careful. Don't just believe whatever others say...\"","Jing Yi's ears were going numb; she could feel Jing Zeqian's words swirling around her.","\"Did you hear me?!\"","Jing Yi snapped back to attention, responding helplessly, \"...Yes, I heard.\"","[Please, spare me!]","When she saw Jing Zeyou, Jing Yi felt like she'd found her savior. She quickly walked over to him.","\"Big Brother! You're home!\"","[Thank goodness! Thank goodness! Big Brother, please save me!]","Jing Zeyou didn't even need to hear her voice; the 'plea for help' in Jing Yi's eyes was clear enough.","He smiled, \"Is Mr. Shen feeling better?\" Jing Zeqian snorted coldly, \"How could he not be? After being taken care of all night, any virus would have been killed off.\"","[The way you say it makes me sound inhuman.]","\"Next week is Jun Jun's awards ceremony. Yi Yi, are you planning to enter through the red carpet or backstage?\"","Jing Zeyou changed the subject with a smile. Jing Zeqian had already said what needed to be said many times, so there was no need to repeat it.","Besides, this was something he had planned to ask Jing Yi about. The huge success of \"Nineteenth Floor Campus\" had led to nominations for both the drama and its lead actors.","This awards ceremony was quite important, and Jing Yi had been insisting on going to the audience seats to witness it firsthand.","According to reliable information from Jing Zeqian, barring any surprises, the Best Actress award would likely go to Jing Zejun.","Hearing Jing Zeyou's words, Jing Yi's expression became animated again.","\"Can I go?\"","She definitely wanted to watch from the audience seats, but could she even receive an invitation to these film and television awards ceremonies?","Jing Zeqian lounged on the sofa like a young master, \"Invitation? If they knew you were coming, the organizers would arrange multiple cameras for you - who needs an invitation?\"","He hadn't expected that Jing Yi's set visit would quietly lead to her getting a role, and she performed quite well too, becoming quite a hot topic during the drama's promotion.","But Jing Yi disappeared after filming, with no information about any roadshows. If people knew she would appear at the awards ceremony, the media would surely swarm in.","Jing Yi smiled, \"Big Brother, let's go quietly! Give Jun Jun a surprise!\"","Since there was no need to worry about invitations anymore, there was nothing else to consider. She didn't like making a grand entrance on the red carpet anyway - just thinking about it felt troublesome!","Jing Zeyou also preferred going through the backstage. This was an important awards ceremony, and going through the red carpet would probably waste a lot of time.","Their only purpose was to witness Jing Zejun receiving her award.","\"Second Brother, what about you? How will you go?\" Jing Zeqian's status was different from theirs, as he was also the owner of Startrack.","Jing Zeqian yawned. He had trouble sleeping in unfamiliar beds, and with checking on Shen Huaichu throughout the night, he hadn't slept well at all.","\"I have to enter first.\"","He was a presenter at the ceremony, so naturally he would enter openly. Of course, this presenting role was something he had 'fought' for.","Jing Zeqian looked smugly at Jing Yi, \"Can't help it, I'm just part of the entertainment industry, aren't I? This presenting job is rightfully mine.\"","Jing Yi rolled her eyes at him.","[At least I don't have to listen to his preaching anymore, he's like Tang Seng.]","Jing Zeqian: ...Jing Yi is really like an uncontrollable monkey!"]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Gu Lin's Probing","paragraphs":["It took Shen Huaichu several days to break free from the nightmare of 'being taken care of by Jing Zeqian,' and he also learned about Jing Zejun's qualification news. As Jing Yi's boyfriend now, he naturally needed to prepare a congratulatory gift right away.","\"Help me prepare a gift to be sent to the Jing family,\" Shen Huaichu instructed his assistant.","Gu Lin sat on the nearby sofa, drinking coffee and watching the scene with amusement. \"Brother, you're really taking your role as a future brother-in-law seriously.\"","Shen Huaichu ignored Gu Lin's teasing and carefully instructed his assistant about what kind of gift to prepare.","Shen Huaichu's current demeanor was quite a curiosity to Gu Lin, who kept staring at the person behind the desk even after the assistant left.","He looked at him as if he were some rare species.","Shen Huaichu glanced at him, \"If you're that bored, I can have you start the second phase of your internship sooner.\" He had originally planned to give Gu Lin more time to rest and catch his breath.","But now it seemed unnecessary.","\"No! I'm sorry!\"","Gu Lin immediately begged for mercy. He had just managed to temporarily escape from Huarui Group, and having barely rested for a few days, how could he possibly start another departmental internship so soon?","Seeing that Shen Huaichu wasn't going to pursue the matter, Gu Lin breathed a sigh of relief, took a sip of coffee, and secretly glanced at Shen Huaichu who continued working.","Wasn't his brother supposed to have become more good-tempered after falling in love? He hadn't improved much at all! What was Little Wang thinking? Were they still fishing buddies or not? How could he deceive him just because he was the boss's relative?","Shen Huaichu casually lifted his eyelids as Gu Lin sat dazed on the sofa, his expression complex, lost in thought.","\"If you have nothing to do, go keep Aunt company.\" Having him hovering around was really distracting.","Gu Lin snapped back to reality, hearing Shen Huaichu's attempt to dismiss him. He lounged lazily on the sofa and said shamelessly, \"I need to lay low for a while.\"","While Shen Tu was overjoyed about Shen Huaichu dating Jing Yi, it had caused quite a bit of trouble for him.","Previously, when they were both single young men, with his brother taking the lead, Gu Lin could easily handle his mother's marriage pressure. But now that his brother had a girlfriend, he had lost that excuse.","\"So, brother, give me a place to stay?\" He planned to hide out at Shen Huaichu's villa to avoid the pressure.","Shen Huaichu rejected him without a second thought.","\"No.\"","Gu Lin looked over in confusion. Something wasn't right - his brother used to never care about these things, typically just answering, \"Whatever.\"","What was going on? Had the villa gotten a new mistress?","Gu Lin's gaze became increasingly direct until Shen Huaichu looked back at him, causing him to quickly avert his eyes.","Shen Huaichu withdrew his intimidating gaze. While the villa didn't have a mistress yet, it would eventually, and it would be inconvenient if Gu Lin was there when Jing Yi wanted to visit him.","How times have changed.","Gu Lin shook his head helplessly. Some people get a girlfriend and won't even spare a room for their brother anymore.","Gu Lin stole another glance at Shen Huaichu and muttered under his breath, \"The villa has so many rooms, what's wrong with leaving one for me?\" Shen Huaichu ignored him.","Gu Lin pouted. Fine, he was interrupting the CEO's work.","But still, his brother's girlfriend was a race car driver - was that really okay?","Looking at Shen Huaichu working, a barely noticeable hint of worry flashed across Gu Lin's eyes. While he was happy for Shen Huaichu, he couldn't ignore the concern in his heart.","He forced a smile, trying to appear more natural.","\"By the way, brother, Mom's annual physical check-up is coming up soon. Why don't you accompany her this year?\" Shen Huaichu's hand paused imperceptibly as he looked up calmly at Gu Lin. \"You've gone every year, why suddenly ask me to go?\"","Gu Lin picked up his coffee again, avoiding Shen Huaichu's gaze. \"She's been nagging me about finding a girlfriend lately. I just want to avoid it for as long as I can.\"","Shen Huaichu stared deeply at Gu Lin until the latter became uncomfortable, then returned to his previous working state.","\"Gu Lin, since when did you start beating around the bush with me?\"","Gu Lin sighed. How he wished he could speak directly to Shen Huaichu, but...","\"Brother...\"","Shen Huaichu continued staring at his computer screen, though the atmosphere around him had grown colder.","\"It's just seeing a psychologist, what's so hard to say about that?\"","Gu Lin's nose stung as he quietly lowered his head.","After the car accident, Shen Huaichu became extremely averse to fast-moving vehicles and couldn't bear the sound of cars speeding by.","It wasn't just dislike - it was fear, a fear from the depths of his soul.","Shen Huaichu had tried to fight fire with fire, but most attempts ended with him waking up in the hospital. The current situation was already somewhat better.","He had tried such cruel methods, so why wouldn't he be willing to completely resolve this issue?","Gu Lin looked at Shen Huaichu and asked hopefully, \"So will you go?\" Shen Huaichu's cold voice replied, \"No.\"","Gu Lin had misunderstood - his attempts to fight fire with fire were never about overcoming the fear, but about facing it.","Those methods from back then were to remind himself never to forget his parents' vendetta, never to forget that moment of death. Only by remembering it over and over could he engrave this hatred in his heart.","Otherwise, how did Gu Lin think he had gotten through these twenty years?","Gu Lin stared at him blankly, disappointment in his eyes. Another failure...","\"You're barely in your twenties, why worry about so much?\" Gu Lin kept his head down without speaking. \"Didn't you want a virtual gaming prototype machine? I had one set prepared for you.\"","Gu Lin's mood remained low, and Shen Huaichu's words only made him feel worse.","Shen Huaichu let out a light sigh and stopped his work, wondering how his uncle had raised such a sensitive child.","What kind of heir was this?","\"Don't want it? If not, I'll have it returned.\"","Gu Lin quickly raised his head, \"Don't return it! It takes forever to get an appointment on the official website.\" Not to mention this was a complete set.","This prototype machine was new equipment launched by Hengjing Group, with functions far beyond just gaming. Gu Lin had tried it before and was completely won over by its immersive experience and comfort.","A hint of amusement flashed in Shen Huaichu's eyes - this kid was still so easy to deal with. \"One condition: you start your position in the investment department earlier.\"","\"What?!\"","Gu Lin's voice was full of reluctance, but Shen Huaichu wouldn't let him escape.","He had realized that Gu Lin needed to master not just how to manage a company, but also all the abilities a leader should possess, which he hadn't yet grasped.","Gu Lin collapsed helplessly on the sofa, silently mourning his lost leisure time. He had ended up losing more than he gained - he hadn't successfully fooled his brother, lost his vacation, and his only consolation was getting the equipment he wanted.","Was this really worth it?"]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: A Warm and Empathetic Wen Qingyan","paragraphs":["Flashing lights illuminated the red carpet, and the atmosphere of the banquet was solemn yet grand. Jing Zejun wore an elegant gold-trimmed diamond dress, walking down the red carpet with Wen Qingyan, occasionally stopping to interact with the cameras.","In front of the cameras stood the main creative team of \"Nineteenth Floor Campus,\" a TV series nominated for the Golden Eagle Awards. Both Wen Qingyan and Jing Zejun were nominated for Best Actor and Best Actress, respectively.","Jing Zejun and Wen Qingyan reached the center of the stage, answered a few questions from the host, and then found their seats. Jing Zejun's seat was next to Jing Zeqian, who had been waiting for some time.","Seeing Jing Zejun sit down, Jing Zeqian instinctively helped her adjust her skirt. Surrounded by the gazes of those around them, he didn't seem to feel anything was out of place.","The live broadcast was in progress.","[I'm here! Zejun! \"Nineteenth Floor Campus\" is so good!]","[Little Jing! Little Jing!]","[He even helped his sister adjust her skirt!]","[Isn't Yi Yi here? She was in the show, right? A bit disappointing.]","[But, Little Jing's seat seems a bit off, doesn't it?]","Jing Zeqian's seat should have been in the front row. Wen Qingyan was seated with the crew, so he didn't get special treatment. Jing Zeqian simply wanted to sit next to Jing Zejun.","He had been waiting rather boredly, but with Jing Zejun's arrival, they started chatting.","He told Jing Zejun about the last time he went to Shen Huaichu's house, \"You wouldn't believe it, but when he woke up and saw me, he looked like he'd seen a ghost.\"","Jing Zejun was both surprised and amused, covering her lips to suppress the curve of her mouth.","Her second brother really could pull off something like that. No wonder he was her brother.","Wen Qingyan, on the other side, momentarily empathized, awkwardly chuckling a few times. But deep down, he felt a pang of sympathy for Shen Huaichu.","Wen Qingyan wasn't very familiar with this president of Huarui Group, but he had heard that he was a decisive and ruthless leader. To be scared like that by someone so cold...","No wonder he was his boss.","If it were him...","Wen Qingyan imagined waking up, thinking his girlfriend was in the kitchen making breakfast, his heart softening, only to open the door and see his brother-in-law!","Wen Qingyan felt a shiver down his spine. He had to remember this! He must prevent such a thing from happening!","[What are they talking about? Why does Wen look so uncomfortable?]","[Maybe the brother-in-law is warning the sister's suitor? Hahaha]","[No, Little Jing is telling Jing Zejun about how he took care of someone with a fever, and the person freaked out when they woke up. I can only lip-read this much.]","[Wow! The person above is amazing, a lip-reading master!]","[Is it Little Jing's partner?]","[Let me add! It's not Little Jing's partner, but someone related to Yi Yi. He mentioned Yi Yi.]","[The comments section is full of lip-reading masters, I can't deny it.]","[Wen Qingyan must be scared of this happening to him. Imagine waking up thinking it's your girlfriend, but it's your boss. Who wouldn't be scared?]","The comments section was on the path to uncovering the truth, and the awards ceremony was about to begin.","The host's voice rang out, and applause and cheers filled the banquet hall. The moment for the TV series nominations had arrived, with lights focusing on the stage.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi sneaked into the audience from the backstage, bending slightly to find her pre-arranged corner seat.","Following behind her was Jing Zeyou, watching his sister's stealthy movements. He paused for a moment, considering whether he should do the same.","Nah, he could be photographed, but not in this manner.","Jing Zeyou strode over and calmly sat down beside her.","This was all pre-arranged. They were watching live, while Lin Ruiqing and her husband were watching the live broadcast backstage.","The stage had reached the awarding of the Best TV Series.","The chairman of the TV Series Production Industry Association announced the winner, \"Now, I will announce this year's Best TV Series award.\" He slowly opened the envelope, and the audience was silent, especially the main creative team including Jing Zejun, who were particularly nervous.","\"This is the pinnacle of art and creativity, and a story that will be unforgettable,\" the chairman paused, looking around at the audience before announcing solemnly, \"This year's Best TV Series award goes to 'Nineteenth Floor Campus'!\"","The venue erupted in thunderous applause and cheers.","The main creative team of \"Nineteenth Floor Campus\" was ecstatic, with the director's eyes glistening with tears as he stepped onto the stage.","\"We express our heartfelt gratitude for this honor! This award not only belongs to our crew...\"","The director was very excited, his voice trembling with gratitude as he thanked everyone, including Jing Yi, \"...and we are also very grateful to Jing Yi, who originally came to visit the set but was pushed into acting.\"","The audience burst into a wave of good-natured laughter, and the camera simultaneously focused on Jing Zejun and Jing Zeqian.","Jing Yi took a moment to clap, continuing with her tasks, \"Big Brother, hold this for me.\" She handed Jing Zeyou a cheering stick.","Last time she met Jing Zejun's fans, she learned what it meant to be a proper supporter. Even though there were only two of them, they had to make their presence known.","Jing Zeyou glanced at the dozen or so fans not far away.","\"Why are some sisters sitting so far away?\"","\"Did they get the wrong seats? This area is for fans, right?\"","\"You know what, their gear is pretty complete.\"","\"Wait, look closely, isn't that Jing Zejun's older brother and sister?\"","\"Ah? Where? Let me see!\"","\"Really! I thought they were sneaking around, maybe stalkers!\"","\"What? What are you talking about?\"","The identity of the two in the corner had already spread from one group of fans to another.","Jing Zeyou turned his head, watching Jing Yi still pulling on the cheering banner, hesitating on how to tell her that their disguise plan had failed within minutes.","...","The awards continued, and \"Nineteenth Floor Campus\" swept the ceremony, with Wen Qingyan unsurprisingly winning Best Actor.","Jing Zejun sat in her seat, her emotions growing more tense. She was happy for the crew but also more afraid of missing out on the award herself.","The next award was for Best Actress, and Jing Zeqian needed to head backstage to prepare.","Seeing the person beside her nervously clutching her skirt, Jing Zeqian smiled slightly, gently patting Jing Zejun's hand to reassure her.","He stood up, looking towards the corner not far away, his smile slightly stiffening.","The corner had little light, flashing with cheering sticks, and Jing Yi was still holding a banner in front of her!","What kind of disguise was that?!","It was only because Jing Zejun was too nervous to notice the commotion behind her. Anyone with eyes had started glancing over!"]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Lu Yichi's Gratitude","paragraphs":["Jing Zeqian went backstage, and Jing Zejun seemed to be getting more and more nervous. Wen Qingyan leaned closer to her and whispered about his first time winning an award, trying to ease her tension.","Back then, everyone around him was either in suits or glamorous gowns, and he felt quite out of place sitting among them.","Jing Zejun gradually got distracted.","[He really made me cry, too much love, right?]","[Speaking of which, haven't they gotten together yet? No confession at an awards ceremony like this?]","[Do you think they might already be dating?]","[I don't think so, their vibe doesn't seem like it.]","[I'm just concerned about the two people in the corner, what are they up to?]","[Sister, you saw them too?!]","[Are they stalkers? Sneaking around like that.]","[I've been watching those two the whole time, and it turns out everyone else noticed too!]","[I have to say, I think the director knows something; he always subconsciously avoids that corner.]","[Maybe some fans sat in the wrong seats?]","[I feel like I've seen them before.]","While the danmaku (live comments) were speculating, the Best Actress award ceremony began. Jing Zeqian stood in the center of the stage and opened the envelope.","No surprises there.","He looked at Jing Zejun in the audience, his lips curling up as he solemnly announced her name.","Jing Zejun's heart skipped a beat, then raced like a wild horse that had been set free.","Knowing she had a high chance of winning was one thing, but hearing her name called out was another.","In that moment, time seemed to stand still. Her eyes welled up, her smile radiant, but her body trembled slightly, unable to contain her excitement.","Wen Qingyan, equally excited, stood up, his eyes filled with joy and affection. He took a step forward and gently wrapped his arms around Jing Zejun.","\"Junjun, congratulations.\"","Jing Zejun's eyes sparkled with tears as she raised her hands to return the hug, wanting to share her joy with Wen Qingyan.","\"Thank you, Qingyan Ge.\"","Jing Zejun walked onto the stage, her trembling hand taking the trophy. Jing Zeqian gently wiped away the tears at the corner of her eyes and hugged her.","\"Well done!\"","Jing Zejun's smile was as bright as the sun.","At that moment, the banner in the corner started wildly swaying, and Jing Yi, behind the banner, reminded Jing Zeyou.","\"Big Brother, wave the glow sticks and fans!\"","If it weren't for worrying about his image, she would have given him this support headgear to wear. She had to hold the banner, so the headgear was invisible.","Jing Zeyou noticed the increasing number of glances around him. The hand waving the glow stick felt heavy.","It was his fault; if their seats were in the fan section, it wouldn't be so conspicuous. But even in the corner, they stood out.","Jing Zejun finally noticed the two busy in the corner, paused for a moment, and her smile grew even brighter.","[...What are those two in the corner doing? The fans are so distracted just watching them.]","[Wait, don't you guys think these two look a bit familiar?]","[Good heavens! Who made our dignified Jing CEO do such a thing!]","[Jing Yi, it's you again! Don't think I can't see you just because you're hiding behind the banner!]","[Hahahaha, I'm dying of laughter, Jing CEO, if you're being held hostage, just say something.]","[This gear is way too complete!]","[Hahahaha, Jing Zeyou's expression, I'm about to die laughing.]","Meanwhile, backstage, Lin Ruiqing and her husband, Jing Beicheng, were witnessing their eldest son in such a state for the first time.","Lin Ruiqing laughed and took screenshots, afraid to miss any exciting moments, while Jing Beicheng also found it rare and took a few extra glances.","Seeing that everyone had noticed, the director's camera started boldly focusing on the two in the corner.","It wasn't until Jing Zejun finished her thank-you speech and stepped off the stage that the corner finally quieted down.","Realizing that she had exposed herself, Jing Yi thought, did I make too much noise?","Jing Zeyou sighed lightly, \"Not too much, just got noticed within two minutes of entering.\"","Jing Yi: ...Is it too late to leave now?","The surrounding gazes and cameras made it impossible for Jing Yi to leave openly. She was worried, but then someone sat down beside her.","He smiled, revealing neatly arranged white teeth, exuding a youthful spirit.","\"Hello, Miss Jing Yi, I'm Lu Yichi.\"","Lu Yichi had come specifically to thank Jing Yi for her role in the Song Yuanye affair.","After Song Yuanye was exposed, the person most affected besides Song himself was the artist who was similar to him, like Lu Yichi.","During this period, he had been furiously 'picking up equipment,' signing contracts with major luxury brands. After all, when an ambassador has an accident, you have to quickly replace them, right?","And he, Lu Yichi, was the perfect candidate!","Jing Yi had seen Lu Yichi's introduction on 'Startrack' but had never met him in person. She was a bit surprised when he came over to greet her.","\"Hello, I'm Jing Yi.\"","Jing Zeyou glanced over. Lu Yichi, an artist from 'Startrack.'","Knowing this was a big shot he couldn't afford to offend, Lu Yichi became even more cautious. \"Hello, Mr. Jing, I'm Lu Yichi, an artist from 'Startrack.' I've come to thank Miss Jing Yi and say hello.\"","Jing Zeyou nodded lightly, not joining their conversation, and continued watching the awards, glancing at the increasingly close camera.","Forget it, when there are too many problems, you stop worrying about them.","Jing Yi was puzzled. \"You came to thank me?\" They hadn't even met before; what was this about?","Lu Yichi glanced at the camera, covering his mouth with his hand, maintaining a proper distance between them.","Since he was similar to Song Yuanye, their fan bases were quite similar. If his fans went to Jing Yi's page and said something inappropriate, this wouldn't be a thank-you but an act of revenge.","More importantly, Song Yuanye was a prime example. If Jing Zeqian found out his fans were acting similarly, Lu Yichi didn't think Jing Zeqian would spare him just because he was from 'Startrack.'","Lu Yichi briefly explained the Song Yuanye affair.","Jing Zeqian hadn't told Jing Yi about this, not wanting to dirty her ears, so Jing Yi was unaware of all that had happened in just a few days.","She smiled and was about to say something when she mimicked Lu Yichi's low-voiced action.","\"You don't need to thank me; you should thank your boss.\"","It was Jing Zeqian who resolved the matter, so it had nothing to do with her.","Lu Yichi didn't think so. If it weren't for Jing Yi, Jing Zeqian wouldn't have had time to deal with someone like Song Yuanye, and he wouldn't have had the chance to 'pick up equipment' and gain a wave of traffic.","\"Thank both, anyway, Miss Jing Yi and Mr. Jing are family, no difference.\"","Jing Yi couldn't help but smile. This guy was quite amusing. The two gradually started chatting.","Jing Zeqian's gaze fell on them, his brows slightly furrowed. Why was Lu Yichi here? Didn't he know his own career path? Was he going to have to deal with another 'Song Yuanye'?"]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: Jingyi CP Big Stir-Fry","paragraphs":["Jing Yi and Jing Zeyou were not the main focus of the ceremony, so despite the director's desire to cash in on the buzz, they didn't overdo it.","However, these few glimpses were enough for netizens to start speculating.","A rising star in the entertainment industry and a wealthy young princess? Hmm, quite the intriguing pair.","As a result, amidst the sea of comments, some fans began to ship them as a couple.","On the other side, Cheng Shu's gaze fell on the two of them. She couldn't help but feel that Lu Yichi was indeed lucky. Not only did he have Startrack backing him, but now he had also unexpectedly gained a boost in status.","The situation with Song Yuanye had caused quite a stir at the company. Cheng Shu understood that it must have been because Song Yuanye had offended someone he shouldn't have, which led to his rapid downfall.","Her own situation wasn't much better. After all, she had recently been promoting a couple image with him, so she was inevitably affected.","But, when it came down to it, Cheng Shu actually felt a bit grateful to Jing Yi. Her actions had given her a chance to catch her breath from this exhausting ordeal.","Should she start thinking about her next steps? Due to the recent hype, she hadn't been able to get her hands on any good scripts. So, she had tried to ride the coattails of a top-tier star. Now, though, the hype was there, but it wasn't quite what she had hoped for.","Cheng Shu drifted into a daze, her gaze still fixed on Jing Yi and Lu Yichi.","Jing Yi felt a gaze on her and turned to see the female artist who had been following Song Yuanye at the racetrack.","The other woman seemed surprised that Jing Yi had noticed her. Their eyes met, and the woman's expression betrayed a hint of panic.","Jing Yi's beautiful eyes curved into a smile, a friendly yet slightly mischievous smile.","Cheng Shu was momentarily stunned, then she smiled faintly and nodded slightly.","...","After the ceremony ended, Jing Yi's first order of business was to rush to the pre-booked restaurant to celebrate Jing Zejun's success with the Jing family.","Meanwhile, discussions about the Jing Yi and Lu Yichi couple began to quietly surface on Twitter.","By the time more netizens noticed, their couple even had a fan page.","['One Chi'? Is this couple too niche?]","[That was fast! It's only their first public appearance together, and they already have a fan page?]","[You can't deny, their looks are pretty compatible!]","[Ahhh! They look so perfect together!]","Perhaps mirroring their idols, Lu Yichi's fans didn't express too much opposition. After all, their idol had just shot to fame, and Jing Yi was the sister of their boss.","This situation seemed like a win-win, and some fans even subtly encouraged it.","However, many fans who had been shipping Jing Yi with others quickly caught wind and joined in.","[I refuse to accept! I've always shipped Wen Yin and Jing Yi! Don't two lively and cute kids deserve a couple fan page?]","[Sister, I have to say, your ship is a bit niche.]","[What's niche about it? Jing Yi and Wen Yin have been hanging out even after the show ended. Isn't that enough to ship?]","[Anyone else shipping the red-haired guy? I think he and Jing Yi would be a great match!]","[Me, me, me! Just imagining them racing together, it's perfect!]","Some slightly less niche couples:","[All you niche ships, step aside! Jing Yi and Jing Zejun are the real deal!]","[Jing Yi attended her award ceremony! What could be more genuine than that?]","[Em... while that's true, isn't it a bit... you know?]","[Well, if you insist, I've already set up a fan page for Jing Yi and the Big Boss Jing!]","[Hey, you don't need to do that. Just check out 'Midnight CP'.]","[Ah? That name is truly niche. I have a feeling you're using the car as a cover to avoid getting caught by Boss Jing!]","[Heh, our Jing Zeqian and Jing Yi thread is pretty popular!]","[Jing Zeqian is the boss of an entertainment company, you know. Aren't you afraid he'll shut down the fan page?]","Some netizens who caught wind of rumors:","[Is it possible that Jing Yi already has her own couple? Like a boyfriend with a title?]","[I heard from a gossip account that Jing Yi picks up her boyfriend after work.]","[I don't believe it! Either pick one of these ships, or I refuse to accept Jing Yi's couple is some random nobody!]","Gu Lin was having a field day, reading and even reciting the comments to Shen Huaichu.","\"And this one, 'Fans of the nobody, please exit this discussion!' Hahahaha, nobody, hahahaha.\"","This was undoubtedly the funniest joke he'd heard all year, no contest!","Shen Huaichu, the 'legitimate partner' and 'nobody' who couldn't find it in himself to laugh: How did the whole world wake up wanting to steal Jing Yi from him?","Gu Lin's laughter grew louder, and Shen Huaichu glanced at him.","\"Don't you have anything better to do? Is the investment department that idle? Need me to assign you more work?\"","A triple whammy of questions!","Gu Lin's smile froze on his face. He silently put away his phone and the smile on his lips.","He knew, when someone was annoyed, they acted like this.","Not even three seconds of silence passed before Gu Lin's eyes darted around, his desire to watch the drama impossible to hide. \"Brother, do you need me to set up a fan page for you?\"","Shen Huaichu's expression remained cold. Gu Lin glanced at the pen in his brother's hand. If it weren't for the fact that he was gripping it so tightly, Gu Lin might have believed his brother didn't care.","Gu Lin shrugged, stood up, \"Alright, alright, I was just trying to be helpful. If you don't need it, then forget it.\" After teasing his brother, Gu Lin left the office with a carefree air.","The next moment, Shen Huaichu picked up his phone and started browsing through the fan pages Gu Lin had mentioned. The more he looked, the darker his expression became.","There was even a fan page for Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian?! Wasn't that just too much?!","...","Jing Yi looked at the small mountain of various items beside her. T-shirts? Jackets? Hats? Bracelets? Even shoes?","What was this little thing? A phone charm?","\"Do I have to wear all of this for our date today?\" Shen Huaichu nodded seriously, \"Last time we missed out because of your illness. This time, we'll make up for it all at once.\"","She didn't mind making up for it, but why did they have to wear exactly the same outfits?","Jing Yi looked at Shen Huaichu's current outfit, which was identical to the items he had brought. Even the phone charm was the same.","She picked up Shen Huaichu's phone, looking puzzled. \"When did you start liking to hang things on your phone?\" Shen Huaichu's expression was a bit unnatural, his gaze shifting. \"It shows more importance to the date.\"","This was the result of Shen Huaichu's assistant's investigation. Apparently, many 'undercover couples' were exposed through matching outfits.","He looked at the items in front of him, his eyes filled with anticipation. Now, from head to toe, they were all matching. Surely, it would be easy for everyone to see they were a couple!","Jing Yi usually didn't refuse Shen Huaichu's little requests, and this time was no different. It also saved her the trouble of figuring out what to wear for their date."]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Shen Huaichu, Who Wants a Little Fame","paragraphs":["Shen Huaichu sat in the living room, waiting for Jing Yi to change her clothes. He sat upright, answering Jing Beicheng's \"casual\" questions in a formal, business-like manner, as if he were reporting to his boss.","\"I heard you went overseas for an inspection recently?\"","\"Yes, Huarui Group is in its initial stages of rebuilding, so I went to inspect some overseas projects...\"","Lin Ruiqing shook her head in frustration. Why does everyone have to adopt this meeting-like posture?","And what kind of casual questions are these?","After Shen Huaichu started dating Jing Yi, he had officially visited their home as her boyfriend. Although the three men present at the time didn't exactly look pleased, at least they acknowledged him.","This visit had also been announced in advance. Jing Yi said it was just to pick her up, so there was no need for any special reception.","Lin Ruiqing hadn't prepared anything special, but she did remind Jing Beicheng to be a bit more welcoming and to casually ask some everyday questions. After all, as her daughter's boyfriend, these conversations could reveal a lot about his character, personality, and capabilities.","But what did she hear? Were these really casual questions?","Jing Beicheng listened intently, his expression serious, as if he were listening to a subordinate's report.","\"Now that Huarui Group has undergone restructuring, your work should be easier, but you still need to focus on training your employees. The previous Huarui Group had far too many nepotistic connections...\"","Shen Huaichu listened carefully, showing no sign of perfunctory behavior.","Lin Ruiqing found it all rather troublesome. Oh well, as long as they're happy.","She got up and went to the kitchen to help Aunt Wang make some desserts.","When Jing Yi came downstairs and heard the two men's \"work report\"-like conversation, she was momentarily stunned.","【What are they even talking about? Work reports? Company development?】","Jing Beicheng cleared his throat, looked up at Jing Yi on the stairs, and then glanced at Shen Huaichu's outfit, his displeasure evident.","\"Mom, Dad, Shen Huaichu and I are heading out.\"","Lin Ruiqing came out from the kitchen, and seeing the two of them dressed identically, she was momentarily surprised.","Couples wearing matching outfits—she could understand that. But why did they have to wear exactly the same?","\"...Alright, have fun.\"","Even after the two left, Lin Ruiqing still couldn't figure it out. Jing Beicheng, on the other hand, remained visibly displeased.","\"What's wrong with you now?\"","She had a feeling that if she didn't ask, her husband could maintain that expression for a full day and night.","Jing Beicheng snorted coldly. \"He's already the CEO of a major group, yet he indulges in these frivolous things.\"","He had thought that being steady was Shen Huaichu's only redeeming quality. He had even been worried that the young man might not be able to handle the remaining \"old foxes\" in the Shen family and had thus patiently discussed company development with him.","But it seemed the kid's mind wasn't really on that!","Lin Ruiqing laughed, clearly catching Jing Beicheng's implied meaning.","\"How do you know it wasn't your daughter's idea?\" Jing Beicheng raised an eyebrow. \"Of course I know my daughter. It must have been that boy's idea.\"","Having been young once himself, he could easily see through the young man's intentions.","Whether it was Jing Yi's idea or not didn't really matter. Lin Ruiqing was just glad to see her daughter and her boyfriend getting along well.","But going out dressed like that—was that really okay? Lin Ruiqing couldn't help but feel a bit worried.","...","That afternoon, Jing Zeqian received a report from his subordinates.","Just moments ago, several marketing accounts' posts about Jing Yi had been intercepted by 'Startrack's PR team. The reason? The posts involved Jing Yi.","'Startrack' was a top entertainment company, and its PR team was renowned. The recent Song Yuanye incident had showcased just how extensive the company's information network was.","The PR team knew how popular the Jing Yi CP had become recently. Since the discussions weren't negative, Jing Zeqian hadn't intervened much, but he had instructed them to keep an eye on the trends.","These marketing accounts were about to reveal Jing Yi's romantic relationship. Without even verifying the accuracy of the information, who was this man?","They didn't even clarify his identity, just posting a photo and a few blurry videos.","Purely for clicks! Definitely for clicks! That person was probably just an actor who looked like Jing Yi!","Shen Huaichu, the \"clickbait\" target: ...","Jing Zeqian was almost in stitches.","In the footage, a couple dressed identically from head to toe stood hand in hand in front of an ice cream shop.","He had been curious about who would be so reckless as to exploit Jing Yi's popularity, but seeing Shen Huaichu's deliberate actions in the video and considering the recent popularity of Jing Yi's CP, he quickly understood what Shen Huaichu was up to.","The guy just wanted to confirm his \"official\" status through this paparazzi exposure, yet he was also worried that Jing Yi might get angry, so he took this roundabout approach.","But who exposes their relationship by dressing exactly the same from head to toe?!","\"Hahahaha, well done! Block any gossip about this, no matter the cost.\"","Seeing Jing Zeqian's satisfied smile, the public relations team felt proud, even puffing out their chests a bit—they were that dedicated to their jobs.","After the report, the PR team left, and Jing Zeqian continued to laugh at the photo, finding it hilarious enough to last him a month.","Lu Yichi, who was in the middle of briefing Jing Zeqian, couldn't help but peek over.","He had come to discuss the recent popularity of his CP with Jing Yi, only to stumble upon the public relations team reporting this news.","\"Is that Jing Yi's boyfriend, Jing Zong?\" Lu Yichi asked, seeing Jing Zeqian in such a good mood that his tone was unusually gentle.","\"Yes, she just started dating him,\" Jing Zeqian replied.","Lu Yichi gasped. This was bad—he was doomed! Jing Yi had a boyfriend, yet his CP with her was trending!","Not only could this affect Jing Yi, but it could also cause trouble for her boyfriend.","Lu Yichi hurriedly explained, \"Jing Zong, I really didn't mean it. I just wanted to thank Jing Yi.\" He hadn't expected that just a few words would lead to a CP super topic and trending status.","Luckily, his fans seemed quite accepting, at least unlike Song Yuanye's fans.","Jing Zeqian remained cheerful. \"It's really fine. Your fans seem to enjoy it, and it's giving you some extra heat.\"","\"But just this once. If I find out you're using her...\" Jing Zeqian's sharp eyes conveyed a warning, and Lu Yichi nodded quickly.","Jing Zeqian went back to looking at the photo, while Lu Yichi was puzzled. If that was Jing Yi's boyfriend, why was his boss blocking the photo? And who exactly was he?","Looking at Jing Zeqian's good mood, Lu Yichi ventured, \"Jing Zong, who is Jing Yi's boyfriend?\"","Jing Zeqian lightly tapped the photo. \"Shen Huaichu. If you want to see his face, check the business news or Huarui Group's official website.\"","\"...\" Lu Yichi was momentarily petrified.","Did he really need to go to Huarui Group's website to see Shen Huaichu's face?! He knew who the CEO of Huarui Group was!","Thinking about how his CP with Jing Yi was still trending, Lu Yichi felt utterly doomed."]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Jing Zeqian, His Life's Enemy","paragraphs":["Shen Huaichu successfully sent Jing Yi home, but he didn't see any news about her until late at night.","What went wrong?","Later, he learned from his assistant about Jing Zeqian's actions.","\"...I see.\"","Holding his phone, Shen Huaichu sank into deep thought. Jing Zeqian truly was his lifelong nemesis.","Still, he had to make the call, just in case.","\"Brother Jing.\"","\"Shen Huaichu, good evening!\" The voice on the other end sounded cheerful. \"What's the matter? Calling me so late?\"","Shen Huaichu remained expressionless. \"Brother Jing, I heard something of mine got intercepted by Startrack?\"","\"Oh, yes, there was such a thing.\" And then? Wasn't he supposed to explain?","Shen Huaichu resigned himself and pressed further, \"I was wondering if you could, uh, not, intercept, it.\"","\"Oh? How could that be?! This is a matter of your reputation, Shen Huaichu. How could I not help you stop it?\"","If the voice on the other end wasn't so smug, maybe he would have believed it.","\"Brother Jing, have you ever thought that I did all this just to gain some reputation?\"","He was just an unknown nobody! Now he was just trying to make some effort, yet Jing Zeqian had to be an obstacle?","\"Ah! Your reputation is already very good, Shen Huaichu. You don't need any more!\"","Jing Zeqian wasn't about to let Shen Huaichu have his way so easily.","Shen Huaichu pulled a face. \"Well, thank you for the compliment, Jing Zeqian!\"","\"But Jing Zeqian, instead of blocking my news, why don't you focus more on managing your artists?\"","Like that one still trending on the hot list, Lu Yichi, the singer-dancer under Startrack, Jing Zeqian's company.","\"Oh, Shen Huaichu! Don't be so petty. I've asked around, it was just an accident. Lu Yichi was just expressing gratitude to Jing Yi; there's no other meaning.\"","Shen Huaichu frowned. Where did this middle-aged uncle vibe come from?","And the other side just kept talking, \"I know, young people care about these things, but really, what's the big deal? It's just playing along with the scene. Besides, I'm Jing Yi's brother, don't I know what she's thinking?\"","Shen Huaichu: ...Then why don't you take down those trending hashtags!","The more he listened, the more his head hurt. Finally, when Jing Zeqian seemed to be done, just as Shen Huaichu was about to speak, the other party said one more sentence before hanging up.","He said, \"By the way, Shen Huaichu, don't worry. For your reputation, I'll definitely help you block similar news!\"","Shen Huaichu stared at the disconnected call and couldn't help but laugh.","Very well, there was no \"just in case.\" Jing Zeqian was indeed his lifelong nemesis!","...","The online buzz didn't catch Jing Yi's attention, but the rest of the Jing family did hear about it, from Jing Zeqian's gleeful mouth.","It wasn't exactly a secret, but under Jing Zeqian's intentional concealment, Jing Yi remained unaware. Plus, she was busy practicing driving and didn't have time to think about these things.","Shen Tu, however, took notice.","Shen Huaichu looked at his happy-go-lucky aunt and said helplessly, \"Auntie, you don't have to go rank-boosting, do you?\"","He didn't even have a proper title yet, and his dear aunt was busy rank-boosting for his girlfriend's CP. Who could he even talk to about this?","Shen Tu didn't even look up. \"Oh, don't worry. It's just for fun online. Besides, Jing Yi doesn't even know about it, and even if she did, she wouldn't take it seriously. It's all just fleeting buzz!\"","She was very clear about it. These were just netizens having fun, and her reason for rank-boosting was simple: she couldn't let that male star and Jing Yi dominate the scene!","Using a less popular hashtag could attract attention to the opposing one.","Shen Huaichu: ...Thanks, but I'm not comforted.","Shen Huaichu glanced over and saw that his aunt's favorite CP was Jing Yi and Li Chengsheng.","Li Chengsheng, the son of luxury brand L.","Great, his girlfriend's brother was pushing Lu Yichi, and his own aunt was pushing the red-haired rich kid.","And he, the actual boyfriend, was still an unknown nobody without even a hashtag.","\"...Auntie, even if you rank-boost every day, this hashtag won't make it to the trending list.\" Should be said, none of them would.","Shen Tu was not pleased. She had already said it was just fleeting buzz, so why was her nephew still being so sour?","\"It's just a hashtag, why are you being so serious?\"","Shen Huaichu was helpless. Who was being serious here? Who was staying up until the early hours to be the first to rank-boost? Who watched every 'fandom' video every day? Who boosted the hashtag's heat every day?","Even rallying Gu Lin and others in the group to do the same. Was this really his aunt?","Well, it was her. Shen Tu was a bit guilty but still stood her ground. \"I'm just treating it like a virtual game! And who am I doing this for? Isn't it to pull down those other hashtags?\"","Seeing her nephew's expressionless face, she added, \"Or, should I create one for you and Jing Yi?\" Though using her nephew and Jing Yi's hashtag to attract attention might be a bit tough.","What's the point of creating one? He was just an unknown nobody, so forget it.","Shen Tu rolled her eyes at Shen Huaichu and muttered, \"Pretentious, you obviously want it.\" She continued boosting the hashtag's heat. \"I'd like to ship you and Jing Yi, but you have to bring her to me first!\"","How long had they been dating, and she still hadn't seen even half of Jing Yi. Those who knew thought they were dating, those who didn't might think her nephew had delusions.","Shen Huaichu casually said, \"She has an important competition coming up, so we might have to wait until it's over to meet.\"","Competition? A racing competition?","Shen Tu paused and stopped rank-boosting. \"Are you... okay?\"","Shen Huaichu looked calm and composed, taking a sip from his water glass. \"Of course, what could be wrong with me?\" He was fine, and he could even often visit Jing Yi during her training.","Shen Tu stared at the red-haired guy in the screen, a bit lost in thought. Rank-boosting was just to tease her nephew, who always didn't bring Jing Yi to visit her.","She thought, maybe hobbies could be transcended, and they could completely have different ones.","\"Huaichu, do you know you've been a bit off lately?\"","Shen Huaichu was at the Gu family today because Shen Tu had called him over. Otherwise, he would have been at Huarui Group handling work.","Shen Huaichu remained calm. \"Did Gu Lin tell you?\" Shen Tu shook her head.","Gu Lin's odd behavior was one thing, and Shen Huaichu's was another.","Though not obvious, how could she not notice that Shen Huaichu had been increasingly distracted lately?","\"You're overthinking it. I'm fine.\"","Shen Tu sighed, shaking her head helplessly. Hopefully, it really was just her overthinking."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: Daily Training","paragraphs":["As night fell, the visibility on the racetrack became limited, and the lights of the racing cars darted through the darkness.","Jing Yi wore a racing suit, and the tightly fastened safety belt around her waist gave her a sense of protection and restraint. Sweat trickled down her cheeks under her helmet, but she had no time to care, her hands gripping the steering wheel tightly.","Jing Yi operated skillfully, and with the roar of the engine, the car shot forward like an arrow.","However, a mistake occurred on the straight section of the track. Not far away, the coach frowned slightly, his expression showing a hint of dissatisfaction.","Through her earphones, the coach's voice came, providing real-time feedback on Jing Yi's performance and offering technical guidance.","Her arms began to ache, and Jing Yi gritted her teeth, quickly adjusting her state.","The training ended, and Jing Yi stopped the car, removing her helmet. Li Chengsheng and Jing Zeqian were waiting nearby. Seeing Jing Yi's tired face, Jing Zeqian hurried over to support her.","Jing Zeqian's brow furrowed, his eyes filled with concern, but his words were sharp. \"You might as well move into Shanchi,\" he said. Jing Yi chuckled a few times, stretching her aching body. \"This is nothing,\" she replied.","A racer's skill isn't judged by the best conditions. It's just that the weather has been clear recently; otherwise, Jing Yi would have specifically sought out a rainy day for training.","Still, her recent form hasn't been great.","Li Chengsheng approached Jing Yi, his eyes filled with admiration. \"Yiyi, you're really amazing,\" he said. He had been watching Jing Yi's training sessions over the past few days, and his respect for her had only grown.","Although there were some mistakes, he still believed that even if Jing Yi didn't make the rankings in this leg, she would undoubtedly be a formidable opponent for other racers.","However, Li Chengsheng dared not say this in front of Jing Zeqian. The man might say he didn't care about Jing Yi's ranking, but if anyone dared to lose confidence first, Jing Zeqian would be the first to rush over and punch them.","Jing Yi's participation in the GT Super Cup was already common knowledge, and the internet had been abuzz with discussions.","Most of the discussions were from racing fans.","The GT Super Cup is different from other events. It is renowned and professional, a coveted goal for all racers. Achieving success in this competition would be a dazzling addition to any racer's resume.","Female racers have always been a rarity in this field, let alone making a name for themselves in such a prestigious event.","The internet was flooded with pessimistic voices.","[Why not just stick to the Champion Cup? Why humiliate yourself?]","[To be honest, I like Jing Yi, but the GT Super Cup is different.]","[Getting a second place in the Champion Cup would be good enough. Why push yourself so hard?]","[Let's be real, there are hardly any female racers in the sub-stations, let alone the main event.]","[I'm curious to see how amazing Jing Yi thinks she is. Does she think my idol isn't worthy? Haven't you heard? There are hardly any female racers.]","There were also some die-hard fans of Song Yuanye who hadn't been swayed by the recent scandals. Even after all the revelations and his disappearance for a while, a small group of fans still stood by him.","They blamed Song Yuanye's troubles entirely on Jing Yi. There had been some tension between the two before, and the racing fans' skepticism only fueled this small group of fans.","However, racing fans aren't pushovers. While they had their doubts about Jing Yi's participation, they at least respected her courage to compete in the professional Super Cup.","Not to mention that Song Yuanye had already been labeled as a problematic artist. Even if he were to participate, it would be in the accompanying Open Cup, a mere exhibition match.","How dare such a person speak up? This earned the disdain of many netizens.","[Before you mock others, can't you do some research? Your idol is in the Open Cup, a performance match.]","[What's more, he's already fallen so far, and yet there are still fans trying to whitewash him?]","[Jing Yi may not be perfect, but at least she's competing in a professional event. When did the business group become so entitled? Especially for someone like Song Yuanye, who's already fallen apart.]","[Song Yuanye, get lost! He's been milking the racer persona for years, but in reality, he's nothing! His downfall is just right; get out of here already!]","Racing fans don't care about fandom politics. They've disliked Song Yuanye for years, and this small group of fans stirred up a hornet's nest. The two sides clashed, and the racing fans easily overpowered them.","Song Yuanye's fans could only retreat in defeat.","Initially, Jing Zeqian couldn't stand it and wanted to silence those voices, but Jing Yi stopped him.","Most of the online comments came from long-time racing fans, and their concerns weren't entirely unfounded.","Since she had chosen this path, she wasn't about to let a few doubts break her.","\"Alright, I'm taking her home,\" Jing Zeqian interrupted Jing Yi and Li Chengsheng's conversation, showing no guilt for discarding his brother.","Li Chengsheng stood with his arms crossed, watching as Jing Zeqian at least exchanged a few words with the coach. He sighed, \"Am I just a useless little brother now?\"","Li Chengsheng paused, and it hit him—he really was.","Ever since Jing Zeqian realized he no longer met the level required to be Jing Yi's training partner, his role had shifted from trainer to decoration...","The next day, Li Chengsheng, as usual, stood guard at the Shanchi Racetrack.","There was no way around it; his big brother had an important meeting today, so he, the useless little brother, could still contribute his last bit of warmth by watching over Jing Yi.","However, today there was another guard.","Li Chengsheng looked at the man standing not far away. He stood there like an iceberg.","His facial features were sharp and defined, with a chiseled jawline that exuded a cold and unapproachable aura. His icy gaze seemed to repel anyone who dared to come close.","His thin lips were slightly pursed, forming an invisible barrier that seemed to refuse any further conversation.","Was this Shen Huaichu from Huarui Group? Jing Yi's new boyfriend?","Shen Huaichu's eyes were fixed on the red racing car on the track, while Li Chengsheng studied him.","Li Chengsheng was curious. Just what kind of person had captured Jing Yi's heart?","Was it this icy block? Li Chengsheng pursed his lips and looked away.","On the other side, Jing Yi had finished her first round of training. She stopped the car and walked towards Shen Huaichu.","She was a bit worried about Shen Huaichu's situation. Although she hadn't heard the details, from Gu Lin's attitude and Shen Huaichu's behavior, Jing Yi could vaguely guess something.","Her breathing was still a bit hurried. \"Okay, you've already seen my training today. Go home now,\" she said. Shen Huaichu's eyes softened slightly as he helped her tidy her hair. \"I'll stay with you a little longer,\" he said.","Jing Yi firmly refused. \"No! You'll distract me like this!\" She grabbed Shen Huaichu's hand, and sure enough, his palm was already moist. This made it even more impossible for him to stay."]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Shen Huaichu, You're Affecting Her","paragraphs":["Jing Yi was busy persuading Shen Huaichu to go back when Li Chengsheng walked up with deliberate steps.","\"Mr. Shen, nice to meet you for the first time,\" Li Chengsheng said with a slight raise of his eyebrows, extending his right hand.","Shen Huaichu glanced at him, noting the red-haired kid—Li Chengsheng—who was the subject of his aunt's niche ship. A few keywords quickly formed in his mind. Seeing the challenge in the other man's eyes, he extended his hand. \"Hello, Jing Yi's boyfriend, Shen Huaichu.\"","Li Chengsheng rolled his eyes inwardly. The ice block had quite the possessiveness. He forced a smile. \"Hello, Jing Yi's good friend, Li Chengsheng.\"","Self-introduction? Who couldn't do that? After all, they were only off by one word.","Jing Yi looked at the two of them curiously. It was just a greeting, but why did it feel like a declaration of war?","\"Chengsheng, you don't need to listen to my second brother and stay with me. I have a coach here, so you should go back too.\"","At the mention of this, Jing Yi felt like rushing to Jing Zeqian's office, grabbing his collar, and asking him why he had to assign someone to watch over her.","Moreover, Jing Yi felt a bit guilty. She almost had no time to spar with Li Chengsheng and the others, so Li Chengsheng's \"standing stance\" really was just standing.","From Li Chengsheng's perspective, it wasn't sparring; it was one-sided crushing. Especially after Jing Yi's intensive training, her racing actions had become instinctive, making it even harder for them to keep up.","However, Li Chengsheng didn't mind. He quite enjoyed being around Jing Yi and now saw her as half a sister. He didn't mind watching her train, or even practicing sparring with her...","Well, maybe he'd think about that.","But Li Chengsheng wasn't about to leave. His older brother had instructed him to take good care of Jing Yi. If she needed anything, he could arrange for it immediately.","If Li Chengsheng were a sparring partner, Shen Huaichu couldn't say much.","But since this red-haired guy wasn't a sparring partner, Shen Huaichu believed he could easily replace this \"decoration.\"","The three of them found themselves in an inexplicable standoff.","When Jing Zeyou arrived, he saw this scene.","He raised his wrist to check the time, raising an eyebrow. He thought he was early, but it seemed the racing track was already quite crowded.","Jing Yi sighed, looking up at the two of them with a fake smile. \"Listen, while I'm still calm, all of you should leave now.\"","Li Chengsheng's face stiffened. Fine, he'd better leave smoothly and gracefully than be carried out.","Shen Huaichu's expression shifted slightly. He had wanted to say a few soft words to Jing Yi, but seeing her expression, he knew.","There was no room for negotiation.","A hint of helplessness flashed in his eyes. \"Alright, I'll call you after your training.\" Jing Yi finally seemed satisfied. \"Good boy!\"","Shen Huaichu's lips curved upward, and the helplessness in his eyes became more evident.","As Jing Yi was speaking, she noticed Jing Zeyou had arrived and smiled, waving at him.","\"Big Brother, help me out and take these two away!\" She didn't think it was strange to assign her brother work as soon as he arrived.","Jing Zeyou had been standing there, leisurely watching the scene, not planning to intervene. But when Jing Yi spoke, he stepped forward.","\"Go ahead, leave it to me.\"","Jing Yi smiled even more happily, handing the two over to Jing Zeyou and heading off to train with peace of mind. As she left, she muttered, \"Honestly, what's the point of having so many mascots at the racing track? They can't help me win the championship.\"","Shen Huaichu, Li Chengsheng: ...","A hint of amusement flashed in Jing Zeyou's eyes as he turned to Li Chengsheng, speaking casually. \"Chengsheng, shall I give you a ride?\"","Li Chengsheng instinctively shrank his neck, forcing a smile. \"No, no! Zeyou Brother, I can go back myself! No need to trouble you.\"","The urgency in his words was evident, fearing that if he refused too late, Jing Zeyou would personally send him home.","Li Chengsheng had always been a bit afraid of Jing Zeyou. Besides his parents constantly holding Jing Zeyou up as an \"exemplary model,\" there was also an inexplicable sense of being dominated.","Jing Zeyou didn't insist. He indeed had something to discuss with Shen Huaichu.","\"Alright, be careful on your way back.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. Take your time, Zeyou Brother!\"","Li Chengsheng forced a smile, ready to leave the \"battlefield.\" As he left, he glanced at Shen Huaichu, his eyes filled with sympathy.","He should have known better than to give him a hard time. Now it seemed being Jing Yi's boyfriend wasn't so easy.","Shen Huaichu: ...What's there to look at? Can't you see I'm talking with my future brother-in-law?","Li Chengsheng slipped away like greased lightning. Jing Zeyou glanced in Jing Yi's direction before revealing his true purpose.","\"Shall we talk?\"","\"Sure.\"","Shen Huaichu also looked in Jing Yi's direction before following Jing Zeyou out of the racing track.","Jing Zeyou was never one for roundabout conversations, finding them a waste of time.","\"You're worried about Jing Yi?\"","Shen Huaichu froze, his fingers slightly tightening. He thought he had hidden it well enough.","As the date of the GT Super Cup drew closer, Shen Huaichu's anxiety deepened, and he felt it himself.","Jing Zeyou rubbed his wristwatch, smiling faintly. \"No need to be nervous. You're her boyfriend; feeling anxious and worried is only natural. We are too.\"","After Jing Yi started training, her family worried not only about her getting into an accident on the track but also about her body being overworked from the intense training. But none of them worried as much as Shen Huaichu.","He seemed more like he was afraid.","Shen Huaichu didn't feel any more relaxed. \"Yes, I'm very worried about her.\" He was waiting for Jing Zeyou to get to the real point.","The two had reached the edge of the racing track, and the sound of the cars gradually faded, leaving only the sight of the red car.","\"Have you seen her recent training reports?\"","Jing Zeqian would regularly communicate with the coach about Jing Yi's training progress, and while Jing Zeyou didn't know much about racing, he could read the data. Jing Yi's recent training data wasn't very good.","In short, she might be facing some kind of bottleneck.","Jing Zeqian was also anxious but didn't dare say anything, fearing it would add to Jing Yi's pressure. But Jing Zeyou had picked up on something from their conversations.","It wasn't a technical bottleneck; it was a change in Jing Yi's emotions.","The two men watched the distant red racing car. Shen Huaichu's pale lips pressed together slightly, as if something was stuck in his throat.","Jing Zeyou didn't mind, continuing. \"Of course, I'm not saying you need to understand it to this extent. It's not your responsibility. And comparatively, as a boyfriend, you're doing fine.\"","He paused for a moment, his tone becoming more serious. \"However, Shen Huaichu, you're affecting her.\"","Perhaps Jing Yi herself hadn't noticed, and Shen Huaichu hadn't either. They were just doing what they normally did.","One was training as usual, the other was accompanying his girlfriend as usual.","In that moment, Shen Huaichu felt a chill run through his entire body."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Relaxation Plan","paragraphs":["As the date of the GT Super Cup Jiangbei Station race drew closer, Jing Yi's body grew increasingly fatigued, and she returned home later each day. However, the tension in her heart eased significantly.","Lin Ruiqing, watching Jing Yi every day, grew more concerned. If she continued training at this pace, she might collapse before the race even began.","\"How about it? Since Zejun is back too, let's go relax as a family of three?\"","Jing Yi thought for a moment and didn't hesitate long before agreeing. She really needed to unwind. Although Jing Zeyou had arranged for someone to help her relieve muscle soreness, she was usually too exhausted to enjoy it when she got home.","Jing Yi was full of anticipation. \"Where should we go?\" Lin Ruiqing smiled. \"How about Baishui Jiahua?\" This was one of Lin Ruiqing's hotels, known for its hot springs.","Not only were the hot springs famous, but the private spa treatments were also renowned. For Jing Yi and Jing Zejun, who hadn't had a proper rest in a while, it was the perfect getaway.","Sure enough, Jing Yi's cheerful voice soon rang out. \"Yes! Yes!\" She had been there once before and had been captivated.","The hotel was nestled among mountains and rivers, surrounded by lush greenery. What's more, it was famous for its hot springs, featuring various pools like herbal pools, flower petal pools, fish therapy pools, and even private hot spring rooms.","If it weren't for having just one body, Jing Yi would have wanted to experience every single pool!","Jing Zejun was also looking forward to it. She had been busy attending various ceremonies and meeting with new scripts, so she was quite tired too.","Seeing both daughters agree, Lin Ruiqing immediately contacted the hotel to make arrangements for their relaxation.","Jing Beicheng, sitting quietly nearby, quietly picked up his teacup and took a sip.","Well, it seemed he wasn't invited. Maybe he should head to the company later to check on how Zeyou was doing with his work.","Once everything was arranged, Lin Ruiqing took her two daughters out, leaving only a message for Jing Beicheng: \"By the way, we won't be back for dinner tonight.\" The hotel's dinner was quite delicious, so they might as well try it.","Jing Beicheng remained silent, realizing he would have to solve dinner at the company as well.","Each hot spring pool at Baishui Jiahua had its own unique charm. Jing Yi and Jing Zejun wrapped themselves in towels and slowly stepped into the hot spring. Lin Ruiqing, meanwhile, had some hotel work to attend to and would join them later.","The hot springs were surrounded by lush bamboo forests. A gentle breeze rustled the leaves, and sunlight filtered through the bamboo, casting golden ripples on the surface of the water.","The warm water enveloped Jing Yi's body, bringing a sense of relaxation and comfort she couldn't quite describe. She moved her limbs and watched the ripples on the surface, finding it quite amusing.","Jing Zejun watched her with a smile that she couldn't suppress.","After Jing Yi had her fill of playing, she leaned back against the edge of the pool and listened as Jing Zejun talked about her relationship with Wen Qingyan. It turned out the two had been secretly dating without anyone knowing.","Seeing Jing Yi's teasing gaze, Jing Zejun blushed slightly. \"After all, love is a matter between two people.\"","Jing Yi's smile deepened. \"Oh, love is a matter between two people, huh?\" She mimicked Jing Zejun's tone playfully, causing Jing Zejun's already flushed cheeks to turn even redder from the heat of the hot spring.","\"Stop it! Aren't you in a relationship too?\" Jing Zejun tried to turn the tables, hoping to make Jing Yi blush too, but she was disappointed.","Jing Yi was very open about it, sharing with Jing Zejun the recent actions of Shen Huaichu and even summarizing seriously: \"He's been a bit naughty lately.\"","Back when they first started dating, just a little peck would leave him stunned. Now, he even tried to take control and used those puppy eyes to make her forgive him whenever he made a mistake!","Though, she did find it hard to resist.","Jing Zejun was surprised. She hadn't expected Shen Huaichu to be like that in a relationship.","However, Jing Yi didn't seem to realize how bright her smile was at that moment.","The warm mist of the hot spring surrounded them, as if shutting out the noise of the world. The occasional sound of their cheerful conversation floated through the air.","...","When Jing Zeyou and Jing Beicheng returned home, Jing Yi and the others hadn't come back yet. The only one at home was Jing Zeqian, who was left to guard the house and was feeling a bit sulky.","Who could understand? It had been so long since he had eaten alone. Especially when he thought everyone was busy with their own things, only to find out they had gone out to play without him!","Jing Zeqian waited and waited, until he got really annoyed.","Jing Beicheng and Jing Zeyou, on the other hand, seemed to have a mutual understanding and continued discussing work without giving him a single glance.","Finally, Jing Zeqian couldn't hold back. \"How much work do you two have to do?\" They were home already, couldn't they stop talking about work?","Jing Zeyou sat down and slowly poured a cup of tea for Jing Beicheng.","\"It's not much. Dad just happened to have some time, so we discussed it.\"","Jing Zeyou was a bit surprised when Jing Beicheng came to the company, especially since they had dinner together. It turned out that his mother had taken the two daughters out to play, leaving the old man at home alone.","Jing Zeqian leaned forward. \"Dad, why didn't you go with Mom today?\" He thought Jing Beicheng had also gone out to play.","Jing Beicheng sipped his tea calmly, glancing at his curious youngest son. \"Your mother wanted to strengthen her bond with her daughters.\"","Jing Zeqian understood. In other words, his dad wasn't invited.","\"They didn't even call me to go out and play!\" He decided he would eat all the supplements Aunt Wang had prepared for them!","Jing Zeyou: You really have guts.","\"Don't be upset. Dad and I talked, and we're planning a family trip next week.\"","When Jing Zeqian heard this, he was so touched, thinking his brother and father had arranged this trip just for him.","Jing Beicheng: ...Fine, let him think that. At least he'll be happy.","When the mother and daughters returned home, they heard about Jing Zeyou's plan.","【Another trip? Has Big Brother stopped loving work?】","Jing Yi hesitated. If it were just for a day, she wouldn't have thought twice, but this trip would take several days...","She wasn't in the best shape lately, and her racing data hadn't been great. Was it really a good idea to go on a trip now?","Lin Ruiqing and the others exchanged worried glances.","Jing Zeyou set his teacup down steadily, his long fingers interlaced. \"Yi, you said yourself that training can't be rushed. The race is coming up, so why not use this as an opportunity to relax?\"","In truth, Jing Yi was the main reason he had proposed this trip.","Jing Yi thought about it and realized her brother was right. After all, it was almost time for the race, and a few days wouldn't make much difference.","Plus, she had always wanted to take Lin Ruiqing and the others on a road trip again. Jing Yi's mood was immediately lifted.","She moved closer to Jing Zeqian and Jing Zejun to discuss where they should go.","Seeing his younger siblings huddled together, Jing Zeyou's lips curved into a faint smile, and his mood lightened."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Are You Afraid, Aren't You","paragraphs":["Shen Huaichu's expression softened unconsciously as he listened to Jing Yi's cheerful voice on the other end of the line.","\"Mr. Shen.\"","The interruption made Shen Huaichu's eyes flash with strong displeasure. Whatever was said on the phone caused the corners of his lips to curl into a faint smile once more.","\"Alright, have fun, and I'll call you later.\"","After the call ended, the coldness in Shen Huaichu's eyes almost materialized. \"What is it?\"","The bodyguard swallowed hard, his back drenched in cold sweat. He only rushed over because the matter was urgent.","\"The person you asked us to keep an eye on... things aren't looking good.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Huaichu's impatience grew, and his expression darkened, as if a storm was about to break.","\"I know.\"","Shen Huaichu got up and left the office, the bodyguard quickly following behind him.","\"Postpone the meeting for now. I'll let you know the new time when I return.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","The assistant watched Shen Huaichu leave, inwardly sighing. The president's mood had been off lately, even a bit restless. No one knew what was going on.","...","Shen Huaichu stood in front of a villa, the bodyguard half a step behind him, reporting the situation of the person inside.","\"He hasn't visited the prison this month. The two inside are barely holding on, and his condition isn't good either.\"","Shen Huaichu gazed at the villa, his eyes icy. He stepped inside.","The door opened, and the dimly lit room was suffocatingly stuffy. Shen Huaichu raised his hand to cover his nose.","Heavy curtains blocked the windows, allowing only a few narrow beams of sunlight to filter through. The ticking of a clock on the wall echoed loudly in the vast space.","A figure huddled in the corner of the sofa, hair disheveled, eyes vacant and lifeless. He seemed indifferent to the arrival of others.","Shen Huaichu glanced indifferently at the person before asking the bodyguard behind him, \"I recall, I never ordered him to be imprisoned.\"","The door wasn't locked, the windows weren't sealed, and there were no restraints on the person's body.","The bodyguard stood respectfully behind him, \"Yes, you didn't give any orders regarding imprisonment.\"","The person on the sofa moved. Under the messy hair, his lips curved into a mocking smile.","Shen Huaichu hadn't imprisoned him, but he couldn't go anywhere anyway. Every month was like a mandatory check-in, no matter where he was, he could be found.","He hadn't stopped seeking help from others, but without the title of the young master of Huarui Group, who would still consider him a friend? Yet, Shen Huaichu hadn't done anything to him.","Shen Qi'an felt like he was going mad. He didn't know what to do. Seek revenge on Shen Huaichu? He had grown up sheltered by his parents for twenty-plus years; how could he suddenly learn to fly on his own?","Leave this world? He had thought of that too, but Shen Huaichu wouldn't let him die.","Shen Qi'an's eyes were dull, his sunken sockets revealing unspeakable weariness and pain.","Shen Huaichu instructed the bodyguard to pull the curtains open. Jing Yi had said people needed more sunlight.","He walked up to Shen Qi'an, looking down at him with a detached tone, \"I heard you didn't visit them this month. Why?\"","Shen Qi'an slowly lifted his head, his eyes filled with hatred. \"Why? You ask why?!\" Each time he visited, his parents seemed to age more, their health deteriorating. Last time it was their legs, this time it was their hands. What next?","Shen Huaichu didn't care about his attitude, his face expressionless, as if the person in front of him wasn't even human.","\"Didn't I tell you? If they die, the game is over for everyone.\"","Shen Qi'an glared at the person in front of him, his hatred so intense it seemed he wanted to tear him apart. \"What do you want to do to let them go?!\"","Shen Huaichu frowned, his tone impatient. \"I thought, with the monthly chance to see them, you should be grateful.\"","\"Grateful?!\"","Shen Qi'an suddenly stood up, and the bodyguard immediately stepped in front of Shen Huaichu.","Shen Huaichu waved his hand, signaling the bodyguard to step aside. Even if Shen Qi'an had ten times the courage, he wouldn't dare do anything. What did Shen Huaichu mean by not letting him die? It was just the self-justification of a coward.","\"Cousin, I beg you! I beg you to let me go! Let my parents go! Or take my life, take my life in exchange for theirs!\"","Shen Huaichu chuckled lightly. \"Your life? Cousin, do you think your life is that valuable? Trying to get me to do what you can't bring yourself to do?\"","The person kneeling on the ground trembled.","Shen Huaichu shook his head in regret. \"If you were a bit more ruthless, I might have considered letting them join you more peacefully. Too bad, cousin, you're a coward, a spineless coward.\"","Shen Qi'an's hands clenched at his sides. These were words he had once said to Shen Huaichu, and now they were being thrown back at him.","After a moment, Shen Qi'an suddenly burst into a wild laugh, his voice sharp and piercing, echoing throughout the room.","His laughter stopped abruptly as he looked up at Shen Huaichu. \"I'm a coward, but what about you?\"","Shen Huaichu gazed coldly at him, wondering what trick the person in front of him was playing.","Shen Qi'an sneered. \"You're not much better than me.\"","\"I heard you found a girlfriend who races cars? How unwise. Racing cars? I bet you can't even stand to hear that word now.\"","Shen Huaichu's face was covered in frost, his aura growing even colder. \"Who told you that?\"","Shen Qi'an ignored his question, feeling unsatisfied and continuing, \"Do you think she's seen you trembling all over after being scared by my car?\"","This remark was like a spark lighting a fuse, causing Shen Huaichu to lose his temper instantly. He stepped forward and kicked Shen Qi'an hard.","Shen Qi'an was sent crashing into the wall by the kick.","Before he could recover, Shen Huaichu had already charged forward, grabbing his collar and slamming him against the wall.","\"Shen Qi'an, don't test my patience!\" Shen Huaichu's voice was low and filled with fury, his eyes sharp as knives.","The pain made Shen Qi'an curl up like a shrimp, gasping for breath, but he still stared back at Shen Huaichu with a challenging gaze.","\"You're scared, aren't you? So, besides that, you have other things to be afraid of? Who's the coward? Who's really the coward? Hahahaha!\"","Shen Huaichu clenched his fists, his eyes fixed on the laughing Shen Qi'an, anger burning like a raging fire in his chest.","He restrained himself, tossing the person aside, and took a handkerchief from the bodyguard to wipe his hands.","\"Go see them. Miss a visit, and they lose a part. This time has been paid for; you can go see for yourself if you're interested.\"","With that, Shen Huaichu walked toward the door.","Shen Qi'an struggled to his feet, glaring viciously at his back. \"Shen Huaichu, you're scared, aren't you? Afraid she'll see your ugly side? Or afraid she'll end up like your parents?\"","Shen Huaichu didn't pause for a moment as he left the dark house."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Crossroads, the Two Sides Chosen","paragraphs":["When Gu Lin arrived at Shen Huaichu's place, the house was once again shrouded in darkness. A faint light seeped through the narrow gap in the curtains, but it was of little help in the pitch-black room.","He had just checked on Shen Qi An's situation.","Over the past few days, he had intercepted numerous pleas for help from both Shen Qi An and Shen Tu. He wasn't entirely unaware of Shen Huaichu's actions.","Gu Lin had known Shen Qi An when the latter was still a carefree young master, especially in contrast to Shen Huaichu.","It had been a long time since they last met, and Gu Lin could hardly recognize him now.","It was impossible for him to remain completely unmoved. After all, he had known Shen Qi An for a long time. In name, like Shen Huaichu, he was also his cousin.","But Gu Lin wasn't naive enough to think that Shen Huaichu and Shen Qi An would ever reconcile.","Now, it seemed like just a reversal of the past scenario. The one lying on the ground had switched from Shen Huaichu to Shen Qi An.","Shen Huaichu lay on the sofa, his eyes closed, his brows slightly furrowed, showing no concern for the person who had just entered.","Gu Lin walked over silently and sat down beside him.","The living room fell into a quiet silence.","Shen Huaichu broke the silence first, asking, \"Why are you here?\"","Gu Lin stared at the out-of-place potted landscape decoration on the coffee table, gradually losing himself in thought.","He didn't answer Shen Huaichu's question. \"I intercepted the news about Shen Qi An,\" he said instead. Shen Huaichu remained silent for a moment, then slightly turned his head and stopped speaking.","Gu Lin swallowed hard, trying to lighten the mood. \"I heard Jing Yi and the others went out to play? That's great. It's nice to be able to go on family trips. Brother, you should work hard and try to make it onto the list next time, huh?\"","Shen Huaichu slowly opened his eyes, sat up, and tossed aside the empty wine bottle in his hand, staring directly at the decoration on the coffee table.","\"Jing Zeyou noticed she's been in a bad mood lately and took her out to relax.\"","Normally, Gu Lin might have started asking why she was in a bad mood, but looking at Shen Huaichu's state, his intuition told him it probably had something to do with Shen Huaichu.","Shen Huaichu's hands clenched tightly on his knees, his voice hoarse. \"Xiao Lin, Shen Qi An was right. I really am a coward.\"","Gu Lin's eyelids fluttered, and he forced a smile. \"Brother, Shen Qi An has always been at odds with you. How can you believe what he says?\"","Shen Huaichu's lips curved in a bitter smile. \"Her voice sounded so happy, but it wasn't because of me. All I brought her was... was hindrance.\"","So Jing Zeyou was right.","It was him who was afraid, afraid of everything, and that fear had affected Jing Yi.","Gu Lin couldn't bear to see him like this. \"Brother, don't be like this, okay?\"","\"From now on, don't block the news about Shen Qi An anymore...\"","How could he not be a coward? He didn't even have the courage to tell his aunt the truth. How could he not be a coward?","Gu Lin snatched the wine bottle from Shen Huaichu. \"Shen Huaichu! It's just a few words! He treated you so badly back then, and it didn't do anything to you. How can just a few words make you like this?\"","Shen Huaichu slumped his shoulders, muttering, \"How could it be just a few words? Those are the things I've been desperately hiding.\"","Jing Yi was right. His aunt was a very warm person. She knew about his revenge plan all along but had always hoped he could become a 'good person'—a 'good person' who would turn to the light after seeking revenge.","How could that be possible? If he were a good person, what was the point of these past ten years?","Gu Lin hesitated, wanting to say something but stopping himself. Shen Huaichu gave a self-deprecating laugh. He knew what his brother wanted to say. \"Xiao Lin, you're not unclear about this either, are you? Otherwise, you wouldn't have helped me block the news.\"","Shen Huaichu had never told Shen Tu about Shen Qi An's situation. On one hand, he didn't want Shen Tu to worry about these matters, and on the other, Shen Qi An was also Shen Tu's nephew. Shen Huaichu couldn't be sure that Shen Tu would always side with him.","Gu Lin lowered his eyes, hiding the sadness in them. He wanted to tell Shen Huaichu that his mother wouldn't do that, but he couldn't bring himself to say it.","If he was so certain, he wouldn't have helped Shen Huaichu block the news about Shen Qi An. Wasn't that just because he was afraid Shen Tu would plead for Shen Qi An?","Shen Huaichu took back the wine bottle from Gu Lin and took a big gulp, leaning back on the sofa, his eyes blurred as he stared at the ceiling, the corners of his eyes slightly red.","Shen Qi An had said he was afraid. Yes, he was very afraid. Afraid that Jing Yi would get into an accident at the racetrack, afraid that Jing Yi wouldn't need him at all, and even more afraid of becoming a hindrance to Jing Yi.","The more he was afraid, the more obvious it became.","His hand hanging by his side uncontrollably lifted, moving closer to the pink peach bixi, but stopped just before it touched it.","He muttered to himself, \"She's different from me. She looks like a fully armored porcupine, but her heart is the kindest.\"","...","\"Xiao Lin, what are you spacing out about?\"","Shen Tu looked at Gu Lin, who was mechanically picking at the rice grains with his chopsticks, puzzled.","Gu Lin came to his senses and hid the thoughts in his eyes, smiling. \"Nothing, just thinking about work.\"","Shen Tu knew that Gu Lin was interning at Huarui Group under Shen Huaichu. She was happy about this and didn't expect Gu Lin to become another Shen Huaichu. If he could learn even a fraction of his skills, she would be delighted.","\"If you don't understand something, ask your father or your brother,\" Shen Tu suggested. Then, thinking further, she added, \"Or you can listen to both and consider a compromise.\"","Gu Jin chuckled. \"Madam, it seems like all the benefits are going to our son, huh?\" Shen Tu shot him a look. \"Are you really going to quibble with your own son over this?\"","She just thought they shouldn't waste such good resources. It would be best to absorb all the good qualities.","Besides, it was his son, yet he had to leave him to her nephew. Who was really at fault here?","Knowing he was in the wrong, Gu Jin smiled obsequiously and started serving Shen Tu some dishes.","Gu Lin smiled faintly, stirring the rice grains with his chopsticks, and asked uncomfortably, \"Mom, have you been in touch with... Shen Qi An recently?\"","Shen Tu paused her chopstick movements. She hadn't heard that name in a long time and was momentarily dazed.","In her memory, that little nephew had gone from being cute to spoiled, and then to being overbearing.","\"No, why?\"","Gu Jin frowned, glancing over, curious why his son suddenly mentioned that person.","Gu Lin forced a smile, avoiding the couple's gaze. \"Nothing, it's just that it's been a long time since I last saw him, and I suddenly thought of him.\"","Shen Tu sighed. \"I heard he occasionally visits those two. It's good that he still has some conscience. It seems his life is not too bad...\" She added, \"You can ask me about this, but don't mention it in front of your brother. It's not good to anger him.\"","Deep down, Shen Tu was relieved that Shen Huaichu hadn't gone after Shen Qi An. After all, he was someone who had always called her aunt.","If things had really come to a point of no return, she wouldn't have known what to do.","\"She has her own considerations, and in the end, the choice she makes won't always be me.\""]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Have you seen Shen Qi'an","paragraphs":["Gu Lin's eyes flickered slightly, and the corner of his mouth curved with a hint of heaviness. \"Mom, you're not even siding with my brother? Be careful he might not bring Jing Yi back to see you next time.\"","Shen Tu shot him a reproachful glance. \"Nonsense! Of course, I'm on your brother's side. But he needs to let go of these things to live a proper life, doesn't he? And...,\" she continued, but Gu Lin had stopped listening.","Gu Jin watched his son thoughtfully, subtly diverting the conversation.","After dinner, Gu Jin pulled Gu Lin into the study, ostensibly to inspect his son's recent progress at Huarui Group.","Inside the study, seeing Gu Lin's pensive expression, Gu Jin cut straight to the point. \"Have you seen Shen Qi An?\" Gu Lin hesitated for a moment before nodding.","Gu Jin sighed; he had known as much. Otherwise, Gu Lin wouldn't have brought up Shen Qi An out of the blue.","Shen Qi An and Shen Huaichu were two very different people, especially after Shen Huaichu's family went through a traumatic event. Gu Jin felt this contrast even more acutely.","He had heard from Gu Lin how cruelly Shen Qi An treated Shen Huaichu, though he had never witnessed it himself. After all, in front of elders, one had to restrain oneself. However, even as a teenager, Shen Qi An's expressions and demeanor were unmistakable.","Shen Tu felt deeply for Shen Huaichu and couldn't bear to see him suffer under that family. Yet, Shen Huaichu was stubborn and insisted on staying. Shen Tu, feeling helpless, couldn't always be there to protect him. Thus, Gu Lin became the \"little guardian,\" and with someone else around, Shen Qi An was less brazen.","After Shen Huaichu regained control of Huarui Group, he had specifically thanked Shen Tu and Gu Jin. But honestly, Gu Jin knew their family didn't have that kind of power. If they did, Shen Huaichu wouldn't have had to scheme for over a decade.","Gu Lin's remarks at the dinner table made Gu Jin recall the days when Shen Huaichu and Shen Qi An were still young.","He had never thought Shen Huaichu would let Shen Qi An off the hook, though he didn't know the exact method. Still, Shen Qi An's situation likely wasn't as his wife imagined.","\"How's your brother doing?\"","Gu Lin's demeanor already hinted that Shen Huaichu's mood wasn't great. The boy had always been close to Shen Huaichu; he couldn't bear to see his brother upset.","Sure enough, Gu Lin shook his head, looking disheartened. \"Shen Qi An said a few things, and it... it hit a nerve with my brother.\" To say it affected him was an understatement.","Hearing this, Gu Jin was somewhat surprised. After all these years, he hadn't expected a few words to still affect Shen Huaichu so deeply. He had thought his nephew had become \"invincible.\"","But since it was a painful memory for Shen Huaichu, Gu Jin didn't probe further. \"You're close to your brother. Try to spend more time with him and talk things through.\"","Gu Lin didn't respond directly but instead looked up and asked, \"Dad, if Mom finds out about Shen Qi An, do you think she'll plead for him with my brother?\"","Shen Qi An's situation had been on Gu Lin's mind all day. He knew this wasn't the real source of Shen Huaichu's distress, even Shen Huaichu himself understood the answer.","Gu Jin was momentarily stunned. \"Is that what Shen Qi An told Shen Huaichu?\" It didn't make sense. He knew Shen Huaichu respected Shen Tu, but he wouldn't be so devastated by a few words, would he?","Gu Lin shook his head. If only it were that simple. That was just one of the many things affecting Shen Huaichu.","\"That's just the question I wanted to ask,\" he said, staring at Gu Jin, as if seeking an answer. \"Shen Huaichu is our family, isn't he?\"","A sigh escaped Gu Jin's lips. \"Son, human relationships aren't as simple as you're making them out to be.\"","Gu Lin stubbornly looked at Gu Jin. He didn't know how else to view it. Clearly, Shen Huaichu was their family. If it were up to him, he would choose Shen Huaichu a hundred times over.","Gu Jin patted Gu Lin's shoulder, signaling him to relax and sit beside him.","He spoke earnestly, \"You can always stand by Shen Huaichu's side because he treats you like a real brother.\"","Gu Lin had practically grown up with Shen Huaichu. His son was naive and often needed Shen Huaichu's protection, so their bond was naturally strong.","In contrast, Shen Qi An, from the prestigious North River Shen Family, with his father as the CEO of Huarui Group, wouldn't give Gu Lin a second glance. At best, he might be polite out of respect for Shen Tu.","\"But your mother... Shen Qi An genuinely considered her like an aunt.\"","Back then, Shen Tu was deeply affected by the troubles of her older and younger brothers. The grief was so intense that Gu Jin, watching from the sidelines, felt pained. Now, to not let it bother her is already commendable.","Otherwise, how could Gu Lin have completely hidden news of Shen Qi An? Gu Jin didn't want Shen Tu to go through that kind of emotional turmoil again.","Gu Lin felt utterly powerless. He knew his father was right, his mother was right, and even Shen Huaichu was right.","But faced with such a situation, he didn't know what to do.","Gu Jin looked at his son and, for the first time, agreed with what Shen Huaichu had once said to him.","Shen Huaichu was right; his son did need some life experience. How could he entrust the family business to him in this state?","Thinking of this, Gu Jin remembered Gu Lin's lethargic day at home.","\"You spent the whole day at home because of this?\" He thought, \"You should have used that time to study at Huarui Group. Learn more from Shen Huaichu.\"","Gu Lin still seemed unmotivated, leaning back on the sofa. \"My brother said I should take today off and go back tomorrow.\"","As for Shen Huaichu, his period of despondency seemed to last only one night. The next day, he was back at Huarui Group as usual.","When Gu Lin heard this, he was a bit disoriented, almost believing the Shen Huaichu who had been drowning his sorrows in alcohol was just a figment of his dream.","Gu Jin: \"...How come the person himself went to work, but you, the bystander, need a rest?\"","His expression was complicated as he glanced at his son, still slouched on the sofa, looking dejected. He looked again, and again.","When Gu Lin noticed his father's expression, he asked, puzzled, \"What's wrong?\" Gu Jin couldn't help but ask, \"Your brother told you to rest, and he went to work?\"","It was like a sick person dragging their illness to work while the one caring for them stayed in bed...","Who wouldn't be confused by that?","Gu Lin nodded, still looking puzzled, as if he didn't see anything wrong with it.","Gu Jin sighed. He was beginning to think that Shen Huaichu wasn't entirely blameless for Gu Lin's current state."]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: The Unstoppable Force","paragraphs":["The sunlight filtered through the sparse leaves, casting dappled shadows on the grass. The air was filled with the refreshing scents of pine forests and wildflowers.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Beicheng were taking photos not far away, while Jing Yi and Jing Zeqian were setting up the barbecue equipment. They occasionally discussed the two who were busy with their photoshoot.","\"Look at our dad, isn't he pitiful?\" Jing Zeqian whispered, careful not to be overheard by Lin Ruiqing. Jing Yi glanced at him and said, \"Second Brother, you must have a hard time finding a girlfriend.\"","Jing Zeqian widened his eyes in protest. \"How could that be?! You have no idea how popular I am.\"","Please! His fame even surpassed that of most artists Jing Yi knew!","Jing Yi took the ingredients handed over by Jing Zejun and said slowly, \"I think they must not know what you're really like behind the scenes. They're all fooled by your looks.\"","\"Hmph, next time I'll bring a dozen of them to you, and let them tell you...\"","When Jing Zeyou finished setting up all the camping equipment and returned, he overheard the two siblings arguing about something. He paid no attention and took the tools from Jing Yi's hands, telling her and Jing Zejun to go play elsewhere.","Jing Yi stopped arguing with Jing Zeqian and pulled Jing Zejun to the nearby lounge chairs to rest, quietly waiting for the food to be grilled.","Perhaps it was the warm sunlight or the relaxed atmosphere, but Jing Yi dozed off.","Not far away, Jing Zeqian's voice, tinged with a hint of defiance, could still be heard.","\"This is Jing Yi's prejudice. I must find a chance to show her how popular I am!\"","\"What's the point of proving that?\"","\"She's looking down on me!\"","\"...If you want to think that way, I can't stop you.\"","There was also Lin Ruiqing's slightly disdainful voice.","\"Jing Beicheng, I told you not to stand there, why did you stand there again?\"","\"...Didn't you tell me to stand on that rock?\"","\"I've never seen such a clumsy model!\"","\"...I've never seen a photographer who complains about their model being clumsy.\"","On the other side, Jing Zejun, who was waiting for her response, turned his head to see that she had fallen asleep.","Jing Zejun was momentarily stunned, then smiled softly, gently covering her with a jacket. He quietly gazed at the distant valley, his consciousness gradually fading.","...","When Jing Yi woke up, the sunset was already hanging over the valley, casting an orange-red glow.","A gentle breeze brushed against her cheeks, bringing a hint of coolness. Jing Yi stretched lazily.","A slender hand appeared in front of her, holding a plate of warm grilled food.","Jing Yi smiled, her eyes curving into crescents, as she took the food from Jing Zeyou. \"Thank you, Big Brother!\" Jing Zeyou smiled faintly, placing a glass of juice beside her with his other hand.","He sat down, leaning lazily back, gazing at the gentle sunset ahead.","Jing Yi looked behind her, but Jing Zeqian and the others were nowhere to be seen. She asked curiously, \"Where are Mom and Dad?\"","\"They ate too much and went for a walk.\"","Jing Yi was shocked.","【How long did I sleep?!】","Jing Zeyou's lips curled slightly. All he could say was that his sister had excellent sleep quality.","\"Do you feel more relaxed?\"","He always worried that Jing Yi was pushing herself too hard, especially in such a state.","Jing Yi nodded happily. The surroundings were filled with the fresh scent of flowers and grass, in front of her was the valley, the river, and the sunset, and behind her were her family and their laughter.","There was no better scene to help her relax.","\"That's good. I did feel you needed to adjust your state recently.\"","Jing Yi put down the skewer in her hand, smiling shyly. \"So Big Brother noticed, huh?\" She had a vague sense of it herself, but she just couldn't figure out how to deal with it.","Jing Zeyou's smile was gentle and light. \"Perhaps it's easier for an outsider to see. I could sense it.\" His expression became more serious. \"Yiyi, you seem to be worried about something.\"","If Jing Zeyou could feel anything, it was Jing Yi's emotions first, and then her drive.","Jing Yi was very focused on this competition, yet she seemed to be conflicted and afraid of something.","Jing Yi's expression was momentarily blank. She had only thought that she was too tense in her mind, which led to frequent mistakes during training. She had never considered what she was afraid of.","【What could I be afraid of? Fear of mistakes? Or fear of injuries? I'm a race car driver, I'm very familiar with these things.】","Jing Yi wanted to refute, but in the end, she couldn't say anything.","Jing Zeyou sighed inwardly, voicing the thoughts Jing Yi had in her heart.","\"You love racing, you're passionate about it. You're not afraid of the naysayers, not afraid of the debris after a crash, not afraid of getting hurt on the track. So, are you afraid of failure?\"","\"Yiyi, that's not like you.\"","Jing Yi suddenly felt her mood drop. She held the skewer, not knowing what she was thinking. How could she be afraid of failure?","As long as she stood on that stage, she had already succeeded. What failure was there?","So, what was she afraid of?","Jing Zeyou quietly stayed by Jing Yi's side, patiently waiting for her to think it through.","He didn't understand the professional aspects of racing, but he knew that once an uncontrollable fear took hold, Jing Yi, as a race car driver, would never be able to let go and race freely on the track.","Seeing the mood of the person beside him growing lower, Jing Zeyou sighed helplessly, affectionately ruffling her hair.","\"Yiyi, the world is harsh to women. Even if they are beautiful, they may face irrelevant speculation from all sides.\"","\"Even if they are successful, they may face societal judgment of 'unworthiness.'\"","\"Their brightness, bravery, and success may all be drowned out by the world's focus on gender.\"","Jing Zeyou paused for a moment, his gaze on Jing Yi gentle and focused.","\"The only thing I'm grateful for is that the Jing family can provide enough protection. Within this shield, you and Junjun can do whatever you want.\"","\"Your ambition can be as high as you want, your dreams can be as big as you want, and your courage can be as strong as you want. We are all behind you.\"","\"So, the strength to move forward without hesitation, I hope you will always have.\"","All the panic and tension in Jing Yi's heart seemed to disappear at this moment, leaving only a warmth like water nourishing the earth.","She smiled, her dimples deepening on one side of her mouth, her eyes slightly red. \"So that's why Big Brother suddenly wanted the whole family to go on a road trip.\"","Jing Zeyou raised an eyebrow, leaning back into the lounge chair, a gentle smile on his lips. \"This can't be said in front of your second brother.\" His younger brother believed he was the main character of this trip.","Jing Yi's smile was soft and warm as she happily ate the still-warm barbecue in front of her.","\"Jing Yi, you're finally awake. You slept way too long! You said you'd help with the barbecue, but you just ended up eating what was prepared!\"","Jing Zeqian's voice came from behind.","Jing Yi retorted unconvincingly, \"What? Anyway, this was given to me by Big Brother!\"","Jing Zeqian was instantly incensed. \"What?! That was grilled by me!!!\" He glanced at Jing Zeyou, who was leisurely enjoying the sunset, his eyes filled with resentment.","Damn it! The credit was stolen again!","Jing Yi paused, then retorted confidently, \"Well, Big Brother kept it for me!\"","Jing Zeqian was furious. How could this be? She didn't even remember his efforts at all!","He rolled up his sleeves, determined to have a three-hundred-round battle with Jing Yi!","As the sun gradually set, occasional noise and laughter could be heard from the depths of the valley."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: GT Super Cup Race","paragraphs":["The Shanchi Racing Track was hosting the GT Super Cup regional race as scheduled. As one of the most important events for racing drivers, it attracted not only professional racers but also a large number of enthusiastic fans.","The time was still early, and a thin layer of mist lingered over the racetrack, but the air was already filled with the scent of oil and fuel.","Various teams had arrived at the venue early, nervously and orderly conducting the final preparations. The mechanics of the racing teams whispered to each other, their tools gleaming with a metallic luster. They occasionally crouched down to adjust the vehicle's chassis, and at other times stood up to check the engine's condition.","The stands surrounding the track were already filled with spectators from all over; this is just the situation at the Jiangbei branch site. The audience wore various racing suits and supporter banners, excitedly discussing their favorite drivers and teams.","Journalists and photographers shuttle back and forth in the work area of the motorcade, capturing every exciting moment, though the person they most wanted to photograph was nowhere to be found.","Jing Zeyou and Jing Zeqian had arranged the venue and personnel early to ensure Jing Yi would not be disturbed by these people.","Those around them gradually noticed the difference between Jing Yi and other racers.","Those who could qualify for the GT Super Cup were all backed by teams, where the protagonist was not necessarily just one person. Sometimes, for the team's collective victory, racers had to make sacrifices.","But Jing Yi's team served only her. From the team manager and coach to the mechanics.","Of course, the team manager was taken care of by Jing Zeqian. He claimed that on the same track, no one had a richer business background than him. And even if he couldn't match up, there was Jing Zeyou behind him.","Thus, a team exclusively for Jing Yi was formed. Some racers would make snide remarks when they saw this, nothing more than comments about how low the level of skill was, yet the attitude was quite pretentious.","But who let them not have a background from the Jing family.","However, after this incident, these people were determined to give Jing Yi a lesson on the racetrack.","Meanwhile, Jing Yi was unaware of so many people aiming to surpass her. She was currently conducting the final checks and adjustments with her mechanic team.","Jing Yi wore a black racing suit, looking cold yet powerful, with her helmet quietly resting by her side.","Jing Zeqian stood by her side, nagging about safety precautions.","Time ticked away, and the announcement came from the broadcast, signaling it was time to head to the starting line.","\"We'll be waiting for you in the stands,\" Jing Zeyou said with a gentle and encouraging expression on his handsome face. Behind him stood Jing Zejun, Lin Ruiqing, Jing Beicheng, Shen Huaichu, Shen Xi, Gu Lin, and Li Chengsheng.","Her family, loved ones, and friends were all present. Jing Yi took a deep breath and smiled, her smile unrestrained and flamboyant.","At the starting line of the racetrack, the cars were lined up in a row, their colorful paint jobs gleaming.","Jing Yi stood beside her car, attracting numerous glances—some from fellow racers, others from the audience. The gazes ranged from doubt and ridicule to those simply waiting for a show.","It seemed they were all very interested in this female racer who had appeared at the Shanchi Racing Track.","\"Yi Yi! Go for it!\"","Amidst the noisy environment, a clear voice rang out. Jing Yi looked up to see a girl with a ponytail waving a banner enthusiastically.","Among the sea of racing enthusiasts, she stood out. This was the first time Jing Yi had heard someone cheering for her at the racetrack.","Jing Yi smiled and waved back, her eyes sparkling, and her cheeks dimpling deeply.","A distinct scoff sounded beside her. Jing Yi turned to see a middle-aged man.","When Jing Yi looked over, he didn't shy away but instead smiled mockingly, \"Miss Jing, black doesn't suit you. Pink would look better.\" His eyes were filled with ridicule.","Ever since he learned that Jing Yi would participate in this GT Super Cup, he had been displeased. This was racing, not a place for girls to play house. What did the Jing family matter? This sacred place should not become a playground for women.","Jing Yi chuckled, not in a hurry to retort. Instead, she said nonchalantly, \"Colors have no gender. But just because you have a beard doesn't make you a man.\"","The man with a bit of a beard's expression changed.","Jing Yi glanced at him, snorted coldly, then slowly put on her helmet, tightened her gloves, and felt the security of the tight fit against her skin. She climbed into the cockpit, gripped the steering wheel, and pressed her foot on the accelerator, feeling the slight vibration of the engine.","The start of the race was just a command away, and the entire venue was filled with tension and anticipation. All eyes were focused on this imminent moment.","Jing Yi looked up at the sky. Dark clouds rolled in, gradually covering the entire sky. The heavy clouds pressed down, making it hard to breathe.","Distant thunder rumbled, low and powerful. The trees on both sides of the track swayed violently in the wind, their leaves rustling. The air was filled with a dampness.","It seemed this race wouldn't be as smooth as she had imagined. Jing Yi silently adjusted her race strategy.","Meanwhile, in the VIP room where the Jing family and Shen Huaichu were watching the race.","Shen Huaichu stood by the floor-to-ceiling windows, his gaze fixed on the dazzling red sports car where Jing Yi was seated in the cockpit.","The roar of engines from all directions reached him, even faintly, causing him discomfort—a kind of indescribable torment.","Like the weather, his mood was overshadowed by a heavy shadow.","Shen Huaichu clenched his fists, his fingers turning white from the pressure, his knuckles making faint sounds.","Each time the roar of a racing car passed by, his brow would involuntarily furrow, but he tried his best to remain calm.","The first to notice Shen Huaichu's discomfort was Gu Lin. Strictly speaking, he had been watching Shen Huaichu the entire time, afraid he wouldn't be able to hold on.","Although Shen Huaichu's expression changes were subtle, Gu Lin, having known him for nearly twenty years, could tell Shen Huaichu was feeling unwell.","Seeing that everyone else was focused on the start of the race, Gu Lin quietly approached Shen Huaichu and whispered, \"Brother, are you alright?\"","Shen Huaichu closed his eyes for a few seconds, then opened them again, returning to his usual indifference. He shook his head, his gaze still fixed on the racing car.","Gu Lin sighed inwardly, feeling helpless. He had wanted to suggest that his brother go outside to wait during the race, as it was a endurance race and wouldn't end for several hours.","But seeing Shen Huaichu's current state, Gu Lin knew he didn't need to say anything, because Shen Huaichu wouldn't listen.","The countdown to the start of the race began.","Everyone's eyes were glued to the countdown display. \"Start!\" The signal light turned green instantly.","In an instant, all the racing cars shot out from the starting line like arrows, the sound of tires rubbing against the ground and engines roaring blending together. The GT Super Cup race officially began."]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: Sub-station Champion Secured","paragraphs":["The sky was overcast, with dark clouds hanging low, as if the entire world was enveloped in a damp, grayish haze.","Suddenly, a drop of rain landed on the windshield, followed by a second and a third. The raindrops gradually became denser, transforming from sparse droplets into continuous rain lines that pounded the racetrack with sharp, crisp sounds.","The track became exceptionally slippery, and the racing wipers worked at full speed, yet they still struggled to clear the obstructive water accumulation.","Through the blurred windshield, Jing Yi focused intently on the road ahead, her hands tightly gripping the steering wheel, feeling the subtle feedback of the car in the rain.","The voice of the chief mechanic analyzing the current vehicle and track conditions echoed in her ears.","Rainy days showcased a racer's true skill, but they were also a significant factor in frequent accidents. Every turn, every acceleration point, Jing Yi had to be even more cautious. A single misstep could lead to a loss of control.","As the race reached its midpoint, the enthusiasm of the spectators in the stands remained undiminished.","Jing Yi adjusted her driving strategy, maintaining a steady speed on the straightaways and avoiding flooded areas as much as possible. She felt every friction between the tires and the slick surface, closely following the black sports car in front.","That was the car of the bearded man from earlier. Since the start of the race, this black car had been appearing near Jing Yi's vehicle, attempting to disrupt her focus.","The rain showed no signs of letting up; instead, it intensified, and water began to accumulate in the low-lying areas of the track.","Entering a turn, she gently pressed the brake, controlling her speed to ensure the car didn't skid. The black car ahead still firmly held the inside position.","He accelerated, and Jing Yi didn't panic. She increased her speed and followed suit.","Suddenly, the black car sharply turned left, overtaking the white car in front. Jing Yi's heart raced, and time seemed to freeze.","In that critical moment, Jing Yi quickly made a judgment, decisively adjusting the steering wheel and focusing on the throttle and brake.","The red racing car slid to the right, its body almost parallel to the ground, emitting a piercing screech of tires. Her car narrowly grazed past the slowing white car.","It was a close call—just a hair's breadth away from turning into a pile of shattered metal!","Everything happened in an instant, but the lingering adrenaline made her heart race, cold sweat dripping from her forehead, her palms damp with tension.","But Jing Yi had no time to dwell on the near-disaster. She quickly adjusted the steering wheel, stabilized the car, and continued to push forward, aiming straight for the black car.","That black car had been deliberate. With limited visibility in the rain, Jing Yi couldn't see the white car that had slowed down.","He had intentionally led her into the trap. If she hadn't reacted in time, both cars would have ended up as wreckage!","Jing Yi was furious, her cold gaze sharp, her almond-shaped eyes flashing with icy fury. All her previous worries vanished in that moment, replaced by a fierce determination to surge ahead.","Her hands gripping the steering wheel turned white with tension, like a predator ready to pounce.","Meanwhile, those who had witnessed Jing Yi's near-collision, including Jing Zeyou and others, were still recovering from the shock.","Gu Lin frowned, looking at the black car ahead of Jing Yi, his voice tinged with anger. \"That car was deliberate.\"","Hearing Gu Lin's words, the others turned their attention to the black car.","Jing Zeqian widened his eyes in disbelief. \"What do you mean?\" He had been so focused on Jing Yi's red car that he hadn't paid attention to the others.","Gu Lin analyzed the black car's movements. \"It was trying to lure Jing Yi into danger.\" Though uncommon, he had seen such dirty tactics before.","Shen Huaichu pursed his lips, his expression darkening, while Jing Zeqian exploded in rage, cursing loudly.","The room's atmosphere grew tense.","Jing Zeyou's expression was cold and stern. \"Get someone to review the footage,\" he said, his voice laced with displeasure.","He hoped it wasn't as Gu Lin had suggested.","Jing Zeqian calmed down and immediately made the necessary arrangements.","...","Jing Yi and the black car were about to enter a turn when the rain suddenly intensified, further blurring visibility and making the road even more slippery.","Jing Yi's grip on the steering wheel never wavered. After the straightaway, her red car showed a tendency to move to the left, as if preparing for an inside overtake at the upcoming turn.","The bearded man had been closely monitoring Jing Yi's movements. Seeing the red car's intention to overtake, he immediately adjusted his steering to take a defensive position.","His lips curled into a sneer. \"Think you can overtake me? Go play house with the kids.\"","At that moment, the red car abruptly shifted to the outside, catching the bearded man off guard. With the outside position secured, Jing Yi had a better exit speed. She pressed the accelerator, spraying a layer of water mist onto the black car's windshield.","Jing Yi successfully overtook the black car, leaving it behind. The on-site commentators were equally excited.","\"A perfect overtake! The 52nd Bugatti moves into second place!\"","The overtaken man hadn't expected Jing Yi's feint. In his panic, he misaligned the steering wheel, causing his car to skid and crash into the barrier below the stands.","Jing Yi was unaware of the incident behind her. She was focused on chasing the car ahead, determined to secure the championship of this leg of the race.","Only by doing so could she ensure her qualification for the final race!","The leading car, trying to prevent Jing Yi from overtaking, frequently changed lanes to block her path.","Entering the final long turn, Jing Yi's eyes lit up. She decisively pressed the accelerator, instantly boosting her speed.","She closed in from the inside, the two cars side by side, tracing a graceful arc.","At the exit of the turn, Jing Yi slightly leaned to feel the tilt of the car and the friction of the tires on the wet surface. She precisely controlled the balance of the car, even sensing its tail gently swaying.","Jing Yi successfully overtook the leading car!","She crossed the finish line first.","The stands erupted in thunderous cheers, the audience waving flags and spontaneously chanting Jing Yi's name, the entire racetrack instantly boiling over.","\"Jing Yi! Jing Yi! Jing Yi!\"","Female racers were rare on this track, let alone one who had won a GT Super Cup leg. Even a leg victory was enough to garner significant attention.","Jing Yi was still immersed in the bewilderment and joy of winning the leg championship, until she heard her name reverberating across the racetrack and stepped out of her car.","She waved to the crowd in gratitude, her eyes slightly red, her smile radiant. The cheers grew louder.","Jing Yi turned to look at the other side of the stands, where the VIP viewing room of Mountain Racing was located. They were all there.","Tiny raindrops blurred her vision, but Jing Yi could see a row of figures standing by the window, watching her. She smiled, waving vigorously.","She knew they could see her!","The rain gradually subsided, the dark clouds dispersed, and the sky began to reveal a faint blue hue."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Song Yuanye Reappears","paragraphs":["Jing Yi's victory in the championship instantly exploded on Weibo.","\"Jing Yi wins the GT Super Cup Jiangbei Station race\" and \"The legendary moment of a female racer\" quickly dominated the trending lists of major platforms.","Especially the video of Jing Yi overtaking the black car had an absurdly high view count.","[My god! I got slapped in the face!!!]","[Jing Yi! You are my goddess!!!]","[Indeed, rainy days are the best way to test a racer's skills.]","[Oh my, when the whole crowd was chanting her name, I was so moved to tears. I should have gone to the venue!]","[That overtake was textbook-level!]","Of course, not all were praises. Some netizens couldn't stand a woman like Jing Yi winning the racing championship, and Song Yuanye's fans mixed in, stirring up trouble.","[It's just a station championship, what's there to be proud of?]","[Exactly, the GT Super Cup is full of masters. We'll see if she can even rank later.]","[Hey, you're still wearing Song Yuanye's fan skin, mocking Jing Yi? Where's your brother? Give me a rank or a position, huh?]","[What position? Song Yuanye probably doesn't even dare to show up now, hiding away obediently?]","[Forget the rank, why hasn't this tainted artist been banned yet? It's really too much.]","[Right! Plagiarism? Dating? Cheating? And he still has fans? You Song fans really don't pick at all.]","A few netizens who spoke sour remarks were quickly mocked and disappeared.","After Jing Yi's victory, congratulations came from all directions, making her feel somewhat unreal until her team swarmed around her, lifting her high into the air.","Looking at the azure sky washed clean by the rain, she gradually felt the reality, the dimples at the corners of her mouth deepening unevenly, her eyes shining brightly.","She had won, she had taken the first step towards becoming a professional racer!","Jing Zeyou and the others approached, standing not far away, watching their celebration.","Lin Ruiqing and Jing Zejun were laughing happily, their eyes glistening with tears, while Jing Beicheng, though trying to maintain a calm demeanor, couldn't hide the joy in the corners of his eyes.","Compared to the others' restraint, Jing Zeqian and Li Chengsheng's joyful expressions were more straightforward. The two immediately joined the team, lifting Jing Yi high, shouting slogans.","\"Jing Yi! Jing Yi! Jing Yi!\"","Shen Huaichu stood nearby, his eyes also revealing warmth, the tension in him easing a bit.","Seeing the audience on the stands joining in the commotion, Jing Yi gradually felt a bit shy and called out to be let down.","\"Alright! Alright! Stop teasing!\"","After Jing Yi stood firm, Jing Zeqian ruffled her hair fiercely, his tone full of pride.","\"Jing Yi is so amazing!\"","The man messed up her hair in front of so many people!","Jing Yi was a bit annoyed at first, but seeing him smile, revealing a row of neat white teeth, she couldn't help but raise the corners of her mouth.","Jing Zeyou and the others chuckled at the two facing each other, smiling foolishly.","Seeing the fun was about over, Jing Zeyou spoke up, \"Alright, let's let Yi Yi go back to the lounge to rest.\" After driving for so long, she must be exhausted.","...","Meanwhile, not far away, Song Yuanye watched Jing Yi and her group celebrating happily.","He wore a mask, hiding under the stands, his gaze filled with unmistakable malice.","How could he have ever suffered such treatment? It was all Jing Yi's fault! The happier they were, the deeper Song Yuanye's hatred grew.","Everything began with Jing Zeqian arranging for people to leak Song Yuanye's affairs.","After that day, many entertainment self-media surfaced online, exposing his plagiarism and dating scandals.","Even his private girlfriends, for some reason, also issued statements, pushing all the blame onto Song Yuanye.","[My god, I'm shocked. I've never seen so many \"sisters-in-law\" come out together before?]","[Right, you have \"sisters-in-law\" and you're still playing the innocent boy persona?]","Celebrities are human too! Why can't they date?! Compared to that someone, Song Yuanye just dated, okay!","[He must have done it for a reason! Who doesn't have a bad mood, having dinner with a few girls means dating?]","[Where's the evidence?! Evidence?! A few essays and you want to nail my brother to the cross?]","[There are still fans defending him, you really don't pick at all.]","In an instant, he went from a million-follower traffic star to a tainted artist!","The company's attitude was also unclear, though they didn't immediately shelve him, their stance had changed significantly, especially his manager's!","\"Yuanye, the company has no choice, you know. Think about it, several luxury brands have already terminated the contracts because of this, not to mention the idol dramas you were negotiating.\"","\"The company's idea is, you take a break for a while, wait until everyone forgets, and then come back. You know, the internet forgets things quickly.\"","\"What attitude is this?! Do you think you're still a top-tier star? I've told you before to rein it in! Rein it in! When have you ever listened to me? To be honest, you'd better just stay put and come back when everyone's forgotten!\"","Song Yuanye clenched his fists, his eyes filled with increasing hatred.","How could he not know who leaked it? Several marketing accounts belonged to Startrack Entertainment!","Who would have thought that just because of that small incident during the live stream, Jing Zeqian would be so ruthless, directly cutting off his path to stardom!","Fortunately, Song Yuanye still had some useful fans, some hiring online trolls to control the comments, others explaining to passersby that those girlfriends were just friends, and the romantic relationship was just a misunderstanding.","Perhaps seeing that he wasn't completely doomed and still had some fighting fans, the company's attitude softened a bit.","Song Yuanye took the opportunity to propose a solution, which was the upcoming Open Cup. If he could shine in this competition, he could surely overshadow other news and reignite his popularity!","Being a racer wasn't Song Yuanye's original persona, but it was the persona that fans loved the most.","To them, compared to other stars who just mix in the entertainment circle, a star who loved and could race was too worth boasting about.","Song Yuanye also rose to the top because of this persona. What did it matter if his singing and dancing weren't good? His racer persona could still secure his position as a top-tier star.","Once he solidified this persona, he wouldn't have to hide and cover up so much. After all, a racer was such a free profession, whatever he did, in the eyes of fans, it would be true character.","He was tired of playing that innocent big boy role, acting like an idiot. At nearly thirty, how could he not understand anything?","Looking at Jing Yi's smiling face, Song Yuanye's mouth curved into a malicious smile, \"Jing Yi, let's see on the racetrack! I want to see how amazing you really are!\"","Song Yuanye pulled his hat lower and turned to leave the racetrack."]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Shen Huaichu, let's all calm down for a moment.","paragraphs":["After the sub-station ended, there was still some time before the final battle for the GT Super Cup championship. Apart from preparations for the Open Cup, the racers also had sufficient time to recuperate.","Jing Yi received numerous congratulations during this period, some directed at her, and some at the Jing family. However, most of these were intercepted by Jing Beicheng and his wife.","Congratulations were welcome, but unnecessary social interactions were not.","But today, it couldn't be avoided. It was time for her to have a formal meal with Shen Huaichu's family.","Jing Yi looked at herself in the mirror. Her hair was simply tied low, with a few strands framing her face. She wore a sleek black high-neck dress paired with a striking silver and white floral chunky necklace.","The makeup was done by Jing Zejun, who was admiring her work. \"Perfect!\" Jing Yi nodded in satisfaction. \"Not bad, not bad. And no high heels.\"","Jing Zejun silently looked at her: ...","She only had one comment? Despite thinking that this makeup and styling was so flawless it could be featured in a magazine.","Jing Yi, of course, also thought she looked great, but compared to other things, the hassle of changing shoes when driving in high heels was just too much!","Jing Yi glanced at her watch. Oh no, she was running out of time. She quickly looked at herself in the mirror one last time and stood up.","\"I'm off, Junjun! I'm almost late. I'll bring you something delicious when I get back!\" With that, she hurried out.","Jing Zejun watched her back and inwardly sighed in relief. Good thing she didn't wear high heels; with Jing Yi's whirlwind personality, she would have been a bit worried.","...","The dinner was held at a private club. Since it was mainly a celebration for Jing Yi's victory, only Shen Huaichu and Shen Tu's family were present.","\"Come, Yi Yi, try this. It's their specialty,\" Shen Tu enthusiastically urged.","Jing Yi sweetly replied, \"Thank you, Auntie. You eat too.\" Shen Tu hardly ate, just smiling and watching Jing Yi with a look of contentment.","Shen Huaichu, sitting beside them, said helplessly, \"Auntie, I'll take care of Yi Yi. You should eat too.\" If she kept staring like that, how would Jing Yi eat?","Jing Yi smiled and obediently ate the food Shen Tu gave her, inwardly relieved.","Shen Tu shot a glare at Shen Huaichu. She said she would take care of Yi Yi, but he hadn't said a word the whole time. It was as if he were mute! She had to step in as the auntie.","However, Shen Tu eventually calmed down and allowed Jing Yi to eat in peace.","\"Yi Yi, so you knew that black racing car was deliberately trying to mess with you during the race?\" The conversation naturally turned to the details of Jing Yi's race.","Gu Lin, who had been uninterested in eating, eagerly looked at Jing Yi, his admiration evident in his eyes.","Gu Lin was also a hardcore racing enthusiast. Previously, he had only admired Jing Yi's skills, acknowledging that she was indeed better than him, but not to the point of idolization.","It wasn't until he saw Jing Yi's overtaking maneuver that his admiration truly blossomed. At the time, he could still calmly analyze the black car's dirty tactics on the surface, but deep down, he was incredibly excited.","Fake moves, braking on the outside—she overtook them all! That kind of maneuver was simply incredible!","Jing Yi took the shrimp Shen Huaichu peeled for her and looked at Gu Lin. \"I didn't have time to react at first. It was only after I dodged that I realized.\"","Gu Lin was excited. \"Your reaction speed is incredible! If it were anyone else, they would have crashed!\"","Shen Huaichu's hand paused for a moment as he peeled the shrimp, but he quickly continued, though this subtle movement did not escape Jing Yi's notice.","Her eyes flickered, and she subtly changed the subject, engaging Gu Lin in a conversation about his daily work.","Jing Yi could tell that Shen Huaichu was worried. The way he relaxed after the high-pressure race was more apparent than anyone else's.","After dinner, Shen Huaichu sent Jing Yi home. They walked hand in hand along the street.","Moonlight bathed the street, and a gentle breeze rustled the leaves, bringing a cool touch of the night. Occasionally, a few cars passed by.","The quiet night seemed peaceful, but both of them were far from calm inside.","Jing Yi spoke first. \"Actually, you didn't have to come watch my race.\"","It was the same thing she had said before. Compared to having Shen Huaichu witness her victory, she cared more about how he felt in that environment.","When he watched her training, Shen Huaichu probably wasn't at ease, and during the actual race, with the added worry about her safety, it must have been even harder for him.","Shen Huaichu tightened his grip on their clasped hands. \"I wanted to see you win.\"","Jing Yi stopped walking and looked seriously at the person in front of her.","\"Shen Huaichu, you don't want to see me win. You want to see me safe and sound.\"","Shen Huaichu opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but he couldn't refute Jing Yi's words.","They stood under the streetlight, the warm light unable to dispel the tension between them.","\"If it makes you uncomfortable, why force yourself?\" Jing Yi pulled Shen Huaichu and stood quietly under the streetlight.","\"Shen Huaichu, I'm not so demanding that even knowing my boyfriend doesn't like that atmosphere, I would still selfishly ask him to stay with me.\"","Shen Huaichu immediately replied, \"It's me who wants to stay with you.\"","\"... Am I affecting you?\" he asked cautiously.","He just wanted to see her safe; he didn't want to become her obstacle.","Seeing the stubbornness in Shen Huaichu's eyes, Jing Yi's nose tingled. She said seriously, \"No, you've never affected me.\"","She just felt that it was time for them to have a good talk.","After a while, Jing Yi softly said, \"Didn't you say you would trust me?\"","'Shen Huaichu, do you trust me?'","'Yes, I trust you.'","Back then, you said you trusted me, even enough to entrust your life to me.","Why now, can't you even trust that I can come out of the race unscathed?","Jing Yi's voice was soft, but her words struck Shen Huaichu like a heavy hammer.","He tightened his grip on Jing Yi's hand even more, his eyes filled with panic. \"Yi Yi, I don't not trust you. It's just that...\"","Jing Yi met his gaze, as if trying to see into his heart, her eyelashes quivering. \"You were already so uncomfortable, yet you still stood there. What kind of trust is that?\"","Jing Yi tried to stay calm, but her voice still carried a hint of grievance.","Jing Yi loved racing, a love that was hard to describe.","It wasn't about wanting to beat everyone else; it was about the love of having her life in her own hands.","She had been an orphan, yet it felt like her fate was never truly hers to control. It seemed like everyone could step in, just because they worried about her being an orphan.","Finally, she went to university, became an adult, and thought she could finally follow the path she wanted. But a bizarre time-travel brought her here.","Oh well, maybe she should just be a salted fish. Having someone arrange things for her wasn't so bad.","Yet, she found herself back at the steering wheel. For her, it wasn't just racing; it was the feeling of holding her own life in her hands.","Now, she seemed to be at a crossroads, unable to find a way that satisfied both.","\"Shen Huaichu, let's both calm down for a while.\""]}]);
